window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":401,"title":"Chapter 401 - Sacrificing Huang Lilan","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huang Lilan’s eyes were filled with hatred as she screamed crazily, “Qiao Xi! Shut up! Ah Yan and I~”","“Miss Qiao is right.”","Lu Yan’s calm voice interrupted Huang Lilan’s words.","He was cold and distant. There seemed to be a hint of hatred in his eyes as he looked at Huang Lilan. “Madam Gu killed my mother. Of course, I can’t be close to Madam Gu anymore.”","The expression on Huang Lilan’s face immediately froze, and the blood in her body seemed to have turned to ice.","Lu Yan smiled lightly. “Thank you, Miss Qiao and President Gu, for helping me find the murderer who killed my mother. Otherwise, I don’t know how long I would’ve continued to be deceived by Madam Gu.”","Huang Lilan’s body went soft as her mind went blank. She just stared at Lu Yan in a daze, her eyes filled with shock.","She had plotted everything for Ah Yan’s inheritance. She had done her best to let him become the heir, but in the end, she was actually despised by her own son?","Qiao Xi said meaningfully, “Mr. Lu, you’re truly heartless!”","Huang Lilan was very vicious, but she was really good to Lu Yan. Who would have thought that Lu Yan would step on his biological mother in order to clear the suspicions surrounding their relationship?","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart. Lu Yan was truly a ruthless character. He could even sacrifice his own mother for the sake of success.","Lu Yan turned his face away. “Miss Qiao, you’re too kind. I only understand now that Madam Gu had planned to get close to me from the start. Now that the truth is out, I naturally have to keep a distance from my enemy. If I continue to have dealings with Madam Gu, what will my mother in heaven think","of me? Therefore, Madam Gu probably understands my decision too.”","The last sentence was a warning to Huang Lilan to not expose them.","Huang Lilan suddenly regained her senses and quickly calmed down. Although she was upset, she could only endure it for the sake of her son. She could not let anyone see through their plot.","She was Gu Zheng’s biological mother and had nothing to do with Lu Yan. She definitely could not make things difficult for Lu Yan.","Huang Lilan bit her lip tightly with a ferocious expression. It was not easy for her to swallow her anger. Her heart was filled with anger, but she did not dare to say a word.","Seeing her forbearance, Qiao Xi’s heart ached for Gu Zheng.","Huang Lilan was too selfish. As a mother, could she resort to unscrupulous means just for her son?","From a young age, Gu Zheng had lived his life carefully. He listened to Huang Lilan’s every word and thought that his sincerity would earn him his mother’s pity, but she never cared.","On the other hand, for the sake of benefits, Lu Yan publicly cut ties with her and kicked her while she was down. Even so, Huang Lilan did not mention a word and took all the blame.","Qiao Xi sneered, “Chairman Gu, the Lu family now knows that Huang Lilan killed Eldest Miss Lu. If you still want to cooperate with the Lu family and bring Lu Yan back to the Gu family, shouldn’t you chase this murderer out of the house first?”","“Qiao Xi!” Huang Lilan’s expression changed as she gritted her teeth. “What exactly do you want?”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with innocence. “Why are you so anxious? I’m just saying. If the Lu family doesn’t pursue this matter, then it’s none of my business. It’s the Lu family’s business.”","Old Master Lu clenched his fists, his face ashen.","Qiao Xi’s goal had been achieved. After saying those words, if the Lu family continued to cooperate with the Gu family, then it would mean that they didn’t care about the dead Eldest Miss Lu at all. Therefore, in order to facilitate the alliance between the two families, one person must be sacrificed.","The guests did not expect such an incident to happen when they were only here for a birthday banquet.","Miss Qiao was right. If Chairman Gu didn’t kick Huang Lilan out of the house but the Lu family still did business with the Gu family and agreed to send Lu Yan back to the Gu family, that meant that they were lying when they said they cared about Eldest Miss Lu.","“Huang Lilan is just a two-faced mistress! Pah! She did something wrong and even maligned President Gu. How can such a woman continue to stay in the Gu family?”","“Why do I feel that it’s quite difficult for the Lu family to get Chairman Gu and Huang Lilan to divorce?”","“Could it be that Eldest Miss Lu’s death was seemingly triggered by Huang Lilan, but in reality...”","‘When Old Master Lu heard this, his heart skipped a beat. He slammed the table and roared, “Get a divorce immediately! How can the murderer who killed my daughter continue to stay in the Gu family?!”","Gu Weiming’s expression changed as he quickly protected Huang Lilan.","Huang Lilan was panting heavily, and her face was pale. Then, her eyes rolled back and she fainted.."]},{"number":402,"title":"Chapter 402 - My Fiancee","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi smiled. “Ah Zheng, let’s go.”","Gu Zheng nodded slightly in response.","Gu Weiming gritted his teeth and glared at the two of them. They were supposed to announce Ah Yan’s identity today but the birthday banquet had been ruined by Gu Zheng. Now, these people were forcing him to divorce Lilan!","Initially, he wanted to use this opportunity to reunite the family. However, now that Ah Yan could return to the Gu family, Lilan had to be sacrificed!","“Gu Zheng! Stop right there!” Gu Weiming was furious.","Qiao Xi slowly turned around and sneered. “Chairman Gu, if you have time, why don’t you quickly settle your divorce procedures? There’s no point in taking your anger out on Ah Zheng.”","This sentence rendered Gu Weiming speechless.","The original plan was for the Gu and Lu families to work together and force Gu Zheng to admit that he had indirectly killed Lu Qingyun. Then, they would strip him off of his inheritance rights and assets. Now, however, the two families could not be as close anymore because of the incident with Lu","Qingyun.","If he had known earlier, he would not have kept this unfilial son with him!","Ten minutes later, Qiao Xi came out of the Gu family’s old residence. Just as she walked out of the door, a man walked up to her. “Miss Qiao, can we talk?”","Lu Yan looked at her warmly.","Even though she had expected the answer, Qiao Xi’s heart still trembled.","Lu Yan smiled bitterly. “It’s all my fault. I didn’t come to look for you in time, which resulted in you and Gu Zheng getting married. However, our engagement was a fact. I just want you to know who Iam.","“Tm the fiance your grandfather chose for you. Even if you don’t marry me, I won’t resent you or hurt you. We can still be friends.”","‘The air was silent for a moment before Qiao Xi sneered, and her eyes were filled with coldness.","“Lu Yan, you’re ridiculous.”","Qiao Xi’s icy cold words rang out. “Don’t think I can’t tell what you’re trying to say. You’re saying that you’re someone my grandfather trusts and that you’re the fiance my grandfather chose for me. You’re accusing Gu Zheng of stealing your woman, yet you’re still pretending to be magnanimous. You really","are a *sshole!","“Whether you’re my fiance or not is still up for debate. Even though Grandpa isn’t by my side, I still have my senior and teacher. Do you think I’l fall for your lies so easily? You think highly of yourself, but don’t treat others as fools. I’m different from other women. I won’t believe your nonsense!”","The smile on Lu Yan’s face gradually disappeared, and his eyes were filled with ferocity.","His pale fingers gripped the jade pendant tightly as he said in a low voice, “Miss Qiao, you don’t believe me anymore?”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly in her heart.","“Since that’s the case, I won’t force you. But Miss Qiao, remember this. Since I’ve accepted your grandfather’s token, I’ll protect you according to his wishes. Whether you like me or not, I’ll fulfill my promise to him..”"]},{"number":403,"title":"Chapter 403 - Stars’ Gathering","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Lhope you won’t regret it, Miss Qiao,” Lu Yan said.","Qiao Xi glanced at him indifferently before leaving.","Lu Yan stood on the same spot and looked at Qiao Xi’s back, unable to return to his senses for a long time.","At this moment, Huang Lilan walked out with a face full of resentment. “Ah Yan, that b*tch Qiao Xi...”","“Shut up!” Lu Yan angrily rebuked. “You don’t have to care about my matters. This is the next step in my plan. I have to get Qiao Xi!”","Huang Lilan said indignantly, “How is she worthy of you?”","“Twant to snatch away everything that belongs to Gu Zheng, including Qiao Xi!” Lu Yan’s eyes were cold as he said fiercely, “Huang Lilan, I warned you long ago not to let others have a handle on you. You ended up like this today because you went to provoke Lu Qingyun back then. Since you could’ve","gotten an official status anyway, why did you still go to find trouble with Lu Qingyun?","“So don’t interfere in my business with Qiao Xi. I have my own plans.”","Huang Lilan was filled with unwillingness, but she still nodded obediently. “Ah Yan... I did it for your sake as well...”","Without waiting for her to finish her sentence, Lu Yan left with a cold face. He did not even bother to look at her.","Eldest Miss Lu had already been dead for 20 years. Even if they were to seek justice for her now, she wouldn’t be able to return.","Actually, with the president’s current ability, as long as he was willing, he could kill Old Master Lu and Lu Xiang in minutes. To the president, it was like crushing an ant.","But what was the point of killing them? No one knew what they had done, much less how much Eldest Miss Lu had suffered. The truth of her death was even harder to unravel.","The president might as well let them live well and watch the truth be unraveled bit by bit. Their crimes would be slowly exposed, and they would watch those people suffer.","At this moment, someone knocked on the door. “Senio1","The person who called out wasn’t Qiao Xi but a man. The two of them knew that only Zhou Guanjin would call Gu Zheng that.","Upon hearing this, Song Shijing immediately pulled Song Shiyu away to the back door.","Seeing that the door wasn’t locked, Zhou Guanjin pushed it open and entered. “Senior, didn’t Dark Net Organization have a gathering before? The people in Stars want to hold a gathering as well. Do you want to go?”","There were two major organizations in the hacker world. Initially, Mo Yuan did not belong to any organization. However, because Black Tide joined Stars, everyone treated Mo Yuan as one of them.","Song Shiyu leaned against the back door and listened to their conversation quietly. No one in Li City knew that the powerful president of the business world was actually the top hacker, Mo Yuan.","Song Shijing frowned. “Are you crazy? If the president finds out that you’re eavesdropping, you’ll be dead!”"]},{"number":404,"title":"Chapter 404 - Black Tide’s Husband Is A Bastard!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor:","Henyee Translations","Song Shiyu said nonchalantly, “The president won’t punish me! His bark is worse than his bite. Brother, did you find any clues when the president asked you to look for the divine physician?”","At the mention of this, Song Shijing looked helpless. “The president is Mo Yuan, the hacker. Even he couldn’t find the divine physician, so how could I? Besides...”","Moreover, Young Madam was related to the divine physician. She had also been searching for the whereabouts of the divine physician, but there were no clues.","Nearly everyone was looking for the divine physician. They had used a huge amount of manpower and resources, but there were no clues at all. It was either he was in hiding, or","Inside the room, Zhou Guanjin said, “Senior, I know that you and Junior have been looking for the whereabouts of the divine physician but you guys haven’t found any clues even after so long, There are so many top hackers in Stars. As long as you give the order, everyone will naturally help you.”","Actually, Zhou Guanjin also knew that if Gu Zheng couldn’t find him, it would be even harder for others.","Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes. “Junior is going too?”","Zhou Guanjin nodded. “Of course. There are many of her friends in Stars. They haven’t seen each other for so long, so it’s a good opportunity for them to meet.”","He lowered his voice and said, “Senior, you know as well that the people in hacker organizations have their own lives and identities. It’s rare for us to host a gathering. I don’t know when the next time will be. Junior also wants to use this opportunity to find out more about the divine physician.”","Gu Zheng nodded. If she wanted to go, he would accompany her.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s eyes twitched while her heart thumped.","‘No, you’ve misunderstood.’","‘When she and Gu Zheng had just gotten married, she didn’t know that Gu Zheng was Mo Yuan. Deep down, she firmly believed that Gu Zheng was a bastard, so when she was taking on a mission with Tang Li, she confided in her about Gu Zheng and ridiculed him.","Hence, Tang Li remembered that Black Tide’s husband was a bastard!","At that time, Qiao Xi had only said those things casually and was not actually angry with Gu Zheng. Who would have thought that her husband actually treated her very well and he was even coming here today?","Qiao Xi was about to explain when Tang Li said indignantly, “Black Tide is so pitiful. Her husband always abuses her and refuses to give her food. How could there be such a bastard like that?!”","Qiao Xi tried to interrupt. “Listen to me...”","Tang Li was so angry that her face turned red. “Poor little sweetheart! What do you want me to listen to?! Don’t be embarrassed. Your husband doesn’t treat you well, so why don’t you just divorce him? You’re so pretty anyway. You don’t have to worry about not finding a man!”","Just then, Gu Zheng walked in.","He was wearing a custom-made suit and a coat, which made him look tall and slender. His well-defined face was full of indifference, while his eyes were deep. There was an expensive watch on his wrist, and it was obvious that he was either rich or noble.","The moment the handsome and rich man appeared, he attracted everyone’s attention."]},{"number":405,"title":"Chapter 405 - Super Embarrassing","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng did not reveal his identity. Someone said to him, “Sir, we’re having a gathering here. You must have come to the wrong place.”","The man lowered his eyes and said indifferently, “No.”","“This is the gathering among online friends. You...”","“Tm Mo Yuan.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled: ”","Tang Li opened her eyes wide and blurted out, “Mo Yuan? Black Tide, didn’t you say that Mo Yuan is a fat and greasy man?”","Qiao Xi: “!!!” ‘Damn! It’s over, how can I explain this?","‘This man was completely different from a fat man with a beer belly!","Everyone looked at him with admiration. “Mo Yuan? You’re God Mo Yuan? Black Tide, did you really invite Mo Yuan here?”","“I really didn’t expect God Mo Yuan to attend the gathering. Is he here for Black Tide? Please take a seat!”","Mo Yuan was a god-like existence in the hacker network, so his appearance immediately set off a huge storm.","‘They did not expect that Mo Yuan would be here as well and were instantly excited. The hackers realized that it had suddenly become a fan meeting.","Gu Zheng curled his lips as a meaningful smile appeared in his eyes. “I heard you guys talking about my junior’s husband? Why don’t you tell me about him too?”","Qiao Xi’s legs went weak from fright, and she smiled awkwardly.","Faced with this super embarrassing situation, she really regretted it! Why was she so talkative?!","She really did not have any ill intentions. She was just idly complaining about her husband to her good friend. Furthermore, she did not know that Gu Zheng was her senior back then. It was not a sin to not know.","However, Tang Li was still furious. “God Mo Yuan! You have to help your junior!”","Gu Zheng touched his wristwatch and raised an eyebrow.","‘Tang Li continued to complain, saying, “Great God Mo Yuan, your junior met a bad man and married that bastard. He married Black Tide, but he always abused her and refused to give her food. Aren’t you going to avenge her?”","Gu Zheng sneered as he looked at Qiao Xi. “Is that so?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. “About that... I, I...”","Gu Zheng’s face was filled with ‘gentleness’. “Junior, come here.”","‘Tang Li pushed her away at once. “Get over there now! Your senior looks so awesome. He’ll definitely avenge you. That way, you won’t be bullied again.”","Qiao Xi bit her lip tightly, her eyes filled with despair. She walked awkwardly to Gu Zheng’s side and smiled stiffly at him.","The man bent down and leaned close to her ear. He lowered his voice and asked, “Mrs. Gu, I don’t give you food to eat?”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled, and she was extremely nervous as she stuttered, “T-This is a misunderstanding. Let me explain.","Before she could explain, Gu Zheng sneered. “You’re so fat that you can’t even wear your old clothes any more, yet you’re going around saying that I won’t give you food to eat? Then what will you look like if I do give you food to eat?”","Qiao Xi:","She swallowed her explanation!","Fat? Did he know that this word could make women kill?!","F*ck! She suddenly felt that her previous insults were justified. Gu Zheng was a bastard!","Zhou Guanjin watched as the two of them muttered to each other and quietly shut his mouth. Actually, he wanted to tell everyone that Mo Yuan was Black Tide’s husband, but after thinking about it, it was better for them to say it themselves.","After a while, Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa and taking a sip of tea.","Although the members of Stars didn’t often meet up with each other, they frequently chatted online. Some of them had known each other for more than ten years, so these people didn’t feel awkward when they gathered together. They immediately started gossiping.","“Although Black Tide calls Mo Yuan ‘Senior’, he should be considered her master!”","“That’s right. Initially, it was Mo Yuan who discovered Black Tide’s talent and taught her to be a hacker. However, Black Tide felt that Mo Yuan was too young, so she didn’t want to call him ‘Master’.”","There were many in Stars who shared a master-disciple relationship, and only geniuses like Mo Yuan could set the rules. Even if everyone was extremely talented, they still needed someone to guide them.","Someone said in a low voice, “Why do I remember Great God Mo Yuan saying before that he wouldn’t take in disciples? Back then, Mu Ling wanted to take Mo Yuan as her master and begged him for many days, but Mo Yuan didn’t agree.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was playing cards with a friend of hers.","Tang Li stood at the side and made a lot of noise. Before she could finish speaking, the door of the card room was suddenly pushed open—","Everyone looked up and saw a fierce-looking woman..."]},{"number":406,"title":"Chapter 406 - Gu Zheng Has So Many Rotten Admirers","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The leader of Stars stepped forward and asked politely, “Miss, are you at the wrong place?”","She looked around coldly and asked arrogantly, “Who is Black Tide?”","The moment she said that, everyone’s eyes widened. Their hearts skipped a beat, and they frowned unhappily.","At that moment, Tang Li came to a realization. “Black Tide! I know who this woman is now. She’s Mu Ling from Dark Net Organization. Back then, Mu Ling had always wanted to take Mo Yuan as her master, but Mo Yuan never agreed to it. He was so upset by her that he destroyed her database right away.","I think Mu Ling must be resentful and wants to vent her anger on you!”","Qiao Xi threw down the cards in her hand with a disdainful expression. “Mu Ling?”","Never heard of her.","‘Mu Ling was furious when she saw Qiao Xi’s expression. She gnashed her teeth. “Black Tide, we’re both hackers. Do you dare to compete with me?”","It wasn’t easy for Qiao Xi to get together with these friends to play cards, and she was just getting excited when her mood was ruined by this woman. It caused a cold expression to appear on her face. “On what basis should I compete with you?”","Her thin lips parted slightly, and her expression was calm. In Mu Ling’s eyes, Qiao Xi was looking down on her.","‘Mu Ling’s face flushed red. “Then what right do you have to be Mo Yuan’s disciple? I begged him for so long but he refused to accept me. What right do you have to be his disciple? I want to see what capabilities you have today!","“It’s fine that Mo Yuan didn’t accept me as his disciple, but why did he accept another woman? You must have done something! Do you dare to have a fair competition with me? If I win, you’ll voluntarily withdraw from your discipleship. You’re not worthy of being a disciple to a top hacker like him!”","Qiao Xi complained in her heart, ‘This Gu Zheng really has many rotten admirers!”","Even if Gu Zheng was no longer the head of the Gu family, he still had his identity as Mo Yuan. He could make many women go crazy for him. Just his face alone could seduce people into committing crimes.","“Black Tide, I don’t think you dare to! I’m also famous in the hacker world. How can a woman like you, who relied on tricks to get to where you are, compare to me? You’re...”","Suddenly, the door to the room was pushed open and the sound interrupted her.","Gu Zheng strode in with his long legs, his voice full of ridicule. “Don’t dare? Do you think that’s possible?”","He walked straight to Qiao Xi’s side, and when the two of them stood together, everyone couldn’t help but gush at the beautiful sight in front of them.","‘Mu Ling’s eyes turned red. “Mo Yuan, Black Tide’s name is only known in the hacker world because of your status. Why are you still protecting her?! If I become your disciple—”","Gu Zheng spoke slowly, “Since you know she’s my disciple, do you think there’s a need to compete?”","Tang Li came back to her senses and chimed in, “God Mo Yuan is right! Mu Ling, you should know your place! Just look at the hacker rankings and the gap between both of you. Black Tide has been receiving so many orders that the starting price to hire her is five million yuan. She has taken on so many","orders over the years and not once has anything gone wrong.","“Black Tide’s achievements today are all due to her own hard work. On the other hand, you’re overestimating yourself just because your brother is the leader of Dark Net Organization. Don’t you know the kind of skills you have? If you’re uneducated, quickly enroll in a school and don’t cause trouble here!”","Black Tide and Mo Yuan were like an immortal couple of the hacker world. This was publicly acknowledged.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was in the mood to play cards earlier but was disrupted, Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with impatience. “Miss Mu, regardless of whether Black Tide is around or not, I won’t accept you as my disciple. This is Stars’ gathering, so please leave as soon as possible and don’t disturb us.","Otherwise, I don’t mind talking to your brother.”","When Mu Ling heard Gu Zheng mention her brother, tears streamed down her face.","She shouted aggrievedly, “Mo Yuan! Are you looking for the whereabouts of the divine physician? I have clues! I can tell you the clues, but you have to admit that I’m stronger than Black Tide and accept me as your disciple!”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled.","The divine physician","How would she know Grandpa’s whereabouts?","The news that Mo Yuan was looking for the divine physician had spread throughout the hacker world. Tang Li also became nervous. “Black Tide, your senior...”","The air froze.","Gu Zheng looked up coldly and said lightly, “Miss Mu, please leave..”"]},{"number":407,"title":"Chapter 407 - Only Children Make Choices, I Want Both Of Them","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Mu Ling widened her eyes in disbelief. “I know the whereabouts of the divine physician! Mo Yuan, you’ve been searching for the divine physician for so long, but you’re willing to give up this clue for Black Tid","No one dared to make a sound. Their eyes wandered between the three of them.","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment. He raised his deep eyes and sneered. “Miss Mu, when did I say that I’m rejecting you because of Black Tide?”","Everyone gasped.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and his voice was like a sharp sword as he said, “I just feel that accepting a person like you as my disciple would dirty my reputation. Besides, no one can threaten me.”","Mu Ling’s tears rolled down her cheeks as she took a few steps back weakly. “You would rather give up the clues about the divine physician than take me as your disciple?”","“Iremember that I’ve rejected you many times. I’ve already shown you enough respect. Even your elder brother doesn’t dare to provoke me. I’l ask your elder brother about the divine physician.”","As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, he tumed to look at Qiao Xi and asked softly, “Do you still want to play cards?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Zheng said, “Tl accompany you.”","He paid no further attention to Mu Ling and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they sat down at the table. The few other card players followed closely behind.","‘The members of Stars were dumbfounded as they watched Mu Ling baw! and rush out of the banquet hall.","Everyone only wanted to watch the commotion. It had nothing to do with them anyway, so they quickly dispersed.","At this moment, Tang Li came back to her senses and said hesitantly, “I suddenly think that... God Mo Yuan seems more like Black Tide’s husban:","The moment that was said, everyone started gossiping. “Yes! I think so too. They’re too compatible! Moreover, they look so intimate! God Mo Yuan’s face is full of gentleness when he looks at her!”","“No way! I heard that Black Tide’s husband is from a rich family. It won’t be easy for her to divorce him! Otherwise, why didn’t she get a divorce even after suffering so much?”","“What a pity! This pair of senior and junior look great together.”","In the card room, Gu Zheng leaned into Qiao Xi’s ear and chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, they seem to be discussing how to get us divorced!”","Qiao Xi’s body tensed up as she smiled awkwardly. “Don’t be angry. This is all a misunderstanding, It’s just a misunderstanding! I didn’t have the chance to explain before you came in.”","Gu Zheng tapped his long fingers on the table and smiled meaningfully. “How do you want to explain it, Mrs. Gu? Please tell me.”","Qiao Xi tossed away the cards in her hand and took a deep breath. She finally had a chance to explain herself.","Lo","“Black Tide!” At this moment, a group of people walked over and interrupted her.","They all looked at the two of them with smiles on their faces. Then, someone asked while keeping a smile on their face, “Black Tide, who do you think is better to you? Your husband or your senior?”","“Brothers and sisters, don’t cause me harm!","“You’ll be the death of me! I’m already in deep waters here. Do you need to add fuel to the fire?","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up when he heard everyone’s words. Then, he tuned around and looked at Qiao Xi with interest. “Junior, I really want to know too!”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. This question was simply as lethal as the question of choosing who to save if two people were drowning in the sea.","Gu Zheng smiled and waited for her reply.","Qiao Xi was silent for a long time before stammering. “They’re both... very good.”","Everyone was unwilling to give up and continued to ask, “If you weren’t married yet and could choose between the two of them, who would you choose to marry? Would it be your senior or your husband?”","This question was just as deadly.","Qiao Xi felt a burning gaze staring at her from the side. If she said anything wrong, it would instantly tear her apart.","She turned her head and looked at Gu Zheng’s sinister smile. She felt a chill in her heart. It felt as if she was going to die the next second.","Due to her nervousness, it was easy for her brain to short-circuit. Hence, under the expectant gaze of everyone, Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and said with a grin, “If I had to choose between my husband and my senior...”","Gu Zheng raised his eyes, and everyone’s gaze fell on her. They felt that there was a high chance that Qiao Xi would choose Mo Yuan. After all, Mo Yuan was handsome and rich, so her husband would definitely not be able to compare to him.","Unexpectedly, she said shyly, “Only children make choices. I want both men.”","The members of Stars: “."]},{"number":408,"title":"Chapter 408 - Crazily Running To The Edge Of Danger","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","There was silence.","Tang Li took a deep breath. This answer was too much. She took a deep breath and coughed violently. Everyone smiled awkwardly and took a few steps back in horror.","‘Damn! Black Tide is a scumbag!","“She wants both? One is her husband, while the other is her senior. She wants Mo Yuan to be her kept lover? She’s crazily running to the edge of danger!”","Qiao Xi’s face was covered in smiles as she felt that she was simply too quick-witted.","Gu Zheng glanced at her and sneered.","After the gathering ended, the two of them returned to Longwan Residential. Qiao Xi thought that the matter had already passed, but Gu Zheng suddenly came over. “Mrs. Gu.”","“Huh?”","“You want both men?” Gu Zheng said slowly, “I really didn’t expect you to be a scumbag, Mrs. Gu. One man isn’t enough and you want two?”","Qiao Xi: “!!!”","Song Shiyu’s face was filled with horror. He quickly rushed in front of Qiao Xi and asked in a low voice, “Young Madam, you have a kept lover? You even have two?”","Qiao Xi was shocked and shouted in a panic, “That’s not true! Get lost!”","Song Shiyu said, “Then why did the president say that? What do you mean by wanting both men? Young Madam, who’s the man you’re keeping outside? Who could be so charming?”","Qiao Xi was at a loss for what to do. “It’s my senior! My senior is Gu Zheng, your president!”","Song Shiyu suddenly realized something. “Young Madam, you’re Black Tide! You’re the president’s junior! Damn! What a special fate! You two have known each other for so many years and got married by chance...”","Qiao Xi nodded like a chick pecking on grains. “Right, right, that’s it. So my senior and husband are both Gu Zheng. They’re two different identities, but in reality, it’s only one man!”","Unexpectedly, Song Shiyu was stunned for a few seconds and asked in confusion, “That’s not right. When you got married, you didn’t know that the president was Mo Yuan. You didn’t know that he was your senior...”","Song Shiyu looked terrified. “So when you married the president, the person you liked was your senior? Although they’re the same person, you didn’t know that. You were still thinking about another man even though you had gotten married to the president?","“Young Madam, why are you such a scumbag?!”","Qiao Xi: “!!!” ‘Damn! You bastard, you’re sabotaging me!”","She was so angry that she stomped her feet. “That’s not true! I only like Gu Zheng. I didn’t like Senior before. I just thought of him as a sibling. I only liked Senior after I found out that Gu Zheng is my senior. I’m not a scumbag at all, alright?”","Song Shiyu looked skeptical. “Is that possible? You’ve known the president for ten years. How could you not have feelings for him? The president has always been so good to you that he couldn’t wait to pluck the stars from the sky and solve all your problems. When has he ever treated others like this?","“How could you not like such an outstanding and warm man? Young Madam, you’re lying, right?”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and said with slight embarrassment, “Um...”","Song Shijing happened to come over and was about to pull Song Shiyu away when Song Shiyu asked, “What? Tell me!”","Qiao Xi took a deep breath and decided to tell the truth. She smiled embarrassedly. “I thought he was a... greasy middle-aged man who was probably in his 40s or 50s.”","Song Shiyu took a few steps back, his eyes filled with horror. “Ah, this...”","After returning to her room, Qiao Xi called Qin An.","“Theard that before Grandpa came to Li City, he went to Ling City. I want to go to Ling City to investigate. Do you have any clues?”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment. “I don’t know if it’s true, but I have a feeling that the clues this time will be useful.","“attended Stars gathering as Black Tide today. Mu Ling from Dark Net Organization barged in and said that she knows the whereabouts of the divine physician.”","Qin An’s expression darkened.","Qiao Xi continued, “I’ve investigated Mu Ling, Even though she doesn’t have much strength, her brother is the leader of the Dark Net Organization. The family behind him is very powerful as well. No one knows their identities in real life, nor can we find any clues. But I keep having the feeling that Mu Ling","looks very familiar.”"]},{"number":409,"title":"Chapter 409 - Participating In The Jewelry Design Competition","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin An hurriedly said, “Think about it carefully.”","Little Six had always had a good memory. Since she said that person looked familiar, she must have met her somewhere before.","If Mu Ling’s family really had clues about the divine physician, they would give it a try no matter how difficult it was.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “I think I must’ve met her during the fashion exhibition in F Country. I attended as Gu Shan and probably saw Mu Ling there. Those who could attend that exhibition were all international designers or their families.”","“Investigate the top fashion families of F Country. Mu Ling’s family might be one of them.”","Qin An agreed and suddenly thought of something, “There’s something else. There’s a jewelry exhibition in Li City in a few days. Do you want to go?”","“1m preparing for it,” Qiao Xi replied indifferently.","Qin An teased, “Little Six, with Yun Chu’s identity, you’ll be the champion!”","After hanging up, Qiao Xi thought for a moment. Her third brother was right.","‘The name Yun Chu was too eye-catching. If she were to use this identity, there would probably be no competition for her. She would just take first place immediately.","After thinking about it, she picked up the pen and crossed out Yun Chu’s name. She was prepared to participate anonymously.","Qiao Xi was just going to join in the fun and did not want to obtain a ranking, She just wanted to play.","The name Yun Chu could not be easily exposed. Otherwise, those noblewomen would definitely break the door of Longwan Residential. She would not be able to live in peace even if she hid in Li City.","On the other hand, Lin Jie had gotten the list of participants for the jewelry exhibition. After taking a look, he snorted. “Mengging, Qiao Xi isn’t on the list. She probably heard that you were participating, so she didn’t dare to compete anymore.”","Lin Jie did not know much about the design industry, but he knew very well that Mengqing had many fashion and jewelry brands overseas. Her designs were highly praised in the industry and were internationally famous.","Although Mengqing was not a top designer, she had already produced such results at a young age. What about Qiao Xi?","Lin Jie comforted her softly. “Mengqing, don’t worry. You’ll definitely get first place this time! Moreover, this competition requires two contestants to collaborate. You’ve even invited the professional jewelry designer, Jason. He’s Yun Chu’s disciple. If the two of you join forces, who will be your match?”","Yao Mengqing smiled shyly. “Ah Jie, don’t praise me like that. I’ll do my best. I’l also put the design drafts into production to ease the burden on my family.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Mengqing’s tone was gentle. “Actually, it doesn’t matter if Xi Xi participates. I have no objections. It’s quite good to be able to compete on the same stage as her.”","Lin Jie thought for a moment, and a trace of scheming appeared in his eyes. “You’re right, Qiao Xi has to participate! Otherwise, how will others know the gap between her and you? Previously, she would interfere in whatever you wanted to do. Why didn’t she sign up this time?","“She definitely thinks she can’t compare to you. Qiao Xi got scared, so she gave up. But I must let everyone know that she’s inferior to you!”","Lin Jie’s eyes were filled with viciousness. “What right does she have to compete with you? We’ll let Ah Zheng open his eyes wide and see the difference between the two of you in this competition!”","Yao Mengqing smiled and did not say anything, However, Lin Jie was already secretly planning something in his heart.","The next day.","After Qiao Xi got off work, Song Shiyu drove her to Gu Corporation.","Gu Zheng pointed at the contract on the table. “It’s for you.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Why would Gu Zheng give her a contract for no reason? She opened it and was instantly stunned.","A few years ago, Gu Corporation sent someone to Country M to look for her to collaborate with them. They wanted her to design jewelry for Gu Corporation, but Qiao Xi refused. With Gu Corporation’s temper, they later announced that they would no longer work with Yun Chu, Everyone in the industry","knew about this.","After Gu Zheng found out about her identity, he had never suggested another collaboration. What was going on today?","Qiao Xi flipped through the contract a few times and was about to sign it when she suddenly recalled something. She immediately threw down the pen and muttered, “I don’t want to sign it.”","Gu Corporation had its own fashion and jewelry designers. The fashion and jewelry brands under their company were also very famous internationally. However, there was a brand that was working jointly with Yao Mengging’s ‘Sunshine.’ If she signed it just like that, she might have to interact with Yao","‘Mengging regarding work in the future.."]},{"number":410,"title":"Chapter 410 - What Right Do You Have To Renew The Contract?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “Are you sure?”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Gu Zheng said slowly, “Gu Corporation has many high-end brands under it, but we haven’t found a suitable designer. As the president of Gu Corporation, I invite Yun Chu to collaborate with me. I hope you’ll agree.”","Actually, Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that as long as she agreed to collaborate with Gu Corporation, she would receive a high commission. However, everyone knew that the designer working with Gu Corporation had always been Yao Mengqing.","At this moment, the secretary knocked on the door. “President, Mr. Lin and Miss Yao are here. Do you want to see them now?”","Qiao Xi: “!!!” Damn, she had just thought of Yao Mengqing when this woman came! How annoying!","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “Let them in.”","Qiao Xi: “?” What? Why was he letting them in? Didn’t he say that he would never see Yao Mengqing again?","However, Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that if it was a private matter, Gu Zheng would definitely ignore the two of them. The reason why Gu Zheng could make an exception was probably because of the company.","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa with an ugly expression. After thinking about it, she felt that it would be better to just buy off the Yao family so that Yao Mengging would not hang around in front of her all day and disturb her.","Qin An sent a message: [It doesn’t cost much to acquire the Yao family’s company, but Yao Mengging’s brother, Yao Junjie, is quite capable. He’s the biggest obstacle.]","Qiao Xi replied with a resentful emoji: [No matter what, I have to acquire it! Yao Mengqing has repeatedly provoked me and won’t stop even after suffering so many losses! I have to teach her a lesson this time!]","Not long after, Yao Mengging and Lin Jie walked in. The three of them were sitting in the lounge together. Only Qiao Xi was sitting on the chair outside with a gloomy expression.","Yao Mengging glanced out of the lounge. Her eyes shifted as she said warmly, “President Gu, we signed a three-year contract before this. The contract is about to expire, so we came to discuss the renewal.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and flipped through the documents. Hearing her words, he could not help but sneer.","Yao Mengqing was still smiling, “President Gu, previously... we had some misunderstandings, but the collaboration concems the interests of the two companies. Our private matters shouldn’t affect the company.","“We’ve been getting along very well during the three years of collaboration. We’ve also produced huge benefits for the company, so I’ve already prepared the contract this time. President Gu, if there’s no problem...”","Gu Zheng glanced at it indifferently and snorted.","Yao Mengging did not understand what Gu Zheng meant. Was he renewing the contract or not?","Right now, her relationship with Gu Zheng was gradually distancing, and they did not have any interactions in private. Fortunately, due to her brand, Sunshine, she still had work dealings with Gu Corporation. She could use work to get close to Gu Zheng. At that time, Qiao Xi would have no reason to say","anything.","“Ah Zheng... President Gu, quickly sign the contract.” Lin Jie advised Gu Zheng.","“For the past three years, Gu Corporation and Sunshine have been working very happily together. The company has also made a lot of money. Although you only agreed to collaborate because of Yao Junjie, Mengqing didn’t disappoint you. She has always been working hard to create benefits for the","company.","“If you agree to renew the contract, it’ll be beneficial to you.”","Yao Mengging smiled shyly. “President Gu, we’ve known each other since we were young. My ability is obvious to all. No one is more suitable than me to be a designer of Gu Corporatio","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. He did not say that he disagreed, but he did not nod either.","Qiao Xi sat at the side with a resentful expression. What right did she have to want to renew the contract?!","Yao Mengging was really shameless! She had already been so humiliated previously, yet she could still pretend that nothing had happened and swagger over to Gu Corporation.","Qiao Xi had always been calm. She also told herself that she could not disturb Gu Zheng’s work. However, anger had already overwhelmed her mind. Her body refused to listen to her as she rushed over.","Damn it, Yao Mengging!","‘Wasn’t she just a small-time designer? She was just a little talented. How could she compare to Yun Chu?","If she had not refused Gu Corporation’s invitation back then, how could Yao Mengqing have gotten the chance?","How arrogant!","Qiao Xi was furious and directly rushed into the living room.","At this moment, Yao Mengging said gently, “I know that I angered you previously, President Gu, so Sunshine is willing to cut the profits by 3%.. The contract has already stated clearly that for Gu Corporation"]},{"number":411,"title":"Chapter 411 - Yun Chu Has Already Agreed To Cooperate","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Before she could finish speaking, Qiao Xi rushed in aggressively and looked down at Yao Menggqing, who was sitting on the chair.","“Miss Yao, I’m sorry, but Gu Corporation can’t renew their contract with Sunshine.”","Yao Mengqing looked embarrassed.","Qiao Xi’s aura was strong, and her gaze was indifferent, causing Yao Mengging to feel invisible pressure.","Lin Jie stood up abruptly and stood in front of Yao Mengging. He frowned and said, “Miss Qiao, we’re dealing with work now. Please don’t interfere!”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were red as she looked at Gu Zheng aggrievedly. “Xi Xi, there’s been a misunderstanding between us. I know you hate me, but I’m here on behalf of Sunshine to discuss the renewal of the contract. This is a matter that concerns the company’s interests. You can’t affect the interests of","the entire company because of your own selfishness.”","With that, Yao Mengging looked at Gu Zheng’s expression tentatively.","Qiao Xi was so indiscriminate and did not care about the overall situation. She was putting her personal emotions into Gu Corporation’s affairs. Gu Zheng hated such unreasonable women the most.","Moreover... Yao Mengqing was sure that Gu Zheng would not risk the company’s interests because of a private matter. Therefore, no matter how much he liked Qiao Xi, he could only refuse Qiao Xi’s request.","Yao Mengqing said gently, “Xi Xi, you might not know this yet, but after Gu Corporation and Sunshine collaborated, we achieved great achievements internationally. Hence, I’m not here to renew the contract just for myself. Gu Corporation also needs Sunshine. We’re an indispensable part of Gu","Corporation.”","“Indispensable?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and her eyes were slightly cold. “Miss Yao, do you mean that Gu Corporation can’t afford to cut off ties with you? Or are you saying that Gu Zheng can’t?”","“This—”","Qiao Xi did not give her a chance to speak and continued, “The International Dress Design Competition is held every three years. The top three win trophies, and those who are in the top ten can enter the rankings. However, according to what I know, you’ve never obtained a ranking before. On the other","hand, another designer from Gu Corporation has. Why can’t Gu Corporation separate from Sunshine? I really don’t understand.”","Yao Mengaing’s face darkened. “But we’ve been working very well together all these years. If I really didn’t have the ability, why did they sign a contract with me? There are so many famous designers in the world, but they chose me.”","“Could it be that you don’t know?” Qiao Xi asked.","Yao Mengging gritted her teeth. “Know what?! Xi Xi, you—”","“Gu Corporation originally wanted to invite Yun Chu to collaborate, but she refused, so","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule. “That’s how you got the chance. Most importantly, your brother gave up a portion of the Yao family’s business for your sake. That’s why Gu Zheng chose you. Could it be that you really think you’re very skilled? Three years have passed. Could it be that you think Gu","Zheng would renew the contract with you?”","“You...” Yao Mengqing’s heart sank, and her face turned livid.","Seeing that Yao Mengqing was aggrieved, Lin Jie instantly shouted angrily, “We’re discussing a collaboration! What does it have to do with you? Can you afford to delay Gu Corporation’s business?”","Yao Mengaing bit her lip and was about to cry. She choked and said, “Xi Xi, it’s fine if you don’t like me, but you have to think about President Gu! You can’t hurt his interests because of your nonsense, right?”","Qiao Xi was not annoyed when she heard this. She just smiled indifferently. “Gu Zheng is my husband, so I’ll naturally take his best interests into consideration.”","“You keep saying that you’re doing everything for President Gu’s sake, so why aren’t you asking President Gu to renew his contract with Mengging? Is this what you mean by ‘taking his best interests into consideration’? How laughable!”","Qiao Xi replied slowly, “Yun Chu has already agreed to collaborate with Gu Corporation!”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Qiao Xi sat down and crossed her legs. She pretended to be helpless and said, “Since we’ve already signed with Yun Chu, there’s no reason for us to continue working with Miss Yao. After all, all of you know Yun Chu’s identity. How could she tolerate working with such an ordinary designer?","“Yun Chu has won so many international awards. She’s the most outstanding designer in recent years. We finally managed to persuade Yun Chu to collaborate with Gu Corporation. We can’t let Miss Yao affect the relationship between Gu Corporation and Yun Chu, can we?”"]},{"number":412,"title":"Chapter 412 - Qiao Xi’s Words Represent My Intentions","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi praised herself calmly and attacked Yao Mengqing at the same time. “The jewelry Yun Chu designed is unique in the world. Miss Yao, do you think you’re qualified to compare yourself to her? Whether it’s jewelry or clothes, you’re far inferior to Yun Chu. What right do you have to renew your contract","with Gu Corporation?”","Yao Menggqing was stunned.","Yun Chu?","Gu Corporation had invited Yun Chu to collaborate with them?","Since they had Yun Chu, how could they choose her?","However, what she did not understand was that Yun Chu had rejected Gu Corporation a few years ago. The two of them had never contacted each other again. Why were they suddenly collaborating this time?","Gu Zheng raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi with interest. Only Qiao Xi could praise herself so shamelessly.","Suddenly, a wave of clamorous thoughts sounded in his ears. They were Qiao Xi’s thoughts.","‘Gu Zheng, I agree! Yun Chu agrees to collaborate with Gu Corporation. Hurry up and say something! Otherwise, I’ll go back on my word!”","Gu Zheng smiled.","‘What are you laughing about? Hurry up and agree! I’m such a capable designer. It’s your honor to be able to collaborate with me. Who does Yao Mengqing think she is? Can she compare to me? Anyone with a brain would choose me!","‘Damn! Why isn’t he saying anything?! I’m so anxious! Could it be that he’s angry because I said I wouldn’t sign the contract earlier?! This bastard is too petty!”","Lin Jie hurriedly said, “President Gu, you can’t do this! You’ve agreed to collaborate with Yun Chu, then what about Mengqing? She has been working hard for Gu Corporation for three years with almost no time to rest.”","Qiao Xi snorted. “Mr. Lin, you just said that I’m refusing to let Miss Yao renew her contract with Gu Corporation because of personal reasons and it’ll affect the company’s interests.","“However, now that Gu Corporation has found a more capable designer, who is Yun Chu, Gu Corporation will only reap even better benefits. What are you going to do about it, Miss Yao? Aren’t Gu Corporation’s benefits more important? Are you going to affect the company’s benefits because of a personal","reason?”","Lin Jie was instantly speechless. “You.”","Yao Mengging’s face was livid. After calming down, she pretended to be tolerant. “Ah Zheng, you’re... really collaborating with Yun Chu? You’re already prepared to sign the contract?”","Gu Zheng slowly looked up and was in no rush to answer.","‘He did say so! He won’t embarrass me in public, right?","‘Gu Zheng! I’m warning you. If you dare to say that you’re not working with Yun Chu, I won’t acknowledge you as my senior anymore. From now on, you’re just a bastard!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was rarely nervous as she anxiously waited for Gu Zheng’s answer.","Seeing this, Yao Menggqing said first, “Xi Xi, I think Ah Zheng means that Gu Corporation and Yun Chu haven’t collaborated yet, right? Don’t tell me you’re.”","Before she could finish, Gu Zheng looked up and sneered. “Miss Yao.”","Yao Mengqing’s heart tightened.","Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed slightly and were filled with coldness. His voice was low, and it was as if a thousand-kilogram rock had smashed into Yao Mengqing’s heart. The air seemed to have frozen.","Gu Zheng swept his gaze coldly. “Xi Xi has already said on my behalf that I want to work with Yun Chu. I thought you would be clear on this, so I didn’t say anything.”","Yao Mengqing’s heart trembled.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “However... you don’t seem to believe me. I’ll say it again. Mrs. Gu is my wife and the mistress of Gu Corporation. Her words represent my intentions.”","Yao Mengqing’s vision darkened as she explained in a panic, “Ah Zheng... President Gu, i-it’s not that I don’t believe in Xi Xi. I just... I just thought that she was joking. After all, Yun Chu has rejected Gu Corporation once before and the two were said to no longer be keeping in contact. Unexpectedly...”","She gritted her teeth. If she had known earlier, she would have come to renew the contract sooner. She did not expect that Gu Corporation would actually collaborate with Yun Chu.","Yun Chu had clearly rejected Gu Corporation three years ago. At that time, it even caused a sensation internationally. Rumor had it that Gu Corporation hated Yun Chu and decided not to ever collaborate with her. How could they suddenly go back on their word?","What was going on?","Yao Mengqing abruptly raised her eyes and looked at Qiao Xi!","It was this b*tch!","At that time, when she was designing clothes for Qiao Xi, Yun Chu had given Qiao Xi jewelry. This meant that Qiao Xi knew Yun Chu and Qiao Xi must have facilitated this collaboration.."]},{"number":413,"title":"Chapter 413 - Who Dares To Fight Me?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing’s breathing quickened. She forced herself to calm down and squeezed out a smile. ‘Tm really sorry, Ah Zheng. I was too impatient and didn’t take the time to understand the situation. I didn’t expect Yun Chu to agree to the collaboration. Congratulations!”","Gu Zheng ignored her.","Yao Mengqing suddenly thought of something. “Li City is going to hold a jewelry design exhibition soon. Will Yun Chu be participating?”","Qiao Xi instantly understood this woman’s thoughts and said directly, “No.”","“Xi Xi, how do you know so much? Do you know Yun Chu?” Yao Mengqing smiled slightly. “I heard that Yun Chu has a proud character and is unrestrained. She has very high standards too. Seeing as Xi Xi and Yun Chu are so close, could it be that Xi Xi has an outstanding talent in jewelry design too?”","Lin Jie also understood what Yao Mengqing meant and hurriedly chimed in, “Yes! Miss Qiao, if you know Yun Chu, you must also know jewelry design?”","Qiao Xi replied unhurriedly, “How could I be as skilled as Miss Yao?”","Acold glint flashed in Yao Menggqing’s eyes as she said gently, “Xi Xi, I heard that you originally signed up for this competition, but for some reason, you withdrew. Since Yun Chu isn’t participating, it’ll be good for you to represent her!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Miss Yao, do you find it meaningful to beat around the bush?”","Yao Mengging’s face was filled with embarrassment, but she quickly recovered and said affectionately, “Xi Xi, I don’t have any ill intentions. I’m just curious as to why you suddenly gave up after registering. Since you signed up, it means that you’re interested in jewelry design. Actually, the rankings aren’t","important at all. If you’re interested, you should just participate!","“Moreover, you’re Yun Chu’s friend! You must be very capable. Maybe your design will be favored by the judges.”","Lin Jie also tried to persuade her. “Yes, it’s rare for Li City to hold a jewelry design competition. Don’t miss this opportunity.”","These two people spoke one after another. On the surface, they seemed to be kindly encouraging Qiao Xi, but it was actually...","Qiao Xi was naturally able to see through Yao Mengqing’s thoughts. Yao Mengging did not see her name on the list, so she thought Qiao Xi had withdrawn from the competition.","Those who quit at the last minute either had health issues or did not have the confidence to participate in the competition. Hence, Yao Mengqing thought that Qiao Xi was afraid and did not have confidence in her jewelry design skills.","Hence, Yao Mengging and Lin Jie were taking tums to encourage her to participate in the competition. When the time came, Yao Mengging would trample on her in public and elevate herself. It would highlight the gap between the two of them.","How thoughtful!","Qiao Xi lost her mind and roared furiously. “It’s just a competition! I’ll participate!”","Seeing that she had agreed, Yao Mengging revealed a satisfied smile. “Xi Xi, the results of the competition don’t matter. What’s important is the process. It doesn’t matter even if your design isn’t good. You’re still so young, so you still have many chances to succeed.","“Jewelry design is different from other crafts. It requires a lot of investment. I don’t think you underwent formal learning, but you don’t have to be afraid. It’s normal to fail. Actually, it’s already very outstanding that you have the courage to participate.”","After a round of hypocritical comforting, Yao Mengqing turned to look at Gu Zheng. “It’s just a pity that I can’t work with President Gu anymore. I’m sorry to have disturbed you.”","Yao Mengqing and Lin Jie stood up and left. When they reached the door, Lin Jie said unwillingly, “Mengqing, what’s the point of comforting Qiao Xi? She won’t remember your kind gestures. In any case, you’ll definitely be the champion this time. It’s uncertain if Qiao Xi can even get on the ranking. She","might even lose miserably!”","“ah Jie","“am I wrong? Apart from Yun Chu, who else can compare to you? I’ve seen all the contestants this time. There are only a few famous designers, and none of them are as capable as you. You’re the most famous one. It’s impossible that the judges won’t show you any respect.”","Qiao Xi pricked up her ears and clearly heard what the two of them were talking about.","Yao Mengqing was so confident. Without Yun Chu, would she definitely be the champion?","‘If don’t reveal my identity, I don’t think you’ll ever shut up!”","Yao Mengqing was really an unkillable cockroach. She did not learn her lesson even after getting humiliated multiple times. It seemed that Qiao Xi had to teach her a fierce lesson this time. She would use Yun Chu’s identity to slap her face!","Who could compete with Yun Chu when she appeared?"]},{"number":414,"title":"Chapter 414 - Pretending To Be Master Yun Chu’s Friend","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After Yao Mengging left Gu Corporation, she bade farewell to Lin Jie and got into the car to go home. Her gentle smile instantly turned vicious. She called someone.","After hearing Yao Mengging’s words, they snorted coldly. “Who’s Qiao Xi? I’ve never heard of her! Teacher Yun Chu has always been living overseas. Even I rarely see her. She doesn’t have a friend named Qiao Xi!”","Yao Mengqing smiled smugly. As expected.","She pretended to be hesitant and asked, “But seeing how confident she is, I think that she’s really Master Yun Chu’s friend!”","The other party snorted arrogantly. ‘I’m the only one who has been with my master for so many years. Mengqing, you must have been deceived. After all, Master Yun Chu’s name is too famous. It’s not odd that someone is pretending to be her friend. The woman you’re talking about is named Qiao Xi, right?","‘When we get to the competition, I’ll definitely let her witness true jewelry design skills and teach her a lesson!”","Yao Menggqing’s eyes were filled with smugness, but she still pretended to be worried. “Jason, don’t do this. She’s just an ordinary person. She doesn’t have any talent in jewelry design. She’s only participating in this competition out of anger.”","Jason was burning with anger. “How dare a person who doesn’t know anything about designing pretend to be Master Yun Chu’s friend? She’s really overestimating herself!”","After hanging up, Yao Mengging smiled proudly. Jason was Yun Chu’s disciple and had always been by her side. If he said that Master Yun Chu did not have a friend named Qiao Xi, then it meant that she did not.","Pretending to be Yun Chu’s friend... Heh, Qiao Xi would definitely pay the price for her rashness.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already submitted her application form and successfully obtained the invitation.","There were a total of three parts to the jewelry design competition this time. The first part required all the participants to prepare their first drafts. This process was confidential. The other participants would not know each other’s first drafts, so they would not be able to know each other’s ability either.","During the on-site competition, the perfect work is designed according to the design draft. In order to ensure fairness, all the materials would be provided by the competition’s organizers.","This was the first time Li City was holding such a large-scale jewelry design competition. Jewelry design looked simple, but color combination and using the right tools were delicate skills. Not only did participants have to design, but they also had to create the jewelry themselves. It was a true test of the","designers’ skills.","The production process would take a total of five days. It was very difficult to produce perfect jewelry pieces. Moreover, the materials provided by the competition’s organizers would be different. This was also a factor that would affect the design results. Of course, it also tested the designers’ ability to adapt","on the spot.","Qiao Xi was not nervous in the slightest. She first applied for leave from the university so that she would be free for five days.","8a.m..","Gu Zheng drove Qiao Xi to the competition venue.","‘Tl come and pick you up after tonight,” Gu Zheng said.","Qiao Xi shook her head. “You’re so busy with work. Let Song Shiyu pick me up. I’m not sure when itll end.”","They had to complete the design and production in five days. They could finish the design drafts at home, but they had to be on-site to produce the jewelry.","In order to save time, many designers would eat and stay in the lounge to avoid wasting time going back and forth from their house.","Qiao Xi felt that Gu Zheng was already very busy, so she had to be considerate. “Let Song Shiyu pick me up.”","Gu Zheng would definitely be very touched that she was being so considerate of him. She was a really sensible and good wife!","However...","Gu Zheng slammed on the brakes, frowned, and questioned, “How is Song Shiyu better than me? Youre insisting that he pick you up instead. Am I your husband, or is Song Shiyu?!”","Qiao Xi: *?” Damn...","She was about to retort when she suddenly saw a familiar person standing outside.","Yao Mengqing was standing with a group of participants and chatting with the judges. She was smiling, “She said that she’s Yun Chu’s friend! Look, she’s here now. Xi Xi, come quickly!”","Qiao Xi: *.”","Yao Mengqing indeed had the ability to drive people crazy. If she did not press Yao Mengqing to the ground this time, it would be difficult to resolve the hatred in her heart.","There were many luxury cars parked at the scene. Although Gu Zheng’s car was expensive, its color was low-profile and did not attract much attention.","After all, jewelry designers were definitely very rich. It was not strange to drive luxury cars. However, Yao Mengging still saw Gu Zheng’s car among the many luxury cars.."]},{"number":415,"title":"Chapter 415 - The Higher You Climb, The Worse You Fall","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng had many cars, and Song Shiyu usually drove them. However, only Gu Zheng could drive this car, and he always used it to fetch Qiao Xi.","Yao Menggqing gritted her teeth. What right did Qiao Xi have to occupy Gu Zheng’s love? It should belong to her, Yao Mengqing!","Her face was livid, while her eyes were filled with envy and viciousness. However, when she faced Qiao Xi, she still squeezed out a smile. “Xi Xi, you came at the right time. We were just talking about you.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression and said casually, “Oh, what are you praising me for? Let me hear it too.”","The air froze.","The corners of everyone’s mouths twitched slightly. They probably felt extremely shocked that a shameless person like Qiao Xi could participate in the competition.","Yao Mengqing was also surprised. She almost shouted, ‘You’re so shameless!” However, she still held it in and smiled. “Didn’t you say that you and Yun Chu know each other? Everyone is very envious of you. Xi Xi, you’re really lucky to be able to meet such an outstanding designer like Master Yun Chu.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi really wanted to strangle Yao Mengqing and make her shut up. The moment she opened her mouth, she was like a two-faced snake!","“Envious of me? Miss Yao, youre really funny! What does it have to do with you whether I know Yun Chu or not? Moreover, I know Yun Chu because I’m skilled enough, not because I’m lucky!”","The smile on Yao Mengging’s face froze. The veins on her forehead twitched as she suppressed the anger in her heart.","Why was Qiao Xi not pretending to be weak anymore? She was actually showing her attitude in front of everyone. Could it be that Qiao Xi really had the strength?","No, no way!","She had long investigated Qiao Xi. She did not know how to design jewelry at all.","Yao Mengqing’s expression eased up a little. Qiao Xi was pretending to be Yun Chu’s friend and even said that she was very skilled. When the time came and her ugly designs were revealed, she would definitely lose miserably. If the media spread the news, Qiao Xi would not be able to raise her head in Li City","anymore.","Yao Menggqing revealed a dangerous gaze. Since it was like that, she would lend Qiao Xi a hand.","She smiled slightly. “Xi Xi, you’re right. It’s because you’re very capable that you could get to know such an outstanding designer like Yun Chu... You’ll definitely stand out in this competition.”","Originally, Yao Mengqing was the person with the highest chance of winning the championship. Everyone had seen her designs and her work was indeed very meticulous. Most importantly, she had even invited Jason as her partner this time. With the two of them working together, Yao Mengqing would be","the champion this time.","However, now that a contestant who was Yun Chu’s friend had suddenly appeared, everyone could not help but suspect if she was stronger than Yao Mengqing.","Yao Menggqing said warmly, “Xi Xi, congratulations.”","“Miss Yao is right. I’ll definitely be able to win the championship!” Qiao Xi smiled proudly. “Miss Yao, it’s really rare for you to be self-aware.”","Yao Mengging: “!”","Qiao Xi was too shameless!","She had only exchanged a few pleasantries, yet Qiao Xi took the words she said seriously? Did she really think that her work could win over the masses?","However, this was also good. The higher one climbed, the worse the fall.","Yao Mengqing suppressed her anger. “Yes, I believe you’ll definitely be able to design a perfect piece. The championship will definitely belong to you!”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. How could she not be able to tell that Yao Mengqing was deliberately flattering her so that she could watch her take a terrible fall later? However, this did not pose the slightest threat to Qiao Xi because she was so outstanding. It was not an exaggeration to say at all!","Qiao Xi raised her head high and proudly walked past Yao Mengaing to go into the hall, but Yao Mengqing suddenly asked, “Xi Xi, isn’t your partner here? It’s a two-person collaboration this time!”","In this competition, apart from the individual’s design skills, it also depended on the designer’s connections and character. If they could invite a skilled designer, they could reverse the outcome of the competition.","Moreover, the competition this time was very large-scale. Most of the designers who had time would not refuse upon being invited. After all, being able to appear in public could increase one’s ability and reputation.","Yao Mengqing looked proud. “I invited Yun Chu’s disciple, Mr. Jason, for this competition. I wonder which designer you’ve invited?”","Qiao Xi: “2”","What?","Yun Chu’s disciple, Jason?","Why didn’t she know that she had a disciple named Jason? Who was this so-called disciple of hers?","Before she could think, Yao Mengging asked with an annoying expression, “Xi Xi, you haven’t said who your partner is.. Tell me!”"]},{"number":416,"title":"Chapter 416 - The President Of ZR Corporation Is Here Too","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi turned around. “Do the rules say that we have to complete the competition with another designer?”","“Not really...”","“That’s good. I’ll participate in the competition myself.” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she walked into the design hall indifferently. She did not even bother to look at Yao Mengqing, and she was arrogant like a peacock.","Yao Mengqing’s expression was ugly as she gritted her teeth. However, it was not appropriate for her to flare up in front of everyone. She only smiled awkwardly. “It seems that Xi Xi is indeed capable! After all, she’s Yun Chu’s friend and definitely has a certain level of talent. When Jason arrives, we should","let the two meet. Perhaps the two of them are very familiar with each other!”","After Qiao Xi entered the design hall, she found her seat—No. 29.","The designers would be seated according to their numbers. They would complete their designs here for the next few days. There were surveillance cameras throughout the venue to ensure the authenticity and fairness of the competition.","“Qiao Xi! You’re here too!” A surprised female voice sounded in her ears.","Qiao Xi turned around and saw Li Xing’er looking at her in surprise. The woman threw down her tools and ran over excitedly. “You’re also here to participate in the competition! I heard from my brother that you were coming. I thought he was lying to me! I heard that you’re Yun Chu’s friend, so you should","be a famous designer too. But why is your seat in the 20s?”","There were a total of 30 seats in the design venue. The top five were in front of the judges. The workstations there were spacious and bright. The materials provided were also the best.","Those who got numbers after 20 were unknown newcomers. Their workstations were small and the lighting was dim. Most importantly, the good materials needed for the design might have already been picked by others. It would greatly affect their designs.","Hence, Li Xing‘er was puzzled. Why did Qiao Xi get 29th? This was the farthest spot from the materials section.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Who’s No. 1?”","Li Xing’er did not hesitate at all. “Of course, it’s Yao Mengging! I feel like vomiting the moment I see her face. She was fooling around at the banquet previously yet she even dares to show her face now!”","Qiao Xi nodded.","She glanced at the design venue in front of her. “Li Xing’er, for people who are truly capable, objective factors are not important. It doesn’t matter which venue it is or under what kind of circumstances. After all, anyone has the right to be the champio","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. She was Yun Chu! Hence, it didn’t matter if her workspace was slightly worse. She would definitely be the champion and let Yao Mengging know her true strength.","When Li Xing’er heard these words, her eyes were filled with hope. “Qiao Xi, I know I’m very talented. I’ll work hard to create the perfect design. I won’t let you down!”","Qiao Xi: “?” Tm talking about myself! What does it have to do with you?!”","ZR was a famous jewelry design company in the world. Almost all the celebrities in the world were proud to have ZR’s jewelry. Moreover, not everyone could wear ZR’s jewelry.","This competition was actually organized by ZR Corporation for the sake of finding talented jewelry designers all over the country. Hence, the competition this time was very significant. Being able to win the championship was equivalent to being acknowledged by ZR Corporation.","Moreover, the president of ZR was here too.","Madam Chu Lan, a judge for the competition and a veteran of international jewelry design, was currently standing in the office on the second floor. She asked the man in front of her respectfully, “Sir, do you want to invite that designer up?”","In the design hall.","Qiao Xi tidied up her workspace and heard Li Xing’er complaining, “My brother is here! He’s definitely here to capture me. They don’t support me in jewelry design as they think it’s useless, but I really want to finish this competition!","“Qiao Xi, help me persuade him. Just tell him that I’m busy and ask my brother to go back first. If you can stop him from coming for a day, then do it. I just have to find ways to stay here till the competition ends.","“My brother is on the second floor.”","Qiao Xi had a good impression of Li Xing’er. It was rare for Li Xing’er to beg her, so she was willing to help her. It was not a big deal anyway.","She nodded. “Where’s the second floor?”","Li Xing’er said, “He said it’s next to President ZR’s office. You should be able to see it if you go up. He brought his subordinates over too. Go upstairs and say that I told you to go. Someone will lead the way..”"]},{"number":417,"title":"Chapter 417 - You Can Only Call Me ‘Brother’","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi was about to leave when Li Xing‘er hurriedly advised, “There’s one more thing. Don’t call my brother ‘President Li’ when you see him. He doesn’t like others calling him that. He keeps saying that it makes him sound like an old man. You’re about the same age as me, so why don’t you just call him","‘Brother Li’ or ‘Brother? Don’t be too formal.”","Qiao Xi nodded and went straight to the second floor. She had just reached the door when she bumped into a man who looked like an assistant.","The assistant was stunned for a moment and was slightly hesitant. “... Are you Miss Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi was also stunned for a moment. Li Xing’er had already told President Li that she would be coming over? He sent someone to pick her up?","As expected of a president, he was very efficient. She nodded. “I am.”","The assistant’s heart was filled with doubts. He did not understand why Qiao Xi would suddenly appear at the door when Madam Chu Lan had just instructed him to fetch Qiao Xi. After thinking about it, he figured that Madam Chu Lan had called Qiao Xi or sent her a message, so he did not ask further.","‘What was even stranger was that Mr. Mysterious in the office wore a mask and looked like an emotionless machine. But it turned out that he was also interested in women?","The assistant looked at Qiao Xi. He had to admit that she was indeed very beautiful and had a cold aura.","He bent down and said respectfully, “Miss Qiao, Sir is already waiting inside. Please come in.”","Qiao Xi sighed. The Li family’s assistants were really cultured. This man and Song Shiyu were both assistants. Why was the difference so huge?","However, President Li’s assistant called him ‘Sir.’ Indeed, he did not like others calling him ‘President Li.","The assistant brought Qiao Xi to the office and knocked on the door. “Sir, Miss Qiao is here.”","The person in the room hummed. Qiao Xi suddenly felt that this voice was a little familiar.","The assistant bent down and reached out with a smile. “Miss Qiao, please go in.”","Qiao Xi thought in her heart that there was no need to be so polite, right? She was just helping Li Xing‘er send a message. It was just a matter of relaying a message, so why did it seem like she was here for an inspection?","However, Qiao Xi did not think too much about it. She simply thought that the Li family was strict with their upbringing. The legendary President Li was good at managing people.","Qiao Xi was not in a rush to enter. She stood at the door and thought for a few seconds. Since she could not call him ‘President Li,’ how should she call him? ‘Mr. Li’? However","At this moment, her phone rang. It was a message from Li Xing‘er: [Qiao Xi, you must remember not to call him ‘President Li. Just call him ‘Brother’. Otherwise, if he’s unhappy, he’ll forcefully bring me back. I won’t be able to participate in the competition anymore. I beg you! Whether or not I can","participate will depend on you!]","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression.","She could feel that Li Xing’er really liked jewelry design. She was also a jewelry designer herself, so she could empathize with Li Xing’er.","Since she had already promised Li Xing‘er, she would persuade President Li not to come fetch her back. She would just do as Li Xing’er said and call him ‘Brother:","A smile hung on the comers of Qiao Xi’s mouth. She took a deep breath, pushed the door open, and chuckled. “Hello, Brother.”","Gu Zheng,","When Qiao Xi raised her eyes and saw the familiar face before her, she was instantly petrified.","Gu Zheng said, “Before you entered, you didn’t know that I was looking for you, right? Or do you just call out ‘Brother’ whenever you see someone?”","Instantly, the atmosphere in the room changed. The smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually vanished, and a terrified expression appeared on her face.","‘Wait, wasn’t the person in the office supposed to be President Li? Why was it Gu Zheng?","Before she could figure it out, the man walked in front of her with his long legs and said in a hoarse voice, “Mrs. Gu, I really want to know who you’re calling ‘Brother’.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she shuddered. If Gu Zheng knew that she called President Li ‘Brother’ the first time she met him, would he directly kill Li Xing’er’s brother?","Qiao Xi hurriedly smiled. “Idiot! Of course, I’m calling you ‘Brother’! Who else would I call that?!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as his deep voice echoed in her ears. “Is that so?”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as she replied guiltily, “Yes, that’s right.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and stared at her with burning eyes. “Mrs. Gu, I’m your husband. You can only call me ‘Brother’ and not anyone else..”"]},{"number":418,"title":"Chapter 418 - Gu Zheng Must Be Jealous Of His Handsome Face","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Since the two of them met, Qiao Xi had always called him ‘Senior’ or ‘Brother’. To Gu Zheng, the word ‘Brother’ held extraordinary meaning, so he did not allow Qiao Xi to call anyone else that.","Speaking of which, who was she calling ‘Brother’ earlier?","Qiao Xi’s expression eased up when she saw that his expression was normal.","‘Fortunately, I’m smart enough not to tell Gu Zheng that I was calling out to Li Xing’er’s brother. Otherwise, Gu Zheng would definitely rush over and kill him!”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Oh! So it was Li Xing’er’s brother!","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng’s meaningful smile and suddenly felt a chill run down her spine. She was just about to change the topic when she heard Gu Zheng ask slowly, “How did you know that I was in the room?”","“Uh, this...”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. She didn’t know how to explain it either. Could it be that they were telepathic?","She resisted the urge to cry and cleared her throat. She said aggrievedly, “Who else would look for me but you? I’m very touched, so I called you ‘Brother,’ but... you’re actually doubting me. I feel so aggrieved! Boo-hoo.","“How would I know that you were looking for me? I thought you were Li Xing’er’s brother! Moreover, I went upstairs to look for President Li. Why did the assistant bring me to see Gu Zheng”","“Although we’re husband and wife, we still need some surprises occasionally. There’s nothing new about calling you ‘Ah Zheng’ and ‘hubby’ anymore, so I wanted to call you ‘Brother’.”","‘Actually, I prefer calling you a bastard, but you definitely won’t let me.’","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Gu Zheng remained calm and sneered. “I didn’t expect you to know how to be romantic, Mrs. Gu. Thank you so much.”","Qiao Xi choked.","“Something’s not right! Gu Zheng, who’s so paranoid, actually believes me?","‘Could it be that my acting skills have improved? I can even deceive Gu Zheng now?","Qiao Xi probed, “Speaking of which, Gu Zheng, why are you here?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her. Although she said that she had guessed that the person in the room was him, she could not guess why she was here. She even had the cheek to say that the person she was calling out ‘Brother’ to was him.","Gu Zheng did not expose her and asked indifferently, “I was just casually looking around. Is the competition about to start?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “There’s still 20 minutes.”","“Let’s go. I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “I don’t have time to accompany you anymore. I just found out that this competition is a two-person competition. I’m alone, so the production time will be longer.”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Come downstairs with me. I’ll give you a surprise.”","Qiao","She followed Gu Zheng downstairs and was about to ask why the assistant called Gu Zheng ‘Sir’ instead of ‘President Gu’. However, she was suddenly stunned by the scene in front of her.","Gu Yao was standing in the middle of the venue with a group of girls around him.","Li Xing‘er was standing not far away and watching the show. When she saw Qiao Xi return, she hurriedly waved at her excitedly.","Gu Yao was surrounded by people. His face was red and he was at a loss.","“Second Young Master Gu, why are you here to watch the competition? You like jewelry design too? It’s not time for the competition yet. I wonder if I have the honor to treat you to a drink?”","Gu Yao said, “I’m not thirsty.”","The girl said sweetly, “It’s okay if you’re not thirsty. We can chat for a while.”","Gu Yao said, “I’m not familiar with you.”","Qiao Xi: “...” What kind of surprise was Gu Yao’s presence?","At this moment, someone came in front of Gu Yao and handed him a piece of paper. She was extremely shy. “Second Young Master Gu, this is my number. If you have time, you can call me.”","Gu Yao’s face was filled with disdain. “Miss, can you be a little more cautious when you’re outside? Aren’t you afraid of being targeted by others if you casually give your phone number out like this? You’re really brainless!”","The girl was about to cry: “...”","After Gu Yao sent everyone away by himself, he sat at the side and stared blankly.","How was he considered the second young master of the Gu family right now? He was just Gu Zheng’s employee. Gu Zheng had ordered him to help Qiao Xi carry the materials, so he had to be obedient. He was the second young master of the Gu family but he was actually reduced to a porter. It was really","too tragic.","Gu Zheng must be jealous of his handsome face!","Qiao Xi walked to his side and said helplessly, “The young lady left you her phone number. Even if you don’t like her, you can’t reject her in front of everyone! You’re not being polite at all.”"]},{"number":419,"title":"Chapter 419 - Longing","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao said aggrievedly, “You don’t know how scary they were. If I accept that lady’s number, there’ll be rumors of me dating her the next day. I don’t want to be treated as a fool! What I want is a passionate relationship!”","Qiao Xi: “...” You haven’t even been in a f*cking relationship before, yet you still have the cheek to say that you want to be in a passionate relationship?","The competition was about to start. Gu Yao squatted obediently at the side. Qiao Xi and the other designers also received the topic of this competition.","The topic was ‘longing,’ They had to design a set of jewelry that matched the topic.","At this moment, the staff had already briefly displayed and introduced all the materials. They also placed all the materials in the materials section so that the designers could clearly see what materials were available and adjust their designs based on them.","Qiao Xi swept her gaze over it. There were many types of materials, including gems of various colors, diamonds, gold and silver threads, pearls, gold foil, and so on. Almost all the materials here were great items, but there were not many of them. It was impossible to guarantee that everyone would get","the materials they wanted.","Of course, the more precious the materials were, the less of them there were. There were a total of 30 designer groups, so there would definitely be some who could not get the materials.","Hence, the competition organizers stipulated that the materials and tools needed would be chosen according to when the designers submitted their design drafts. If a particular material had all been picked, the others could only choose other materials.","Gu Yao was excited. “Wow, that sounds exciting. This isn’t just a competition of design skills but also luck and wisdom. If they can choose the materials first, they’ll have an advantage!","“However, if your ranking is lower and the materials have already been selected, the product will have to be completely different from the design drafts. Ten points will be deducted too. Qiao Xi, have you thought of your design drafts?”","Qiao Xi picked up the pen unhurriedly. Design drafts were totally easy for her. She thought for a moment before starting to draw.","A moment later, the exquisite design draft was completed.","Gu Yao stretched his head out to take a look and instantly widened his mouth in surprise. “Wow! Qiao Xi, you’re too awesome! Hurry up and submit the design draft! I’ll help you look for the materials. What do you need?”","Qiao Xi told Gu Yao all the materials she needed. Gu Yao took notes and was about to head to the materials section when he saw that Yao Mengging had also completed her design draft and was about to submit it.","Gu Yao: “?” That wasn’t right. He was very clear about Yao Mengging’s standard of design. It was absolutely inferior to Qiao Xi’s. It had only been a moment, yet she had already finished her design draft? How was that possible?!","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing in admiration. She was indeed a goddess of design. She designed it so quickly.","Gu Yao was afraid that the materials Qiao Xi needed would be snatched away by others. He did not dare to delay any longer and hurriedly walked to the materials section.","Everyone was surprised.","Yao Mengging was an internationally renowned designer. It was understandable for her to finish her design draft so quickly and get to choose the materials first, but Qiao Xi was just a newcomer. How could she finish her design draft so quickly?","The requirements for the design drafts of this jewelry competition were complicated. For the sake of fairness, the details of the design and production had to be drawn on paper. Moreover, everything had to be clearly marked. Even if one’s imagination was unleashed, it would not be easy to complete the","design drafts. It was also a test for the designers.","In less than an hour, the two of them had already submitted their drafts. It was really unbelievable.","It was still reasonable for Yao Mengging to be able to quickly finish her design draft. After all, she had a brand called Sunshine under her name. The clothes and jewelry she designed were also very popular overseas. Practice made perfect. It was not strange for her to draw her design draft quickly.","However, Qiao Xi","“Yao Mengqing is so awesome! She finished her design draft in less than an hour.”","“Qiao Xi must have drawn it blindly, right? How could a newcomer like her compare to so many outstanding designers? She might not even know how to draw the design draft. She must have just casually drawn a few strokes.”","“speaking of which, only Yun Chu has dared to be this arrogant in all these years!”","At this point, everyone could not help but start recalling. “Back then, I was lucky enough to watch Yun Chu participate in a competition. She entered as a newcomer and designed her draft in 20 minutes. At that time, everyone thought that she casually drew it. Unexpectedly, her design draft was perfect.”"]},{"number":420,"title":"Chapter 420 - Imitate Indiscriminately","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“After Yun Chu became the champion, she became famous overseas. Many designers wanted to acknowledge Yun Chu as their master, even if they had to be her assistant. However, she kept a low profile and rarely showed her face. After that, many people tried to learn from Yun Chu and quickly completed","their design drafts. The results were tragic. Could it be that Qiao Xi...”","“She’s just imitating her. Yun Chu is a genius, so how could Qiao Xi have the qualifications to compare to her?”","Hearing the crowd’s discussion, Yao Mengqing was calm as she smiled at Gu Yao. “Ah Yao, are you here to help Xi Xi get the materials? I asked her who her partner was just now, but she refused to tell me. So it’s you!”","Yao Mengqing’s assistant snorted. “Why is Miss Qiao doing this?! She clearly has a partner, but she said that she was participating in the competition alone in front of everyone. Was she trying to show off and claim that she’s very capable? She even dares to order Second Young Master Gu around. She’s too","arrogant!”","“Lil Tong, don’t say that,” Yao Mengging interrupted, then looked at Gu Yao. “Xi Xi probably forgot. Ah Yao, I didn’t expect you to participate in the competition too. If I had known that Xi Xi’s partner was you, I would have introduced you to the judges.”","Gu Yao stopped in his tracks.","Damn! Was this woman trying to drive a wedge between them?","He had actually been deceived by this woman for so many years. In the past, he thought that she was gentle, kind, and not scheming. Hence, even if there was anything wrong, he would not think too much about it. Now, it seemed that Yao Mengging had done countless bad things behind his back.","What Yao Mengqing meant was that Qiao Xi deliberately did not mention her partner and pretended to be participating in the competition alone because she wanted to make herself look good.","Gu Yao narrowed his eyes. “Sister Mengqing.”","Yao Mengqing’s face was gentle.","Gu Yao asked, “I heard that your partner is Mr. Jason? Since it’s a two-person competition, why did you bring your assistant over? If an assistant isn’t considered a partner or a participant, it’s understandable that Qiao Xi said she doesn’t have a partner because I’m her assistant! I’m not her partner at all","because I don’t know jewelry design!”","The smile on Yao Mengging’s face vanished instantly.","Gu Yao... The second young master of the Gu family was Qiao Xi’s assistant?","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and followed Gu Yao’s footsteps. She still asked in a gentle tone, “Ah Yao, did Xi Xi ask you to get the materials for her? Since you don’t know anything about design, do you know how to choose the materials? Do you want me to help you?”","At this moment, Gu Yao wanted to look into Yao Mengging’s brain to see if it had been damaged. Hadn’t he already shown his disgust? How could she be so shameless as to still come over?","Yao Menggqing saw Gu Yao’s impatience and smiled slightly. “Xi Xi is Yun Chu’s friend. No wonder you’re willing to be her assistant. I won’t disturb you from choosing the materials.”","After Gu Yao left, Yao Mengqing’s assistant said angrily, “Sister Mengqing, you were the one who submitted the design draft first. Why did you let Qiao Xi choose first? This is very disadvantageous to us.”","Yao Menggqing smiled confidently. “It’s okay. I’ve been a designer for so many years. I can adapt to the situation even without the corresponding materials, but Xi Xi is a newbie. If I choose the materials she needs, won’t I be bullying her?”","Gu Yao ignored the two of them, but he still felt that something was wrong. Yao Menggqing was letting him choose first. Could it be that she was up to something?","He turned around and glanced at Yao Mengging, then walked in warily. There should be no problem with choosing first.","If Yao Mengqing chose the materials Qiao Xi needed, then it would be troublesome. There were benefits to being the first to choose. There would be no conspiracy!","Gu Yao walked in front of the staff and wrote down the materials he needed.","For the sake of fairness, the competition’s organizers stipulated that after all the designers had handed in their drafts, they would distribute the materials at the same time. The designers could then start working on their pieces at the same time.","However, the designers who submitted their drafts first could reserve the materials. Those who submitted later could only pick from the leftover materials that had yet to be reserved.","‘When Yao Mengging came in to make a reservation, she saw Gu Yao’s registration form and glanced at it quietly. There was a special material on it called Spirit Jade Pearl. It was transparent and shiny.","Among the available materials, there was another material that was very similar to the Spirit Jade Pearl. It was called the Gray Spirit Pearl. The two pearls looked very similar at first glance, but the effects were completely different. If one used this pearl wrongly, it might affect the final outcome."]},{"number":421,"title":"Chapter 421 - The Material Was Destroyed","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the afternoon, the designers handed in their design drafts one after another. The competition’s organizers informed the contestants to collect the materials from the materials section with their reservations.","Yao Mengqing and Jason received their materials first. Just as they were about to return to the design hall, Yao Mengqing suddenly exclaimed, “Oh my! I forgot to take the Gray Spirit Pearl. Lil Tong isn’t around either. Id better go back.”","Jason was unhappy. “We can do it later. We have to go confirm the main body of the piece first.”","“But...”","Yao Mengqing was in a difficult position. “No, the materials Xi Xi chose are very similar to mine. What if I take the wrong materials? Moreover, she...”","Jason roared, “What are you afraid of? What can she do in public? Even if she has a backer, she won’t dare to destroy your materials so brazenly!”","“Mengging, I’l go get it for you!” At this moment, a familiar face walked over and looked at Yao Mengqing gently.","Yao Mengqing’s face was like a peach. She had a good figure and gentle eyes, making the man’s heart tremble. “Miss Yao, I’m Lin Jie’s friend. He asked me to take care of you. I’m going to get my materials now, so I’ll help you get yours too.”","In their circle, Yao Mengqing was like a goddess. She had the status of the eldest daughter of the Yao family. Her figure and appearance were outstanding. She also had her own fashion and jewelry brands, as well as superb talent in design. Such a woman was the dream lover of all men.","Of course, she understood the man’s thoughts. She made herself look pitiful, and her eyes were red. “Thank you, Brother Chen Hao. I... It’s all my fault for being too careless. The material I need is the Gray Spirit Pearl. You should know what it is.”","Chen Hao nodded, and he just happened to see Qiao Xi walk past him. His face instantly turned gloomy.","Qiao Xi, this b*tch, actually dared to bully Mengging. Mengqing was the favorite among the bunch of them. Whoever dared to bully her would be going against the children of wealthy families like them!","After a while, Chen Hao returned with the material. Yao Mengging picked it up and positioned it under the lights, smiling proudly.","It was the Spirit Jade Pearl that Qiao Xi needed. Chen Hao did not take the Gray Spirit Pearl that Yao Mengging had reserved.","Without the Spirit Jade Pearl, she wanted to see what Qiao Xi could design!","Chen Hao shifted his eyes. “Mr. Jason.”","Jason looked up.","Chen Hao lowered his voice. “Actually, this pearl isn’t Mengging’s Gray Spirit Pearl. Mengqing’s Gray Spirit Pearl had a very deep mark on it. It was destroyed. Even if you take it, it can’t be used in the design.”","Yao Mengqing stood at the side and looked at the design draft. She pretended not to hear anything, but her eyes were filled with joy.","Chen Hao continued, “I asked someone about it. They said that the person who destroyed the Gray Spirit Pearl was Qiao Xi. She’s deliberately causing trouble for Mengqing because she wants to stop Mengqing from becoming the champion. After thinking about it, I couldn’t let her succeed, so I took the","Spirit Jade Pearl that Qiao Xi reserved.","“Qiao Xi shot herself in the foot. She deserves it! She should pay the price for destroying others’ materials. If she hadn’t damaged Mengging’s pearl, I wouldn’t have taken the materials she needed either!","“Mengqing is too kind. If I tell her the truth, she’ll definitely return the Spirit Jade Pearl to Qiao Xi. It’s better not to say anything.”","Chen Hao felt that he was really considerate. If he told Mengqing about it later, she would definitely be very touched.","Yao Mengqing smiled and pretended to be focused on creating the jewelry.","She was using Qiao Xi’s materials, but it did not matter even if someone found out because she was not involved! It was Chen Hao who stole Qiao Xi’s materials, not her!","However, Qiao Xi might not necessarily lack the materials because there were others who chose Spirit Jade Pearls as well. They would definitely be lacking in them in the end. If those people found out that there were fewer Spirit Jade Pearls, would they look for Qiao Xi to settle the score?","The competition was about to start. Qiao Xi and Gu Yao went to get the materials together. Unexpectedly, there were many people outside the door complaining about something.","“How did this happen? How can we complete our work without the materials?!”","Qiao Xi frowned and had a bad feeling.","Li Xing‘er hurriedly ran over and said anxiously, “Qiao Xi! Have you heard? Someone destroyed a pearl. The organizers are investigating it..”"]},{"number":422,"title":"Chapter 422 - Wrong Materials","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised as well. She did not expect that someone would dare to destroy the materials at the competition venue. If they were caught, it would not be as simple as revoking their qualifications to participate in the competition. It would be very difficult for them to gain a foothold in the","design world in the future.","Everyone present was a famous designer. Of course, they would not be angry, but the assistants were all very angry. The atmosphere in the materials section was very awkward.","After Qiao Xi entered, she saw a destroyed Gray Spirit Pearl on the table.","The Gray Spirit Pearl and the Spirit Jade Pearl looked very similar, but the colors revealed under the illumination of the light were completely different. Qiao Xi did not choose the Gray Spirit Pearl, but she did not understand why someone would destroy it.","Qiao Xi ignored it and went straight to collect her materials, but there was nothing there. She frowned and walked in front of the staff. “May I ask where the Spirit Jade Pearl I reserved is?”","Gu Yao said that he was the first to reserve the materials, but now that they were gone, it meant that someone had secretly taken away her materials.","The staff member’s expression was ugly. He did not have the time to care where a newcomer’s materials went. The most important thing now was to find out who destroyed the Gray Spirit Pearl.","An older staff member at the side hurriedly reminded, saying, “The president of ZR is here too. It won’t look good if something happens. Let’s solve Qiao Xi’s problem first before finding out who destroyed the materials.”","At this moment, Chen Hao walked over.","After checking the surveillance footage, the staff said with certainty, “The last Spirit Jade Pearl was taken by Mr. Chen Hao.”","Everyone’s gazes instantly landed on Chen Hao. In the lounge behind the materials room, the president of ZR slowly looked up.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were deep. “Mr. Chen Hao, according to the rules of the competition, you have to take your own materials. May I ask if you also need Spirit Jade Pearl? I remember that your work mainly consists of dark colors, so you shouldn’t need such a shiny pearl. If so, why did you take the Spirit Jade","Pearl that you don’t need?”","The atmosphere became awkward, and everyone looked at Chen Hao in confusion.","Today’s competition was full of twists and turns. The materials were destroyed, and someone took someone else’s Spirit Jade Pearls. When these two things were added together, the competition’s organizers looked troubled. “Mr. Chen, please explain why you took the Spirit Jade Pearl.”","Li Xing‘er’s face was filled with anger. “I’m guessing that Mr. Chen didn’t want to use the pearls for his own work but took them for Yao Mengqing! Did Yao Mengging reserve Spirit Jade Pearl as well? I don’t think so. Then why did you take someone else’s things?”","Gu Yao suddenly remembered that when he was reserving the materials, Yao Mengqing had asked him to make the first pick. At that time, he had already felt that something was wrong.","At this moment, Yao Mengging walked in and asked gently, “What happened? Mr. Chen, why are you here? Everyone... What’s going on?”","Gu Yao’s eyes darkened. “Yao Mengqing, you asked Chen Hao to get the materials for you, right?”","Yao Mengging looked innocent. “Yes, what’s wrong?”","“But the material you reserved is a Gray Spirit Pearl. Why did you let Chen Hao take Qiao Xi’s Spirit Jade Pearl? Have you already used the materials?”","One could hear a pin drop.","Everyone’s burning gaze landed on Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengging blinked innocently, her eyes filled with confusion. Coupled with her pale face, she looked very ignorant. It made one’s heart ache.","“The material I reserved is indeed a Gray Spirit Pearl. I asked Mr. Chen to help me get it. This...”","Yao Mengging paused for a moment, then suddenly widened her eyes. Her voice trembled slightly. “Could it be that Mr. Chen took the wrong materials? You gave Xi Xi’s materials to me? Our materials look similar, so it’s normal to mistake them, but... I’ve already used the pearl. This... What should I do?!”","Yao Mengqing looked troubled. Her eyes turned red unconsciously, and she looked pitiful. “Xi Xi, I didn’t know that those were your materials. I’m sorry, I... It’s my fault. I hope you can forgive me...”","Everyone was stunned. The person in charge also looked embarrassed.","They had held so many competitions before, but this was the first time they encountered such a situation. The designer had taken the wrong materials. This kind of thing should not have happened. This was because the basic skills a designer should have were not just the ability to design but to be able to","differentiate materials.. If one could not differentiate the materials, what right did they have to be a designer?"]},{"number":423,"title":"Chapter 423 - Surveillance Camera In The Materials Section","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","According to the rules, Yao Mengging should be punished for using the wrong materials. A light punishment would result in a deduction of points, and a heavy punishment would be the disqualification of the competition. However, the current situation was slightly troublesome because the person who","took the wrong materials was Chen Hao. Yao Mengqing had no idea.","The person in charge looked troubled. ZR’s president was in the lounge. If he did not handle it well and it caused a bad effect, he could just hand in his resignation.","He thought for a moment and cleared his throat. “Chen Hao, everyone saw the rules before participating in the competition. Now that you’ve violated the rules and took someone else’s materials, you...”","“Wait, listen to my explanation.” Chen Hao shouted. Then, he looked at Qiao Xi with vicious eyes.","“I did take Qiao Xi’s materials to give to Mengging, but I’m not wrong!”","Yao Menggqing lowered her eyes and smiled.","Qiao Xi was not surprised in the slightest. She knew that Yao Mengqing would definitely take this opportunity to trip her up. This was already within her expectations.","Chen Hao said hatefully, “Mengqing chose the Gray Spirit Pearl. She asked me to help her take it, but when I came, the last Gray Spirit Pearl was already destroyed, so I chose to take the remaining Spirit Jade Pearl.","“I saw Qiao Xi destroy Mengqing’s Gray Spirit Pearl with my own eyes! What’s wrong with me taking her Spirit Jade Pearl?!”","Boom!","Everyone was stunned.","Everyone was in disbelief. They did not expect the situation to turn around.","‘The person in charge was very surprised. “This...”","Chen Hao’s face was filled with ridicule. “Qiao Xi knew that Mengqing chose the Gray Spirit Pearl, so she deliberately destroyed it. Without the material, no matter how talented Mengging is in design, she won’t be able to design a perfect piece. However, I saw it happen with my own eyes, so I wanted to","take revenge on Qiao Xi by taking away her materials.","“It’s Qiao Xi’s own fault for destroying someone else’s materials. I did it to teach her a lesson!”","After he finished speaking, Chen Hao walked over to Yao Mengging’s side and said with a gentle tone, “Mengqing, I’m sorry. I hid the truth from you because you’re too kind. If you found out that I took Qiao Xi’s materials, you definitely wouldn’t have agreed. Moreover, you’ve always treated Qiao Xi as a","friend. If you knew that she destroyed your materials, you would definitely be very sad. That’s why I didn’t say anything. I hope you don’t blame me.”","At this moment, everyone came to an understanding, It turned out that Qiao Xi had destroyed the materials of others first. No wonder there was a damaged Gray Spirit Pearl on the table.","It turned out that Qiao Xi was jealous of Yao Mengqing, so she deliberately destroyed her materials.","In the lounge area behind the materials section.","The assistant looked at ZR’s president nervously. “Sir, do you need me...”","Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly as he instructed softly. The assistant nodded and left.","In the materials section, Chen Hao was aggrieved. “I don’t plan on denying that I took Qiao Xi’s materials because I want to tell everyone that Qiao Xi destroyed Mengqing’s materials first. She deserves it! There shouldn’t be such an unprofessional person in the jewelry design industry!”","Qiao Xi’s expression remained indifferent when facing his accusations.","Chen Hao’s face was filled with ridicule. “What? You’re unwilling to admit it?”","Gu Yao was so angry that his face turned red. “You’re slandering Qiao Xi! You said that Qiao Xi destroyed Yao Mengging’s materials, so show us the evidence! You’re the one who took Qiao Xi’s materials, yet you still have the cheek to complain!”","Yes, empty words could not be trusted. Evidence was required.","The person in charge had a gloomy expression. “Mr. Chen, you should know that the impact of this matter is very big. You said that Miss Qiao Xi destroyed the materials. Do you have evidence?”","Chen Hao smiled proudly and replied confidently, “I saw Qiao Xi destroy the materials with my own eyes. I didn’t malign her, but for the sake of convincing everyone, I have evidence!”","He pointed at an exquisite brooch on the pile of materials. “This is Qiao Xi’s brooch. She was wearing it when I saw her today. The brooch is no longer on her and appeared here. Qiao Xi must have accidentally lost it when she was destroying the pearl. Moreover, I saw it with my own eyes. How could I be","wrongly accusing her?”","“There’s a surveillance camera in the materials section! Can’t we just check if Qiao Xi came here?”","Chen Hao was extremely sure that the gazes everyone shot at Qiao Xi were filled with disdain.."]},{"number":424,"title":"Chapter 424 - Evidence","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The staff hurriedly walked over and said anxiously, “Everyone, I’m really sorry. The surveillance camera in the materials section suddenly broke. The images from this afternoon have all disappeared, so we can’t be sure if Miss Qiao Xi was the one who destroyed the materials.”","Everyone sighed. Wasn’t this too much of a coincidence? They were just about to check the surveillance footage when it turned out the cameras broke. This was a little too obvious!","Chen Hao said anxiously, “The surveillance camera in the materials section is broken, but the surveillance cameras outside the door aren’t broken, right? Just check the surveillance cameras outside and see if Qiao Xi has come to the materials section.”","The person in charge nodded and quickly sent someone to investigate.","Gu Yao was burning with anxiety.","He believed that Qiao Xi would not do this, but Chen Hao was extremely sure that he saw Qiao Xi destroy the materials with his own eyes. Moreover, Qiao Xi’s brooch had fallen here, so it meant that she had indeed been here. This evidence was very disadvantageous to her.","“Qiao Xi, what exactly is going on?”","The designers were furious. “What are you trying to do by refusing to talk? Did you destroy the materials? Are you jealous of Yao Mengging, so you used such despicable methods? An outstanding designer wouldn’t deliberately destroy others’ materials!”","“You want to take revenge on Yao Mengqing, but have you thought about us? Many of us chose Gray Spirit Pearls as well. You’re leaving us without enough materials. We’ve been preparing for this competition for a long time. Are our careers going to end in your hands?”","Yao Mengqing widened her eyes in disbelief. “Xi Xi... Did you really destroy the Gray Spirit Pearl? Why... did you have to do this to me?”","Qiao Xi looked coldly at her and sneered.","It was a pity that Yao Mengging did not want to be an actress. Everything was clearly planned by her, but she still pretended that she did not know anything, It must be really hard on her to pretend to be an innocent girl in front of everyone.","Yao Mengging bit her lip tightly and shed tears of sorrow. “Xi Xi, as long as you say that it’s not you, I’ll believe you. The brooch can’t be used as evidence, nor can it prove that you did this. Perhaps others have the same brooch as you too. Have you put away your brooch? Why don’t you show it to","everyone?”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi and waited for her to retort.","Qiao Xi smiled and took out the brooch from the pile of materials. She smiled meaningfully. “This brooch is indeed mine.”","Chen Hao revealed a delighted expression and shouted happily, “All of you heard it. Qiao Xi admitted it! She said that this brooch is hers, so she did it!”","Yao Mengqing squeezed out a few drops of sparkling tears. “Xi Xi, even if you hate me, you can’t do such a thing. You can target me, but if it affects the competition, how can I face the designers who worked so hard?!”","Yao Mengqing wiped her tears and bowed to everyone.","“Tm sorry! I’m really sorry. Today’s incident is all because of me. I’ve harmed everyone and affected the progress of the competition. I’m willing to withdraw from the competition so that everything can be peaceful again. I hope everyone can forgive me.”","When they saw Yao Mengging being so aggrieved, someone couldn’t endure it any longer. “This isn’t your fault! Qiao Xi’s motives weren’t pure, and this affected the competition. It has nothing to do with you!”","“Yeah! If Mr, Chen Hao hadn’t given you Qiao Xi’s materials, your work would have been affected as well. Miss Yao, you don’t need to withdraw from the competition. Someone else should withdraw!”","“S-Sorry, I...” Yao Mengqing’s tears trickled down. “Xi Xi, you made a mistake and should bear the punishment. You owe everyone an apology!”","“Yeah, Qiao Xi, you must apologize to Yao Mengqing and all the participants. Moreover, you violated the rules and destroyed the materials of others, so you ought to withdraw from the competition immediately!”","The person in charge hesitated for a moment. Seeing that ZR’s president wasn’t objecting, he said, “Mr. Chen is right, Miss Qiao. If you don’t have any objections to the result, according to the competition rules, you can’t participate in the competition. Please—”","“Wait.” Qiao Xi interrupted him and raised her brows. “Who said I have no objections?”","Chen Hao’s expression instantly changed. “You already said the brooch is yours. Could it be that you want to go back on your word now?","“Qiao Xi, what else do you have to say? It’s too late for regrets now!”"]},{"number":425,"title":"Chapter 425 - Give Qiao Xi A Chance To Change","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Tonly said that the brooch is mine. I never said that I destroyed the materials. There’s no correlation between the two,” Qiao Xi replied indifferently.","Chen Hao snorted coldly. “Excuses!”","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently. “Mr. Chen, aren’t you just quibbling? You said you saw me destroy the materials with your own eyes, but no one else saw it. Your one-sided story isn’t trustworthy. After all, you’re filled with hostility toward me!”","“Why... Why am I untrustworthy? You’re jealous of Mengqing. You’re afraid of losing to her, so you destroyed her materials. Isn’t this all true? I saw it with my own eyes. I have no reason to wrong you!”","Chen Hao spoke forcefully and righteously. “It’s the first time we’re meeting, so why would I target you for no reason? Could it be that I’ll be suspected even though I’m telling the truth? I just don’t want everyone to be kept in the dark.”","Seeing this, Yao Mengqing tried to persuade her earnestly. “Xi Xi, don’t make a fuss. Actually, it’s fine even if you admit it. You’re a newbie. No one will blame you. This matter won’t have a bad impact on the other designers as well. They won’t say anything. When the time comes, tell everyone that you","withdrew from the competition due to health reasons. This will protect your reputation as much as possible.”","Then, she bowed with a gentle expression. “Everyone, although Xi Xi did something wrong, she’s still young and it’s her first time participating in a competition. I hope everyone can give her a chance. Don’t tell anyone about this, alright? I believe Xi Xi will try her best to correct her behavior. She won’t do","such things again. I beg everyone.”","Everyone hesitated for a moment. Since Yao Menggqing, the person directly involved, wasn’t making a fuss about it, what else could they say? Because of Yao Mengaing, they agreed to give Qiao Xia chance to change herself.","Yao Mengqing turned around and smiled gently. “Xi Xi, look. No one is pursuing this anymore. This way, your reputation will be preserved and the competition can proceed normally. It’s better if you don’t”","“Yao Mengqing, why are you pretending to be understanding? Aren’t you indirectly forcing Qiao Xi to confess?”","Before Yao Mengqing could finish her sentence, she heard angry voices.","“She says that she wants to give Qiao Xi a chance to change her attitude, but in reality, Qiao Xi is the scapegoat! If she agrees to it, how is she going to maintain her position in the design industry in the future?! What right do you have to stop her from explaining, Yao Mengging?!”","Second Young Master Gu was not going to let Yao Mengqing have her way. He immediately retorted, his eyes burning with fury. “Qiao Xi already said that the brooch is hers, but she didn’t destroy the materials!”","There was complete silence.","Yao Mengaing bit her lip pitifully. “Ah Yao...”","Chen Hao immediately stood out to defend the injustice. “Second Young Master Gu, Mengqing is already very considerate of Qiao Xi and isn’t pursuing her for the matter. She even advised everyone not to pursue the matter as well. Qiao Xi only has to apologize. Are you still not satisfied?”","Gu Yao roared, “T’ll say it again. Qiao Xi didn’t do it! Are you deaf?!”","Chen Hao said furiously, “It’s her! Qiao Xi, don’t take advantage of Second Young Master Gu’s protection and refuse to admit your mistake. Do you still have any shame?! Making a big deal out of this won’t be beneficial to you!”","The designers’ eyes were also filled with anger and hostility. “Qiao Xi, don’t you think you’ve gone too far? Miss Yao is already very forgiving. Can’t you just apologize?”","Gu Yao trembled in anger.","Qiao Xi patted Gu Yao’s shoulder. “It’s alright, don’t worry.”","She smiled confidently. “Mr. Chen, the person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified, right?”","Chen Hao was stunned.","‘The atmosphere became awkward.","Everyone was puzzled. From beginning to end, Qiao Xi wasn’t the slightest bit nervous. It could even be said that she was very indifferent. Moreover, she emphasized that the person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified from the competition. What exactly did she mean?","Gu Yao’s expression softened a little when he saw Qiao Xi speak. He knew that Qiao Xi would not swallow her anger after being wronged. If she spoke, it meant that she was going to retaliate.","He was extremely excited and anxiously waited for Qiao Xi to turn the tables around.","“That’s right! The person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified! Chen Hao, Sister Mengqing, don’t you think so?”","Chen Hao suddenly felt nervous.","Yao Mengging looked helpless. “Xi Xi, what exactly do you want? Actually, you could’ve just withdrawn from the competition... But since you said so, I have nothing else to say. Let’s leave it at that..”"]},{"number":426,"title":"Chapter 426 - Who Said There Was Only One Surveillance Camera?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao was puzzled.","Why did Yao Mengging look so calm this time? She wasn’t afraid of being exposed at all. Was she not the one who destroyed the materials?","Chen Hao’s expression eased up when he heard Yao Mengging’s words, and the uneasiness in his heart gradually dispersed.","N-Nothing would happen. Weren’t the surveillance cameras broken? Even if they can’t prove that Qiao Xi was the one who destroyed the materials, no one can prove that she was innocent either. Besides, Qiao Xi was just a newcomer while he was a famous designer. Compared to her words, he was","naturally more trustworthy.","After pondering for a moment, Chen Hao nodded confidently. “Of course, I agree! The person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified from the competition and apologize to everyone.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly.","Chen Hao spoke forcefully and righteously, “Qiao Xi, you said that you didn’t destroy the materials. What proof do you have to show that you’re innocent? I think you’re just speaking glibly!”","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently. “Mr. Chen, actually, the first time you said that you personally saw me destroy the materials, I had already wanted to refute you. But... I found that the way you were lying was truly interesting, so I’ve been enduring it","Chen Hao gulped. “Tsk! You don’t have any evidence at all. You just admitted that the brooch is yours! Isn’t this the strongest evidence?”","Qiao Xi’s brows raised. “Mr. Chen, this materials section isn’t a closed area. What’s strange about me accidentally dropping the brooch here when I came to retrieve my materials? Could it be that this can be used as evidence?”","Chen Hao felt that Qiao Xi was just quibbling. Actually, there was no material evidence. If she continued delaying like this, it would only cause everyone to hate her even more. The consequences would be even worse.","“Qiao Xi is stalling for time. I suggest that Qiao Xi’s qualifications to participate be revoked immediately. We shouldn’t allow a single person to affect the progress of the entire competition!”","The person in charge hesitated and looked at Yao Mengging, In the end, he said helplessly, “Miss Qiao, it’s better not to make things too awkward. You should—”","“Mtr, Chen.” Qiao Xi interrupted him.","“I don’t want to argue with you about whether my brooch can be used as evidence, but...”","She paused for a second and smiled meaningfully. “I just want to ask why Mr. Chen is so sure that there is only one surveillance camera in the materials section?”","Everyone gasped.","Qiao Xi’s voice was indifferent as it slowly entered everyone’s ears. “If Mr. Chen wants to prove that I destroyed the materials, then a brooch is probably insufficient. Could it be that nobody here lost anything? How can this be used as evidence?","“Actually, the easiest way is—”","Qiao Xi smiled slightly and said word by word, “To check the surveillance camera!”","Chen Hao’s pupils constricted as he blurted out, “Nonsense! The surveillance camera in the materials section is clearly broken!”","“Who said there’s only one surveillance camera?”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “In past competitions, there was only ever one surveillance camera in the materials sections. But for the sake of making the competition more transparent, it isn’t impossible for them to add a few more surveillance cameras in the materials section. Mr. Chen, did you think that so","long as the surveillance camera was broken, I’d be unable to explain myself regardless of how you accuse me?”","Qiao Xi’s voice suddenly turned cold. “Mr. President of ZR, I request to check the surveillance cameras!”","Everyone gasped. Who was Qiao Xi talking to? The president of ZR was here too? Could it be that he was among this group of people?","At this moment, the door of the lounge room slowly opened. A deep voice came from inside. “Yes.”","‘The man leaned lazily against the sofa, his long legs crossed as he looked at everyone with interest.","Everyone widened their eyes in disbelief.","‘The president of ZR actually came to the materials section personally and had been watching from behind the scenes. Everyone instantly became nervous. This was a design competition organized by ZR. If they offended this big shot, they would not be able to survive in the design industry anymore.","But he actually agreed to let Qiao Xi check the surveillance footage?","The assistant walked out of the lounge room and swept a cold glance at Chen Hao. He said sternly, “Sir has agreed to let Miss Qiao check the surveillance cameras. Seeing is believing. After finding the person who destroyed the materials, they must be disqualified!”","Yao Mengging’s expression changed as her body stiffened.","All these years, she had been secretly investigating the president of ZR, hoping to get close to this man. However, he had always been very mysterious and no one knew what he looked like.."]},{"number":427,"title":"Chapter 427 - Double Standards","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","If Yao Mengqing became close to the president of ZR, she wouldn’t have to participate in all kinds of competitions anymore. She would even be invited to be a judge in various competitions. She would have endless connections and resources.","However, after investigating for a long time, she still couldn’t find any clues. Every time this man appeared, he would wear a mask and wouldn’t stand in the crowd. He would always sit on the chair and observe the entire situation.","Hence, everyone suspected that the president of ZR was actually disabled and could not stand. He wore a mask because he was disfigured and embarrassed to let others see him.","Yao Mengging felt that such a disabled man would like a gentle woman like her. She would use her true feelings to move him and let him feel the warmth of the world.","However, she did not expect their first meeting to be under such circumstances. It was possible that the president of ZR’s impression of her would be greatly discounted.","At this moment, Chen Hao’s entire body was trembling, and his eyes were filled with terror. He took a few steps back and still struggled desperately. “How... How could there be more surveillance cameras in the materials section? Qiao... Qiao Xi, stop talking nonsense.”","‘The president of ZR frowned and looked a little impatient. His assistant immediately understood and looked coldly at Chen Hao, his eyes full of warning. “Immediately check the surveillance footage!”","The staff quickly checked the surveillance cameras. The time shown on the screen was from this afternoon. The angle was different from the first surveillance camera, but the image was very clear. Everyone’s face could be seen clearly.","‘There was really another surveillance camera!","“Isn’t there only one surveillance camera in the materials section?”","“It wasn’t like this before, but it seems like they’ve really increased the number of surveillance cameras this year!”","“Look! It’s Qiao Xi!”","Everyone stared fixedly at the scene. Qiao Xi walked into the materials section and took away her materials in the corresponding area. Then, they saw Qiao Xi’s brooch accidentally drop on the screen.","“Qiao Xi didn’t destroy the materials!”","“Yeah, she didn’t even touch the Gray Spirit Pearl! Quick, look! Chen Hao has entered.”","Chen Hao’s entire body stiffened before he trembled slightly.","Impossible! He had already destroyed the surveillance camera. How could there be another one?","“ah! It’s Chen Hao! Chen Hao destroyed the Gray Spirit Pearl!”","“He picked up Qiao Xi’s brooch and placed it in the pile of materials. So he intentionally framed Qiao Xi! Truly too detestable!”","“He’s too scheming! No wonder he was anxious to force Qiao Xi to admit her mistake earlier. So it turns out that he’s guilty!”","The blood in Chen Hao’s entire body was about to freeze, and his mind was in chaos as he roared with terror, “This is fake! Stop watching! I won’t allow you to watch!”","The assistant waved his hand coldly, and the bodyguards immediately rushed in to restrain Chen Hao.","“Tm sorry, Mr. Chen. You just agreed that the person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified. You’re no longer a participant. Please leave now!”","No!","He was the young master of the Chen family and a famous designer. How could he be disqualified?","Chen Hao’s face paled as he looked pleadingly at Yao Mengqing.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Why is Mr. Chen looking at Miss Yao? You’re the one who destroyed the materials, so what does it have to do with Miss Yao? Could it be that she can save you?”","Chen Hao’s mind buzzed as his face turned hideous. He roared, “Mengqing! Tell me why there’s another surveillance camera! Help me explain!”","Yao Menggqing shuddered and couldn’t help but retreat.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I remember that Miss Yao agreed earlier that the person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified. If you plead on his behalf, I might think that you’re in cahoots with Mr. Chen.”","Gu Yao chimed in, “That’s right! Although the materials that were destroyed earlier were Sister Mengqing’s, Chen Hao took Qiao Xi’s materials. Moreover, if Chen Hao had successfully framed Qiao Xi, she would’ve been expelled from the competition. No matter what, Qiao Xi would be the one at a","disadvantage.","“Sister Mengqing was constantly persuading Qiao Xi to admit her guilt earlier. She even asked Qiao Xi to apologize to everyone. Isn’t it too double standards if she pleads for mercy for Chen Hao now?”","“Could it be that... you and Chen Hao joined forces to frame Qiao Xi?”","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing suspiciously.","“A didn’t.”","“Mengqing! Help me explain! I did all of this for you! There’s no enmity between me and Qiao Xi, so why would I harm her? Isn’t it because...”","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale.","Chen Hao had already admitted that he destroyed the materials and framed Qiao Xi for Yao Mengging’s sake.."]},{"number":428,"title":"Chapter 428 - If You Keep Doing Bad Deeds, Your Hands Are Bound To Be Dirty","paragraphs":["Chapter 428: If You Keep Doing Bad Deeds, Your Hands Are Bound To Be Dirty","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing looked at everyone’s doubtful eyes and felt a little guilty. “Ah Yao... I-I really didn’t. You know me very well. Why would I frame Xi Xi? Although Xi Xi and I have some misunderstandings, I won’t hurt her. Moreover, this incident affected the entire competition. I wouldn’t have...","“It’s just that when I was chatting with Mr. Chen, I unintentionally said that there were some misunderstandings between me and Xi Xi... I didn’t have any ill intentions. I just casually grumbled about it. I never expected Mr. Chen to do such a thing. I really didn’t know!","“Mr. Chen, I know you did this for me, but your actions were wrong. You ruined Xi Xi’s reputation and affected the competition... Therefore, I still agree that the person who destroyed the materials should be disqualified.","“I’m sorry, everyone. This happened because of me. I’m really sorry...”","Chen Hao’s face instantly paled!","Why did she do this to him and abandon him when the truth was revealed?","He didn’t know Qiao Xi, and only after he calmed down did he understand that it was Yao Mengqing who always said that Qiao Xi bullied her and hinted at him that he should go deal with Qiao Xi for her. However, she wasn’t willing to put in a good word for him now. It seemed like it was all his fault.","Gu Yao thought to himself. This was already the second person to take the blame for Yao Mengqing. Previously, it was Yao Mengqing’s cousin. This time, it was Chen Hao. Who else would it be after this? Yao Mengqing made use of her weak appearance and pretended to be weak to attract men. After that, she would unintentionally reveal the enmity between her and Qiao Xi to get these men to do things for her.","After being exposed, as long as Yao Mengqing stood on the moral high ground and criticized them, she could pretend to be ignorant and get away with it. She was still the pure goddess in everyone’s hearts.","Gu Yao sneered as he watched Chen Hao get dragged out by the bodyguards. “Sister Mengqing, you’re still so lucky this time. However, if you keep doing bad deeds, your hands are bound to be dirty. If you do too many bad things, you might get your retribution. I really want to know who the next idiot who’ll take the blame for you is.”","Gu Yao paused and took a deep breath. “You’re a scheming b*tch! How disgusting!” Yao Mengqing was shocked by suddenly getting cursed at. She couldn’t help but take a few steps back. Her pale face was filled with fear. Then, tears of grievance fell. “Ah Yao... How could you say that about me? I know.. it’s all my fault, but... Xi Xi, I really didn’t know that Chen Hao would do such a thing for me. I don’t like him at all.","“I’ve let everyone down. In that case, I’m willing to withdraw from the competition. I don’t want to affect everyone...” With that, she sobbed weakly and covered her face pitifully. She ran out aggrievedly.","Gu Yao couldn’t help but scold, “What’s there to cry about?! Why are you pretending in front of me! You used someone else to frame Qiao Xi. Now that your plan was exposed, you still managed to dodge the blame. I’m guessing you’re just running off to hide and laugh evilly. I can’t believe you managed to escape again!”","Everyone lowered their heads and remained silent.","Regardless of whether Yao Mengqing was involved or not, she was still the eldest daughter of the Yao family. Gu Yao could scold her in public, but they did not dare to do so.","Actually, everyone was clearly aware in their hearts that even if Yao Mengqing hadn’t directly instructed Chen Hao, this matter couldn’t be separated from her. After all, she was the one who used her suitors to deal with Qiao Xi.","The person in charge immediately sent someone to get extra materials, and everyone returned to the design hall after collecting their own materials. Just then, the assistant stopped Qiao Xi. “Please wait.”","Gu Yao stopped with Qiao Xi, only to see the assistant say with a smile, “Miss Qiao, Sir wants to meet you.”","Qiao Xi smiled.","Actually, ever since she left Gu Zheng’s office, she had found it a little strange. Why did everyone know that there was a big shot upstairs, and why did the assistant call him ‘Sir’ but not ‘President Gu?","Gu Zheng had worked hard in the business world for so many years. Everyone had to respectfully address him as ‘President Gu’. President Gu represented Gu Zheng, and no one called him ‘Sir.’","In that case, there was only one possibility. Gu Zheng did not come here as President Gu but as the president of ZR.","When she arrived at the materials section, she saw that the door to the lounge room was tightly shut. There seemed to be someone guarding inside, so she asked the president of ZR to help her check the surveillance cameras. If that person was really Gu Zheng, he would definitely agree.","As expected, Qiao Xi really won.."]},{"number":429,"title":"Chapter 429 - My Brother Is A Bastard!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","‘What? I’m still here, and you’re meeting a stranger alone? If Gu Zheng finds out, it’ll be troublesome!’","Gu Yao immediately stopped Qiao Xi, his face full of vigilance. “Tl go with you!”","The assistant looked troubled. “Uh...”","“Te long heard of your president’s great name. I also want to meet your president. Can’t I? Is there a problem with me going with Qiao Xi?”","The assistant didn’t know that the president of ZR was Gu Zheng, nor did he know that Qiao Xi’s assistant was the famous Second Young Master Gu of the entire Li City. Thus, he answered with a serious expression, “Sir, the president only invited Miss Qiao. You should wait here. Our president won’t hurt","Miss Qiao.”","“It’s fine. Let him come in.”","At this moment, a cold voice came from the lounge room. The assistant was stunned for a moment before he nodded. “Please follow me.”","The assistant brought them in and left.","At this moment, the masked man was sitting lazily on the sofa. He was wearing a dark gray suit, giving off a mysterious sense of oppression.","Gu Yao looked wary.","Gu Zheng said coldly, “You’re not willing to wait?”","This voice sounded a little familiar, but Gu Yao could not quite put his finger on it. However, this tone made Gu Yao very unhappy. He was the Second Young Master of the Gu family. In this world, only that bastard, Gu Zheng, would talk to him like this. Who was this president of ZR? How dare he be so","arrogant?","He didn’t think too much about it and directly retorted, “Who cares if I’m willing to wait or not?! I want to ask why you invited Qiao Xi to see you alone? What’s your motive for asking a woman to be in a room with you alone?! Let me tell you, don’t have any bad intentions!","“Qiao Xi has already married my elder brother, so don’t even think about being a third-party! You should give up on this thought as soon as possible! Do you know who my elder brother is? My elder brother is a bastard. If he finds out that you have feelings for Qiao Xi, he’ll absolutely not let you off! Don’t","blame me for not warning you. Your end will be extremely miserable.”","Qiao Xi:”...”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes: “...”","Amoment later.","Gu Yao wailed, “Brother! I was wrong! I don’t dare to do it anymore! How could I know it was you since you were wearing a mask?! Why are you pretending to be the president of ZR?”","He explained carefully, “I didn’t say you were a bastard. I thought that another man liked Qiao Xi, so I deliberately said this to intimidate the other party. This is also for your own good! I’m protecting Qiao Xi for you because I’m afraid other men will snatch her away!”","‘Damn! How did my brother become the president of ZR? If I had known his identity, I wouldn’t have dared to be so arrogant!”","Gu Yao trembled in fear. Then, he heard Gu Zheng’s calm voice.","“Couldn’t you recognize my voice? Gu Yao, is it because your ears are not good enough, or do you not care about me at all? Tell me.”","Gu Yao:”...”","He was finished!","Qiao Xi reminded him by his ear. “Friendly reminder. Think carefully before you speak.”","Gu Yao’s eyelids twitched crazily. If he said that his ears weren’t good enough, would Gu Zheng say that he didn’t need them and that he could cut them off? If he said that he didn’t care about him, his ending would be even worse. He might be sent to the hospital.","After thinking for a long time, he replied with a sincere expression, “My ears truly aren’t fine. I’ve never had good ears since I was young. You know that.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Yes.”","Gu Yao’s expression softened. It was already very good that he was not beaten up.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng stood up the next second and pulled Gu Yao’s collar as he walked out. The two brothers talked about something outside the door. A moment later, Gu Yao walked in with tears streaming down his face.","Qiao Xi asked him worriedly, “Did he hit you?”","Gu Yao looked desperate. “He might as well beat me up!”","This bastard was too terrifying!","Gu Zheng actually wanted him to work in the company next week!","Gu Corporation was founded by Gu Zheng and had nothing to do with the Gu family. However, the Gu family’s company was now under Gu Zheng’s control as well. Gu Yao and Gu Zheng both knew that the Gu family would fight for everything sooner or later.","There were only two possibilities. Firstly, Gu Zheng would give up the family’s company and return it to the Gu family. Secondly, if Gu Zheng did not give up the company, the company would be withdrawn from the Gu family. However, Gu Yao did not expect that Gu Zheng would transfer all the shares of","the Gu family’s company to him and let him be the person in charge of the company.","The second master of the Gu family, who was used to being idle, could not accept this.."]},{"number":430,"title":"Chapter 430 - It’s Not That Easy Even If He Wants to Beat Me To Death","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tears welled up in Gu Yao’s eyes. Qiao Xi thought that Gu Zheng had bullied Gu Yao and was instantly furious. “Gu Zheng is too much! You’re his younger brother, after all. Why did he bully you until you’re crying? What did he say to you? Did he hit you but you don’t dare to say it? Did he hurt you? Don’t be","afraid of him. Even if he bullies you, you can’t just take it lying down. Beat him back!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s indignant words, Gu Yao looked at her with eyes full of grief. His lips trembled slightly. “Q-Qiao Xi, please don’t have any dangerous thoughts. I’m a living example!”","Qiao Xi’s face was full of heartache. “Gu Zheng always bullies you. You’ve been oppressed for so many years, so why do you still like this brother of yours so much? Could it be that you like being abused?”","Gu Yao wiped his tears and said pitifully, “Actually, he’s not that strong. At most, I’m only half-submissive. Although he can defeat me with one punch, it’s not easy for him to kill me. After all...”","Qiao Xi hurriedly asked. “What?”","Gu Yao looked at her meaningfully. “After all, he can’t kill me as it’s against the law.”","Qiao Xi:”..”","Gu Yao said, “Even if I resist, I won’t be able to beat Gu Zheng. This is what I’ve learned from many bloody lessons. Moreover, if I resist, Gu Zheng will retaliate even more crazily, so I might as well let him beat me up. Anyway, I’m his younger brother. He can’t kill me, and at least I can keep my life.”","Qiao Xi: “...” This kid was really open-minded!","When they went back, Gu Yao was clearly unhappy. When the two of them returned to No. 29 workstation, the people around them came over one after another.","“Didn’t Yao Mengqing say that she wanted to withdraw from the competition just now? Then why did she return to No. 1 workstation? If she doesn’t want to withdraw from the competition, then she shouldn’t have said that. Why is she pretending?”","“She was just saying that. She definitely won’t withdraw from the competition. After all, she’s the most likely candidate to win the championship!”","Li Xing’er came up to Qiao Xi and asked curiously, “Qiao Xi, I heard that the president of ZR invited you over?”","At once, everyone’s ears perked up. They also asked curiously, “Yeah! Why did the president of ZR ask you to see him? Do you know him? What does he look like? I heard he’s not easy to get close to!”","Qiao Xi: “Uh...”","Li Xing‘er pulled Qiao Xi to a corner and lowered her voice. “Qiao Xi! You’re really something! The president of ZR has always been mysterious and has never invited any designer to meet him alone. He actually helped you check the surveillance footage and even invited you to his office. Are you guys...”","Qiao Xi didn’t know how to explain and could only smile awkwardly.","Li Xing‘er instantly understood. “I understand! Don’t worry, I won’t tell President Gu. You’re already married, so you definitely won’t have any thoughts about the president of ZR, right?”","Qiao Xi had an aggrieved expression. “This... Please don’t misunderstand. Actually...”","Before she could finish speaking, she heard a few women gather together. “If the president of ZR takes a fancy to a woman, it’ll be a huge leap for her. There’s no need for her to compete here at all. She can just sit in a judge’s seat. Half of the world of design is already hers. What’s there to work hard for?!”","“But I heard that the president of ZR doesn’t like women. Has he really taken a liking to Qiao Xi? Although Qiao Xi is very good-looking, there are so many beautiful women here. Why did the president of ZR take a liking to a newcomer?”","“I think it’s a little strange too. The president, who has never been close to women, suddenly likes a woman. Something doesn’t feel right!”","Li Xing‘er was extremely excited. “Qiao Xi! Everyone is curious about your relationship with the President. Does he really like you?”","Before Qiao Xi could reply, Gu Zheng’s assistant walked over with an expensive men’s watch and a cup of hot latte.","The moment the assistant appeared, everyone’s eyes widened and they held their breaths.","“Wow, that latte must be for Qiao Xi!”","“Tm so envious. If the president of ZR has really taken a fancy to her, she wouldn’t have to work hard for the rest of her life. Cinderella will become a rich wife. The plot in this novel would really become a reality.”","Seeing this, Li Xing’er gave Qiao Xia push. “Quick, go accept it! Qiao Xi! This is the president’s love for you!”1"]},{"number":431,"title":"Chapter 431 - So The President Likes Gu Yao!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Under the envious gaze of everyone, Qiao Xi slowly took a few steps forward","The assistant turned to the side. “Is Mr. Gu Yao here?”","Everyone:","Gu Yao lifted his eyes, looking confused.","The assistant walked in front of him and smiled. “Mr. Gu, you accidentally left your watch in the office just now. Sir asked me to send it over to you. Sir also said that you like to drink latte and asked me to buy you a cup. He instructed me to add more sugar. Do you think it suits your taste? If you don’t like","it, Ican buy another cup for you.","“Sir said it’s better not to drink too much coffee. Otherwise, you won’t be able to sleep at night and it’ll affect your rest.”","Gu Yao pouted, feeling wronged. He wanted to bribe him with a cup of latte to have him take over the Gu family’s business?","However, everyone did not understand what was going on. Their expressions gradually tuned to horror. No way!","Didn’t the president of ZR like Qiao Xi? How did Gu Yao’s watch end up in the President’s office? How did the president know that Gu Yao liked sugar in his latte? He even got his assistant to specially buy Gu Yao a cup of latte?","Li Xing’er widened her eyes and looked at Gu Yao, then at Qiao Xi. She jumped up excitedly, her face flushed red as she shouted in disbelief, “Could it be... the person the president of ZR likes is not Qiao Xi but Gu Yao?”","Everyone gasped.","“Qiao Xi is just a cover. Actually, the person the president of ZR likes is Gu Yao. He invited Qiao Xi to hide it from the public and then let Gu Yao go as her assistant!”","“Yeah, the president of ZR has never been close to women. So, it’s because he likes... men!”","The news that the president of ZR liked Gu Yao spread throughout the entire hall.","Second Young Master Gu was stunned:","Gu Yao’s face tured pale instantly. ‘F*ck, do you have a grudge against me”","However, this was a competition, after all. Gossip was just entertainment. Everyone quickly immersed themselves back into the competition.","In order not to affect the designers’ work, the main door of the design hall would be closed during the official competition to prevent people from entering and disturbing the designers.","Within five days, the designers had to complete a full set of jewelry. Time was quite tight, so the assistants were also very busy and anxious.","Qiao Xi was designing the framework when Gu Yao looked at her with admiration. “I’ve finally experienced the charm of jewelry design. If I were a woman, I would definitely wear the jewelry you design. Your work is too beautiful. Just looking at the design draft makes me think that it’s going to be","stunning!”","Qiao Xi carefully placed the gemstone on the necklace, which was very dazzling under the light.","Five days passed in the blink of an eye. Everyone kept the jewelry they designed and handed it to the judges to grade.","All the jewelry was placed in an opaque box, so no one could see the other designers’ works.","The participants were all waiting backstage. After drawing lots, they would go on stage in order while models would wear the jewelry they designed to show to the judges. Then, they would get an average score based on the judges’ scores.","Backstage, some famous designers had gathered together to discuss. Newcomers like Li Xing’er also gathered with them to chat.","Li Xing’er panicked. “Qiao Xi, I’m so nervous!”","“Only a newbie like you would be nervous. We’re all used to it, and Qiao Xi is Yun Chu’s friend. Her design skills must be very strong. She’ll definitely get a high score when the time comes.”","At this moment, an eccentric female voice sounded.","The woman beside Yao Mengqing said arrogantly, “Jason, you’re Master Yun Chu’s disciple. You should know her friend, right? If she doesn’t have the ability to design, how could she be Master Yun Chu’s friend?”","Everyone’s expression changed, and the atmosphere suddenly became oppressive.","Jason was Yun Chu’s disciple, and Qiao Xi was Yun Chu’s friend. If they lost, they would be affecting Yun Chu’s reputation as well. This was a battle of the century.","However, Jason sneered in disdain. “Who’s Qiao Xi? I only know that Master Yun Chu has no friends at all. I think she must be lying just because she wants to forge connections with my master!”","Boom—","The entire backstage was silent.","Jason had never heard of Qiao Xi?","Yao Mengqing pretended to be surprised. “Mr. Jason, did you remember wrongly? Xi Xi wouldn’t lie. She said that she’s Master Yun Chu’s friend in public.”"]},{"number":432,"title":"Chapter 432 - Battle Of The Century","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jason sneered. “A friend of Master Yun Chu? Doesn’t she know that she’s not qualified? Is Master Yun Chu someone a new designer like her can get close to? She’s overestimating herself!”","The woman next to Yao Mengging scolded, “Qiao Xi is too shameless! Teacher Jason said that he doesn’t know her at all. She wants to use Yun Chu’s reputation to enter the design industry? Why doesn’t she look in the mirror and see if she’s worthy first!”","Someone else chimed in, “It must be because she doesn’t have much strength, so that’s why she came up with unorthodox methods. She deliberately said that she’s Yun Chu’s friend, wanting to use this method to rise up.”","Jason’s face was full of mockery. “There’s nothing to say to this kind of person. I’l file a report against you for using the identity of Master Yun Chu’s friend to participate in the competition. A person like that is not qualified to compete with us on the same stage!","“I don’t know what sh*tty work your designs will be. Don’t embarrass Master Yun Chu!”","These words weren’t kind at all.","If Jason successfully filed the report, the entire design industry would know about the scandal of Qiao Xi pretending to be Yun Chu’s friend. From then on, no design team or design competition would accept her. Her future would be ruined.","However, Qiao Xi just said indifferently, “If you rely on Yun Chu’s name to participate in the competition, then you ought to be unworthy of being a designer, right?”","Jason did not hesitate. “Of course. Otherwise, do you think a person like that deserves to stand in the arena?”","Qiao Xi went silent for a short while before she smiled lightly. “I agree with the statement very much. I hope you won’t regret it.”","At this moment, all the judges had arrived and the participants had finished drawing lots. Next, they had to go on stage to show their works according to the order decided by the lots.","Since this competition was sponsored by ZR Group, it attracted widespread attention. There were television stations that broadcast the entire event live, and many reporters were there to interview them.","Today was the day of the competition for the championship. Some seniors from the design world had also come. The scene was very lively and spectacular.","Li Xinger asked in a low voice, “What’s your number?”","Qiao Xi replied, “Still 29.”","Li Xing’er widened her eyes. “What? Yao Mengging is the 28th! Did they deliberately arrange for you to go after her?”","Li Xing‘er’s partner said helplessly, “I think Yao Mengging did it on purpose because everyone is saying that you don’t have the ability. If your work is really bad, it’ll affect the judges’ scores. If that happens, she’ll have a reason to attack you.”","Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “It’s fine.”","Actually, it was good to go after Yao Mengging. After all, she wasn’t the one who would be embarrassed in the end. Yao Mengqing would definitely regret it. This was called shooting oneself in the foot.","The participants ahead quickly finished displaying their works. It was soon Yao Menggqing’s turn.","For the competition this time around, the judges were very strict and their words were sharp. The designers were all dealt a blow and left the stage feeling dejected. Li Xing’er also looked dispirited. “The judges this time are really too scary!”","“What’s there to be afraid of? It’s all because you’re not strong enough. Those who are truly capable will not be worried.” Jason looked at them arrogantly and coldly.","Yao Mengqing looked at Qiao Xi and smiled apologetically. “Xi Xi, Mr. Jason is just a straightforward person. Don’t take it to heart. I believe in your strength!”","Seeing Yao Mengqing and Jason going on stage together, Li Xing‘er said indignantly, “Tsk! What’s there to be proud of? She always pretends to be a good person!”","Everyone remained silent. Actually, they were clearly aware in their hearts that Yao Mengqing had been targeting Qiao Xi since the beginning. Qiao Xi drawing the last lot was also the work of Yao Mengqing.","But so what? Yao Mengging was indeed capable. Moreover, she was the eldest daughter of the Yao family and had the help of Yun Chu’s disciple, Jason. Yao Mengging would definitely be the champion this time!","As for Qiao Xi","Everyone sighed helplessly.","At this moment, a tall model came on stage to showcase the jewelry. The judges’ eyes lit up.","Previously, the designs were too ordinary. Finally, when the competition was about to end, they saw a perfect design.","“Miss Yao’s work is indeed eye-catching.”","“I heard that Miss Yao is the founder of Sunshine.. Her work is really amazing!”"]},{"number":433,"title":"Chapter 433 - We Can Only Win; We Can’t Lose","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s right! The other designers can’t be compared to her. I think she’ll be the champion this time.”","“What do you think, Mr. Ye?”","Everyone held their breaths and suddenly became nervous.","‘Mr. Ye was the president of ZR. No one knew his full name, nor had anyone seen his face before. However, in the design industry, this name was well-known.","‘Mr. Ye had superb design skills and controlled half of the world of design. It would be every designer’s lifelong dream if they could get his approval.","Yao Mengging was extremely nervous.","Mr. Ye looked up slowly and took a glance at the set of jewelry. He replied nonchalantly, “Mhm.”","What did ‘mhm’ mean?","Did he agree with the other judges?","Jason was overjoyed, while Yao Mengqing was even more excited.","The designers backstage were also very envious. “Mr. Ye didn’t even take a look at the earlier designs. But after Yao Mengqing went on stage, he opened his eyes and took a look. Yao Mengqing is really capable!”","“All the judges gave high scores. Mr. Ye seems to like her work too. The championship is hers to take!”","“That’s right. None of the previous designers surpassed Yao Menggqing’s score, and only Qiao Xi remains now. How could she possibly compare to Yao Mengqing? There’s no doubt about who the champion will be!”","Qiao Xi looked at Yao Mengaqing’s work as well.","Actually, it was not too bad. Although jewelry needed to be gorgeous, if too many materials were piled up, it would appear very messy and affect the aesthetics. Moreover, she felt that this design was very familiar, especially the shape of the gem cutting. It was as though she had seen it somewhere before.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and suddenly recalled that she seemed to have done a similar draft many years ago, but she didn’t know where she had thrown it later.","Yao Mengging’s design was praised by everyone. After she got off the stage, she smiled gently. “Mr. Jason, if it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have achieved such good results. Thank you so much.”","Jason nodded proudly. “It’s nothing. Since I agreed to participate in the competition, I surely won’t embarrass Master Yun Chu. We can only win; we can’t lose!”","Yao Mengging looked at Qiao Xi who was about to go on stage. “Mr. Jason, Xi Xi is going on stage soon. If her work is not good, please guide her. After all, she’s still a newcomer and needs to improve. Don’t hurt her too much and make her lose her confidence.”","Jason sneered. “You want me to guide her? Is she worthy? Is a lowly designer worthy of my guidance? I don’t have the time for that.”","Yao Menggqing nodded helplessly. “Alright, then. I’ll go and comfort Xi Xi after the competition. I won’t trouble you, Mr. Jason.”","Just then, the designers surrounded her. “Miss Yao, the work you did with Mr. Jason is perfect! You’ll definitely be the champion!”","Yao Menggqing smiled in embarrassment. “The competition hasn’t ended yet. It’s too early to say that I won the championship. Xi Xi hasn’t shown her work yet!”","“Even those famous designers can’t compare to you. How can a newbie like Qiao Xi be your opponent? Miss Yao, your win has been determined. There’s no need to be humble.”","Yao Mengging was ecstatic.","She had deliberately arranged for Qiao Xi to go after her. With the two of them displaying their works one after another, the judges would definitely give Qiao Xi low scores after making a comparison.","‘As expected, the judges had all praised her work. In their eyes, she was the champion.","Qiao Xi’s work would have no meaning. Just a few points would do. The judges might even cruelly criticize Qiao Xi’s poor work.","Yao Mengging lowered her head and smiled sinisterly.","People continued to praise her. “Miss Yao’s ability is obvious to all. How can some newbie surpass you? If I were her, I would just forfeit!”","“Look, Qiao Xi has gone up the stage!”","All the lights in the surroundings converged together and fell onto Qiao Xi, causing everyone to gasp.","What? There was no model?","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm as she carried the box to the front of the stage and slowly opened the box, revealing the jewelry within.","Yao Mengqing didn’t bother looking at the screen. She could clearly feel that the venue had instantly quietened down and only melodious notes were flowing."]},{"number":434,"title":"Chapter 434 - No Doubt About Who The Champion Is","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She smiled confidently. “Xi Xi is still a newcomer. Don’t expect too much from her, Mr. Jason. I think...”","Before she could finish speaking, one of the judges suddenly came back to their senses and stood up abruptly. The designers backstage were also boiling with excitement as they rushed to the front of the big screen in shock.","“How is this possible?!”","“Did a newcomer really design such a perfect piece of work? In just five days and using the same materials as us, she created such a stunning piece!”","At that moment, the judges stood up one by one and walked to the front of Qiao Xi’s jewelry, carefully observing the nearly perfect work.","“How beautiful! This is the most perfect set of jewelry I’ve ever seen!”","Yao Mengaqing’s expression froze and she slowly turned around.","Under the lights, a set of sparkling jewelry shone so brightly.","“Qiao Xi’s design concept is amazing! The more I look at her work, the more beautiful I find it!”","“The judges are about to give their scores. Let’s hear what they have to say. I suddenly feel that I don’t have the qualifications to comment on Qiao Xi’s work as if it would be blasphemous!”","The judges stared intently at the set of jewelry and discussed it excitedly. Their eyes were filled with amazement and admiration.","“Lbelieve everyone has already gotten a good look. This set of jewelry can be said to be perfect. To be honest, I can’t even produce such a high standard of work. How can I have the nerve to comment on her work?”","“That’s right. This set of jewelry can’t be described in words. No words can describe it.”","Yao Mengging’s body stiffened. She stared at the screen. At that moment, time seemed to have stopped.","Impossible! Impossible!","How could such a perfect piece of work be designed by Qiao Xi? Qiao Xi was just a newbie. Why was her work more perfect than hers? She must have copied it from somewhere.","“What do you think, Mr. Ye?”","The judges all looked at him, waiting for his comment.","Mr. Ye, who had been silent this whole time, looked up slowly. It was different from when he commented on Yao Menggqing’s work. He stood up and clapped leisurely.","“The championship belongs to her alone.”","Her alone?","Yao Mengging’s body softened and she almost fell to the ground. Her eyes were filled with unwillingness.","Mr. Ye said that Qiao Xi would be the champion? What would she become, then?","Li Xing‘er glanced at her coldly. “Miss Yao, I’m sorry to disappoint you. But it doesn’t matter. Even if you don’t win the championship this year, you can still participate in next year’s competition. But Xi Xi had better not participate. It’s meaningless if she keeps winning the competition. She should just let","you win it once.","“After all, our Xi Xi is a newbie. She still has a lot of youth and time, but Miss Yao, you’re already a famous designer. You’ve been in the design industry for so many years but still haven’t won the competition. It wouldn’t be nice if word got out. With a designer like Mr. Jason helping you, you still lost. If","word got out, how would you have the face to continue accepting orders? Don’t you think so?”","Yao Mengging’s face turned green, and she clenched her fists tightly.","“Jason even looked down on Qiao Xi and said that she wasn’t fit to be Yun Chu’s friend. I think the person who really lost all reputation is Jason. His designs are simply trash compared to Qiao Xi’s. Does he have the nerve to say that he’s Yun Chu’s disciple?”","“Yao Mengqing even intentionally made Qiao Xi go after her in order to crush Qiao Xi, yet in the end, she shot herself in the foot and was severely humiliated.”","Yao Mengqing was trembling with anger. However, in front of everyone, she had no choice but to remain calm. She forced a smile on her face, but her expression was still ugly.","Jason’s face was dark, and there was a trace of viciousness in his eyes.","Qiao Xi was just a newcomer. How could her designs be more perfect than his?","After the judges gave their scores, Qiao Xi’s work crushed all the participants present. She received a perfect score. There was no doubt about who the champion was. After the competition’s organizers announced the champion of the design competition, they gave Qiao Xi an award.","Jason shouted indignantly, “Absolutely not! She’s just a newbie! I want to go look for Yun Chu.. She’ll stand up for me! There must be some conspiracy!”"]},{"number":435,"title":"Chapter 435 - Yao Mengqing Delivered Herself To The Door!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing his roar, Li Xing’er frowned unhappily and said softly, “Qiao Xi, I think this person is crazy. You have to be careful. He might do something.”","Qiao Xi held the trophy and smiled meaningfully. “Yun Chu is in Li City right now.”","Li Xing’er exclaimed, “Ah? What should we do, then? If Jason really complains to Yun Chu and Yun Chu speaks up for Jason, will the judges revoke your championship title and let Yao Mengqing have the title? What should we do?”","“One more thing, I heard that before the competition, Yao Mengqing said that she wanted to sell her designs. They’ll be the flagship products for Sunshine’s next season. She didn’t even win the championship. How dare she sell them?”","Qiao Xi was slightly stunned. “Yao Mengging wanted her designs for the competition to be put into the production line?”","She suddenly had a good idea. This time, she couldn’t be blamed. It was Yao Mengqing who delivered herself to her door!","At this moment, Gu Zheng was sitting lazily on a chair. A group of people was standing not far away from him, maintaining a distance from him. However, their faces were still filled with solicitousness.","“Mrr. Ye, the champion of this competition is indeed very impressive. Miss Qiao Xi’s work is perfect. The set of jewelry she designed is very suitable to be the first batch of jewelry for the next season.”","Another person refuted, “But Qiao Xi is just a newcomer. She doesn’t have much fame. If we promote her work first, I’m afraid many people won’t buy it. Although Yao Mengging lost, she has some influence internationally, after all. The jewelry she made will definitely sell well.”","“But before the competition, we already said that we’d put the champion’s work into production. Yao Mengging didn’t win. If we sign a contract with her, wouldn’t we be breaking our promise?”","“But if we don’t sign Yao Mengging, she’ll produce her designs this time under Sunshine for their next season. This will affect our interests.”","Everyone expressed their opinions, but they could not come to a definite conclusion in the end. Hence, they looked at Mr. Ye.","The man lifted his eyes slowly and sneered. “So, if ZR doesn’t sign a contract with Yao Mengging, she’ll release her designs under Sunshine?”","Everyone nodded. “That’s right.”","“Heh.”","Gu Zheng scoffed lightly. “Since that’s the case, let’s satisfy her. Let her bring her work back to Sunshine. She won’t have anything to do with ZR anymore.”","Everyone was stunned for a moment before they understood what Mr. Ye meant.","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had long since heard that Yao Mengging would bring her designs from this competition back to Sunshine and sell them in batches after the finished products were made.","Since she did not win the championship, this set of jewelry could not be sold as a masterpiece. It could only be placed on the display counter like other jewelry pieces for people to browse from.","The price would be much lower as well. However, they could be mass-produced and Yao Mengging could earn a small sum.","Qiao Xi smiled disdainfully. She had long since felt that Yao Mengging’s work was somewhat familiar, and only later on did she recall that it was a draft she had drawn many years ago. She lost the physical copy somewhere, but all her drafts were saved on her computer.","She turned on the computer and tapped on the keyboard. Soon, she found the draft.","At this moment, downstairs.","The sound of a car engine came from outside, followed by the butler’s voice. “President, you’re back.”","Gu Zheng nodded and asked, “Where’s Young Madam?”","“Madam went back to her room as soon as she came back.”","Just as Gu Zheng was about to go upstairs and knock on the door, Qiao Xi stood up and rushed over, saying sweetly, “Ah Zheng~”","The butler’s mouth twitched slightly. He saw his boss holding his wife’s hand as they entered the door and slammed it shut.","Qiao Xi said shyly, “Ah Zheng, we’ll sign the contract now, alright?”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment and instantly understood what she meant, but his expression remained calm. “Sign what?”","Qiao Xi tugged at him and said coquettishly, “Stop fooling around! Didn’t we agree before? I’ll sign a contract with Gu Corporation as Yun Chu.”","“Oh,” Gu Zheng replied casually and nodded. “Yes, we did agree, but that was a few days ago. I’ve been thinking about it for the past few days...”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually vanished.","Why? Was Gu Zheng going back on his word?"]},{"number":436,"title":"Chapter 436 - Hope You Won’t Ignore My Kindness","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng paused for a moment before he calmly said, “After these few days of deliberation, I think that Yun Chu isn’t suitable for our company. After all, you rejected me a few years ago. Furthermore, when I asked you to sign a contract with us that day, you rejected the offer as well. I think it’s better to","forget it. I won’t accept a designer who rejected me twice.”","Qiao Xi’s expression froze, and she was completely petrified.","She almost passed out and questioned, “You’re not signing the contract with me anymore? G-Gu Zheng, you’d better think about it!”","If she didn’t sign the contract, how could she deal with Yao Mengqing?","From the moment Qiao Xi found out that Yao Mengqing wanted to mass-produce her work, she’d already thought of a plan. Now, she was completely thrown into disorder by Gu Zheng’s words. Her mind was instantly in chaos.","She looked at Gu Zheng in disbelief. “Y-You need to reconsider! I’m Yun Chu! Don’t you know who Yun Chu is? I’m the best jewelry designer in the world! Gu Zheng, why are you rejecting me?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently. “Mrs. Gu, this is the first time I’ve seen someone praising themselves to the skies without blushing or having their heart skip a beat. I’ve learned something.”","Qiao Xi originally didn’t think much of it, but when Gu Zheng said this, she instantly blushed in embarrassment.","After a moment of silence, she said self-righteously, “W-What’s wrong with me praising myself? I’m telling the truth! I’m really amazing! The people who want to sign a contract with me can form a line all the way to Paris. I agreed to sign a contract with Gu Corporation on account that you’re my","husband! I hope you won’t fail to appreciate my kindness!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Ha, thank you very much, but Gu Corporation won’t accept it.”","Qiao Xi: “?”","‘Where’s my Imife! Don’t stop me! I’m going to kill this bastard!”","She was about to vomit blood from anger because of Gu Zheng, She resisted the urge to flare up and smiled. “Ah Zheng, can you tell me why you suddenly don’t want to sign a contract with me?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curved up as he watched Qiao Xi swallow her anger. “That’s inappropriate.”","Qiao Xi:”..”","F*ck! Him saying this was the same as him not saying anything! This bastard was trying to mess with her!","The gentle expression on her face suddenly disappeared and was replaced with a fierce expression. Her eyes were filled with anger. “Gu Zheng, close your eyes. I have a gift for you.”","Gu Zheng raised his eyes, a little puzzled. He had rejected Qiao Xi, but she still wanted to give him a gift. What exactly did she want to give him?","He tried to hear Qiao Xi’s inner voice, but it was extremely calm without the slightest sound. Gu Zheng couldn’t help but feel some anticipation. Could it be a kiss?","Gu Zheng hesitated for a moment before closing his eyes expectantly.","Then, Qiao Xi said hatefully, “Gu Zheng, open your eyes.”","The next second.","Gu Zheng clearly saw the international ‘friendly’ gesture in front of him. Qiao Xi’s slender middle finger had suddenly appeared in front of him.","Qiao Xi gnashed her teeth and said, “You rejected me, yet you still thought I’d give you something? Dream on! I’ll give you the middle finger! How about it! Do you like it?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Before he could speak, Qiao Xi rushed out angrily. He smiled helplessly. “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi felt that there was definitely something wrong with this person. He refused to agree to a collaboration, yet he could still smile when she gave him the middle finger!","Was he planning to take revenge on her?","‘When he thought up to here, Qiao Xi suddenly felt a chill run down her back. This bastard might have thought of some dirty tricks to deal with her!","However, she had already raised her middle finger, so she didn’t regret it! In any case, she was very happy at this moment. She really wanted to roar at the sky.","Gu Zheng heard her inner thoughts and could not help but laugh. “Mrs. Gu, it’s not that I don’t want to sign a contract with you. It’s because Gu Corporation is not good enough for Yun Chu. Yun Chu should be a free designer and should not be bound by any company or rules.”","‘When Qiao Xi heard his words, she stopped in her tracks and snorted coldly.","‘Do I need you to say that? Of course, I know I’m very powerful! Don’t think that I’ll forgive you just because you put in a few good words!","‘At least continue to praise me! I won’t be coaxed by just a few words.","‘But if you don’t sign a contract with me, how am I going to get Gu Corporation to file a claim against Yao Mengging for me? She violated my copyright.. If Gu Corporation steps in, Yao Mengqing will definitely have to pay a huge price for it this time!”"]},{"number":437,"title":"Chapter 437 - Profit","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi had already planned things out in her heart. If she signed a contract with the Gu Corporation, Yao Mengqing would be in violation of both her and Gu Corporation’s copyright terms. The amount of compensation she would have to pay would double, or perhaps it would be even more than that. With","this, Yao Mengqing would definitely be given a lesson she would remember.","But Gu Zheng, this damned man, refused to sign the contract with her. Qiao Xi’s plan was completely messed up.","Qiao Xi frowned as waves of anger surged in her heart. No matter what Gu Zheng said, she was unwilling to forgive him, so she secretly decided that no matter what Gu Zheng said this time, she would not cooperate with Gu Corporation!","Shortly after, Gu Zheng’s voice slowly sounded from behind her. “Mrs. Gu, I’m speaking the truth. With your status, you shouldn’t sign a contract with any company. You’ll have more freedom and won’t be restricted.","“We don’t have to sign a contract if we want to work together. As the president of Gu Corporation, I’ve decided to buy the design draft of ‘Returning Dream’ that you created three years ago. This way, you won’t have to sign a contract with Gu Corporation to achieve your goal.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned.","Returning Dream?","It was the draft that Yao Mengging plagiarized!","If Gu Corporation bought Returning Dream and Yao Mengging sold her plagiarized works in batches, Gu Corporation would demand compensation and Yao Mengqing would have to pay a huge price.","Qiao Xi was just about to turn around when she heard Gu Zheng’s unhurried voice. “But... Mrs. Gu, you seem to have decided not to cooperate with Gu Corporation anymore, so I won’t force you.”1","Qiao Xi instantly swallowed the words she was about to say.","‘Was there a man who was worse than Gu Zheng in this world?","Qiao Xi, who’d just sworn in her heart that she wouldn’t agree no matter what Gu Zheng said, suddenly hesitated.","She thought about it for a while before turning around slowly and moving closer to Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng~”","Gu Zheng’s eyes softened.","Mrs. Gu, who was still angry a moment ago, suddenly became shy and revealed a fawning smile.","“Ah Zheng! You’re so smart! You intend to buy my design draft to achieve the same result. My impression of you has improved again. Ah Zheng, I love you so much!”","Gu Zheng smirked. “Does that mean that you’ve agreed?”","Qiao Xi nodded like a chick pecking on rice. “Of course! Actually, I’ve always wanted to work with you. I was just joking earlier. I’m very happy that you’re willing to work with me!","“rma girl, after all, so I have to be more reserved! Since you’ve already invited me, of course, I’ll agree. I’ll sell the design draft of Returning Dream to you at a low price. Is three million okay? You’ll get a huge sum of compensation soon. It’ll definitely be a profit!","“Ah Zheng, you’re smart and capable! You’re handsome, rich, wise, and competent! Actually, I’ve been wanting to work with you for a long time! This is the best opportunity. I’m even willing to sell the design draft to you at a low price. Where else can you find such a good deal? Hurry up and agree!”","Three million yuan to buy Yun Chu’s design draft. If news of this got out, countless jewelry companies would probably show up at Yun Chu’s door with stacks of money.","The smile on Gu Zheng’s face grew wider. “Since you’re so sincere, I’ll agree to it.”","Qiao Xi jumped up in excitement, but she had forgotten something. “Have you printed the contract? We’ll sign it now. Let’s not waste time!”","Gu Zheng waved his hand indifferently, and Song Shiyu brought over a contract.","Qiao Xi signed her name without the slightest hesitation, but she didn’t sign it as Yun Chu and signed it as Qiao Xi instead.","1","After receiving the contract that she had been longing for, Qiao Xi urged Gu Zheng, saying, “Get Song Shiyu to use the Gu Corporation’s account to post a statement on Weibo about the company buying Yun Chu’s design draft.”","First, they would tell everyone about this matter. Then, after Yao Mengqing sold her designs in bulk, they would take out evidence and ask Yao Mengqing to compensate them with a huge sum of money!","Gu Zheng nodded and gave a few instructions according to Qiao Xi’s wishes. Then, he sized Qiao Xi up with interest and slowly said, “Mrs. Gu.”","“Huh?”","He lowered his eyes slightly and said casually, “If you have nothing to do, read more books and learn how to praise others. Don’t use what you learned from television dramas in real life. It’s very awkward.”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually vanished: “?","Read more books? Did he mean that she was uneducated?","This wretched man! How unlucky of her to have met him!"]},{"number":438,"title":"Chapter 438 - Counter-attack","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Overnight, the internet exploded.","Firstly, the feud between Yun Chu and Gu Corporation was resolved. This was the first collaboration between the two parties. Gu Corporation had bought Yun Chu’s design draft Returning Dream’ from three years ago and would use it as the company’s first jewelry piece for the next quarter.","On the other hand, although Yao Mengging did not win the championship, her and Jason’s jewelry was going to be put into production and sold as the main product of Sunshine. Jason was also said to be Yun Chu’s disciple.","As for the last piece of news.","In the moming, Qiao Xi was woken up by the noisy ringing of her phone.","Li Xing‘er’s anxious voice came from the phone. “You’re still in the mood to sleep at a time like this? Jason... and Yao Mengging are going to sue you!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was muddled, and her mind was still in chaos.","Li Xing‘er gritted her teeth in anger. “Jason said that your work that won the championship in the competition was plagiarized from his previous design draft, so he wants to sue you! Where did he get his confidence from? If he could design such a perfect piece of work, he wouldn’t have lost the","competition!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes gradually became clear.","This was going to be interesting. She had yet to settle scores with Yao Mengqing and Jason, but they had turned on her first?","Qiao Xi logged into her account and saw a bunch of messages in her private inbox.","She opened Jason’s Weibo and frowned.","There were two photos recently posted on his Weibo. One was a design sketch provided by Jason, while the other was a piece of jewelry designed by Qiao Xi during the competition. There were indeed many similarities between the two photos. From the design concept and color tone, they looked very","similar.","Jason’s design draft was published in ‘International Design Record Magazine’ three years ago.","Jason had also attached a caption to the photos—","[I wasn’t satisfied with this design draft at first, but the person in charge of the magazine approached me, hoping that he could publish my design draft. Hence, I handed the completed design draft to him. Probably because this magazine isn’t very famous, many people haven’t read it, giving Miss Qiao a","chance to plagiarize it.","[But coincidentally, I also participated in the competition this time. The first time I saw her jewelry, I felt that it looked familiar. After I went back and thought about it carefully, I decided to announce the truth of this matter. I hope that the competition’s organizers will revoke Miss Qiao’s title as","champion as her work was plagiarized. She doesn’t deserve to be the champion!]","Li Xing’er was worried. “Qiao Xi, he took out a design draft and said you plagiarized. Who knows if his design draft was really published three years ago?”","“Yes,” Qiao Xi replied calmly, “I’ve looked into it. Three years ago, the person in charge of International Design Record Magazine accepted his design draft.”","Li Xing‘er asked anxiously, “Then...”","“But I drew this design draft four years ago.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Although I haven’t released it anywhere, I can prove that the design draft is mine.”","The biggest taboo in the world of design was plagiarism. Plagiarizing something that another had created with their own inspiration was no different than stealing their soul. Therefore, everyone found plagiarism to be a shameful thing, especially now that a famous designer like Jason was accusing Qiao","Xi of plagiarism. If she did not have evidence to prove her innocence, she would not be able to turn the situation around.","But she was Yun Chu!","Jason was digging his own grave!","Not long after, the person in charge of the International Jewelry Design Competition called and asked about Qiao Xi’s work.","Qiao Xi did not give a clear explanation. Instead, she asked indifferently, “Is this regarding Mr. Jason’s appeal to revoke my title as champion? You’re saying that there’ll be a press conference tomorrow where famous designers will come together to boycott plagiarism, so you want me to explain the origin","of my work?”","“Yes, that’s right,” the person in charge said.","Qiao Xi didn’t hesitate in the slightest. “Il attend.”","After hanging up, Qiao Xi turned on her computer and logged into Black Tide’s account.","Although her design draft was not released anywhere, there would be records of it on the computer.","Some things could not be faked. Even though four years had passed, she could still find evidence.","The next day.","At the press conference, Yao Mengqing and Jason sat in front of the stage, their faces full of grief and anger.","“Tve been in the design industry for so many years, but this is the first time I’ve seen such an arrogant designer. I had already gone on stage, yet she still dared to copy my work.. Did she think I wouldn’t remember my own work from three years ago?”"]},{"number":439,"title":"Chapter 439 - The Title Of Champion Doesn’t Belong To You!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“When I saw the work, I found it familiar. I wondered why Qiao Xi’s work was so similar to my design draft. It was only later that I realized something. How could a newcomer complete her design draft in such a short period of time and produce such perfect work?","“If it’s not plagiarism, there’s no other way to explain it!”","Facing everyone’s camera, Jason was extremely furious. “I’ve invited many famous designers in the design industry to do an examination. They’ve confirmed that Qiao Xi’s designs are 90% similar to my design draft. This is enough to constitute plagiarism!","“I’ve also invited Miss Qiao to the venue. I hope she can explain to me why her work is so similar to my design draft!","“But the press conference is already halfway through and Miss Qiao still hasn’t appeared. It looks like she’s admitting that she plagiarized!”","Jason’s eyes were full of contempt. “Since Miss Qiao is not coming, then—”","“Tm here!”","Before Jason could finish, a cold female voice floated in.","Qiao Xi wore a sapphire blue velvet dress that revealed her fair shoulders and collarbone. Her slightly curled hair fell onto her shoulders while her red lips were bright. She seemed like a celestial maiden who had walked out from a painting.","“Wow! Her clothes are really good! Why haven’t I seen this dress before? Where did you buy it from?”","“Tsk! What’s so good about it? It must be a small brand. If a big brand had released a new collection, how could we not know about it?”","“It can’t be. How could a small brand have such an amazing design? It must be a new work by some big designer!”","“There’s no point discussing this. We’re boycotting plagiarism today. Whether she looks good or not has nothing to do with us. The plagiarist should get out of the design industry!”","Yao Mengaing looked at Qiao Xi coldly and acted as if she was in a difficult position when Qiao Xi got closer. “Xi Xi, don’t blame me for this. I’ve also begged Mr. Jason to give you a chance and not make a big deal out of this. But he thinks that his work has been blasphemed, so—","Jason interrupted her impatiently. “You’re finally here! I thought you wouldn’t dare to come! You copied my design draft. What do you have to say for yourself now?”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head and revealed a sinister smile.","She really thought that Qiao Xi was talented in designing, but it turned out that she had copied the design from a magazine. Now that she had been discovered, she would not be able to deny it!","Qiao Xi was also a fool. She knew that Jason was going to participate in the competition, yet she copied the design draft that he published in a magazine many years ago. Wasn’t she courting death?","‘The reporter hurriedly asked, “Miss Yao, if Miss Qiao hadn’t plagiarized, you would undoubtedly have been the champion. What do you have to say about this?”","“Mr. Jason, I heard that you’re ready to sue Qiao Xi?”","Jason did not answer, but Yao Mengging replied gently, “Although I have a good relationship with Xi Xi, having zero tolerance for plagiarism is the basic ethics of a designer. We should protect the ethics of the design world!","“Some people use other people’s things as their own and ruin the design industry’s culture. If we tolerate plagiarism, who will protect the rights of the original creator?”","Yao Mengging was helpless. “Xi Xi, the title of champion doesn’t belong to you!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. At this moment, Yao Mengqing was surely overjoyed in her heart. She must feel like Qiao Xi would surely be unable to turn the situation around this time.","Yao Mengging was an internationally renowned designer, and her reputation was still very resounding. Therefore, at this time, the number of netizens in the live-stream kept increasing. Most of them were attacking acts of plagiarism and defending Yao Mengqing.","The comers of Yao Mengqing’s mouth curled up. From now on, Qiao Xi would never be able to participate in another jewelry design competition.","She wanted Qiao Xi to know that this was the outcome of going against her!","She thought that the woman who married Gu Zheng would be very capable, but it turned out that she could only rely on plagiarism to participate in the competition. No wonder she was so confident previously. In reality, however, she was actually just a piece of trash.","Jason said coldly, “Mengging is right! I’m here today not only to seek justice for myself, but also for all the designers who have been plagiarized! Qiao Xi, you have no respect for anyone and dared to plagiarize my work in the competition. Do you still have any shame? It’s because of designers like you that","the design industry is approaching its doom!”"]},{"number":440,"title":"Chapter 440 - Who’s Plagiarizing Who?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The reporters then rushed to Qiao Xi and aimed the microphones at her.","“Miss Qiao, do you admit that you copied Mr. Jason’s work?”","“You thought that not many people knew about that magazine, so you chose that design draft. You thought that no one would find out, right?”","“Do you regret plagiarizing someone else’s work and getting first place in the competition? Will you continue to work in the design industry in the future?”","The reporters’ sharp questions came one after another. Without waiting for Qiao Xi to reply, countless fans at the scene cursed Qiao Xi to the skies.","“The design industry doesn’t need a designer like her! Get out!”","“Qiao Xi isn’t worthy of being the champion!”","Yao Mengqing heard the scoldings around her and looked pleased.","This time, Qiao Xi’s reputation would surely be ruined!","Amidst the curses of the crowd, Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and casually took over a microphone. She said indifferently, “The first creator is the original, and the next one who comes after is a plagiarist, right?”","Jason snorted. “Yes!”","His design draft was released three years ago. Although he did not finish the final product, the design draft was still there. This was the most powerful evidence.","“Qiao Xi, the truth is right in front of you. Don’t try to deny it! You’d better hurry up and apologize to Mr. Jason. He’s a magnanimous person. He won’t hold it against you!” said Lin Jie.","Yao Mengqing also chimed in. “Xi Xi, it won’t do you any good if things get out of hand. Even if you’re not thinking about yourself, you should think about... him!”","Him? Gu Zheng? Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","She looked up at the design draft from three years ago on the big screen, and everyone’s gaze followed her to the big screen.","suddenly, the screen went black and a video appeared.","“Everyone heard it just now. Mr. Jason also agreed that the first creator is the original. Please take a look at this video.”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, the video started playing.","‘There was a sketch on the screen. Someone was drawing and editing on the computer. That person’s movements were smooth and meticulous.","Although the video was fast-forwarded, one could still clearly see that this was the design process of a draft. Furthermore, it was a highly-skilled designer.","‘What was even more shocking was that the time displayed was four years ago!","Everyone’s eyes widened.","That was because they realized that the design was almost identical to Jason’s!","Back then, Qiao Xi was watching a drama set in the Qing dynasty and suddenly had an inspiration. Following the theme of the male and female leads’ undying love, she created a design draft. It happened to be exactly the same as the topic of the competition this time, so she used this design draft to","participate in the competition.","She was too busy to complete the design draft back then, so it had been kept on her computer for so long. She had only shown it to two people during this period.","She did not understand how the design fell into Jason’s hands, but she was sure that Jason copied her design draft because all the details were exactly the same. Even some of the flaws were not changed by him.","After the video ended, two design drafts appeared on the big screen. Although it could be seen that they were not drawn by one person, the two were basically the same.","Those who were cursing Qiao Xi madly earlier didn’t utter a single word now. The reporters couldn’t help but be stunned as well.","“This design draft is... the same as Jason’s?”","“Four years ago? Does that mean Jason copied someone else’s work?”","“Actually, if you take a closer look, it’s not hard to notice that the design draft from four years ago is exactly the same as the one Qiao Xi produced during the competition. The flow of the lines and details are exactly the same. It can be seen that the two drafts were done by the same person.”","“Ah! So the person who drew this design draft four years ago was Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi didn’t plagiarize because this design draft was originally hers, but she didn’t publish it and only chose to reproduce it during the competition.”","Everyone was enlightened. “Jason kept saying that he would boycott plagiarism, but it tuned out that he was the one who plagiarized and even used public opinion to attack the original creator! This way, no one would know that he was the plagiarist!”","The situation suddenly changed. Those who were scolding Qiao Xi started cursing Jason, and his face turned pale.","“No, no! It’s not true!”"]},{"number":441,"title":"Chapter 441 - There’s Still Another Half To The Design Draft","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jason staggered as he pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted, “Where did you get your video from? Qiao Xi! You plagiarized my work! It’s fine if you don’t want to apologize, but you even forged evidence to frame me! I won’t let you succeed!","“Te been in the design industry for so many years. When have I ever plagiarized? If I’m capable, why would I plagiarize? But you’re just a newcomer. How could you design such a perfect piece? This doesn’t make sense!","“You plagiarized me!”","Yao Mengging’s face was ashen, and Lin Jie, her lackey, hurriedly said, “Qiao Xi, there’s concrete evidence that Mr. Jason published his design draft in a magazine, but you only have a video. It can’t be used as evidence. Moreover, even if you drew the design draft, it might not be from four years ago.","possible that you drew it yesterday. In order to clear your name, you changed the time.”","Everyone was puzzled. Actually, this wasn’t impossible. After all, technology was advanced now. What couldn’t be done?","However, in order to prove that the time stamp was not edited by anyone, was it enough to just get a professional to examine it?","If Qiao Xi had found a very capable hacker, changing the time stamp on the video shouldn’t be a problem for them. They couldn’t wrongly accuse someone just because of a video.","No matter what, Jason had substantial evidence, while Qiao Xi’s evidence was just a video. It was not as convincing.","Jason’s face softened for a moment, then he shouted in exasperation, “Qiao Xi! You not only plagiarized but also framed me! A person like you is not fit to be a designer!”","Yao Mengqing’s face was full of grief. “Xi Xi, how could you do this? It’s not too late for you to admit your mistake now. I can still use my identity to help you deal with the design world, but if you persist, the design world will definitely not tolerate you. Don’t be foolish!”","Qjao Xi didn’t get angry. Instead, she smiled meaningfully. “Indeed, a video can’t be used as evidence, but I don’t think Mr. Jason would have thought that this is only half of my design draft.”","Jason’s expression changed.","Everyone was puzzled. What did she mean by half of her design draft?","This design draft looked very complete! Moreover, Qiao Xi had already finished the product. They had seen that set of work before. It was truly perfect.","Jason said disdainfully, “Qiao Xi! What’s the point of making up such a lie just to clear your name? Everyone can see that this design draft is complete and doesn’t lack anything!”","However, Yao Mengging’s heart skipped a beat. Half of the design draft? Could there be something else?","“Mr. Jason, this set of jewelry is only half complete because the other half is a men’s watch and accessory!”","Qiao Xi’s voice was cold, and her words were clear. “I drew this design draft four years ago and named it ‘Longing.’ It represents an unwavering love. Mr. Jason, you said that you’re the original creator of this set of jewelry. Then, you should have another design draft, right?”","What?","Another design draft?","Jason’s body stiffened. He stood up abruptly and shouted in a panic, “Nonsense!”","‘The moment he finished speaking, another scene appeared on the big screen.","Everyone looked up and clearly saw that after the designer completed the first set of jewelry, they began designing a men’s watch and accompanying accessory. The patterns and details on the watch and accessory were completely in line with the set of female jewelry.","Jason watched in disbelief.","Qiao Xi glanced at him coldly. “Mr. Jason, although I don’t know how you stole my design, who gave you the courage to publish it in a magazine without changing anything at all? You named this set of jewelry ‘Late Autumn.’ You didn’t even know that the name of this set of jewelry is ‘Longing.’","“The reason why it’s called this is that they’re for a man and a woman. The patterns on it are all harmonious. Mr. Jason, can you produce the remaining half of the design draft?","“If you’re really the original creator, please tell me why there’s a semi-circular ruby in the middle of this set of jewelry. Please tell me what you think.”"]},{"number":442,"title":"Chapter 442 - Red Beans Are A Symbol Of Love","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let me explain, then. The ruby is cut into this shape because the other half is on the cufflinks meant for the male wearer. When the two halves are put together, they represent a red bean. Red beans are a symbol of love!”","Jason trembled. “W-What...”","“What else do you want to say?” Qiao Xi sneered.","“You claim to be the original creator, but you have no idea that there’s another design draft. You can’t explain the concept of the design either. If you’re the original creator, why didn’t you realize that many parts of the design are incomplete?”","Each and every word was like a huge rock weighing a thousand kilograms smashing into Jason’s heart. His face was pale, and he could not speak for a long time.","The designers below the stage who had originally come to denounce Qiao Xi were all dumbstruck. At this point, they could no longer lie through their teeth.","“Toriginally thought that the ruby was the designer’s unique artistic choice. I didn’t expect it to be part of a couple design. But now that you mention it, I suddenly feel that this set of jewelry is even more perfect.”","“That’s right. The set of jewelry Qiao Xi made looked perfect, but I kept feeling that there was something missing. It wasn’t until after the other design draft was revealed that I realized that the other half of the design was missing. When I put the two together and look at it, everything makes sense now.”","“Even if the plagiarist could copy the design, they wouldn’t be able to copy the essence of it. He even has the nerve to accuse the original creator, Qiao Xi!”","Jason’s face flushed red and white, his expression growing menacing.","“No! It’s not like that! I didn’t plagiarize! She’s framing me!”","The one who was originally accused of plagiarism was Qiao Xi. Now, she had become the victim, and the situation had an unprecedented reversal.","Jason’s face was full of fear. “You faked the evidence! I didn’t create any couple designs at all. The ruby is just a unique artistic choice I made! You made up a random excuse to slander me!”","He continued to argue, but everyone just sneered at him.","“shut up! Do you think we’re all idiots? The time stamp on the video clearly states that Qiao Xi completed the design draft four years ago!”","“Jason, you plagiarizing dog! You’re not fit to be Yun Chu’s disciple at all! Four years ago, Qiao Xi was still a child who hadn’t fully grown up. Yet you had the nerve to steal her design draft?”","“You still have the cheek to hold a press conference and want Qiao Xi to take the blame?! How shameless!”","Hearing everyone’s curses, Jason trembled slightly as his body shook uncontrollably.","He knew that no one would believe him no matter what he said.","Yao Mengqing’s face darkened. She bit her lip and said apologetically, “Xi Xi, I’ve wronged you. I didn’t know that Jason copied your work. I’m really sorry. I hope you can forgive me.”","Qiao Xi glanced at her indifferently.","Yao Mengqing was as heartless as ever!","She pretended to feel guilty. “I... I really didn’t expect Jason to plagiarize. After all, he’s Yun Chu’s disciple... I believed everything he said, but...”","“So Miss Yao was deceived!” Qiao Xi said meaningfully, “Since it’s like that, then I have some things I want to confirm.”","As she looked at Qiao Xi’s icy-cold gaze, Yao Mengging’s heart jerked. She hurriedly admitted her mistake. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I’ll apologize to you!”","“Miss Yao, I’m reporting you for plagiarism too!”","Boom!!!","The moment that was said, the entire venue erupted!","‘What? Qiao Xi actually said that Yao Mengging’s work was copied as well!","It was fine if Jason plagiarized, but Yao Mengqing was a designer with her own brand. How could she have plagiarized?","The veins on Yao Mengging’s forehead popped out as she roared, “Xi Xi, how could you slander me?! I didn’t know that Jason plagiarized your work and I’ve apologized to you. What else do you want from me? Even if you hate me, you can’t accuse me of plagiarism!”","Everyone was stunned. How did Yao Mengqing suddenly become a plagiarist as well? Whose work did Yao Mengqing copy? Could it be Qiao Xi’s?","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale. She forced herself to calm down. “Xi Xi, Jason copied your work. If you say that I plagiarized too, then tell me whose work I copied! Did I copy yours too? I know you don’t like me, but you can’t accuse me like this!”"]},{"number":443,"title":"Chapter 443 - Yun Chu Gave Me The Design Draft!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yes, Yao Mengqing had no reason to copy Qiao Xi’s work!","Yao Mengging was the founder of an internationally renowned brand. She was talented in designing and was very capable. Was there a need for her to copy a newcomer?","‘Those die-hard fans of Yao Mengqing instantly went crazy, but Qiao Xi was still calm and composed. “Why are you so agitated? That’s right, you naturally have no reason to copy the work of a newbie.”","Yao Mengging’s expression eased up as she looked at Qiao Xi with slight bewilderment.","“Because you plagiarized the work of a famous designer!”","Qiao Xi waved her hand, and an image flashed onto the big screen. A stunning and perfect design appeared. Yun Chu’s name was clearly written on it.","“You plagiarized Yun Chu’s work! This is ‘Returning Dream’ that Yun Chu designed four years ago!”","Everyone sucked in a breath. After a few seconds of silence, there was an uproar.","“Goddess Yun Chu? Yao Mengqing dared to copy Yun Chu? F*ck! Is she crazy? How can someone like her copy Yun Chu’s works?”","“Look at the design draft. It has Yun Chu’s signature and the date. This is Yun Chu’s work. It can’t be wrong!”","“F*ck! I really have to take my hat off to her! Yao Menggqing is so shameless! Of all people, she plagiarized Yun Chu! How dare she say that she’s an internationally renowned designer? Maybe her previous works were all plagiarized too!”","‘The moment Yun Chu’s name was announced, everyone was instantly enraged.","Yao Mengging’s works in the competition were very similar to Yun Chu’s Returning Dream’ from four years ago. Although there were some changes, one could still see the traces of Yun Chu’s style.","“Yao Mengging kept saying that this boycott of plagiarism isn’t for herself but for the sake of the entire design industry. In order to protect the rights and interests of the original creator, she wanted to investigate this matter! But it turns out that the most shameless plagiarist is her!”","“Tm really angry! She pretends to be all proper and even looked down on Qiao Xi just now. In the end, it tums out that Qiao Xi didn’t plagiarize. It was this dignified bitch who plagiarized someone else’s work!”","“Get out of the design industry, Yao Menggqing!”","Yao Mengaing’s face turned pale as her body swayed.","Yun Chu... Yun Chu again... Why should she lower herself to this woman?","Originally, the plagiarism incident today had nothing to do with her, yet Qiao Xi had obtained Yun Chu’s design draft. However, where did she get it from?","She had not plagiarized Yun Chu at all. She had only borrowed parts of Yun Chu’s work. She was not convinced. Why was she overshadowed whenever Yun Chu was mentioned? Why did she have to be chased out of the design industry after borrowing Yun Chu’s work?","1","Just like Qiao Xi, Yun Chu was a b*tch who went against her!","Yao Mengqing was nervous. She was thinking about how to escape.","She knew in her heart that if she did not come up with a suitable reason, these people would not let her off. She would end up in a worse state than Jason.","Jason was Yun Chu’s disciple, after all. These people would not do anything to him, but she was different.","Yao Mengaing quickly said, “Everyone, let me explain.”","All eyes were on her.","Yao Menggqing calmed herself down and said forcefully, “I did borrow some aspects of Yun Chu’s design to use on my own, but I didn’t plagiarize her. I just admire her work. Also... Yun Chu gave me this design draft!","“Jason is Yun Chu’s disciple, and I’m Jason’s friend. I’ve met Yun Chu a few times. She has a good impression of me, so she gave me this design draft. I’ve always admired Yun Chu, so I would always take it out to have a look at it. When I was coming up with the draft, I subconsciously added some elements","from Yun Chu’s design, but I really didn’t plagiarize!","“Jason and I are the same. We both treat Yun Chu as our own master. This design draft was given to me by her. It’s not wrong to say that it’s mine. Besides, there’s nothing wrong with me imitating my own master’s creation! This isn’t considered plagiarism!”","Everyone fell silent. Yun Chu’s design draft had never been released before. If it was given to Yao Mengging, then Yao Mengqing would not be considered a deliberate plagiarist. If Yun Chu did not pursue this matter, what right did they have to pursue it?","Just when everyone thought the matter was about to be turned around, Qiao Xi sneered.."]},{"number":444,"title":"Chapter 444 - Qiao Xi Is Yun Chu!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, a cold voice sounded from not far away—","“Miss Yao, you said that Yun Chu gave you the design draft? Do you have any evidence? Don’t you know that Yun Chu has already sold the design draft to Gu Corporation?”","What?","Yao Mengaing’s lips trembled.","Song Shijing said solemnly, “Gu Corporation has issued an announcement that Miss Yun Chu has sold her design draft to us! Miss Yao, you said that Miss Yun Chu gave you the design draft? If that’s the case, who do you think is lying here? Miss Yun Chu or Gu Corporation?”","His words caused a huge commotion.","A few days ago, Gu Corporation had indeed posted on Weibo about their collaboration with Yun Chu, but unexpectedly","‘The design draft that Yun Chu sold to Gu Corporation happened to be the one that Yao Mengqing copied! What a coincidence!","Yao Mengaing’s body stiffened. Her heart was in turmoil. How was that possible? The design draft had been sold to Gu Corporation? It was over! Everything was over!","1","No! She could not admit to having plagiarized just like that, or her future would be ruined! She would never allow that to happen.","“Assistant Song, this... This design draft was really given to me by Yun Chu! I think... she must have forgotten about it, so she sold it to you. After all, she has a lot of design drafts, and anyone would want one.”","Yao Mengging explained weakly, “I’m Yun Chu’s friend. If you don’t believe me, you can ask Jason. He’s Yun Chu’s disciple. We meet up often. It’s not strange for her to give me a design draft.","“It’s possible that Yun Chu forgot about it and sold it to Gu Corporation. I’ll immediately cancel my own work and stop the production of it. I’ll return the design draft to Yun Chu now! I really didn’t plagiarize!”","‘There was complete silence.","Everyone waited for the Gu Corporation to speak, only to see Song Shijing smile disdainfully.","Everyone held their breath. Song Shijing was not to be trifled with. Yao Mengqing had violated the interests of Gu Corporation. How could they let her go so easily?","He said calmly, “Miss Yao, Mr. Jason, both of you are lying in front of everyone. Did you think Yun Chu wouldn’t show up? Don’t you know that Yun Chu is here right now?”","Boom!!!","Everyone was stunned!","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng, who wasn’t far away. The man was hidden in the darkness, but it was hard for one to look away. He raised his eyes slightly, his deep black eyes flickering with a faint light. The corners of his lips curled up as he slowly stood up.","Yao Mengging’s heart skipped a beat. Fear engulfed her like cold water, making it hard for her to breathe.","Yun Chu was here?","Who? Where is she?","No! This was impossible! It couldn’t be her!","Before Yao Mengqing could reply, Lin Jie could no longer sit still. He roared angrily, “Qiao Xi, you’re not going to say that you’re Yun Chu, are you? Do you think you’re worthy?”","Just as she finished speaking, Yao Mengging interrupted in a panic. “Xi Xi! Don’t talk nonsense. Why would you pretend to be Yun Chu? If Yun Chu finds out that you’re pretending to be her, your future will be completely ruined! You can’t be Yun Chu, you...”","Before she could finish speaking, a tall figure slowly walked over.","Everyone felt a cold aura around them and hurriedly made way for him.","Gu Zheng, the man who could control everything in Li City, currently had a gloomy look on his face. His gaze was deep. He seemed to be stepping on Yao Mengqing’s heart.","However, he didn’t even bother to look at Yao Mengging. He fixed his gaze on Qiao Xi with a small smile on his face.","“Yun Chu, stop being so mischievous.”","!","Yun Chu? President Gu was calling Qiao Xi Yun Chu?","Everyone knew that Yun Chu was collaborating with Gu Corporation. President Gu must have seen the real Yun Chu. Could it be that Qiao Xi was the real Yun Chu? She was the top international jewelry designer?","Just then, Yun Chu posted a message on her Weibo account—","[That’s right, it’s me.]","This short sentence explained everything. If Yun Chu wasn’t present at the scene, then there would be no reason for her to post this. These few words represented Qiao Xi’s identity.","Furthermore, President Gu was a witness. Even if everyone found it hard to believe, this was the truth!","Qiao Xi was Yun Chu!","Yao Mengqing’s body trembled. Her face was as pale as paper. It was as if she was going to faint at any moment..1"]},{"number":445,"title":"Chapter 445 - Fearless","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s face was full of ridicule. “Miss Yao, I’m sure that I didn’t give this design draft to you, which can only mean that you copied my work!","“What else do you want to say?”","Everyone hadn’t recovered from the shock of Qiao Xi being Yun Chu when they heard Qiao Xi speak these words. They were shocked once more, and at the same time, Yao Mengqing’s face was full of terror.","Qiao Xi’s words seemed to have pressed her dignity to the ground. Everything she had said earlier became a joke, and she was now the most despised person present!","Initially, she decided to work together with Jason to deal with Qiao Xi. She even invited famous designers and Li Cheng’s reporters to the venue. In the end, all these people were now going against her.","Yao Mengaing bit her lip tightly. Her face was filled with ruthlessness.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly.","“Yao Mengaing is so disgusting!” Everyone cursed.","“She said that she’s on good terms with Qiao Xi and treats Qiao Xi as her friend, but she’s always targeting Qiao Xi. Does she really think we can’t see through her evil intentions? It’s fine if she plagiarized Yun Chu, but she still refuses to admit it and says that Yun Chu gave her the design draft!”","“Pretending to be good friends with Yun Chu, huh? She definitely didn’t expect the real Yun Chu to be here!”","“Today, I’ve seen what a real shameless b*tch is! She keeps saying that Yun Chu is her idol and friend. She boasts about her relationship with Yun Chu outside, using Yun Chu’s name to snatch many resources. Her skin is thicker than the city walls! That’s how shameless she is!”","Yao Mengging’s nails dug into her palms. Her mind was in a mess, and she wished she could find a hole to hide in.","“No! You’ve misunderstood! It’s... It’s Qiao Xi! She’s framing me!”","Lin Jie’s heart ached, then he shouted angrily, “Qiao Xi! What do you want? Mengging is the eldest daughter of the Yao family. You...”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Hah! Yao Mengging was the eldest daughter of the Yao family? It was because of this identity that Yao Mengqing managed to escape punishment several times and let others take the blame for her. As long as she had this identity, she would always be fearless!","“Yao Mengqing, didn’t you say that plagiarists should leave the design industry?”","She leaned closer and lowered her voice. “Look at yourself. Don’t you look like a shrew right now? Since you want to pretend to be weak, then you have to pretend all the way to the end! You should be gently advising me not to do this and not do that. What a pity! You still can’t beat me!”","Yao Mengging gritted her teeth. “Qiao... Xi! Just you wait!”","Qiao Xi pretended to be terrified. “I’m so scared!”","With that, she looked up at Jason, whose eyes were lowered.","Jason trembled slightly, his eyes avoiding hers.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she spoke word by word, “Mr. Jason, I’ve never accepted a disciple, yet you’ve been using my name to swindle others for so many years. I have to say that you’re really smart. You’ve taken special precautions to avoid me, which allowed you to go undiscovered for so long.”","Jason trembled. “I... I...”","“Woah! So that’s how it is! Yun Chu has never accepted any disciples! It’s Jason who has always been pretending to be Yun Chu’s disciple, and he’s never even seen Yun Chu before. Otherwise, why would he say that Qiao Xi is only a newbie and isn’t worthy to compete with him at all?!”","“Open your eyes wide and take a good look, Jason! The designer you were mocking and bullying is Yun Chu! You and Yao Mengging are really birds of the same feather. Both of you are plagiarists! You obviously plagiarized someone else’s work, but you still maligned Yun Chu. You’re so disgusting!”","Jason’s face was pale. He took a few steps back and tripped.","It was all over!","He pretended to be Yun Chu’s disciple and copied Yun Chu’s work. From now on, the design industry would never tolerate him.","2","He never would have thought that Qiao Xi was Yun Chu. How could she be Yun Chu? He could have caused trouble for anyone, but he just had to provoke this big shot. If he had known earlier, he would not have come to Li City at all. All of this would not have happened.","Jason’s heart crumbled to pieces, and he hung his head weakly like a defeated rooster.","Yao Mengging’s legs went weak as she fell onto the chair. She struggled a few times but was unable to stand up.","Lin Jie’s heart ached for her. He quickly held her arm and helped her stand up.","“Qiao Xi, you’re happy now, right?! You’ve won! You’ve won completely! What else do you want?!”"]},{"number":446,"title":"Chapter 446 - My Biggest Mistake Was Being Too Merciful","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing looked aggrieved. Tears slowly flowed down her face.","Lin Jie felt indignant. “Mengqing didn’t plagiarize your work. She was just using your work as a reference. Can’t she do that? She has the international brand, Sunshine, under her name. She’s also very powerful!”","“Heh!” Gu Zheng sneered, his eyes deep.","The man’s tall figure made him look like a god. His handsome face was calm and so were his eyes.","Gu Zheng sat in front of the stage, and everyone quickly stood up to give up their seats. No one dared to sit in the same row as President Gu. Even if he wasn’t angry, no one could withstand the cold air around him.","Everyone held their breaths. This powerful pressure was suffocating.","Lin Jie braced himself. “Qiao Xi is indeed very powerful, but Mengqing is also capable. She—”","“But...”","Gu Zheng interrupted him coldly, scaring Lin Jie so much that he did not dare to continue.","“Sunshine will disappear from now on.”","Boom!!!","Yao Mengqing’s pupils constricted as her voice trembled. “Ah Zheng... Ah Zheng, what do you mean? What are you doing?”","Fear was written all over her face as she screamed crazily, “Ah Zheng! You want to kill me for this woman?! Sunshine is my everything! Don’t you know that the Yao family is now... The entire Yao family is relying on Sunshine! If Sunshine is really gone, then we... Ah Zheng, we grew up together. You can’t","do this to me!”","Words of pleading and questioning gushed out from her mouth. Then, Yao Mengging suddenly tumed around. “Qiao Xi! I’ll absolutely not let you off!”","“Not let me off?” Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “Do you know what my biggest mistake was?”","She paused for a moment before continuing, “My biggest mistake was that I was too benevolent and allowed you to behave atrociously in front of me time and time again. Between us, who exactly is the one not letting the other off? Think about everything you’ve done in the past. At this point, you’re only","reaping what you sow!","“Moreover, do you really think that Gu Zheng is making a move on you because of me?” Qiao Xi smiled, and her eyes were filled with ridicule as if she was looking at a pile of trash.","“Yao Mengqing, you’re also in the business field. You should understand that businessmen don’t get up early unless there’s profit to be made. President Gu is doing this because you’ve hurt the interests of Gu Corporation.","“Your previous works have already been mass-produced and the first batch has been sold. I think you’ve already made a small profit and invested a lot of money into production.","“But you forgot that you plagiarized my work, and my work, ‘Returning Dream’, has already been sold to Gu Corporation. What you’re doing is affecting the interests of Gu Corporation. Not only did you plagiarize my work, but you’re also profiting off it illegally. How do you intend to compensate us?”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale instantly!","“I think you’ll soon be receiving a lawyer’s letter from Gu Corporation, Miss Yao.”","Everyone instantly reacted, and Lin Jie’s expression was also very ugly.","If it were just a case of plagiarism and Yao Mengging didn’t profit from it, she only needed to apologize to Yun Chu in front of everyone and suffer moral condemnation. At most, she would have to pay a sum of money, but it wouldn’t be too much. It wouldn’t hurt Yao Mengging at all.","However, if the matter involved Gu Corporation, the nature of the matter would be different. President Gu had always been someone who would not suffer losses. How could he tolerate Yao Mengqing invading his interests?","Sunshine had no chance of winning against Gu Corporation!","Yao Mengqing did not care about her image anymore and rushed to Gu Zheng. Just as she was about to touch his hand, she was flung away by a strong force. Yao Mengqing lost her balance and fell backward. Luckily, Lin Jie rushed over and hugged her.","“Ah Zheng... No, no!”","Hearing her pleas, Gu Zheng stood up abruptly, his eyes filled with impatience.","Just then, Song Shijing handed Gu Zheng a handkerchief and Gu Zheng took it. He wiped his hands in front of everyone as if they were stained with dirt.","He then threw the handkerchief into the rubbish bin.","They had long heard that President Gu did not like women and was cold and heartless. Seeing him today, it was true.","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with humiliation. Then, she fainted.","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes. Yao Mengqing fainted again? But it seemed like it was real this time. This woman’s mental endurance was truly too poor. She fainted whenever she encountered something."]},{"number":447,"title":"Chapter 447 - Diamond Brooch","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the design industry, the most famous designer was undoubtedly Yun Chu, but she had always kept a low profile. The number of people who had seen her true face could be counted on one hand. Now that her true face was exposed, it caused a wave of buzz on the internet and instantly took the top spot","on Weibo’s list of trending topics.","There was no mention of Yun Chu’s real name in the photo, nor was there any mention of it in the comments. In the photo, Yun Chu’s face was a little blurry as if it had been done on purpose. However, just this photo alone was enough to stir up the netizens.","1","All the celebrities in the entertainment industry took pride in wearing Yun Chu’s jewelry. If they wanted better resources, they absolutely could not offend Yun Chu. Knowing that Yao Mengqing had copied Yun Chu’s work and angered Yun Chu, everyone naturally knew what to do. From then on, no one","would work with Yao Mengging anymore.","Qiao Xi raised her brows. “Sunshine is about to cease to exist. Yao Mengging has failed miserably this time. I want to see how she’ll survive in the design industry in the future!”","Gu Zheng sat calmly on the chair and took a sip of tea.","Qiao Xi was unable to calm down. She was a person that wouldn’t offend others unless they offended her, and when she saw Yao Mengqing suffer retribution, she was unable to restrain her happiness. She could not control her emotions.","“Gu Zheng, why aren’t you happy at all?! You didn’t even see Yao Mengqing’s expression at that time. Also, after those people found out that I’m Yun Chu, their expressions completely changed!","“Have you sued Sunshine?","“How much does Yao Mengqing have to pay this time? I previously estimated that she would pay 20 to 50 million yuan. After all, it’s Gu Corporation that’s suing her. She’ll definitely have to pay a heavy price!”","Gu Zheng looked up slowly. “How much do you want her to pay?”","Qiao Xi blinked her eyes. “Actually, I don’t need much. But I heard that the Yao family’s business has always been managed by her elder brother, and her elder brother didn’t do anything wrong, so there’s no need for me to make the other members of the Yao family suffer. I think it’s better to not let Yao","Mengging use her identity as the eldest young miss of the Yao family to compensate for her crimes.”","Gu Zheng suddenly thought of Liang Pingchuan’s words—","‘Little Six may look weak, but if anyone bullies her, she’ll definitely take revenge. President Gu, I have to give you a heads-up. If you don’t like Little Six’s vengeful personality, you’d better quickly divorce her, or you won’t be able to accept her true colors.’","Gu Zheng curled his lips, and his eyes were full of smiles. He held her hand and led her to the study. “I have a present for you.”","Actually, there was nothing bad about taking revenge for a grievance no matter how small. As long as it was Qiao Xi, everything was fine with him.","Gu Zheng walked into the study, opened the safe, and took out a dark red box. When he lifted the lid, there was a diamond brooch inside. It was light and exquisite. It was decorated with diamonds but did not appear luxurious or complicated.","Qiao Xi looked at the brooch and suddenly felt that this brooch was slightly strange.","She grew up on the mountain and had learned some knowledge about hidden weapons from her master and teacher. She had also seen those exquisite hidden weapons with her own eyes. Furthermore, her teacher had also given her a hidden weapon—silver needles.","As long as she did not encounter any hidden weapons expert, she could pierce the silver needle into the other party without anyone noticing.","There would be some poison on the silver needles. This way, she would be able to poison someone without anyone knowing.","She knew about hidden weapons, so she could tell that this brooch was also a hidden weapon.","“Why are you giving me this?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “The hidden weapon you have on you is too weak. It’s still not enough to protect yourself. Moreover, Li City doesn’t allow guns. If you encounter any danger, this brooch can save you.”","1","Qiao Xi’s throat suddenly felt dry: “...”","“Besides, isn’t your brooch broken? I’ll give you one as compensation. This brooch is useless if left here. You’re just the right person for it.”","Qiao Xi seriously studied the brooch for a moment, then a silver light instantly burst out from it and was directly shot at the wall. This power was indeed stronger than her concealed weapons.","“President!”","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door of the study and walked in slowly. He was slightly surprised to see the brooch in Qiao Xi’s hand but soon recovered his senses and reported respectfully, “President, the old madam is awake..”"]},{"number":448,"title":"Chapter 448 - Why Should I Give Up The Hope Of Living?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing that Old Madam Gu had woken up, Gu Zheng suddenly looked up.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. Old Madam Gu had woken up?","She was seriously ill and unconscious. They had looked for countless doctors to treat her, but even those doctors were helpless. They could only allow her to fall into a deep sleep from time to time, hoping that she would wake up.","Old Madam Gu would wake up once every two days in the beginning. Now, she would only wake up once a week or even longer. Furthermore, she could only be awake for two to three hours each time. Hence, this period of time was extremely precious.","Song Shijing was a little excited. “But Old Madam Gu has been awake for three hours this time. She said she wanted to see you.”","Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly. “Come! Let’s go to the old residence!”","Qiao Xi put on the brooch, and the two of them rushed out of the door.","After getting into the car, she couldn’t help but ask, “Gu Zheng, actually, the poison in Grandma’s body isn’t incurable. Although my grandpa has gone missing, my teacher and third brother’s medical skills are also very advanced. They might have a way.”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips. “Grandma doesn’t want to.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “Why?”","‘When she met Old Madam Gu previously, she had also mentioned this matter. At that time, Old Madam Gu was concerned about her words and did not directly answer her question.","Qiao Xi really didn’t understand. The old madam already knew that she would frequently fall unconscious and her condition was getting worse. She clearly knew that she could still be saved, so why didn’t she fight for it?","Although her grandpa had gone missing, her third brother’s medical skills were also very brilliant. Even if he couldn’t completely cure the poison, he could still control the illness. Furthermore, as long as Old Madam Gu gave the order, Gu Zheng would spend a lot of money to invite the world’s famous","doctors no matter what.","So... why was she giving up on her own life?","Gu Zheng’s heart trembled as he slowly closed his eyes.","It had been a while since the poison acted up. It was all because he drank Qiao Xi’s blood that the poison in his body was temporarily suppressed.","However, once the descendant of the divine physician used their blood to save someone, they would suffer a certain degree of backlash. If Gu Zheng continued to use Qiao Xi’s blood to detoxify the poison in his body, then her body would become weaker day by day.","If the person who was being treated was about to die, the descendant of the divine physician would be severely injured and might even die on the spot.","He didn’t know what his outcome would be. It might be blindness, paralysis, or even death. Gu Zheng was utterly uncertain, but no matter what it was, he wouldn’t allow Qiao Xi to take this risk.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “I don’t know. Grandma has her reasons for doing this. She doesn’t want to receive treatment. It could also be that your grandfather had already tried to treat her back then.”","Qiao Xi nodded and felt that it was possible as well. A person whom even the divine physician was unable to save was a lost cause.","However, Qiao Xi still felt that something was off. Even if her grandfather said that there was no hope, how could a person easily give up the hope of living? Even if it was extremely unlikely, they should still try!","However, it was not that Old Madam Gu had lost hope. She simply did not want to talk about this matter. Why was that so?","At the Gu family’s old residence.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi went straight to Old Madam Gu’s residence as soon as they entered. She liked the quietness, so she lived in the courtyard at the back of the old residence. The scenery was beautiful, and no one would disturb her most of the time, so she was happy to have peace and quiet.","Just as the two of them were about to enter, Old Madam Gu’s personal servant stopped Qiao Xi and said respectfully, “Young Madam, I’m really sorry. Old Madam Gu wants to speak to President Gu alone.”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Zheng walked into the house. Old Madam Gu opened her tired eyes. “Zheng’er...”","“Grandma.”","Old Madam Gu sighed. “Zheng’er, I only found out today that the lady you married is your junior. I think you must really like her.”","Gu Zheng replied without hesitation, “Yes, I like her.”","“Tknow you. You have her in your heart, so even if you risk losing your sight and life, you won’t let her help you detoxify the poison in your body, right?”","Gu Zheng felt bitter in his heart.","Old Madam Gu’s eyes reddened as she recalled the past. She said helplessly, “Zheng’er, there’s no one in this world who understands your feelings better than I do. If the person you love the most loses her life in order to save you, you’ll be in pain even if you live..”"]},{"number":449,"title":"Chapter 449 - Lone Star","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“She gave up her life to save you. You know that she did her best to save you, so you can’t even bear to die for fear of letting her down. But at the same time, you also feel that staying alive is too boring, and you’re tormented by pain every day. I’ve already experienced this kind of pain in my life, and I don’t","want you to suffer the same. But... has she already used her blood to cure you?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “It was my negligence, but I’ll never let her take the risk again.”","“Mmm, good child.” Old Madam Gu heaved a sigh of relief. “Her blood can cure the poison, but this is not a good thing. You must protect her to the best of your ability. You must not let anyone else know this secret.”","Outside the door, Qiao Xi asked the servant curiously, “Do you know why Old Madam Gu doesn’t wish to receive treatment? Actually, I can arrange for someone to treat her.”","The servant smiled bitterly. “Maybe it’s because Old Madam Gu is kind-hearted and doesn’t want the younger generation to worry about her, so she doesn’t accept treatment.”","Was this the reason? Qiao Xi fell into deep thought.","At this moment, there was a commotion nearby.","Gu Weiming said agitatedly, “Gu Zheng is the same as his mother. He’s a complete lunatic! His illness has never been cured. I think he’ll go blind soon. At that time, he’ll no longer be qualified to be the successor of the Gu family. We’ll lock him up in the courtyard of the Gu family’s backyard and announce","to the public that he’s seriously ill. Let him fend for himself!”","After he left, a few people from the Lu family said excitedly, “Gu Weiming is right! If Gu Zheng were not sick, he would indeed be the most suitable candidate to inherit the position. However, he’s a lunatic! Furthermore, he’s destined to be blind! How can the Gu family be handed to a useless person like","him?!”","“I still remember his crazy expression when he was locked in the basement when he was young. His eyes looked like they wanted to kill someone! How scary!”","“When he goes crazy, he’ll really kill people! And his eyes are... Sigh! Let’s not talk about it. Just hearing about it makes me panic. Anyway, people like him are jinxes. He doesn’t deserve to have relatives. He should have been abandoned at birth!”","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth in anger as she listened to their discussion.","They actually dared to say such things about Gu Zheng behind his back. Such people would definitely go to hell after they died!","Those people didn’t realize that Qiao Xi was nearby, and they continued to ridicule Gu Zheng. These people were jealous of Gu Zheng and didn’t dare face him head-on, so they only dared to speak a few bad words behind his back. They were all bark and no bite!","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with danger as she raised her wrist and lightly flicked it. A few silver needles flew out rapidly, and after swiftly pricking a few people, they were quickly retracted. This process only took two seconds. It wouldn’t leave any traces.","“Ah! It hurts! What is it?”","“Lalso feel a sharp pain in my back!”","“What’s going on?”","“Could it be G-Gu Zheng? I heard that he just came back to visit Old Madam Gu!”","Qiao Xi smiled smugly and counted to three in her heart. The few of them instantly turned pale, then they hugged their stomachs and started to look for the toilet in a panic.","“Naughty!” Gu Zheng’s gentle voice suddenly rang out. After he finished speaking with the old madam, the old madam fell asleep due to exhaustion. The moment he went out, he saw Qiao Xi using her hidden weapon.","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly. “How am I naughty? I’m just playing! It’s not a big deal, haha...”","She laughed a few times and suddenly realized how long Gu Zheng had been standing there. In fact, she didn’t care about her hidden weapon being exposed. In any case, Gu Zheng already knew about it, but did he hear what those people had said just now?","They said Gu Zheng was a piece of trash, a lunatic","Qiao Xi’s face sank, and her eyes were filled with worry. However, he was calm and composed. “Grandmother woke up for a very long time this time, and she’s in pretty good health. Let’s stay here and accompany her for a few days, alright?”","Qiao Xi nodded without the slightest hesitation. Old Madam Gu was old and couldn’t stay awake for long, so it was only right for Gu Zheng to stay here and accompany her.","“have my own courtyard in the Gu family.” Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. “You should know that.”","Qiao Xi had naturally heard of it before. The courtyard was called Maple Garden, and since it was called this name, the place he lived in ought to be filled with maple trees. It would surely be extremely beautiful when autumn arrived and the ground was covered in red maple leaves."]},{"number":450,"title":"Chapter 450 - Darkness Is Pain","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s go there,” Gu Zheng said.","Qiao Xi nodded her head and followed Gu Zheng inside. The more she walked, the heavier her heart became. Old Madam Gu’s courtyard was already remote enough, but Gu Zheng’s courtyard was still a long walk away. Moreover, the surroundings were becoming more and more desolate, not like a place","where people lived.","Although Gu Zheng was an illegitimate child, he was Gu Weiming’s only son when he returned to the Gu family. Even if he didn’t like this son of his, he shouldn’t have built Gu Zheng’s courtyard in such a remote place.","This should be the northernmost courtyard of the Gu family’s old residence. It seemed like no one had ever come to clean it. There were two large bare trees at the entrance, and the ground was covered with fallen leaves. There was no maple tree as expected.","Qiao Xi looked up and saw a small two-story building in front of her. Even though she wasn’t a professional architect, she could still see the oddness of this small building. The color of the building was gray. It looked just like an unfinished house.","This... was where Gu Zheng lived since he was young?","Every courtyard in the Gu family’s old residence was decorated luxuriously. In order to show off the Gu family’s prestige, even the servants’ quarters were exquisitely decorated. However, the place where Gu Zheng lived was so dilapidated.","Qiao Xi’s heart was filled with doubt as she followed Gu Zheng’s footsteps. She was just about to enter when she heard waves of knocking sounds coming from inside. They seemed to be doing renovation work?","This was Gu Zheng’s courtyard. Without his permission, who would come here to mess about?","Qiao Xi pushed open the door and walked in. She instantly frowned. “Who are you? What are you doing?!”","A few people were hammering on the windows. Some of the windows were already covered by thick wooden planks, leaving only two or three windows on the second floor.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold, and he suddenly felt a sharp pain.","Qiao Xi was extremely furious. “How audacious of you?! Who allowed you to seal these windows?!”","One of the middle-aged men turned around and looked at Qiao Xi with a lofty gaze.","“What’s with the noise?! I’m doing this for my good nephew, Gu Zheng! Isn’t he sick? The doctor said that he can’t see the light due to his illness. Once I heard about this, I quickly brought people over to seal all the windows here so that he wouldn’t be uncomfortable staying here!","“President Gu, am I right?”","Gu Zheng’s lifeless eyes gradually focused and burst forth with raging fury.","However, the middle-aged man was still arrogant. “Tell me, you’ve been living here since you were young. Why did you go out? What if you hurt others when your illness relapses? You’d better stay here obediently. Don’t worry, I guarantee that not even a ray of light can penetrate this place!”","This was Gu Zheng’s uncle?","No, no, it was Huang Lilan’s brother?","Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened. Was this woman crazy? It seemed like Gu Weiming had not divorced her yet, so this woman was too free!","She suppressed the anger in her heart and rushed forward to snatch the hammer from one of them. “Let me tell you. If any of you dare to do anything today, this hammer in my hand will be used on you! Do you believe me?! I’ll be sure to teach you a lesson today!”","Huang Lilan’s younger brother, Huang Wei, got a fright. “It was Madam Gu who asked me to do this. You...”","“What? If you don’t believe me, then come and give it a try! You said that Gu Zheng is a lunatic, so you should know that if I could marry Gu Zheng, that means I’m not a good person either!”","Qiao Xi picked up the hammer and smashed it heavily on the ground, instantly creating a deep pit. She opened her mouth and threatened, “I don’t know if all of you will be able to endure a strike of this hammer!”","Everyone shuddered as they looked at the pit on the ground. They seemed to have imagined their own heads being smashed in and hurriedly fled.","Qiao Xi turned around and shouted loudly, “Tell Huang Lilan that today’s matter isn’t over!”","Huang Wei was frightened by Qiao X’s fierce gaze. He staggered and fell to the ground, but he didn’t hesitate. He got up and continued running.","Gu Zheng didn’t move an inch. His eyes were bloodshot, and the pain was destroying his rationality.","From the moment he entered the door, he could no longer control himself. This was not the first time he had seen such a scene. He had faced these kinds of things since his childhood. He had lived here since he was young, after all.","To him, darkness was pain.","However, those people knew that he would lose his sight in the dark. They even cut off the power source and nailed the windows. They were happy to see him struggle in the dark.."]},{"number":451,"title":"Chapter 451 - Going Crazy","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng had spent his childhood in the dark. Listening to those mocking voices and enduring the pain brought about by his illness, he felt like he was in hell, struggling at death’s door.","He finally became crazy and was feared by everyone. He became the person in control of the entire Gu family. He could finally escape this pain, but the shadow of his childhood would never disappear.","Only the Lu family and the Gu family new about the things that had happened when he was young. They would often talk about these things as if Gu Zheng was still the kid they used to trample on.","It was just that he was no longer the old him. Now, he was the President Gu who could call the wind and summon the rain. No one could disrespect him, including the Gu family and the Lu family.","The Gu family felt that he was too sharp and pressured him until he could not breathe. Moreover, he also blocked Lu Yan’s path. Therefore, they wanted to make Gu Zheng go completely crazy.","At this moment, Gu Zheng felt a dull pain in his forehead, and his vision became blurry. He felt as if the demon in his body had awakened. That voice kept repeating the words—","‘Kill them! Kill these people who made you suffer!”","“Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi saw that his body was slightly trembling and his eyes were blood red.","He turned his head slightly and was stunned for a few seconds when he saw Qiao X’s face. In an instant, the demon in his body disappeared and he finally regained his rationality.","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “Are you afraid of me too?”","At this moment, the two of them had already walked into the house where the light gradually dimmed. Qiao Xi was still able to clearly see their surroundings. She knew that dim lighting was still better than nothing to Gu Zheng.","However, when she met Gu Zheng’s eyes, she was surprised to find that his eyes were not as empty and lifeless as she had expected. Instead, he was staring at her passionately.","Moreover, he could avoid the obstacles under his feet, which meant that he could see clearly even in the dark. However, how was that possible?","Gu Zheng’s eyes were blood red, and a gleam of cold light flashed in his eyes as if a devil had descended onto the earth. “Qiao Xi, tell me. Are you afraid of me?”","‘When he saw that Qiao Xi didn’t answer, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled into a gloomy smile. Sorrow filled his heart and evoked the madness hidden within it. “So you’re just like them. You think I’m a madman! Good, very good! Now you’ve seen me, you’re right! I’ma madman!”","Flames of fury bumed in his eyes. The Gu Zheng who was usually calm and collected had disappeared. He could explode at any moment.","As soon as he finished speaking, he casually picked up the cup on the table and smashed it heavily onto the ground. The fragments scattered on the ground, appearing especially clear in the silent hall.","Qiao Xi wished for nothing more than to immediately charge over and kill Huang Lilan because she knew that Huang Lilan had intentionally allowed these people to infuriate Gu Zheng. Her objective was to make Gu Zheng go mad.","‘When she thought of this, her heart suddenly trembled. The Gu family would be having a family banquet in the next few days. Many elders and descendants from the branch family were here. Huang Lilan’s true goal was to let everyone see Gu Zheng go crazy.","This way, she would be able to join hands with everyone to oppose Gu Zheng becoming the head of the Gu family. It would be perfectly justifiable.","Although Gu Zheng was very strong, how could the Gu family tolerate a lunatic being their head? If word got out, where would they place their reputation?","Qiao Xi pondered for a moment, but her body was already pressed against the wall by Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng lowered his head and placed his hands on both sides of her body, controlling her movements. His lips were pale. “You’re seeing it with your own eyes.”","“Ah Zheng, I...”","The man’s lips curled into a bitter smile. “Is it really scary when I go crazy? Even you’re afraid of me? Have you started to hate me?”","Gu Zheng’s rationality was gradually burned away by his rage. He clearly knew that the woman before him was the person he loved, yet he was still unable to control himself. But it was precisely because she was Qiao Xi that Gu Zheng was unable to control his rage. It turned out that even Qiao Xi hated","him!","His scorching palm landed on Qiao Xi’s face and slowly slid down her body, caressing her fair and slender neck before gradually tightening","Qiao Xi didn’t resist and instead indifferently stretched out her hands to embrace his strong waist before lightly closing her eyes.","Gu Zheng’s fiery eyes were filled with coldness.. “Qiao Xi, I won’t allow you to leave me!”"]},{"number":452,"title":"Chapter 452 - Qiao Xi, Don’t Leave Me","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Asudden impulse surged in Gu Zheng’s heart. Without Qiao Xi, he would once again fall into darkness.","If Qiao Xi insisted on leaving, then they should just descend into hell together!","‘Those people were right. He was indeed a lunatic!","“Mrs. Gu, why aren’t you answering me, huh?” The man’s voice was gentle and soft. However, when it entered Qiao Xi’s ears, that cold and sinister aura instantly caused her body to tremble.","Gu Zheng let go of her neck and gently placed his hand on her back, letting her lean into his embrace. However, his eyes were still filled with coldness when he spoke again, “Tell me. Are you leaving me?!”","She did not utter a word and he could not hear her thoughts. It seemed that she was really afraid of him.","‘That was right! He was a madman. Even if he and Qiao Xi had known each other for ten years, she was still unable to accept this fact. It was normal for her to want to flee when she saw his mad appearance.","No! He could not hurt her.","She was Qiao Xi and also Black Tide. He absolutely could not.","He had already lost his rationality and almost broke her neck just now. He just wanted to know what Qiao Xi was thinking, so he kept asking her.","Every second of silence made Gu Zheng panic and fall into further despair. His grip gradually tightened.","Gu Zheng’s body was filled with murderous intent. A voice rang in his ears. ‘If she’s afraid of you, then kill her! Go to hell with her!”","Just as he was about to lose his mind, he heard a female voice.","“Wow! Gu Zheng’s abs are amazing!”","Her voice was filled with excitement, and her delicate fingers were still wandering around his waist.","‘It feels so good to touch his abs. I have to take advantage of this situation!’","After that, Gu Zheng could clearly feel the hands on his waist getting more and more impudent, causing him to shiver.","‘When he heard those words, the anger and killing intent on his body seemed to have frozen. Gu Zheng even suspected that he had heard wrongly, and his face stiffened.","Qiao Xi was almost drooling.","Gu Zheng’s abdominal muscles were too impressive, and his figure was even better than a model’s. Was this what it meant when people said some guys would look slim when wearing clothes but muscular after taking off their clothes? It was such a blessing to have such a husband!","His eight-packs were well-defined, and she could feel the muscles through his clothes. If.","Qiao Xi shook her head. She also despised her own thoughts, but she really couldn’t control herself. The two of them were so close to each other, so she couldn’t help but think crookedly.","Hearing her thoughts, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched as he sighed helplessly.","Mrs. Gu had only touched his waist and already thought of so many things. It was really unexpected.","‘The man’s Adam’s apple bobbed. “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi immediately raised her eyes and felt slightly guilty. “Hmm?”","How embarrassing! What was she thinking at this time?! But she really couldn’t control herself!","Gu Zheng’s gentle voice carried a tinge of lingering affection. “Mrs. Gu, do you know that touching a man will cost you?”1","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with confusion, then the world spun before her eyes as she was carried up by Gu Zheng.","“Cost what?”","“What do you think?”","After a short moment, Qiao Xi lay on the bed and looked at the man that was on the verge of going mad before her. She was slightly hesitant. Was it a little too hasty? Should she refuse?","However, she had always wanted to sleep with Gu Zheng. This was an excellent opportunity, and Gu Zheng was the one who took the initiative this time. It would be meaningless if she remained reserved.","But","Gu Zheng could clearly hear the conflicted thoughts in her mind. The corners of his lips curled up, and he did not give her any chance to regret. With a wave of his hand, his clothes were torn into pieces.","“Gu... Gu Zheng...”","Qiao Xi gulped. Was it starting?","‘The crazy man didn’t give her any time to think. He went straight to the point and hugged her soft body tightly. It was as if she was a life-saving medicine to him.","“Qiao Xi, don’t leave me.”","Before Qiao Xi collapsed, there was a trace of regret in her mind. If she knew that she would have to pay such a huge price for taking advantage of him, she would absolutely not have dared to provoke this man. He was simply too terrifying.","After some time, Gu Zheng finally stood up and went to get the ointment.","It turned out that Mrs. Gu’s weakness was not an act. She was really weak.."]},{"number":453,"title":"Chapter 453 - This Kid Was Really Talented!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He had already restrained himself earlier, but he still hurt her. Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with heartache as he carefully carried her into the bathroom. First, he helped her clean her body, then changed her into a set of clean clothes. After that, he helped her apply the medicine with a red face.","Earlier, it was the first time he had heard Qiao Xi beg for mercy. Even though he felt pity in his heart, he still didn’t let her off because he had already fallen into madness at that time.","When Mrs. Gu woke up, she would definitely feel sore all over.","Morning.","Qiao Xi opened her sleepy eyes and picked up the phone beside her.","Yesterday, they entered Maple Garden at two in the afternoon. Who would have thought that she would sleep until the next morning?","She struggled to get up and found that her body was sore all over. Every part of her body was aching. She was on the verge of tears.","Damn! It really hurt!","She looked at the broken pieces on the floor, the messy bed, and felt the pain coming from a certain part of her body. She couldn’t help but blush.","Who said that Gu Zheng couldn’t do it?","F*ck, this kid was really talented!","At this moment, footsteps came from the door and Gu Zheng walked in slowly.","The sky had just turned bright outside. Afraid that it would affect Qiao Xi’s sleep, there was only a faint light from the lamp in the room.","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng’s empty and lifeless eyes and instantly understood. At this moment, he probably could not see anything. However, he had lived here since he was young and was very familiar with the layout here, so he was able to come and go as he pleased.","Qiao Xi was furious the moment she saw Gu Zheng.","What a shameless bastard!","Gu Zheng reached out to turn on the lights, and his eyes gradually recovered their clarity. As he looked at Qiao Xi’s expression, he knew that she was surely cursing him in her heart at this moment.","But strangely, he was unable to hear Qiao Xi’s thoughts.","His expression did not change as he asked gently, “Is your body... alright?”","Qiao Xi had already cursed enough in her heart, but when she heard Gu Zheng’s voice, blazing flames of rage instantly ignited in her heart once more.","This bastard still had the nerve to ask? She had already begged him yesterday, but Gu Zheng did not listen at all and even kept","“Yesterday, I...” The man’s cheeks reddened. “I couldn’t control myself. Please don’t be angry.”","Qiao Xi glared at him fiercely and struggled to get up. She walked to the kitchen with some difficulty and saw freshly prepared breakfast on the table.","She casually picked up a sandwich. Indeed, she had a sense of taste!","She didn’t even kiss Gu Zheng earlier and already had a sense of taste. This meant that she could recover their sense of taste by doing that with Gu Zheng!","At this moment, Qiao Xi felt that it was worth it for her back to be aching so badly! At least her taste buds had recovered!","“Lwas wrong.” Gu Zheng handed her a cup of warm milk.","Qiao Xi muttered, “Wow! Sweet milk must be delicious!”","Gu Zheng bent down. “What did you say?”","Qiao Xi raised her head proudly and snorted.","She would not forgive this bastard so easily. She decided not to talk to Gu Zheng for a day.","Gu Zheng frowned and thought to himself, ‘Has she recovered her taste buds?”","Qiao Xi suddenly widened her eyes. She seemed to have heard Gu Zheng’s voice earlier, but she clearly saw that Gu Zheng didn’t open his mouth at all!","What the hell?!","On the other hand, Liang Pingchuan looked helpless.","“Previously, Gu Zheng could hear Little Six’s thoughts, but that was only temporary. If Little Six doesn’t use her blood to help him detoxify the poison in his body again, President Gu will no longer be able to hear her thoughts.”","“But... Tsk, tsk, Little Six has already used her blood to help him detoxify the poison in his body. Their bloodlines are connected now. If they do ‘that’, Little Six will be able to hear Gu Zheng’s thoughts for a short period of time because of their blood connection.”","Liang Pingchuan smiled. “That’s not bad. It’ll let Little Six know what Gu Zheng is thinking. If Gu Zheng has any bad thoughts, he’ll be exposed.”","Just when Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression and couldn’t figure it out, she received a message from Teacher Liang.","Her teacher had clearly told her that if she used her blood to save the other party and did that kind of thing with the person she saved, she would be able to hear the other party’s thoughts for a short period of time.","What?!","Qiao Xi looked up in surprise. Did this mean that she could hear Gu Zheng’s thoughts?","What kind of superpower was this? It was so cool! But wasn’t it a little unfair to Gu Zheng?"]},{"number":454,"title":"Chapter 454 - Let’s Eat Instant Noodles Together!","paragraphs":["Chapter 454: Let’s Eat Instant Noodles Together!","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","So, the voice she heard just now was Gu Zheng’s inner voice?","Qiao Xi smiled slyly and moved closer, wanting to hear what Gu Zheng was thinking.","‘Who knew.","‘Thad already restrained myself, but she still fainted.’","Qiao Xi’s expression instantly froze.","‘Tstill need more training.’","Qiao Xi:”..”","‘But she smells so good. Her body is so soft. It feels so comfortable to touch. She looks so good when she’s eating.”","Qiao Xi: “...” So, Gu Zheng usually looked dignified and didn’t get close to women, but in reality, he was thinking about these unhealthy things?","Previously, Gu Zheng pretended to be aloof and even rejected her offer to give herself to him. It was all an act! In fact, he really wanted to do it, right?","Qiao Xi maintained her calm and cleared her throat. “Why is there only one sandwich? I’ve already eaten it, so what are you eating?”","After all, it was early in the morning. The Gu family would have their breakfast at eight o’clock. The servants had not woken up yet, and there was nothing to eat in the kitchen. Moreover, Maple Garden was too far from the main residence, so it was really inconvenient to go there.","Gu Zheng pursed his lips.","‘It doesn’t matter if ‘m hungry, but I can’t let her starve. Is she... not full yet? I can ask Song Shiyu to send food over, but Qiao Xi consumed too much energy last night. It’ll be too slow if we wait for Song Shiyu.","“Mrs. Gu sure has a big appetite.","‘Til et Song Shiyu...”","Gu Zheng said calmly, “I’l call Song Shiyu now and ask him to bring food over. What do you want to eat?”","Qiao Xi smiled slyly. “Don’t! Song Shiyu probably hasn’t woken up yet. Don’t ask him to come over for such a small matter. Wait for me.”","After saying that, she rushed upstairs, took out two items from her bag, and quickly went downstairs.","Gu Zheng looked at the items in her hand and could not help but frown.","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “Gu Zheng, let’s eat instant noodles together?”","Before Gu Zheng was five years old, in order to torture him, Huang Lilan always let him wander outside. Forget about eating instant noodles, he couldn’t even have leftovers.","After he returned to the Gu family, he was locked up in Maple Garden where he had to eat leftovers. But at least he did not have to starve anymore. Hence, he had never eaten instant noodles before.","Meanwhile, Qiao Xi had already boiled the water and poured it into the cups of instant noodles. She brought one to Gu Zheng.","She had just sat down when she heard—","“She eats instant noodles? The Qiao family must have severely abused her. I won’t let them off.","‘Although I’ve never eaten instant noodles before, I know that this thing is not nutritious at all. It’s only popular because it’s cheap and convenient.","‘Could it be that the Qiao family didn’t let her eat and made her starve, so she could only buy a cup of instant noodles to fill her stomach? That must be it. I’ll take revenge on the Qiao family for this!","‘But she looks so cute eating instant noodles. I suddenly feel that instant noodles must be very delicious.’","Qiao Xi swallowed the instant noodles in her mouth, her eyes filled with surprise. The great President Gu’s imagination was quite wild!","Gu Zheng frowned and immediately sent Song Shiyu a message. Song Shiyu received the message and rushed to Maple Garden immediately.","When Qiao Xi finished the last mouthful of noodles, she suddenly heard a loud bang.","Song Shiyu rushed in with all kinds of delicacies in his hands. Sweat had beaded on his forehead and he was out of breath, “President, I’ve brought everything you wanted. You said you’d raise my salary. You must... keep your word!”","Then Song Shiyu saw the cup of instant noodles that Qiao Xi was holding.","His expression changed to one of anger.","“Young Madam! What are you eating? The Gu family is really too much! President, you’re the head of the Gu family! How dare they treat you like this! Does Gu Weiming think that he can control everything just because he’s your father? He’s humiliating you by doing this! How infuriating! Looks like they","want to fight us to their deaths!”","Qiao Xi: “..”","“Song Shiyu, you’re thinking too much. I bought the instant noodles myself.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng nodded. “The Gu family has indeed gone overboard.”","Qiao Xi:","She suspected that Gu Zheng was teasing Song Shiyu on purpose.","After breakfast, the sky was completely bright, but the windows of Maple Garden were all nailed shut, so the light was still dim.","Gu Zheng raised his hand and rubbed the top of her head. “There’s soup on your hair. Let me help you wipe it.”"]},{"number":455,"title":"Chapter 455 - Mrs. Gu Is So Domineering","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","‘She’s good-looking, and her hair is beautiful too. It’s like satin, so smooth.","‘She thinks that there’s really something in her hair and is obediently letting me touch it. She’s as cute as a kitten.’","Qiao Xi’s face was instantly covered in terror.","What a disgrace! Gu Zheng’s heart was actually so passionate!","This damned man looked so cold, but his heart was actually so indecent. She really couldn’t tell!","‘Why is her body shaking? Does she feel cold? After eating her fill, I’ll let her return to her room to rest. It’s time to recuperate. After all...”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled.","‘After all, it was too intense last night, but she must have liked it a lot. She kept calling out my name, so I’ll hug her to sleep later.’","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “It’s still early. Go back to your room and rest.”","‘Then, Qiao Xi heard in the man’s heart—","‘Tl take a break too. It’s a blissful thing to be holding Mrs. Gu’s soft body, but Mrs. Gu still seems to be in pain. Even so, Song Shiyu said...’","Song Shiyu?","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly widened, but because Gu Zheng had walked far away, she couldn’t hear the rest of his thoughts clearly.","‘There was a loophole in this superpower. He was just a little farther away from her yet she couldn’t hear his thoughts anymore. Qiao Xi could only chase after him.","‘In the future, when Mrs. Gu tries to seduce me again, I must warn her not to do that. Girls should be more reserved. Otherwise, I won’t be able to control myself.","‘But this is good. 1 like it’","Gu Zheng’s expression was gentle. “Maple Garden is remote, so no one will disturb your sleep. However, Grandma will wake up today. Let’s have lunch with her at noon, and...”","He was about to say something when he suddenly froze. He looked at Song Shiyu beside him and swallowed his words.","‘I did go overboard last night, but luckily, I prepared some ointment and applied it to her while she was asleep. Otherwise, she definitely wouldn’t have been able to wake up.","‘Lalmost forgot that Song Shiyu is here too. If I say this in front of him, Mrs. Gu will definitely throw a tantrum. If that’s the case, Song Shiyu will have to shut up forever.’","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and remained silent.","Looking at Gu Zheng’s expression, he still looked calm and indifferent. Song Shiyu would never have guessed that the president was thinking about such things!","Gu Zheng even said that she liked acting, but he was two-faced himself!","Qiao Xi turned around and returned to her room. She had just laid down when she heard Gu Zheng’s thoughts.","‘Maple Garden’s windows...’","What? She couldn’t listen to what he thought about after that.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed. Even though she was slightly exhausted, she didn’t have the slightest trace of sleepiness.","Gu Zheng had a relapse last night. He should be fine now, right?","Qiao Xi couldn’t help but feel a bit of lingering fear when she thought of how his poison had acted up last night. However, she didn’t feel that Gu Zheng was scary. Her heart merely ached for him as she worried about his health.","Actually, he was not as scary as what those people said. They said that he was crazy. He only felt pain because he was sick. He was no different from other patients, but the way he vented was different.","Qiao Xi closed her eyes as sleepiness overcame her.","Ding ding ding","A strange sound rang out, and Qiao Xi was no longer sleepy. She got off the bed and walked to the door to listen carefully.","It turned out that those people from yesterday had come again. There was no end to it!","She returned to her room, pulled out a hammer from her bag, and stormed downstairs.","These people were really like gnats. They came early in the morning to disturb her sleep. Did they think she was easy to bully?","What time was it? Did they think she couldn’t hear them?","Gu Zheng and Song Shiyu also heard the sound coming from outside. Before the two of them could go out, they saw Qiao Xi rushing out with a hammer in her hand with an angry expression.","Song Shiyu exclaimed, “Damn!”","“Madam is so domineering, I like it!”","Qiao Xi was truly infuriated.","‘When she heard the sound, she knew that they were here to nail the windows again. They wanted Gu Zheng to live in a dark environment. Doing so would cause Gu Zheng to have more relapses.","Originally, his illness was not that serious. If he had the company and care of his family, he could still control his emotions. However, not only did those people not counsel him but they even tried to anger Gu Zheng, causing him to go crazy every time the poison acted up.."]},{"number":456,"title":"Chapter 456 - Sending You To The King Of Hell!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huang Lilan and the rest of the Gu family wished that Gu Zheng would become a lunatic. At that time, he would not be qualified to be the head of the Gu family, much less the president of Gu Corporation.","Back then, when Gu Zheng found out about his true identity, he went to look for the Lu family. However, the Lu family refused to acknowledge him. It was probably because they knew that he had been poisoned, so they hoped that he would just die and not tarnish their family name.","Now, Huang Lilan still wanted to make use of the people from the Gu branch families?","Qiao Xi had just walked out of the door when she smelled a strange fragrance. She pondered for a moment, then her eyes instantly burst out with coldness.","This fragrance was a hallucinogenic drug. After inhaling too much of it, one would hallucinate and become a lunatic.","Huang Lilan could actually get her hands on such a medicine?","Qiao Xi took out a small bottle from her pocket and shook out three small pills. She took one herself, then turned around and handed one each to Gu Zheng and Song Shiyu.","She walked out aggressively and sneered at the few people. “Whose dog is disturbing my sleep so early in the morning?!”","Everyone was stunned.","Qiao Xi’s icy-cold gaze sized them up. A few people were holding tools and preparing to seal the two remaining windows. Another person held an incense burner in his hand that emitted waves of smoke. This was the fragrance that could make one hallucinate.","“What’s wrong with all of you? You broke into the head of the Gu family’s courtyard so early in the morning to seal the windows. Do you want to die?” Qiao Xi roared furiously.","Song Shiyu stood beside Gu Zheng. The sky was still dark, and Song Shiyu was worried about the president’s eyes, so he didn’t dare to go too far away from him.","The few of them looked at each other and could not help but laugh.","‘Was Gu Zheng scared? He actually let a woman stand up for him? So what if they were found out? Would they be afraid of a weak woman?","Moreover, Madam Gu had already said that the surveillance cameras around Maple Garden were removed, so they might as well knock Qiao Xi out directly. In any case, the other party didn’t have any evidence, and they wouldn’t admit it afterward. Moreover, with Madam Gu protecting them, what could","Gu Zheng do to them?","The few of them muttered to each other and then rushed over with vicious expressions. “Mrs. Gu, don’t blame us for being ruthless!”","Bang!","Qiao Xi lifted her leg and kicked the man several meters away.","“Ruthless?” Qiao Xi laughed coldly. “If I don’t teach you a lesson, will you really think I’m easy to deal with? I’ll send all of you to meet the King of Hell today!”","Qiao Xi walked up to the man with a disgusting face. She stepped on his head fiercely and raised the hammer in her hand high, scaring the man so much that his whole body trembled. “You... What are you doing?”","“What do you think? What did you want to do to me just now?”","Qiao Xi swung the hammer in her hand. “How much did Huang Lilan give you?”","“L.. [don’t know what you’re talking about!”","“Oh! You’re quite loyal!” Qiao Xi smiled and fiercely stepped on his hand. The man let out a miserable cry. Obviously, his fingers were broken.","Song Shiyu watched in horror.","Gu Zheng remained calm. “Don’t be afraid. She won’t do this to you.”","Assistant Song was really getting worse. She was just dealing with a few useless people. Did he have to be so afraid?","Song Shiyu was terrified. “President, are you sure? Young Madam is so scary!","“president, look at Young Madam’s physique. She can break a person’s bones with a single step. Look at how much pain those people are in! They’re probably going to lose their heads with the hammer she’s holding!","“Young Madam always says that she’s weak. She doesn’t look weak at all!”","Gu Zheng smiled faintly. “Mm.”","Song Shiyu thought that the president had the same thoughts as him. They both thought that Young Madam was scary.","‘Who knew that the president’s next sentence was—","Gu Zheng said, “I like it.”7","Song Shiyu:","F*ck! Both of them were freaks!","Qiao Xi picked up the hammer and fiercely smashed it against the man’s arm. The man’s arm was broken, and he howled in pain as his body trembled violently from the pain and fear.","Then, her gaze fell on the other three people.","One of them was trembling with fear. “I... I don’t know anything...”","“That’s great. All of you are quite professional! But I just want to know if it was Huang Lilan who sent you here!”","Qiao Xi took out a foldable knife from her waist and swiftly brandished it.. She asked domineeringly, “How much did Huang Lilan give you? Why are you all so stubborn? You’re not willing to tell us even though you’re about to lose your lives?”"]},{"number":457,"title":"Chapter 457 - Mrs. Gu Is So Beautiful Even When She’s Angry","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi pretended to be gentle. “Don’t worry, I won’t kill all of you. After all, murder is against the law! How could a weak woman like me do something illegal?”","The men could not help but take a few steps back.","“Ican be considered half a doctor. I’ll spare your lives, but I don’t know if you can withstand the pain of being dismembered!”","‘The moment the cold blade touched one of the man’s skin, he trembled in fear. “Don’t! I’l talk!”","Qiao Xi nodded with satisfaction. “If you had been this agreeable earlier, you wouldn’t have suffered so much. Huang Lilan ordered you to use hallucinogenic drugs. This can be considered as concrete evidence.”","The man stuttered, “The person who sent us here... isn’t Madam Gu. It’s Madam Gu’s younger brother, Huang... Huang Wei.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","So it was Huang Wei?","That was also because of Huang Lilan. In any case, it was fine as long as it was related to her.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Okay, I understand. Huang Wei actually dared to attack me and Ah Zheng. He’s really audacious. It seems I was too kind. I didn’t teach him a lesson yesterday and he seems to have a short memory. Since that’s the case, then he shouldn’t blame me. You guys, follow me!”","The few of them: “...”","“You’re kind? Would a kind woman beat us up like this? Don’t you feel embarrassed saying this?","Song Shiyu’s eyes widened in disbelief. “P-President, do you like having this kind of wife?”","‘Kind, my *ss!”","Gu Zheng smirked. “How could I not like a woman who is trying her best to protect me? She looks so good even when she’s angry!”","Song Shiyu: “..”","After Qiao Xi left, she took out her phone and sent a message. [Song Shiyu, go and welcome my third brother at the door in ten minutes. ]","Song Shiyu was confused. The divine physician’s disciple, Qin An, was coming. However, what was he doing here?","In the main residence.","Madam Gu didn’t sleep well the whole night and felt uneasy. She looked at the time and realized that those people must have succeeded in their task by now.","The windows of Maple Garden had been sealed, and Gu Zheng had also taken in the poisonous fragrance. Coupled with the poison in his body, it was about time for the effects to be seen.","But why hadn’t Huang Wei contacted her? Didn’t they agree that regardless of whether the plan succeeded or not, he would update her? It was already past six o’clock. Why was there still no news?","“What are you doing so early in the morning?” Gu Weiming was woken up by Huang Lilan, who was tossing and turning in bed. He looked displeased.","Huang Lilan’s face was full of flattery as she said gently, “I’m just worried about Ah Zheng. Although he’s not my biological son, we’ve been mother and son for more than 20 years. How could we not have feelings for each other? I heard that his condition isn’t too optimistic...”","At dawn, everyone from the Gu family had arrived. If Gu Zheng went crazy at this time, everyone would know that he was crazy. In that case, the position of the Gu family’s heir could only belong to Lu Yan. No one would object to it anymore.","There had been no news for such a long time. Huang Wei must have succeeded. If Gu Zheng breathed in even a little of that incense, he would lose his mind.","At this moment, a strange sound came from outside the door.","Gu Weiming opened his eyes unhappily. “What’s that sound?”","Right after that, there was another strange sound as if someone was smashing the door. The sound became more and more urgent.","Gu Weiming got up and shouted unhappily, “Who is it?”","There was a moment of silence outside the door, which made the atmosphere even stranger. Gu Weiming felt that something was wrong, so he got up, put on his coat, and left the bedroom.","Before he could reach the front door, there was a loud bang. The front door of the mansion was kicked open and several dark figures were tossed in. The figures even rolled a few times on the ground before hitting the coffee table until it shook.","Huang Lilan stuck her head out to take a look. Weren’t these the people she had sent out to deal with Gu Zheng? She was immediately alarmed and her fingers trembled slightly. “A-All of you...”","Gu Weiming was furious. “Who are you? Why did you barge in so early in the morning? Guards!”","However, it was quiet outside the villa. The bodyguards who usually guarded the door were nowhere to be seen.","At this moment, a slim figure appeared at the door, followed by a cold voice. “Chairman Gu, I’m really sorry.”","“Qiao Xi?”","Madam Gu opened her mouth in surprise, but Gu Weiming had already shouted angrily.","What did this woman mean by coming to his place early in the morning and throwing in a few men who had been beaten black and blue?"]},{"number":458,"title":"Chapter 458 - Even A Ferocious Tiger Can’t Eat Its Son","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Chairman Gu, don’t be angry! You must be furious that I disturbed your sleep, right? I’m also very angry right now, so I came to talk to you.”","Gu Weiming was so angry that his whole body was shaking. He shouted angrily, “What are you doing?!”","Qiao Xi calmly walked into the living room and coldly glanced at Huang Lilan. Then, she reached out and grabbed the man’s collar. Huang Lilan’s flustered face was revealed.","“Don’t be so fierce, Chairman Gu! If you scare me, I might do something. Madam Gu, I think you know these people.”","She walked to the door and threw another person into the house before stepping on him ruthlessly.","Huang Lilan’s expression instantly changed. “Qiao Xi! What are you trying to do!? He’s my younger brother and you have to call him ‘Uncle’! How could you beat up an elder?! Quickly let go of him! Qiao Xi, I thought you","were just a little naughty and mischievous, but I never expected you to be so cruel! You dare hit my younger brother? You’re really mad!”","Gu Weiming’s face darkened. “This is Gu Zheng’s uncle. How dare you beat him up like this? Do you still have any etiquette?”","Qiao Xi looked disdainfully at Huang Wei who was lying on the floor and snorted coldly. “So, he’s Madam Gu’s younger brother? I really didn’t expect this! Ahh, that’s a little troublesome, then!”","At the same time, Qin An brought a few doctors from the Medical Association to the Gu family’s residence.","Song Shiyu was shocked.","Qin An said respectfully, “Assistant Song, nice to meet you! My sixth sister said that President Gu was poisoned. Previously, my grandfather had given him treatment but my grandfather is missing now. I’m the successor","of the divine physician. I can’t stand by and watch as the poison in President Gu’s body flares up. Bring me to see President Gu.”","Everyone followed Song Shiyu to Maple Garden. Before Qin An could speak, the doctors’ faces changed. “Why does Maple Garden smell like this? This fragrance will worsen the patient’s condition and speed up the","poison’s effects! Where did the fragrance come from?”","Song Shiyu was a little nervous, but Qiao Xi had already taught him what to say. “It’s... It’s Madam Gu’s brother. He put out some incense early in the morning. I’ve already cleaned it up, but it still smells.”","The people from the Medical Association were instantly filled with indignation. “They know that President Gu has been poisoned, yet they still put out an incense like this at Maple Garden. How is this any different from","killing someone? Mr. Qin, don’t worry. As doctors, other than treating and saving people, we can’t watch others treat a patient like this!”","Qin An also nodded. “Everyone is right. For President Gu’s sake, we have to talk to Madam Gu.”","“That’s right! We’ll ask her what she’s up to. She actually put out this kind of incense at President Gu’s residence. She’s trying to kill him!”","At this moment.","In the Gu family’s residence.","Huang Wei’s face was bruised and swollen as he fell to the floor. A few of his teeth were missing. “Big Sister! Save me! This woman is too scary! She wants to kill me...”","Gu Weiming’s face was ashen. Qiao Xi was really too arrogant. She was close to committing murder in front of the Gu family. She was the daughter-in-law of the Gu family, and her every move represented the Gu","family.","“Qiao Xi! Is a shrew like you qualified to be the daughter-in-law of the Gu family? I advise you to divorce Gu Zheng and get out of the Gu family. Don’t make things too embarrassing!”","Qiao Xi blinked her eyes innocently. “Chairman Gu, I only beat up Huang Wei yet you want me to divorce Gu Zheng!”","“What else can I do? You can even beat your elders up. You’re disloyal and unfilial, so I’m telling you to get lost from the Gu family. Do you feel wronged?”","Qiao Xi sneered, “Chairman Gu, I hit Huang Wei because I’m disloyal and unfilial? Sigh! I was really stupid to have come to you to uphold justice. It seems that you were also the one who ordered President Gu to be","poisoned, then, Chairman Gu? I thought that since you’re Gu Zheng’s father, even a vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs. You couldn’t possibly be trying to kill him, but I really didn’t expect this!”","At the same time, Old Madam Gu woke up.","This piece of good news immediately spread in the old madam’s courtyard. The kitchen also hurriedly prepared breakfast for the old madam. It had been a long time since the old madam woke up so early and was in","good spirits.","When the old madam woke up, she wanted to go and see Gu Zheng. Who knew that Maple Garden was empty? When she heard that they had all gone to the main residence, she also went to the main residence.."]},{"number":459,"title":"Chapter 459 - You Should Be The One Kneeling Down And Apologizing","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Old Madam Gu was accompanied by a group of people. The doctor and nurses were almost always by her side. The maids also took care of her at all times, afraid that there would be any mishaps. The butler and","bodyguards also stayed by her side. There were some Gu family members who rushed over after hearing the news as well.","Everyone had just reached the main residence when they heard Gu Weiming’s roar from inside. “Qiao Xi! Get lost!”","Following that was Qiao Xi’s sobbing voice, “Chairman Gu, Huang Wei almost killed Gu Zheng. He’s your biological son! Even if you want Lu Yan to inherit the Gu family, you can’t kill Gu Zheng!”","Everyone widened their eyes in shock. Old Madam Gu narrowed her eyes.","Gu Weiming was furious. “Qiao Xi! Shut up! How could I have...”","“This morning, Huang Wei went to Maple Garden to poison Ah Zheng. If it weren’t for the fact that I couldn’t fall asleep and coincidentally caught him, Ah Zheng might already be... Sob, sob, sob. I even invited the","descendant of the divine physician, Qin An, to treat Ah Zheng’s illness...","“Your son was almost killed by someone. | thought that you would stand up for Ah Zheng, so I brought the culprit here. Who knew that you...”","Qiao Xi was sobbing so hard that she couldn’t make a sound. She was crying so hard that her body was swaying weakly.","“Who would have thought that you would scold me? You think that I shouldn’t have hit Huang Wei, huh? Let me ask you, then. Why can’t I hit someone who almost killed my husband? I really don’t understand why you","want to cover up for Huang Wei. Could it be that everything that happened today was your and Huang Lilan’s idea?”","Boom—","Gu Weiming widened his eyes.","Huang Lilan’s body stiffened as she quickly retorted, “You... You’re spouting nonsense!”","“Madam Gu, you’ll know whether I’m spouting nonsense or not in a while. If I don’t have any evidence, why would I come looking for you? You said that you don’t know about these things, so that means Huang Wei did it","himself?","“But I remember that you sent people to Maple Garden last night. You asked them to nail all the windows in Maple Garden with wooden planks so that Ah Zheng could live in the dark forever. Then, someone came to","poison him right after midnight. That’s why I thought it was you...”","“Qiao Xi! Shut up! Why don’t you just die?!” Huang Lilan roared in exasperation after being exposed.","Qiao Xi said in a carefree manner, “Madam Gu, is this your upbringing? I didn’t offend you from the beginning until the end, yet you’re cursing me to die. Looks like you really did have a part in poisoning Gu Zheng!","You’re so brazen. Is it because you think you have backers?”","Huang Lilan was trembling with anger.","“I did beat Huang Wei up, but he almost caused Gu Zheng’s death. So what if I beat him up? Moreover, I’m just a weak woman. His injuries are nothing more than flesh wounds. Even if you sue me, I’ll just have to pay for","his medical fees. But you tried to commit murder!”","Their faces turned pale.","if things really got out of hand...","Gu Weiming knew in his heart that Huang Lilan was behind this. He glared at Huang Lilan before saying coldly, “Qiao Xi, | think you’ve misunderstood. Why would Huang Wei poison Ah Zheng?”","Huang Lilan also put on the appearance of an elder. “Qiao Xi, why would my younger brother harm Ah Zheng? Ah Zheng is my child. He wouldn’t do such a thing. It’s your fault for beating him up for no reason. Hurry up","and admit your mistake! Kneel down!”","ight now, only the few of them knew about this matter. As long as Gu Weiming was on her side, there was nothing Qiao Xi could do.","Huang Lilan was just about to reprimand Qiao Xi when an angry roar came from outside.","“You should be the one kneeling down and apologizing!”","Huang Lilan did not hesitate and said without thinking, “Pah! Who dares to be so...”","Old Madam Gu slowly walked in with her walking cane. Qin An supported her from the side. Her eyes were clear and her voice was deep. At this moment, her gaze was filled with anger.","Huang Lilan was stunned for a few seconds before her face turned pale with fright. Her mind was suddenly in a mess.","Old Madam Gu walked in front of her with a cold gaze. “Huang Lilan, you poisoned my precious grandson and even told my granddaughter-in-law to kneel down to you. Why? Are you in charge of the Gu family now?”","At this moment, everyone had followed Old Madam Gu into the main residence. Old Madam Gu had finally woken up and everyone wanted to suck up to her. No one dared to anger her.","However, Old Madam Gu had just woken up in the morning and already flew into a rage.."]},{"number":460,"title":"Chapter 460 - Grandma Is Really A Hero Among Women!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huang Lilan’s lips were trembling. “Mom, no. It’s not like that... I...”","“Kneel!”","Old Madam Gu did not want to listen to her explanation at all. She raised the walking cane in her hand and hit Huang Lilan’s leg heavily. Huang Lilan felt a sharp pain in her knee and her body immediately knelt on the","ground.","This was the first time Qiao Xi had seen Old Madam Gu fly into a rage. Her face was filled with shock.","Although this old lady was getting on in years, she was still quite strong. With just one swing of her cane, Huang Lilan had already knelt down. No wonder she gave her a lethal weapon the first time they met.","Old Madam Gu was full of vigor. “Huang Lilan, do you think that I’m terminally ill and won’t be able to live for long? Do you think it’s your turn to make decisions for the Gu family now?”","Huang Lilan’s face contorted in pain, but her tone remained gentle. “No... No, Mom. I really...”","“No? Although I’m always in a coma, I’m not deaf or blind. I know very well how you treat Zheng’er. Just look at the state of Maple Garden? Is that the place where the head of the Gu family should live? Not only did you","chase him there but you even sent someone to seal the windows. Are you worthy of being the wife of the Gu family?”","Huang Lilan explained weakly, “Mom, I didn’t mean any harm. Maple Garden is where Ah Zheng has lived since he was young. I... | was afraid that he wouldn’t be used to it, so... I let him live there. As for the windows... I","don’t know about the windows! It’s Qiao Xi! She’s framing me! I really... don’t know anything!”","Old Madam Gu swept a cold glance at her, raised her walking cane, and hit her hard on the back. She roared, “You still dare to slander your daughter-in-law? Although I’m old, my eyes are still bright! I know clearly what","you’re thinking. It’s fine if you don’t like Zheng’er, but now that he has already established his own family and business, you’re still unwilling to let him off. Don’t forget that everything in the Gu family now belongs to my","grandson. If you’re unwilling to stay here, then get lost!”","When Huang Lilan heard this, her body went limp and she fell to the floor.","Gu Weiming’s expression turned ugly as he tried to persuade Old Madam Gu in a low voice. “Mom, calm down. This is actually still Qiao Xi...”","Old Madam Gu gave him a look of disdain. Without giving him a chance to speak, she smashed her walking cane on his knee.","He hadn’t finished speaking when he felt a sharp pain in his knee. He instinctively knelt before Qiao Xi.","Old Madam Gu lowered her eyes and looked at Gu Weiming in disgust. “Why did I give birth to such a silly person like you?! I get angry whenever I see you. From now on, whenever you speak to me, you have to kneel","down!”","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Weiming who was kneeling before her and took a few steps back in embarrassment. She walked to Gu Zheng’s side and was extremely shocked. “Your grandmother is really... a heroine! As expected","of the Gu family’s old madam. She’s really bold!”","Gu Weiming’s face turned pale, but he did not dare to refute.","Even though he was an arrogant man, he did not dare to go against Old Madam Gu. This was because Old Madam Gu was the true master of the Gu family. She had once wanted to hand over the authority of the Gu","family to Gu Zheng, but Gu Zheng was unwilling to accept it.","The power of the Gu family was now in the hands of Old Madam Gu, and Gu Weiming only had the right to speak when Old Madam Gu was unconscious.","Gu Weiming gritted his teeth. “Mom, don’t listen to Qiao Xi’s side of the story. She’s very scheming. Lilan is Ah Zheng’s biological mother. There’s no reason for her to poison him!”","Old Madam Gu glared at him from above.","Gu Weiming panicked. He was afraid that Old Madam Gu would reveal the secret. He quickly said, “I think this...”","Huang Lilan’s face was also filled with terror as she shed tears of grievance. “Mom, | didn’t make things difficult for Qiao Xi. She went too far and wrongly accused me of poisoning Ah Zheng. I’m Ah Zheng’s mother. Why","would I want to poison him? Qiao Xi beat up my younger brother without any explanation. As an elder sister, can’t I question her?”","Huang Lilan said sorrowfully, “I’ve never asked for anything from Qiao Xi, but as my daughter-in-law, she rushed to the residence of her in-laws so early in the morning to denounce me! How can I not be angry with","such a shrewish daughter-in-law?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. This was the time to act!","Old Madam Gu snorted impatiently and was about to reprimand her when Gu Zheng spoke.","“My wife has always been weak. How could she hit anyone? Madam Gu, please don’t bully my wife anymore.”."]},{"number":461,"title":"Chapter 461 - The Real Fight Begins","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huang Lilan was so angry that she gritted her teeth. “Ah Zheng, would your uncle lie?","“There’s no evidence now, so, of course, you guys can say whatever you want!”","“Madam Gu, I’m the one who hit your younger brother.” Gu Zheng’s voice was cold, and his tone was flat. His gaze swept over Huang Wei like he was looking at trash.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds. Why did Gu Zheng say that he was the one who hit Huang Wei? She was the one who beat him up!","Initially, she did not want to refute, because she had indeed made a move on Huang Wei. Even so, Huang Wei only suffered some superficial injuries. Even if she had to take","responsibility, she only had to compensate for the medical fees, which was a small amount.”","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng worriedly. She moved closer and heard—","‘Everyone from the Gu family is here. If they know that she hit someone, I don’t know what ugly words they’ll say.","‘And if this matter gets out, how is Mrs. Gu going to act weak in the future?’","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless: “...”","‘Actually, Mrs. Gu is quite cute when she pretends to be weak. Moreover, she seems very happy pretending to be weak. As long as she likes it, I’m willing to cooperate with","her.’","Qiao Xi knew that with Gu Zheng’s intelligence and wisdom, he had definitely seen through her long ago. Her image of a weak and delicate woman had long collapsed, but","she did not expect that her senior would actually indulge her and allow her to continue pretending. He even enjoyed it.","Then...","‘I can’t let grandma know that Qiao Xi is pretending to be weak, otherwise...’","What? Qiao Xi hurriedly moved closer.","‘If Grandma finds out that Qiao Xi is as fierce as her, how can I have a good life in the future?”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes and lowered her voice. “Gu Zheng, were you beaten up by your grandmother when you were young?”","Old Madam Gu had a fiery temper, and no one in the Gu family dared to defy her. It was also because of Old Madam Gu’s love that Gu Zheng was not killed earlier on.","Gu Zheng replied nonchalantly, “Grandma is frighteningly strong, but in the Gu family, this is the best way to establish your power. Otherwise, how can you suppress these","demons and monsters?","“But I’ve always been obedient and sensible. Grandma never beat me up or was harsh to me. She’s only fierce toward her disobedient children and grandchildren, like","Chairman Gu and Gu Yao.”","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. What he said made sense.","‘Why would I tell her that I was beaten up? Wouldn’t that be embarrassing?’","Gu Zheng thought in his heart, not knowing that Qiao Xi had already heard his thoughts clearly.","Qiao Xi lowered her head and smiled slyly.","It turned out that Gu Zheng had also been beaten by his elders when he was young. No wonder he was so good at teaching Gu Yao a lesson. It was all from his experience","when he was young.","At this moment, Huang Lilan and Gu Weiming were still quibbling. They completely omitted the fact that they had tried to poison Gu Zheng. Instead, they were accusing Gu","Zheng of disrespecting his elders and beating up his uncle.","Huang Lilan’s expression softened a little. Looking at the time, Old Madam Gu was about to fall asleep again. As long as she fell asleep, the entire Gu family would be under","their control.","At that moment, Qin An’s assistant walked in and whispered into Qin An’s ear. Following that, Qin An and the others from the Medical Association widened their eyes as","their expressions changed.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. The real battle had begun.","Qin An said sternly, “Madam Gu, I really don’t understand how President Gu offended you. And how did our medical staff offend you?”","Chairman Gu was dumbfounded. He didn’t understand how this matter had anything to do with doctors. Why did Qin An bring people from the Medical Association to the","Gu family?","Just now, Qin An had helped Old Madam Gu inside. Chairman Gu thought that Qin An was here to treat Old Madam Gu’s illness, but now, it seemed to be related to Gu","Zheng.","Qin An said sternly, “Madam Gu just said that she didn’t poison President Gu, but the incense your brother put out at Maple Garden can clearly cause hallucinations. It’ll also","accelerate the effects of the poison already in President Gu’s body!","“Don’t be in such a hurry to refute. We of the Medical Association will naturally have found all the evidence we need before we speak. This incense is distributed by the","Medical Association. Because this kind of incense is poisonous, the buyer has to register their name in our records. I’ve already investigated. The person who bought the","incense is Huang Wei! He came to the Gu family to poison President Gu. Him getting beaten up is considered a light punishment.","“All these years, the members of the Medical Association have been trying to find a way to help President Gu detoxify the poison in his body, but Madam Gu, you ordered","your younger brother to poison him. You intended to cause the poison in his body to flare up. If that happened, what about the reputation of the Medical Association? Just","what’s your motive, Madam Gu?!”."]},{"number":462,"title":"Chapter 462 - In Charge","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Madam Gu, was your younger brother Huang Wei trying to kill your son, Gu Zheng, or was he trying to ruin the hundred years of reputation that we doctors have","accumulated?”","Huang Lilan’s expression changed!","The Medical Association? It would be troublesome if the Medical Association was involved!","Be it poisoning Gu Zheng or wanting to ruin the reputation of the Medical Association, they were both things she could not afford to admit to. Fortunately, the one who","poisoned Gu Zheng was Huang Wei and not her. As long as she refused to admit it, it would have nothing to do with her.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “The Medical Association has already provided evidence, Huang Wei! The evidence of your attempted murder is conclusive. If you have anything","to say to the police, then say it! It’s just a pity... you’ll have to spend the rest of your life in prison.”","Huang Wei trembled uncontrollably.","He had yet to marry and have children. If he were to go to prison like this, the rest of his life would be ruined.","Huang Lilan was exasperated. “Qiao Xi!”","This roar woke Huang Wei up. Although the person Huang Lilan was shouting at was Qiao Xi, she was looking at him and her eyes were full of warning.","Huang Lilan was the money tree of the Huang family. If anything happened to her, he would also suffer.","Qiao Xi mocked and ridiculed, “Madam Gu, you and your little brother have such a deep relationship. It’s really touching. Since that’s the case, then let Mr. Huang Wei follow","us to the police station. Actually, it’s not a big deal. Ah Zheng isn’t dead. It’s just a case of attempted murder, so your brother will be out in a few years.”","Qiao Xi waved her hand, and the bodyguards went forward to capture Huang Wei.","Huang Wei’s eyes were filled with fear.","“L... I didn’t...”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Madam Gu, weren’t you defending your younger brother just now? Why aren’t you saying anything now? Your younger brother wanted to kill your son.","Don’t you want to say something? If the person who was poisoned today was... Lu Yan, would you...”","“It was my younger brother who poisoned Gu Zheng! That bastard!” Hearing Lu Yan’s name, Madam Gu immediately shouted in a panic and interrupted Qiao Xi.","She rushed in front of Huang Wei and gave him a vicious slap. She shouted with a fierce expression, “Huang Wei! You bastard, you actually poisoned Ah Zheng! Ah Zheng is","my biological son! From now on, I don’t have a younger brother like you! I’ll bring you to jail myself!”","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue.","Madam Gu was not a good person to begin with considering how she was able to become Madam Gu back when she was just an ordinary person. Now, she even betrayed","her own brother. How cruel!","Huang Wei’s body went soft as he fell to his knees.","Huang Lilan turned around and pretended to be sad. “It’s all my fault. If 1 knew you hated Ah Zheng so much, I would never have let you get close to him!","“Xi Xi, | wronged you today. I hope you won’t resent me.”","Qiao Xi’s face was full of doubt. “But I don’t understand one thing. Huang Wei and President Gu have only met a few times, so what deep grudges could there be between","them? Could it be that Madam Gu... Forget it, forget it. Since Huang Wei has already confessed, there’s nothing more to say.”","“Take him away!” Old Madam Gu ordered.","Then, Old Madam Gu’s voice turned slightly cold. “Huang Lilan, the entire Gu family was left to you to manage, but such a big thing happened and my precious grandson","was almost killed. Since that’s the case, you don’t have to manage the Gu family anymore!”","“Old Madam Gu!”","Old Madam Gu glanced at her coldly. “Xi Xi is Ah Zheng’s wife and the wife of the head of the Gu family. She should be in charge of the Gu family.”","“Mom!”","Old Madam Gu glared at her coldly. “Am I not clear enough? Does anyone have any objections?”","Gu Weiming was about to speak when he felt a slight pain in his knee. He was afraid that the old madam would beat him up in public, so he stammered, “No, no.”","When Huang Lilan heard this, her face immediately turned pale.","She failed to poison Gu Zheng to death and even got herself in trouble, causing her to lose her right to manage the family. She went out for wool but came home shorn. In","the beginning, she wanted to scheme against Gu Zheng, but in the end, she was screwed over by that b*tch Qiao Xi.","She had worked hard for so many years to obtain the right to be in charge of the family. Now...","“In charge? In other words, apart from Old Madam Gu and Chairman Gu, everyone else in the Gu family’s old residence has to listen to me?” Qiao Xi muttered excitedly.","“Grandma, Ah Zheng’s condition is serious. Maple Garden is desolate and remote. It’s not suitable for him to recuperate there. Also, someone might try to harm him again.","Now that I’m in charge of the old residence, I want Ah Zheng to move to the vicinity of the main residence. What do you think?”","Huang Lilan’s expression turned ugly. She had a bad feeling about this.."]},{"number":463,"title":"Chapter 463 - You’ve Really Found A Good Wife!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Then, she heard Qiao Xi continue, “Boya Yard is very good. Although it’s still not good enough for Gu Zheng, this is the most suitable place for him. The scenery is not bad and the courtyard is big enough. Gu Zheng is","the head of the Gu family, so he should live in such a courtyard.”","“No, that’s for Lu Yan...”","“For Lu Yan?” Qiao Xi raised her brows. “Oh~ So Boya Yard is for Lu Yan! Madam Gu, you’re really benevolent. You chased your son to Maple Garden but you’re letting Lu Yan stay in Boya Yard. Everyone knows that you","forced Eldest Miss Lu to her death, but you treat her son better than your own son. Lu Yan hasn’t even returned to the Gu family, yet you’ve already prepared a courtyard for him and arranged for your son to live in the","remote Maple Garden instead!","“Tsk tsk... | wonder what Madam Gu is thinking.”","Huang Lilan’s eyes were filled with panic as she frantically tried to defend herself. “It’s precisely because I’ve let Eldest Miss Lu down that I have to treat her son well. This can be considered as atoning for my sins!”","“Is that so?” Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “That’s right, let’s let Lu Yan stay in Boya Yard.”","She waved her hand, her eyes filled with coldness as her lips curled into a mocking smile.","“Huang Lilan, then you should move out. You’re a mistress, yet you’re living in the Gu family’s second-largest courtyard, Jialin Courtyard. It seems a little inappropriate. Back then, you indirectly caused Eldest Miss Lu’s","death. Since you want to atone for your sins, you should go to Maple Garden where you’ll follow a vegetarian diet and pray to Buddha every day.”","Qiao Xi then looked at Old Madam Gu. “Grandma, what do you think?”","Huang Lilan’s face turned ashen. “You... On what basis? If I’m a mistress, then... Gu Zheng is an... illegitimate child!”","“Madam Gu, you’re still so stubborn.”","Qiao Xi looked at everyone and smiled meaningfully. “Don’t you understand why when you said that Gu Zheng is unfilial and that he’s an illegitimate child, none of the members of the Gu branch families stepped","forward to speak up for you?”","Huang Lilan’s heart skipped a beat. Her expression was one of fear and disbelief. “Why... Why?”","Qiao Xi lowered her voice and said word by word, “Because everything in the Gu family... belongs to Gu Zheng!”","Everyone had to rely on Gu Zheng for their lives.","“Now that Gu Zheng is the head of the Gu family, so what if he’s an illegitimate child? He controls the entire Gu family. Without him, there wouldn’t be the Gu family today. All the food and drinks you guys enjoy were","all obtained by Gu Zheng! Madam Gu, can’t you understand this logic?”","Huang Lilan’s face instantly turned pale. Her legs went soft as she sat on the floor, her body trembling uncontrollably. There was a hint of disbelief in her eyes.","So... the Gu branch families were all Gu Zheng’s people now?","From the moment she became Gu Zheng’s enemy, she had already lost. It was because she simply did not have the ability to fight him.","But... what should Ah Yan do now? How should he return to the Gu family?","Ah Yan was the future head of the Gu family. What right did Gu Zheng have to occupy his position?","“Forget it. After all, Maple Garden was where Ah Zheng grew up. If Madam Gu stays there, the elegant courtyard will be tarnished. Since you like Lu Yan so much, why not stay in Boya Yard with Lu Yan?”","Qiao Xi said coldly, “Someone, help Madam Gu pack her luggage and bring her to Boya Yard.”","The butler immediately stepped forward and said respectfully, “Yes!”","Gu Weiming’s face was filled with hatred as he gritted his teeth. “Gu Zheng, you’ve really found a good wife!”","“Thank you for your praise, Father!” Gu Zheng smiled. “Grandma, Xi Xi, let’s go.”","The members of the Gu branch families also left with the old madam. Gu Zheng was walking at the back.","Gu Weiming walked to Gu Zheng’s side and said in a low voice, “Gu Zheng, if it’s not for the old madam helping you, will you still be so arrogant? Don’t think that the Gu family is yours!”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks.","Gu Weiming said in disdain, “I’m your father and have lived 20 years longer than you. My position in the Gu family is not something you can replace. When the old madam falls into a coma again, I’ll still be the one in","charge of the Gu family. Do you think I’ll let you off? Not only me but also the Lu family. Do you think you have the ability to go against us?”","Faced with Gu Weiming’s threat and mockery, Gu Zheng remained silent for a few seconds. Then, he sneered impatiently. “Father, do you really think so?”."]},{"number":464,"title":"Chapter 464 - Qiao Xi Likes Handsome Men","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Weiming nodded confidently. Gu Zheng was his son, after all. How could he win against him?","Gu Zheng sneered, “I’m very curious. Who gave you the confidence to think that you can contend against me?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Weiming was so angry that his face turned red and he almost couldn’t catch his breath. By the time he recovered, Gu Zheng had already left.","Old Madam Gu had just woken up when she already became furious. She felt exhausted and lay down after returning to her room.","Qiao Xi covered her with the blanket and saw her slowly closing her eyes. Just as she was about to leave, Old Madam Gu suddenly said, “Xi Xi, you know everything, don’t","you?”","Qiao Xi’s body stiffened.","Old Madam Gu sighed helplessly. “After what you said in front of everyone today, I know that you must be aware of Zheng’er’s true identity. That’s why you said that Huang","Lilan is good to Lu Yan.”","Qiao Xi turned around with a surprised expression. “Grandma, you know that as well? Gu Zheng’s identity...”","“Yes! I know Zheng’er’s true identity. He’s Lu Qingyun’s biological son.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes and asked in confusion, “Since you know, why didn’t you investigate? If you step in, then Gu Zheng...”","“That’s unnecessary,” Old Madam Gu said calmly, “Ah Zheng has never begged me to help him. I think he probably doesn’t need my help anymore. The matters regarding the","Lu family’s betrayal and the Gu family’s abandonment have to be settled by him, so I’ve never interfered in this matter. Xi Xi, you must believe that he has the ability to","resolve these problems. One day, he’ll clear his name.”","Qiao Xi nodded her head. She naturally believed in Gu Zheng, but just looking at the Lu family’s hypocritical faces made her furious.","On the other hand, Qin An was taking Gu Zheng’s pulse. “The poison in your body has been temporarily suppressed, but your eyes...”","He took out a medicine bottle from his pocket and handed it to him. “Take this and your eyes will return to their normal color, lest your blood-red eyes scare our Little Six.","She’s obsessed with looks and only likes handsome guys. If you don’t look good, she may abandon you.”","Initially, Gu Zheng thought that it didn’t matter whether he took the medicine or not. In any case, everyone knew that he was poisoned. Taking this kind of medicine","wouldn’t help his body in any way. Furthermore, medicine had its own toxicity.","But when he heard Qin An say that, he accepted the medicine for the first time and took a pill.","Then, Gu Zheng went out to welcome Qiao Xi. He suddenly recalled Qin An’s words.","Qin An, Xue Liang, and Qiao Xi’s other brothers were all handsome men with stunning looks. There was also Lu Yan, who was always close to Qiao Xi and had a gentle","appearance.","Qiao Xi liked handsome guys?","Gu Zheng frowned. “Song Shiyu.”","“Yes?”","Gu Zheng asked, “What do you think of Lu Yan’s appearance?”","Song Shiyu looked confused. “Huh? Why do you ask? He’s... quite handsome.”","“What about Qin An?”","Song Shiyu said, “He’s very handsome too.”","Gu Zheng’s expression grew darker and darker. When he thought of how Qiao Xi had to face so many handsome men every day, he felt slightly vexed, but when he thought","of his interaction with Qiao Xi yesterday, his expression gradually became warm. He asked again, “Then what do you think of me?”","“Huh?” Confused, Song Shiyu tilted his head and widened his eyes. He took a few steps back and hugged himself in fear.","What did the president mean by that? Why was he asking him that question and with such a gentle expression too?","“Ah!","Song Shiyu widened his eyes in disbelief.","“P-President, y-you’re very handsome, but I’m a normal man. I won’t like you, and you already have a wife. Don’t have such dangerous thoughts.”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment. He suddenly regretted asking Song Shiyu these questions. If he wanted to ask, he should have asked someone with a normal brain.","At this moment, Qiao Xi walked over and asked curiously, “Gu Zheng, what are you and Song Shiyu discussing?”","The man replied nonchalantly, “Business.”","Qiao Xi was a little suspicious. She could clearly see Song Shiyu’s terrified face. Why would he be so scared if it was business?","She leaned closer and tried to hear his thoughts, but there was nothing.","Qiao Xi suddenly realized that time had passed. Although this ability was very good, it lasted for just a short while. She hadn’t had enough fun yet!."]},{"number":465,"title":"Chapter 465 - Being Too Handsome Is A Problem","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The next day.","There was a banquet for the upper class, and Li Xing’er walked around in boredom.","She was the eldest daughter of the Li family. Coupled with her fiery temper, no one dared to provoke her.","When she reached the corner of the hall, Li Xing’er heard a conversation from inside. Just when she was about to leave, she heard a male voice. “Miss, if you didn’t hear me clearly, I can say it again.”","Li Xing’er felt that she had heard this voice before, but she could not recall where.","The man raised his voice. “My requirements are very high. My girlfriend must be good-looking, have a good figure, and have the ability to earn money. She must not be a freeloader. She must be sensible, and I have to","be able to call her to come and go as I please. When I’m not free, she needs to stay away from me. She can’t disturb me.”","Li Xing’er: “...”","F*ck! Who was this man? He was so stupid!","The man inside continued, “Other than appearance, she has to be kind and cute, which is consistent with my requirements. Also...”","Before the person inside finished speaking, Li Xing’er saw the woman sitting opposite her suddenly stand up and splash the water in her cup on the face of the man opposite her.","“Pah! Do you think someone like you is worthy of finding a girlfriend? You should just die alone!”","Li Xing’er could not help but laugh. That was right. This kind of man was not fit to have a girlfriend!","The door was suddenly pushed open and the woman rushed out in anger. Li Xing’er was shocked and wanted to leave quietly.","Unexpectedly, the voice came from inside again. “Is there anyone else? Sigh! Being too handsome is also a form of distress!”","Was there anyone else?","This voice sounded so familiar?","Li Xing’er looked inside. It was Gu Yao!","Gu Yao was dressed in a high-end suit with a large gold watch on his wrist and a necklace that cost hundreds of thousands on his neck. He looked like a nouveau riche, and his eyes were filled with indifference and","arrogance. When he saw Li Xing’er, he could not help but exclaim, “Woah!”","This woman was Qiao Xi’s friend, right?","Li Xing’er entered and smiled. “Where’s Young Master Gu’s blind date?”","Gu Yao had a helpless look on his face as he smiled bitterly. “Sigh! You saw it as well. I failed again. This is my 78th blind date. I think I’ve offended all the girls in the upper class circle. I just don’t understand. I’m still a","baby. Why do I have to go on blind dates?”","Li Xing’er was enlightened. “You said those things on purpose, right? But even if you don’t want to go on blind dates, you shouldn’t have done that to a girl. Aren’t you just ruining your own reputation?”","She remembered that Gu Yao and Qiao Xi were very close. When she saw him back then, he did not have the air of a young master at all. He was not as rude as the other rich second-generation heirs.","Gu Yao leaned against the sofa and smiled helplessly.","Those were all good women. It would be a pity if they were to follow him incessantly. He was the second young master of the Gu family. With such unbearable parents and a brother like Lu Yan who had a scheming","mind, whoever married him would be ruined.","Moreover, he didn’t have the ability to protect his wife now, so he might as well not marry anyone. He would also have a peaceful life this way.","He was alone and free with no attachments.","“You’re so young. Don’t pretend to be deep. The auction is about to start. Let’s go and join in the fun.”","As Li Xing’er spoke, she grabbed Gu Yao’s hand subconsciously. “You’re really different from the other rich second-generation heirs. I know you’re only doing this because you don’t want to hold back those girls. You’re","so kind!”","The auction was about to begin.","Li Xing’er liked such events very much. She came from a rich family, so she bought a few items.","When the last item came out, Li Xing’er’s expression changed. “Gu Yao, look!”","Gu Yao looked up, and his expression darkened.","Li Xing’er hurriedly said, “You’ve seen that jade pendant before, right? I’ve seen Qiao Xi wear one, but her jade pendant and the jade pendant being auctioned now are only half of each other. When the two jade","pendants are brought together, that’s the complete jade pendant.","“I remember Qiao Xi saying that her jade pendant was left behind by her mother. Unfortunately, she only got half of it. The other half is supposed to be in the hands of the Qiao family. She searched through the entire","Qiao family but couldn’t find it. I didn’t expect it to appear at the auction.”."]},{"number":466,"title":"Chapter 466 - Gu Moling, You’re Not Even Worthy!","paragraphs":["Hearing Li Xing’er’s words, Gu Yao’s expression darkened. “The Qiao family actually dares to auction the belongings of Qiao Xi’s mother?”","Gu Yao immediately raised his card, bought the jade pendant, and left in a hurry.","...","Longwan Residential.","After Qiao Xi received Gu Yao’s call, her eyes darkened.","Gu Zheng’s gaze was cold. “The Qiao family still has the jewelry your mother left behind?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “My mother has many assets under her name. Besides the Qiao Corporation, there are also many priceless jewelries. Every single one of them can be said to be exquisite.”","Gu Zheng asked, “Where are they now?”","“I managed to snatch some of them back, but there are also some that I couldn’t take back. According to the law, my mother didn’t mention those assets in her will. Qiao Zhenguo has the right to decide, so I can’t take those things back.”","Qiao Xi’s mother’s will clearly stated that Qiao Corporation, other assets, and a portion of the jewelry would all be left to Qiao Xi. It was","impossible for the Qiao family to keep them.","She could not take back those that were not mentioned in the will, but she did not want to leave any of them to the Qiao family.","At this moment, Gu Zheng smiled indifferently. “I’ll help you snatch them back.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes lit up. “How?”","The man tapped his long fingers on the table and said calmly, “Those jewelry pieces are your mother’s dowry, right?”","He smiled meaningfully. “According to our country’s law, as Xia Yunqiu’s only daughter, you have the right to take your mother’s dowry","as your own dowry when you get married.”","“Even though she has already passed away for many years and Qiao Zhenguo has a new lover and an illegitimate daughter, you’ll be","asking for your mother’s dowry because you’ve gotten married. It’s in accordance with the law, so no one has the right to refuse you.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes.","That was right!","That was indeed the law of the country. If she wanted to get her mother’s dowry back on the basis of her marriage, the Qiao family","would have no choice but to agree. At most, they would go to court.","However...","Gu Zheng turned around and reached out to pull her into his arms. He gently stroked her silky hair, and his voice revealed a trace of","danger. “Hasn’t the Qiao family always thought of Qiao Rou as the Qiao family’s lucky star? They think her being engaged to the young","master of the Gu family will bring endless benefits to the Qiao family? Now, we’ll let them know who the real lucky star is. Gu Moling","isn’t even worthy of carrying your shoes!”","Qiao Xi was slightly stunned, then she beamed. “Alright!”","“I have something to ask you. Do you know why your mother married Qiao Zhenguo?”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes.","Gu Zheng asked word by word, “She has outstanding looks, great talent, and impressive family background. Normal men wouldn’t be","able to dream of having her. What was so good about Qiao Zhenguo that your mother was willing to marry him?”","“Qiao Zhenguo was useless when he was young. At that time, Qiao Corporation was always managed by your mother. Qiao Zhenguo ate,","drank, and played all day without asking anything. Why would such an outstanding woman like your mother choose him?”","Qiao Xi gasped.","That was right. Why would Mom marry a piece of trash like Qiao Zhenguo?","Her eyes were cold. “Let’s go to the Qiao family’s house.”","In the Qiao family’s house.","Old Madam Qiao sat on the main seat and smiled affectionately. “Moling, our Qiao family has very few people. Rou Rou is our only","daughter. We’ve always doted on her, so when you get married, half of the Qiao family’s assets will be given as Rou Rou’s dowry.”","After the previous incident, Qiao Rou’s image had collapsed, and Gu Moling had also been greatly implicated. He had embezzled public","funds and was now being ostracized in the company. Everyone wanted Qiao Xi to come back and take over the company.","Gu Moling was stretched out and urgently needed a sum of money.","Xu Mei rolled her eyes. Although that woman had made a will, there were still some things that were not included in it. Altogether, it was","a large sum of assets.","Now that Qiao Xi was not married yet, as her father, Qiao Zhenguo had the right to control this inheritance. When Qiao Rou got married,","these things would become her dowry. At that time, if Qiao Xi wanted to come back to get them when she got married, she would not","have the chance.","Ever since the previous incident, Qiao Rou had been getting cursed by people all over the world, causing her to be unable to go to","university, much less develop in the entertainment industry.."]},{"number":467,"title":"Chapter 467 - Qiao Xi Is Getting Married!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Zhenguo looked at Gu Moling. “Although the outside world has many misunderstandings about Rou Rou, she’ll one day clear her name. Rou Rou is the beloved","daughter of Xu Mei and me. We’ve never let her suffer any grievances since she was young. I hope you can treat Rou Rou well in the future and not let her suffer. After all,","the entire Qiao family will be handed to Rou Rou to manage in the future.”","Gu Moling looked at Qiao Rou and nodded.","No matter what, Rou Rou really loved him. She could endure being scolded just to marry him. It was a blessing for him to be able to marry such a woman who truly loved","him.","The incident of the donation to Li City University was ultimately the manager’s mistake. It had nothing to do with Rou Rou.","“Brother Moling, I heard that my sister is getting married too. Let’s attend her wedding together,” Qiao Rou suddenly said.","Gu Moling was slightly surprised. “Why is Xi Xi suddenly getting married? Who... is she marrying?”","A glint flashed across Qiao Rou’s eyes as she smiled. “Zhong Ming, the young master of the Zhong family.”","Qiao Zhenguo had a smile on his face. “This matter was just decided. The Zhong family came to propose marriage. They said that Young Master Zhong Ming likes Xi Xi very","much. I thought that the two of them were suitable for each other since Young Master Zhong is very outstanding, so I agreed.”","Gu Moling was silent for a moment before he said helplessly, “With Xi Xi’s taste, she probably won’t take a liking to Zhong Ming. Why do you suddenly want Xi Xi to marry","him? If Xi Xi doesn’t want to...”","Young Master Zhong Ming was a famous rich second-generation heir in Li City. He was rich, but his appearance was really unbearable.","“She has to marry even if she doesn’t want to!” Old Madam Qiao immediately interrupted. “She’s the eldest daughter of the Qiao family, so she should consider the Qiao","family’s future. A business marriage is inevitable. Rou Rou will be marrying you, so Qiao Xi can’t drag the Qiao family down. Now that the Qiao family’s company urgently","needs funds, as the daughter of the Qiao family, she should take responsibility! It’s her honor that Young Master Zhong likes her!”","Gu Moling frowned and was about to say something when Qiao Rou’s eyes suddenly turned red. Tears trickled down her face. “Brother Moling, I know that you still have","Sister in your heart. I can’t replace her position in your heart. I did something wrong and my actions have hurt her. I’ve been feeling guilty about it. It’s because of this that I","want Sister to marry Young Master Zhong. He personally came to propose marriage and expressed his liking to Sister. He’ll definitely be very good to Sister in the future.","“Moreover, we’re about to get married, but my sister is still alone. I just hope that someone can take care of her. Young Master Zhong’s family is rich. If she marries him,","she’ll be a rich madam. That’s something that many people can’t even dream of! I’m doing this for my sister’s sake!”","Hearing Qiao Rou’s words, Gu Moling also felt that it made sense, so he was relieved.","There was indeed a misunderstanding between Rou Rou and Xi Xi, but Rou Rou had always been kind. How could she harm her sister? On the other hand, Xi Xi had always","hated Rou Rou and always embarrassed her in public. She even ruined Rou Rou’s career.","He nodded slightly. “Rou Rou, I know you’re doing this for Xi Xi’s sake, but marriage is a major event in life. You can’t be too rash. Just looking for someone rich won’t do. It","depends on the man’s character too.”","Qiao Rou wiped her tears. “Brother Moling, you don’t have to worry. I’ll help my sister. Although Young Master Zhong is a little ugly, he’s kind-hearted and has a gentle","temper. Most importantly, he really likes my sister. As long as my sister marries him, she’ll be the mistress of the Zhong family in the future and will be in charge of the","entire Zhong family.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the butler walked in. “Old Madam, someone from the Zhong family is here. They want to see Miss Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Zhenguo abruptly stood up and was extremely excited. “Moling, what did I say? If the Zhong family doesn’t take Xi Xi seriously, why would they come to visit so many","times?”","Gu Moling heaved a sigh of relief, stood up, and entered the inner residence with Qiao Rou. Only Old Madam Qiao, Qiao Zhenguo, and Xu Mei were left in the living room.","A moment later, Mr. Zhong and Madam Zhong walked in with Zhong Ming.","Qiao Zhenguo went forward to welcome them warmly. “Mr. Zhong, Madam Zhong, excuse me for not going out to meet you! Why didn’t you tell us before coming? Xi Xi isn’t","back yet!”","Zhong Ming had a big belly, and his heavy body moved slowly. His face was fierce, and his fat lips moved. “I’ve already given her enough face by personally coming to your","Qiao family. Hurry up and call her back!”."]},{"number":468,"title":"Chapter 468 - Double Happiness","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Zhenguo looked obsequious. “Please wait a moment. I’ll call her back now. Young Master Zhong, why don’t we let her go home with you today to serve you? She’ll be","yours in the future. You can do whatever you want with her. Regarding the collaboration funds...”","Before he could finish, Madam Zhong said arrogantly, “Isn’t it just 200 million? As long as my son is happy, it doesn’t matter how much it costs. But it all depends on whether","your daughter can serve my son well or not.”","Qiao Zhenguo nodded and bowed, then shot Xu Meia look.","Xu Mei hurriedly said, “Don’t worry, Young Master Zhong. I’ll teach Xi Xi and promise that she’ll serve you well! My youngest daughter, Rou Rou, is engaged to the young","master of the Gu family. There’s going to be a banquet later. If the three of you are free, why don’t you stay and attend the banquet? This is a good opportunity to announce","the marriage between Young Master Zhong and Qiao Xi.”","When Young Master Zhong thought of Qiao Xi’s beautiful appearance, his eyes narrowed into lines as he smiled wretchedly. “Alright! Alright!”","In the afternoon, the Qiao family held a banquet in the villa.","Those who attended the banquet were all people who were close to the Qiao family. Although it was a banquet, it was actually just to announce the wedding date.","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was filled with joy. “Thank you, everyone, for attending this banquet. I believe everyone knows that there have been some untrue rumors circulating","online recently, but fortunately, they didn’t affect Moling and Rou Rou’s marriage. Their wedding will be held on the fifth of next month. I hope everyone can attend it.”","Although Qiao Rou’s image had collapsed and she could not return to the entertainment industry, she was still getting married to Young Master Gu. She would be in charge","of the Qiao family’s business in the future too. The guests naturally did not dare to offend her.","“There’s also another happy occasion,” Qiao Zhenguo said again.","“This is what they call ‘double happiness’. My eldest daughter, Qiao Xi, will also hold her wedding next month!”","Everyone was puzzled. Qiao Xi was getting married? Why didn’t they know that Qiao Xi had a boyfriend?","Just as everyone was puzzled, Qiao Zhenguo announced loudly, “My eldest daughter, Qiao Xi, is engaged to the young master of the Zhong family, Zhong Ming. She’s getting","married next month.”","Everyone present could hear a pin drop. Under the burning gazes of everyone, Zhong Ming staggered onto the stage. His eyes narrowed into lines, and the flesh on the","corners of his cheeks trembled. “Qiao Xi is my fiancee, my...”","“Hah! This is ridiculous! I didn’t know that I was marrying Young Master Zhong!”","At this moment, a cold female voice sounded from outside the door. The next second, the door was suddenly pushed open.","Qiao Xi stood at the door and glanced at everyone. In the end, her gaze landed on Zhong Ming, and her eyes were filled with disgust. She felt disgusted just by looking at","him.","She was wearing a long trench coat and walked in with a strong aura. She sneered. “Why am I suddenly getting married to this man?”","Everyone gasped.","The moment Zhong Ming saw Qiao Xi, wretchedness and desire appeared in his eyes. He almost drooled.","Madam Zhong looked at her son’s infatuated appearance and could not help but frown. Qiao Xi was a little too beautiful. It was fine to keep her as a lover outside, but she","felt that it was inappropriate for her to be the mistress of the Zhong family.","She snorted. “President Qiao, you’ve always praised your daughter for being smart and beautiful. But she didn’t even greet us after entering. How rude!”","Mr. Zhong frowned. “She’s indeed a little rude, but I heard that she founded Moling Corporation. Those elders all praise her for her ability. In the future, when she marries","our Zhong family, she’ll have to do her best to help my son manage the company.”","The more Madam Zhong looked at Qiao Xi, the more she found her unappealing. “Hmph! If my son hadn’t taken a liking to you, I would never have let a woman like you","enter the company. However, you’re quite capable and can even help my son manage the company. Let me tell you, the company belongs to my son and has nothing to do","with you. Just do what you have to do!","“As the young madam of the Zhong family, your first task is to serve my son well. Secondly, you have to give birth to children for the Zhong family. You also have to be filial","to your in-laws and manage the company. This way, you can be considered to be contributing to the Zhong family.”","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. Why were some people so shameless and confident?."]},{"number":469,"title":"Chapter 469 - The Qiao Family Is Crazy","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi curled her lips and said mercilessly, “I didn’t agree to marry Young Master Zhong. All of this was privately decided by you guys. It has nothing to do with me.”","“Nonsense!” Old Madam Qiao raised her walking cane and slammed it on the floor as she berated with a gloomy expression.","“Qiao Xi, who allowed you to speak like this?! You have no right to speak when there are so many elders here! You’re already marrying into the Zhong family, yet you still dare to refuse?”","Old Madam Qiao walked in front of her and lowered her voice. “Qiao Xi, you’ve already been abandoned by Moling. Who in Li City is still willing to marry you? I told you not to tell anyone about Moling and your past, but you refused to listen. Now that you’ve reaped the consequences, not only will you not be able to marry anyone, but you’ll also ruin the Qiao family’s reputation!","“Young Master Zhong doesn’t care about your past. It’s your blessing that he’s willing to marry you. If you marry him, you’ll be the legitimate young madam of the Zhong family. You’ll also bring benefits to the Qiao family. This is killing two birds with one stone! In short, we’ve already accepted the Zhong family’s betrothal gifts. You can’t go back on this arrangement! You have to marry him!”","Qiao Rou gently advised. “Sister, just agree. Grandma is doing this for your own good. Moreover, the Qiao family is already in a difficult situation. As a member of the Qiao family, you should help.”","Qiao Xi had always known that the Qiao family was shameless, but she never expected this group of people to be shameless to this extent. Their skin was thicker than city walls. Even a machine gun wouldn’t be able to penetrate it.","They wanted her to marry Young Master Zhong in exchange for money. Qiao Rou would take her money to manage the company and lead carefree lives with Gu Moling?","Was the Qiao family crazy, or was she crazy?","Xu Mei’s relatives covered their mouths and laughed when they saw Qiao Xi remaining silent.","“Qiao Xi was so arrogant before and even went against Rou Rou. She must be dumbfounded now. It was good for her when she used to be alone and free, but now, she’s being forced to marry Young Master Zhong.” “What a pity! Who asked her to not have a mother?! Her deceased mother had a hard life too. What’s the point of amassing such a huge amount of wealth? In the end, her daughter can’t even enjoy her life. It’s all because Rou Rou and Xu Mei are the ones controlling the Qiao family.”","“Qiao Xi is the eldest daughter of the Qiao family on the surface, but she’s actually destined to be sacrificed. Marrying Zhong Ming to be the young madam just sounds nice on the surface, but I heard that... Zhong Ming is a pervert who likes to torture women. He’s already been married twice, and both times, he tortured those women to no end. Look at his appearance. You’ll have nightmares if you take another look!” “Haha! That b*tch, Qiao Xi, deserves to marry a man like Zhong Ming. Perhaps she can live a few more years if she serves him well!... Ah!”","Qiao Xi flicked her wrist and threw out some silver needles. The few of them could not help but let out a sharp cry, but she had an indifferent expression. “Are you sure you want me to marry him?”","“You have to marry him!”","“Unfortunately... I’m already married!”","Qiao Xi said casually, “Even if you didn’t read many books, you should know the law. I’m already married. If I get married again, won’t I be committing the crime of bigamy? For the sake of the company, you’re forcing a married woman like me to marry Zhong Ming. Is that appropriate? Old Madam Qiao, President Qiao, if you insist on doing this, why don’t we meet in court? We’ll see who loses in the end!”","Everyone fell silent.","What? Qiao Xi was married? Since she was already married, why was the Qiao family forcing her to marry Young Master Zhong? They were too shameless!","Qiao Xi’s gaze was icy-cold. “Qiao Rou, you want me to marry Young Master Zhong, right?”","The Qiao family was extremely guilty. Everyone instantly understood that it was actually Qiao Rou who suggested Qiao Xi marry Young Master Zhong.","Although they were all relatives and friends of the Qiao family, they could not help but complain in their hearts. Qiao Rou, an illegitimate daughter, had snatched Qiao Xi’s father, her fiance, and her company.","Now, she was still unwilling to let Qiao Xi off and wanted to marry her to that beast, Zhong Ming. She wanted to use her to the end.","Qiao Rou could clearly feel everyone’s burning gazes on her. Her face instantly turned pale as her body trembled nervously. “I... I didn’t...” Immediately after, she squeezed out a few tears and cried aggrievedly. “Sister, don’t... misunderstand me. I know... I’ve let you down. You were Brother Moling’s fiancee in the past. After you were abandoned, I heard that you married a random passerby in a fit of anger. I... Boo-hoo...”"]},{"number":470,"title":"Chapter 470 - Ugly But Thinks Highly Of Himself","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Mei said that after Moling broke off the engagement with Qiao Xi, Qiao Xi had casually married someone else. She heard that the man had no house or car. He was so poor as he was just an ordinary worker.","Qiao Rou’s face was filled with pride. If Qiao Xi did not marry Zhong Ming, she would have to be the wife of a normal worker. She would have no power or influence. Meanwhile, she would be Gu Moling’s wife, the mistress of the Gu family. Qiao Xi would never be able to compare to her.","Although Gu Moling was only a member of the Gu branch family, he was also a member of Li City’s high society. Qiao Xi was not worthy to be compared to her at all. Any piece of clothing she bought would cost as much as the annual salary of Qiao Xi’s poor husband.","Thinking of this, Qiao Rou smiled proudly, but she still wiped her tears and pretended to be sad. “Sister, I just don’t want you to suffer. If you marry Young Master Thong, you can live a carefree life and won’t have to suffer with that man anymore!”","Everyone’s expressions eased, and they could not help but nod.","“Rou Rou is kind-hearted. She’s only thinking for her sister’s sake. She wants her to have a good home!”","“Young Master Gu was originally Qiao Xi’s fiance. Now that Rou Rou and Young","Master Gu are about to get married, Rou Rou feels guilty, so she wants to help","Qiao Xi get married.”","“We’ve misunderstood Rou Rou. ”","Qiao Rou said gently, “Sister, if you’re unwilling, then forget it. I won’t force you either, but now that the Thong family has already given the betrothal gifts, what should we do?!”","“No! You have to marry him!” Old Madam Qiao roared. “Qiao Xi, we’re all your relatives. How could we harm you? What’s so good about marrying a poor man?","You’re lucky that Young Master Thong likes you. This is your blessing!”","Qiao Rou also chimed in, “Sister, Brother Moling and I are about to get married. I can’t bear to see you marry an ordinary worker. Don’t you like money the most? Young Master Thong is rich. You can enjoy life if you marry him.”","Hearing everyone’s persuasion, Qiao Xi still had a disdainful expression. It instantly infuriated the members of the Thong family.","“Qiao Xi! Don’t be so shameless! It’s your honor that my son is willing to marry you.","If you dare to cancel the marriage and hurt my son’s heart, I’ll absolutely not let","you offY’","Madam Zhong threatened, and the old madam beside her was so anxious that she stomped her feet. “Qiao Xi! Hurry up and get a divorce. You’ll be marrying Young Master Thong next month, yet you secretly got married. You didn’t even tell your family about it, you bastard!”","(Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “I like money?”","Everyone was stunned. She said casually, “I do like money.”","The Thong family thought that she was going to give in and smiled smugly.","Thong Ming’s face was fierce, and his gaze was wretched. “Baby Xi Xi, as long as you serve me with all your heart, I’ll definitely not treat you badly. Don’t you like money? How much do you want? I’ll give it to you!’","Madam Thong nodded as well, “As long as you marry my son, you’ll be responsible for serving him. I’ll fulfill your wish no matter how much money you want to spend.”","Thong Ming’s eyes were filled with infatuation. “Baby Xi Xi, listen to me. Quickly divorce that poor bastard and cut off all contact with your third brother from now on. I’ll dote on you well.”","“Also, after you marry someone in the future, you’re not allowed to wear short skirts when you go out. You’re not allowed to show your shoulders and neck.","You’re not allowed to meet any men. In short, you’re not allowed to go out unless my son is with you. Your mission is to make my son happy. Nothing else matters.” Madam Thong said word by word, and Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened.","Thong Ming leaned closer and said with his disgusting mouth, “As long as you serve me obediently, I’ll be happy. I’ll agree to anything.”","“Young Master Thong is so ugly, but he sure thinks highly of himselfl”","At this moment, a cold voice came from outside the door. A chill invaded everyone’s hearts.","The man’s voice was cold. “I’ve always been arrogant, but even I don’t dare to make demands from Mrs. Gu like this. Young Master Thong, what right do you have to ask for so much from Mrs. Cru?”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a tall man slowly walking in with a suppressive aura. His heavy footsteps stepped on everyone’s hearts.","What did this person say? He was... Qiao Xi’s husband? He actually dared to mock Young Master Thong in public?","Madam Thong was about to curse when she saw her husband and the Qiao family’s old madam turn pale and tremble slightly.","The man in front of her was like a god who had descended. His cold eyes swept across the room, causing everyone to stop breathing.."]},{"number":471,"title":"Chapter 471 - Gu Zheng Is Here","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou looked at the man in front of her with eyes filled with horror.","He... He was... the master of Longwan Residential.","Gu Moling, who was beside Qiao Rou, felt a storm in his mind. He ignored everyone and staggered to the man.","“President Gu! W-Why are you here?”","The moment that was said, the living room instantly fell silent.","Gu Zheng slowly looked up, his eyes filled with coldness.","Gu Moling could not help but tremble as he stood in front of Gu Zheng.","Qiao Zhenguo suddenly reacted. Madam Zhong also swallowed her curses, her face red.","President Gu...","The man in front of her was the legendary President Gu! Why would that god-like man come to the Qiao family?","After all, Old Madam Qiao was someone who had been through a lot. She quickly went forward and smiled. “President Gu, your presence brings light to my humble home. I just don’t know why you’re here...”","The old madam bent down and invited Gu Zheng to take a seat. She was very polite.","Gu Zheng did not refuse and sat in the seat that originally belonged to Old Madam Qiao with a calm expression. That seat represented the highest status and power in the Qiao family. It was suitable for Gu Zheng to sit in.","Gu Zheng had just sat down when the Qiao family’s servants immediately brought hot tea over. They then retreated to the side and waited for instructions.","The man calmly picked up the teacup. Seeing that his eyebrows were relaxed, Old Madam Qiao said uneasily, “May I ask why President Gu is visiting the Qiao family today?”","Qiao Xi sneered.","Gu Zheng looked up at her. Since she wanted to play, he would play with the Qiao family. Hence, he said indifferently, “I’m naturally here for a big matter.” A big matter? What big matter could trouble President Gu?","The Qiao family looked puzzled, while Madam Thong, who was at the side, immediately reacted. “Could it be that President Gu is here for Young Master Gu and Second Miss Qiao’s engagement banquet?”","Old Madam Qiao was a little surprised, while Xu Mei and Qiao Rou were wild with joy. They did not expect to be so valued by President Gu after marrying Gu Moling.","This way, President Gu would personally witness their marriage. Whoever said that Qiao Rou was a mistress would be opposing President Cru!","Old Madam Qiao was full of smiles and was extremely excited. “Thank you, President Cru, for showing me respect. It’s really our Qiao family’s honor that you value our daughter so much!”","As soon as she finished speaking, a mocking laugh came from behind her.","Old Madam Qiao turned around and was instantly infuriated when she realized that it was Qiao Xi who was laughing.","Why was Qiao Xi, that b*tch, laughing? President Gu was still sitting here. What was so funny about it? What did this have to do with her?!","Old Madam Qiao warned fiercely, “President Gu came to the Qiao family to celebrate Moling and Rou Rou’s marriage. What’s so funny about that?! You’re really rude! You and Moling are already a matter of the past. Now that your sister is about to get married and you’re about to get married as well, what else are you dissatisfied about? What do you want?!”","With that, Old Madam Qiao turned around. Her expression changed instantly. “President Gu, my granddaughter is stubborn and always targets Rou Rou. Please don’t blame her.”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Xu Mei pretended to be helpless. “Xi Xi, it doesn’t matter if you don’t like Rou Rou, but Rou Rou is your younger sister. You can’t harm her! Now that she has obtained President Cru’s recognition, this is also a good thing for you too. Stop fooling around, alright?”","Old Madam Qiao reprimanded, “Qiao Xi, you’ve indeed gone too far. Rou Rou is your younger sister no matter what. Moreover, she has always been very good to you. She even found you a good marriage partner. What else are you dissatisfied about?”","After she finished speaking, Old Madam Qiao looked at Thong Ming with a smile. “Young Master Thong, Qiao Xi is your fiancee. Quickly take her away. Don’t let her disturb the esteemed guest.”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and looked at the Qiao family sarcastically. This group of people was afraid of her reputation, so they wanted to belittle her in front of everyone.","When Gu Zheng entered, he had mocked Thong Ming in public. At this moment,","Thong Ming’s heart was filled with rage, but he did not dare vent it out on Gu Zheng. Hence, he roared angrily, “Qiao Xi! Get the hell over here! Let me tell you, those requests I made just now weren’t a joke. You’re not allowed to leave the house without my permission to avoid embarrassing me!”."]},{"number":472,"title":"Chapter 472 - Gu Moling? Is He Worthy?","paragraphs":["“Young Master Zhong, are you deaf? Didn’t President Gu just say that even he doesn’t dare to ask for so much from Mrs. Gu? What right do you have?” Song Shijing reminded him.","Zhong Ming did not understand what he meant and thought that it was because Gu Zheng thought that he was too troublesome. Gu Zheng did not even have so many requests for Mrs. Gu, yet he had so many requests for Qiao Xi. However, was this related?","Zhong Ming had been pampered since he was young, so he sneered. “President Gu treats Mrs. Gu well because she’s outstanding. Qiao Xi! What right do you have to compare yourself to Mrs. Gu? Moreover, Qiao Xi is my wife. Why should someone else discipline my wife for me?”","“Heh.”","A cold laugh sounded.","Gu Zheng sat in the main seat with deep eyes. His thin lips parted slightly. “Indeed, knowing someone by their reputation is inferior to meeting them in person. Young Master Zhong is indeed as unbearable as the rumors say!”","Zhong Ming was angered to the point his face flushed red. He had liked Qiao Xi for a long time, but he never had the chance. This time, it was Qiao Rou who agreed to sell Qiao Xi to the Zhong family. Was a woman who was sold to the Zhong family worthy of their care and concern?","Madam Thong and Mr. Zhong acted a little strangely. President Gu had never been a busybody. Could it be that he knew Qiao Xi and that was why he spoke up for her? Hence, he could not help but ask, “President Gu, you... You know Qiao XP”","Mr. Thong felt a cold gaze land on him. Coupled with what Gu Zheng had just said, he seemed to understand something. Hence, he said while trembling, ‘This... This is a misunderstanding. Our Zhong family and the Qiao family have just gotten engaged. Qiao Xi is the future mistress of the Thong family. How could we treat her badly? What we said just now was just a joke.”","“The mistress of the Thong family?” Gu Zheng raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi and asked casually, “Do you know that the Qiao family wants to marry you to the Thong family?”","Everyone gasped!","Qiao Xi looked aggrieved. “I just found out too! Because the company needs a sum of money, Qiao Rou suggested marrying me off. My good sister has helped me choose a good marriage partner! President Gu, if I refuse, the Qiao family won’t let me off!”","When Old Madam Qiao heard Qiao Xi mention Qiao Rou and blame her sarcastically, her expression instantly changed. “Qiao Xi!”","“The Qiao family wants to sell the Qiao family’s legitimate eldest daughter to the Zhong family for an illegitimate daughter.” Gu Zheng’s tone was cold. “You guys are really capable!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart trembled. He mustered his courage and asked in Qiao Zhenguo’s heart trembled. He mustered his courage and asked in confusion, “President Cru... Y-You know my eldest daughter? Why are you asking about her marriage? This child has a bad reputation. It’s already the best outcome that Young Master Thong doesn’t care about her past and is willing to marry her. This—? I ‘","“President Qiao, don’t you understand why I’m here today?’ Gu Zheng interrupted.","Qiao Zhenguo felt his entire body turn cold, making him tremble uncontrollably. He thought about it carefully and really did not know what Gu Zheng meant. “President Gu, you’re not here today for Moling and Rou Rou...”","“Gu Moling? Is he worthy?”","With that, Gu Zheng looked up with a gentle gaze. “Mrs. Gu, have you had enough fun?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the surroundings fell silent.","Mrs. Gu was here too?","Or rather, if Mrs. Gu had always been here, who was she?","Old Madam Qiao did not understand Gu Zheng’s words and thought that Qiao Xi had angered Gu Zheng, so she hurriedly explained, “President Gu, you’re probably mistaken. Xi Xi’s marriage was decided from before, but—”","“Old Madam Qiao, don’t you understand human language?”","Qiao Xi had never called Old Madam Qiao her grandmother and had always called her Old Madam Qiao. However, Old Madam Qiao felt alarmed today.","Immediately after, Song Shijing said seriously, “President Qiao, the Qiao family is slapping the Gu family’s face by selling the madam of the Gu family to the Thong family for the sake of company interests.”","Boom!!!","Everyone widened their eyes in disbelief. Old Mada Qiao felt the blood in her body freeze as her body instantly stiffened.","Sold who to the Zhong family? The madam of the Gu family?","The person they were selling was clearly Qiao Xi...","Wait! Old Madam Qiao was abruptly stunned. Her eyelids twitched as she looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief.."]},{"number":473,"title":"Chapter 473 - The Qiao Family Has Low IQS","paragraphs":["Madam Qiao had once told Qiao Xi that she wasn’t worthy of Gu Moling. Only a well-behaved and obedient girl like Rou Rou was worthy of being with the young master of the Gu family, hence she forced Qiao Xi to break up with Gu Moling.","But now, she realized that Qiao Xi was standing together with President Gu.","T-This was impossible!","Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who grew up in the countryside. She lost her mother when she was young and her father did not love her. She was just a useless person. She did not know the etiquette of the upper class society and could only embarrass the Qiao family. How could she...","But President Gu really did say those words.","“Old Madam Qiao, you still don’t understand.”","Song Shijing said coldly, “The Qiao and Zhong families have offended the president, so the president doesn’t have to show you any mercy. Song Shiyu.”","Song Shiyu immediately walked forward and cleared his throat. “Old Madam Qiao, our president originally thought that since the Qiao family is the young madam’s family, at the very least, they must have raised her for a few years. In order to thank the Qiao family for raising her, he even prepared some gifts for everyone. He prepared some jewelry pieces and a sum of money. It would be enough for the Qiao family to survive this crisis, but...”","Young Madam’s family?","When everyone heard this, they felt like a bolt of lightning had struck their heads!","Old Madam Qiao took a few steps back in disbelief and asked suspiciously, “Mrs. Gu? May I ask who she is...”","As long as Gu Zheng did not tell them personally that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu, she would not believe it. This was definitely not true. It was just a misunderstanding. The rest of the Qiao family were dumbfounded as well. Their faces were pale, and their bodies trembled uncontrollably as they stared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou’s heart skipped a beat as horror spread from her heart.","She had always been bullying Qiao Xi since she was young. There was once she almost drowned Qiao Xi. After she grew up, she snatched Gu Moling from her. Moreover, during this period of time, she had been showing off in front of Qiao Xi that she was getting married to Qiao Xi’s ideal husband.","If Qiao Xi was really Mrs. Gu, how could she let her off so easily? Moreover, her previous boasts would all become a joke!","“No! No way!”","At this moment, Gu Moling shouted and rushed out agitatedly. He looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. “Xi Xi... Xi Xi, tell me, what’s your relationship with President Gu? You... How could you...”","Back then, he abandoned Qiao Xi and got together with Qiao Rou because Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who grew up in the countryside. She was not worthy of his status as the young master of the Gu family, but now, Qiao Xi had become the wife of the head of the Gu family. It was as if his face was pressed against the ground.","Hence, this could not be true!","“Xi Xi, why does he look so surprised?” Gu Zheng asked casually.","Qiao Xi said coquettishly, “Ah Zheng, it’s all because of you! We’ve been married for so long but you haven’t introduced me to Young Master Gu. He doesn’t seem to believe me!”","Gu Zheng smiled sarcastically. “When I entered, I already said that you’re Mrs. Gu. It’s just that with their IQs, they don’t understand and insist that I make myself clear. “Although they’re stupid, they’re still your family. I’ll let it slide.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked down at everyone. He announced loudly, “In that case, I’ll officially inform everyone that Qiao Xi is my wife and the mistress of the Gu family!”","Boom!!!","The Qiao family’s living room was silent for a moment. Then, as if it had been bombarded, the scene instantly erupted.","President Gu admitted it himself!","Old Madam Qiao’s face was ashen, and her old eyes instantly turned gray.","Everyone originally had a trace of doubt, but at this moment, they had no choice but to believe that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu. The faces of the Qiao and Zhong families were livid with resentment.","Gu Moling looked dispirited as if he had been betrayed. “Qiao Xi, how did you...”","Actually, he really liked Qiao Xi. She had outstanding beauty, figure, and the ability to manage the company. She would definitely be a good wife in the future, but everyone said that he was the young master of the Gu branch family and that Qiao Xi was not worthy of him. He should marry an even more outstanding woman.","Because Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside and did not receive any education or etiquette from high society, she would definitely be mocked if he brought her out to socialize."]},{"number":474,"title":"Chapter 474 - According To Seniority, I’m Your Aunt","paragraphs":["However, such a country bumpkin had actually married the honorable head of the Gu family and became the mistress of the Gu family. She was above the entire Gu family.","“Qiao Xi, tell me if this is true.”","“Gu Moling.” Qiao Xi glanced coldly at him, her eyes filled with warning. “According to seniority, Gu Zheng is your uncle and I’m your aunt, yet you’re calling me by my name in public. Is this your family’s upbringing?” Smack!","Before Gu Moling could react, Song Shiyu raised his hand and slapped him. He said coldly, “The Gu family has rules. Those who disrespect their elders will be punished according to the family rules. However, the family rules don’t apply here, so I’ll do it!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shiyu slapped Gu Moling again. Red finger marks appeared on his cheeks.","Qiao Xi turned around coldly and walked to the seat where Gu Zheng was sitting earlier. She slowly sat down in front of everyone, her aura fully released at this moment.","The main seat was usually Old Madam Qiao’s seat. If Old Madam Qiao was not around, it would be Qiao Zhenguo’s seat. However, this seat should have belonged to her mother. Everything in the Qiao family was earned by her mother. What right did the Qiao family have to squander it as they pleased?","If it were at any other time, someone would have stopped Qiao Xi if she dared to walk to the main seat. Moreover, she would receive a scolding. However, no one dared to stop her now.","She said casually, “Gu Zheng, I already told the Qiao family that I’m married, but they still asked me to get a divorce and marry into the Zhong family. They’re really not taking you seriously! Or do they think that the Zhong family... is more powerful than you? Do they think the Zhong family is richer and more powerful than the Gu family?”","The Qiao family, who were initially shocked, felt their hearts skip a beat. Song Shiyu looked at Qiao Xi in admiration. Mrs. Gu looked so satisfied when she was bullying others!","At this moment, the arrogant members of the Zhong family were like mice that had seen a cat. They lowered their heads silently, and their bodies trembled uncontrollably. “President Gu, we... It’s the Qiao family...”","Mr. Zhong did not care about his reputation anymore and immediately explained, “It’s the Qiao family! The Qiao family said that they wanted to sell their daughter to us. We didn’t know that Miss Qiao was already married. If we had known that Miss Qiao and you... were married, we wouldn’t have dared to get Qiao Xi to marry into the Qiao family! The Qiao family hid the truth and even forced Miss Qiao to marry my son!”","“Is that so?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Hearing Gu Zheng’s question, everyone’s faces turned pale.","Old Madam Qiao gritted her teeth and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","What kind of luck did this little b*tch have? She actually married Gu Zheng. Why didn’t she say so earlier? Why did she have to embarrass the Qiao family in front of everyone? She was really a b*tch!","Song Shijing sneered. “Mr. Zhong, you should know what will happen to you if you deceive our president. I advise you to tell the truth. Maybe our president won’t hold it against you if he’s in a happy mood. What do you think?”","Upon hearing this, Mr. Zhong could not take it anymore. His body went soft as he knelt on the floor.","“President Gu! I really didn’t know that Miss Qiao is Mrs. Gu! This is just a misunderstanding. I...” Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the sofa, his lips curling into a cold smile. A delicate dagger had appeared in his hand.","“But your son and wife didn’t say that just now. You seemed to want to bring Xi Xi back just now? What did you say you wanted to do to her?","“Tell me about it. Maybe... I’ll let you off.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. She remembered that Qiao Rou and Gu Moling had already held an engagement banquet a long time ago. Why did the Qiao family have to hold another banquet? Weren’t they just taking the opportunity to invite the Zhong family over to announce her marriage to Zhong Ming and sell her to the Zhong family?","Old Madam Qiao knew that Qiao Xi would never agree, so they definitely had other tricks up their sleeves. What were the Qiao family’s plans?","President Zhong recalled the unreasonable requests and humiliation his wife and son had given Qiao Xi earlier. They even said that Qiao Xi should serve their son well and wasn’t allowed to leave the house in the future. He felt that Gu Zheng would rush over and take his life in the next second.","“I-I just wanted Qiao Xi and my son to be engaged. The two of them aren’t... familiar with each other yet, so I wanted Qiao Xi to come back with us... as a guest. The Qiao family is vicious. For the sake of the company’s interests, they wanted to sell Qiao Xi to us!”"]},{"number":475,"title":"Chapter 475 - Punishment","paragraphs":["“President Gu, I’m telling the truth. Our Zhong family has no intention of offending Mrs. Gu. It was planned by the Qiao family. Today’s banquet was all their idea!”","Gu Zheng’s cold gaze landed on Old Madam Qiao.","Old Madam Qiao was terrified to the point her entire body trembled. She hurriedly retorted, “Nonsense! You took a liking to Qiao Xi and even lied to us, saying that Qiao Xi had a very good impression of Young Master Zhong. That’s why our Qiao family agreed to it. We only asked for a sum of money from your Zhong family for the sake of protecting Qiao","Xi!”","Her voice trembled as she was afraid of offending Gu Zheng.","“President Gu, you have to believe us!”","If President Gu believed them, he would definitely suspect that Qiao Xi was secretly in contact with Zhong Ming because of money. How could the dignified head of the Gu family tolerate his woman having an affair? He might just kick her away!","As soon as Old Madam Qiao finished speaking, Mr. Zhong slammed the table and stood up. He roared, “You damned old woman! What nonsense are you talking about?! My son only saw Mrs. Gu from afar. Miss Qiao doesn’t even know my son. I’ve never said such things!","“It was your Qiao family who sold Mrs. Gu to us for money. You even said that as long as the funds are in place, we can torture Mrs. Gu however we want. You’re the greedy ones. Why are you maligning our Zhong family?”","Old Madam Qiao roared, “Nonsense! I’m Xi Xi’s biological grandmother. How could I sell her for 200 million? I just wanted to find a good home for her!”","Mr. Zhong sneered. “You? Are you worthy of being Mrs. Gu’s grandmother? You—”. “Excuse me.” Song Shijing interrupted them indifferently, then said impatiently, “Do you think our president is very free? Does he have the time to listen to you quarrel?” The two of them instantly shut their mouths, afraid to say another word.","Then, Old Madam Qiao smiled obsequiously. “President Gu, I don’t want to waste your time, but what I said is the truth. Xi Xi is the eldest daughter of the Qiao family. Of course, I want her to find a good husband. It’s that boy from the Zhong family who insists that they’re in love with each other. I only agreed to this marriage for Xi Xi’s reputation. Moreover, the 200 million isn’t for us. It’s for Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","Previously, whenever Old Madam Qiao saw her, she would call her a b*tch. Now that she knew that she was married to Gu Zheng, she called her Xi Xi.","However, Gu Zheng clearly did not have the patience to listen to her explanation. He waved his hand to signal them to stop. Song Shijing said immediately, “Old Madam Qiao, Mr. Zhong, since you don’t want to tell the truth, don’t blame our president for being heartless.”","As he spoke, he took out a document from his briefcase and threw it on the table.","The paper at the top had the words ‘Sunshine Mall’ written on it. This was a mall under the Zhong family. Although it was not big, it was located in the center of Li City and had a lot of customers every day. Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the sofa, his long legs crossed. Song Shijing handed him a cigarette. Gu Zheng took it and lit it elegantly, filling the room with smoke.","The man was shrouded in smoke, adding a hint of danger to him.","Everyone held their breaths. The Zhong family’s hearts were pounding. Mr. Zhong asked in fear, “President Gu, I don’t understand what you mean.”","Gu Zheng pressed the cigarette onto the paper and said casually, “I gave you a chance, but you didn’t cherish it. This is your punishment.”","Punishment?","Before the Zhong family could react, Mr. Zhong’s phone suddenly rang. It was his secretary. “Mr. Zhong, I don’t know why Gu Corporation suddenly acquired Sunshine Mall by force. They’re now suppressing the company’s other businesses. If this goes on, we...”","Mr. Zhong was not in the mood to listen to what the secretary said after that. His mind was blank as his body fell to the floor. “President Gu!”","Everyone looked at this scene in disbelief. In just a few minutes, Sunshine Mall had been forcefully bought over by Gu Corporation. What kind of terrifying strength was this?!","Gu Zheng said slowly, “This is just a small punishment. I don’t want to push you into a dead-end. How about this? Whoever gives me an explanation that I’m satisfied with, I’ll let them off and make a move on the other party.”","He took out another piece of paper from the folder. On it was clearly written ‘Linglong Advertising Company’. It was a company under Qiao Rou’s name that had just been established."]},{"number":476,"title":"Chapter 476 - he Qiao And Zhong Families Are Fighting","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness as he glanced at Zhong Ming. “Don’t say that I didn’t give you a chance. Whoever gives me an explanation that satisfies me, I’ll destroy the other family instead. Otherwise...”","The man paused, and Song Shijing continued, “Young Master Zhong, otherwise, it’s your Zhong family that will be destroyed.”","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng with eyes filled with admiration. Bastard men were indeed capable. In this way, the Qiao and Zhong families would completely fall out. They would even fight each other. As expected, Old Madam Qiao frowned, while Qiao Rou’s face turned pale. Her body trembled slightly. “Grandma, I finally established the company...” Old Madam Qiao stared at Mr. Zhong with bloodshot eyes. Mr. Zhong also glared at her fiercely. He hurriedly said, “I’ll speak first!”","The matter was clearly planned by the Qiao family, but the Zhong family was the one who was implicated first. Sunshine Mall had already been forcefully bought over. This was completely unfair!","Mr. Zhong was afraid that Gu Zheng would destroy the foundation of his life in a fit of anger, so he hurriedly rushed in front of Gu Zheng and said, “I’ll tell you! I’ll tell you the truth! My son has taken a liking to Qiao Xi. Actually, they don’t even know each other, and they’re certainly not in love with each other. I was talking nonsense just now! I was wrong!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “What else?”","Mr. Zhong’s eyes were filled with horror. “I... We didn’t plan on bringing Qiao Xi back to the Qiao family as a guest today. We wanted to do it to ensure the success of the matter. That way, even if she’s unwilling to marry, she won’t be able to escape. However, my son... really likes Qiao Xi. We would naturally treat her well if she married into our family. If we had known that she was your wife, we would never have...”","“Burn it.”","Gu Zheng said calmly and gave the order. Song Shijing took out a lighter and lit up the paper that stated the words ‘Linglong Advertising Company’ on it. The next moment, Linglong Advertising Company was declared bankrupt.","Everyone gasped.","President Gu was indeed vicious!","“It... It was Qiao Rou who suggested it. If my son married Qiao Xi, she would torture Qiao Xi to death. Qiao Rou even said that Qiao Xi is good at serving others. My son has a small hobby, so he thought that Qiao Xi was outstanding in that aspect. President Gu, everything I said is true! Please let our Zhong family off!”","Zhong Ming and Madam Zhong’s faces were livid. If their family’s secret was revealed in public, they would be utterly embarrassed. How would they have the cheek to continue living in high society in the future?","Gu Zheng took out another piece of paper and lit it up with a lighter. This was because Mr. Zhong was still lying.","Mr. Zhong’s body trembled as fear spread throughout his body. He had only said a single lie when Gu Zheng discovered him.","“Mr. Gu, he’s spouting nonsense. We’re Qiao Xi’s relatives. How could we do this to her? You must not believe him!” Old Madam Qiao hurriedly shouted.","Gu Zheng took out a paper that stated the words ‘Qiao Corporation Fashion’ and crumpled it into a ball before throwing it on the floor.","Mr. Zhong’s voice trembled slightly. “It’s this damned old woman’s idea! She said that Qiao Xi definitely wouldn’t agree to go back with us, so she’d drug Qiao Xi. After the banquet ended, she would let us bring Qiao Xi back to the Zhong family. At that time, my son could do whatever he wanted to Qiao Xi. The old woman even... She even said that my son could play with her till she died!","“President Gu, if we had known that it was Mrs. Gu, we definitely wouldn’t have dared to have such thoughts. Moreover, this was all the Qiao family’s idea. We’ve been following their arrangements from the beginning. Please let us","off!”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily on the sofa and picked up another piece of paper. The words ‘Qiao family’ were written on it. He looked at Old Madam Qiao coldly. “Old Madam Qiao, what else do you want to say?”","Old Madam Qiao’s body went soft, and her eyes were filled with horror. “I-I... We did set up a trap today, but we’re Qiao Xi’s family. We wouldn’t harm her. Actually... it’s for her own good. President Gu, we really didn’t know that Qiao Xi married you. If this child had told us earlier, we wouldn’t have been so anxious to arrange a marriage for her. You...”","Before Old Madam Qiao could finish, Song Shijing burned the document. Old Madam Qiao’s heart was about to jump out of her chest.","If this continued..."]},{"number":477,"title":"Chapter 477 - One After The Other","paragraphs":["Song Shijing reminded her indifferently. “Old Madam Qiao, let me remind you that if you don’t tell the truth, you can’t blame our president for being vicious. There aren’t many companies left under the Qiao family’s name. There are only three more. Let me tell you again, we won’t touch the companies left behind by Madam Xia Yunqiu. After all, those companies were left behind by Young Madam’s mother. They’re the hard work of our president’s mother-in-law. Those companies will be left to Young Madam in the future.”","“But the Qiao family...” Song Shijing looked regretful. “President, I’m afraid Old Madam Qiao won’t tell the truth. There’s nothing left in the Qiao family. Everything will probably be destroyed after we burn a few more documents. How boring.”","Old Madam Qiao’s body swayed and she almost fell to the floor. Then, she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and forcefully endured the anger in her heart. “Xi Xi, the Qiao family is your home too!”","“Old Madam Qiao, our president’s time is limited. If you continue to delay and anger the president, your Qiao family will lose everything!” Old Madam Qiao’s face turned pale, while her heart thumped violently. Qiao Xi, that little b*tch! Why didn’t she tell her family that she had married Gu Zheng? Shouldn’t she take the initiative to give the Qiao family a sum of money to tide over the difficult times and bring benefits to the family?","“Old Madam Qiao, our president just wants to know the truth. Why did you want our young madam to marry Young Master Zhong? Was it just for that sum of money? If it was for money, you have so many other options. Why did you have to choose to marry Young Madam to the sadistic Zhong Ming? Or is Mr. Zhong telling the truth? Did the Qiao family want Young Master Zhong to torture our young madam to death?”","Old Madam Qiao was shocked. “No, no! He’s spouting nonsense!”","Then, the flames burned again. A piece of paper turned to ashes, which also meant that one more of the Qiao family’s businesses had gone under.","Old Madam Qiao felt like she had a fishbone stuck in her throat. She forcefully endured the rage in her heart and hurriedly explained, “We didn’t intend to torture Xi Xi to death. We just thought that Xi Xi’s character was too stubborn, so we wanted to...”","Song Shijing took out another document. The lighter was lit up, and the paper was burnt to ashes.","“Stop burning! I’ll tell you the truth!”","The Qiao family’s phones rang one after another. Their subordinates were anxiously asking for help. Gu Corporation was suppressing the Qiao family’s businesses. Some went directly bankrupt, while others were forcefully bought over. If this continued, Qiao Corporation would disappear from Li City.","Old Madam Qiao’s eyes were bloodshot. She was going crazy. She stared at the lighter in Song Shijing’s hand. If she did not tell the truth, Gu Zheng would destroy the entirety of Qiao Corporation.","This could not continue!","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and his eyes were calm. However, the aura he exuded made one shudder and feel reverence.","At this moment, everyone present did not say anything. They were afraid that if they angered President Gu, he would use the same method to deal with them.","Seeing the Qiao family’s businesses getting destroyed one after the other, Old Madam Qiao almost went crazy. “I’ll say it now! It was Rou Rou. This was all Rou Rou’s idea!”","Qiao Rou’s heart skipped a beat.","Song Shiyu had a mocking look on his face. “Miss Qiao Rou, didn’t you say it was all for the sake of our young madam? You suggested this marriage because you wanted someone to take care of her. You made it sound as though our young madam would be letting you down if she refused! You pretend to be gentle and sensible, but in reality, you’re trying to kill our young madam!”","Gu Moling looked at Qiao Rou in disbelief.","Song Shiyu continued to attack her. “Second Miss Qiao is indeed the daughter of a mistress. She’s so pretentious! She sold our wife to Zhong Ming just to torture her to death!”","The entire venue was silent as everyone watched this scene in disbelief.","Qiao Rou took a few steps back and hurriedly retorted, “Sister, I didn’t do that! I know you still hate me, but Brother Moling and I are about to get married. What else do you want?!”","Immediately after, another document was burned to ashes.","Qiao Rou widened her eyes and stared at the ashes on the floor. “I... I didn’t do it. I didn’t do it. Don’t burn it, don’t burn it! I didn’t do it!”","Gu Zheng shot him a look, and Song Shijing continued to burn the documents.","Seeing that there were not many documents left, Old Madam Qiao felt her heart stop."]},{"number":478,"title":"Chapter 478 - Qiao Rou Was Beaten Up","paragraphs":["Qiao Rou shed tears aggrievedly. “I’m so good to my sister. Why would I harm her? Although she doesn’t like me and even ruined my career, I don’t blame her at all. I just hope that my sister can let go of the grudge. “President Gu, it’s true that my mother is a mistress, but my mother and I have already atoned for our sins for so many years. However, my sister still refuses to forgive me. I’m tired now too. I just hope that my sister won’t create trouble anymore. The Qiao family really can’t take it anymore!”","When Qiao Rou said these words, she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi as if she was warning her.","Then, she turned to look at Gu Zheng with a pitiful face. “President Gu, I really didn’t hurt my sister. On the contrary, my sister is the one who has been targeting me. I can’t do anything about it either.”","Gu Zheng frowned, picked up the lighter, and lit all the documents. Flames flashed in his cold eyes.","At the same time, the Qiao family’s phones started ringing. Bad news came one after another. The living room was in a mess.","Qiao Rou trembled but still refused to admit it. “President Gu, everything I said is true. My sister is framing me. I really didn’t do it... I was wronged!” “Qiao Rou! Shut up!” At this moment, the Qiao family finally could not sit still anymore. They roared, “You little b*tch! You caused the Qiao family’s company to fall into a predicament after the incident with the donation to Li City University. Now, it’s because of you that the company is in trouble. It’s already come to this, yet you’re still being stubborn!”","“That’s right!” The people from the Qiao family’s third branch rushed over and shouted, “Qiao Rou, you wanted to use the Zhong family to kill Qiao Xi. If you don’t admit it, the Qiao family’s business will all be gone. How can our family continue to live?!”","“Old Madam! If this goes on, the Qiao family will be ruined! We can’t let the entire Qiao family die with Qiao Rou!”","Gu Zheng was not only attacking the companies of the Qiao family but also the shares of the Qiao family’s relatives and friends. These people slammed the table and stood up. They were not willing to pay for Qiao Rou’s mistake.","Old Madam Qiao was instantly infuriated. “Are you rebelling?! Shut up!”","Old Madam Qiao’s third son was indignant. “Mom! For Qiao Rou, are you going to watch the Qiao family’s foundation be destroyed? It doesn’t matter if your family loses a few companies. After all, you still have Sister-in-law Yunqiu’s inheritance. You definitely won’t lack money, but we only have the shares of those companies in our hands. We depend on that money to live! If we lose those companies, what will we do? In order to protect a granddaughter, will you bear to see us die? “Qiao Rou! Hurry up and admit it! You’re the one who wanted to kill Xi Xi. You’ve always been jealous of Xi Xi’s identity as the Qiao family’s eldest daughter. You’ve been targeting her since she was young and have tried to kill her time and again. I really don’t know how my brother gave birth to such a vicious daughter like you!”","“I... I didn’t!” Qiao Rou gritted her teeth and refused to admit it. Then, she turned to look at the man behind her. “Brother Moling, you believe me, right?”","Gu Moling lowered his eyes and did not say a word.","The Qiao family’s company was destroyed because of Qiao Rou. What was even more infuriating was that even at this time, Old Madam Qiao was still unwilling to let Qiao Rou confess.","As this concerned everyone’s interests, they immediately flared up. They did not care about their reputations or identities anymore. They roared, “Qiao Rou! Admit it!”","With the first person stepping forward, the others also stood up indignantly. A few women rushed up and grabbed Qiao Rou’s hair. “Little b*tch! Admit it! Why won’t you admit it? Are you going to destroy the Qiao family?! You jinx!”","The Qiao family’s third branch family’s shares were all in those companies. Now that they were all destroyed, they did not dare to look for trouble with Gu Zheng. Naturally, they vented all their anger and resentment on Qiao Rou.","“You’re so f*cking shameless! You’re as cheap as your mother! You’re a b*tch who was born to be a mistress!”","The few women rushed over and grabbed Qiao Rou’s arm tightly, slapping her hard. They cursed, “Little b*tch! Admit it! If you don’t, We’ll beat you to death!”","Qiao Rou was pressed to the floor. Her face was red and swollen. She was wearing a high-end dress, but she was kneeling in front of Qiao Xi in a sorry state."]},{"number":479,"title":"Chapter 479 - Kneel And Apologize","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi smiled lightly as she finally managed to vent out her anger.","Now that she was Mrs. Gu, these people’s looks toward her had changed. It was good to have power!","Qiao Rou’s cheeks burned as tears fell uncontrollably.","“It’s fine that you caused Qiao Zhenguo’s company’s capital chain to crack, but you also caused us to lose our shares! Kneel down and admit that you did it. Otherwise, we won’t let you off!”","The few of them pressed Qiao Rou to the floor and snatched all the valuable jewelry on her. Qiao Rou had always been prideful and would wear the most expensive jewelry to every banquet, so the jewelry on her body was very valuable.","Qiao Rou resisted with all her might. Unfortunately, how could she deal with a few middle-aged women alone? She was even slapped twice.","Xu Mei went forward to stop them, but she was also pressed to the floor and had her jewelry snatched away. The mother and daughter were kneeling on the floor in a sorry state. Their clothes were disheveled, and their hair was a mess. It was as if they had been robbed.","Qiao Xi watched this scene coldly, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly.","Back then, this group of people had all stood by Qiao Rou’s side. They said that although Qiao Rou was an illegitimate daughter, she was the Qiao family’s lucky star. On the surface, Qiao Xi was the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, but she was a country bumpkin. Moreover, she was useless. They said that she did not know the etiquette of high society.","Those people gathered together to steal her jewelry, clothes, assets, and even chased her to the basement. Now, Qiao Rou was having a taste of what it was like being abused.","Everyone in the Qiao family cried out. “Xi Xi... Xi Xi, we’ve already helped you deal with this little b*tch. Let us go! Don’t destroy the Qiao family’s company. We... We’ll get Qiao Rou to kowtow to you! Alright?”","As they spoke, they grabbed Qiao Rou’s hair and slammed her head onto the floor.","Bang! Bang! After getting her head knocked against the floor twice, Qiao Rou felt dizzy. The skin on her forehead hurt and blood dripped onto the floor.","However, everyone did not care about her life at all. Everyone was berating her and forcing her to kowtow to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou knelt on the floor, her entire body trembling. Her fingers covered the wound on her forehead as she felt the coldness around her body. It was true that she wanted to kill Qiao Xi, but it was because that woman was always in her way. If she had known that it would be so troublesome, she would have dealt with Qiao Xi earlier.","She originally wanted to officially announce her marriage with Gu Moling at the banquet today, but everything was ruined now. Everyone was criticizing her, and she wished she could die now.","This should not have happened. She was the one who was marrying into a rich family, while Qiao Xi was only worthy of marrying a poor man. Now, it was uncertain whether she could still marry into the Gu family, while Qiao Xi was married to the supreme head of the Gu family!","“Qiao Rou! Admit it! Admit it!”","Qiao Rou’s body was violently shaking, and she almost fainted. She was angry and unwilling, but she was too weak to resist.","Everyone pressed her head down and made her kneel in front of Qiao Xi. She was forced to kowtow to Qiao Xi over and over again.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Do you hear that? Qiao Rou, aren’t you going to apologize?” Old Madam Qiao and Xu Mei were sobbing uncontrollably. They came forward to stop her. “Let go of Rou Rou. Her body is weak. She can’t take it! Ah-!”","Everyone did not dare to hit Old Madam Qiao, but Xu Mei was just a mistress. Moreover, she had not married Qiao Zhenguo. Everyone naturally would not let her off. They pressed her to the floor and slapped her a few times.","The scene was extremely chaotic. The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up as he looked at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, are you happy?”","Qiao Xi nodded, but she had no intention of stopping the scene.","“Gu Moling, you’re a descendant of the Gu family. I should spare you this one time, but Qiao Rou is your fiancee. You can’t shirk responsibility for her mistakes. If she’s unwilling to apologize, then you...”","Gu Zheng paused for a moment and slowly said, “...shouldn’t even think about living well.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s warning, Gu Moling’s body instantly trembled.","Song Shijing understood at once and announced loudly, “I’m afraid you didn’t hear what our president just said. I’ll repeat it. If Miss Qiao Rou doesn’t apologize to our young madam in two minutes, then the Qiao family...”","Without needing Song Shijing to continue, the Qiao family knew what the consequences would be. They shook Qiao Rou with all their might and said vicious words."]},{"number":480,"title":"Chapter 480 - Spat Blood Out And Fainted","paragraphs":["Qiao Rou could taste blood in her mouth, and she spat out a mouthful of it. Then, she gritted her teeth tightly. She would not apologize, and she would absolutely not lower her head in front of Qiao Xi.","Gu Moling ordered, “Apologize!”","Qiao Rou shook her head aggrievedly. “Brother Moling, I don’t want to! Could it be that you don’t love me anymore? Don’t do this... Please don’t force me. Qiao Xi wronged me. Why should I apologize?!”","Song Shijing was already counting down. “It’s fine if you don’t want to apologize, Miss Qiao. Gu Moling and the Qiao family will just have to pay the price for your stubbornness! Ten... Nine...”","When Qiao Rou looked up, she saw that everyone was looking at her fiercely. With their bloodshot eyes, it seemed they could not wait to poke holes in her. Those people, including her parents, grandmother, and Gu Moling, were all looking at her angrily. No one was willing to speak up for her.","“Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi! You b*tch! You did this to me! If I knew earlier, I would have killed you back then! I would have drowned you!”","“Four... Three...” Song Shijing’s voice was like a curse from hell.","Back then, the person who knelt on the floor and was bullied was Qiao Xi. Why was it her now?","It was unknown who kicked Qiao Rou from behind. Her body was weak to begin with, so this kick knocked her down. Everyone’s roars could be heard. “Apologize!”","“Two...”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “I won’t force you if you’re unwilling to apologize. Ah Zheng, do as you deem fit.”","“Qiao Rou!","A furious roar sounded. Gu Moling’s mother aggressively rushed over and grabbed Qiao Rou’s hair. She slapped her already red and swollen cheek. After a few slaps, blood was already seeping out of the corner of Qiao Rou’s mouth.","“You b*tch! Hurry up and apologize to Xi Xi! Because of you, Moling’s company has already been declared bankrupt. Moling Corporation is gone, do you know that?! This is all your fault!","“You did something wrong and are unwilling to apologize for it! Apologize to Xi Xi right now!”","“Go to hell! B*tch! You good-for-nothing! B*tch!” Gu Moling’s mother grabbed Qiao Rou’s hair and smashed her head against the floor with a bang Gu Moling’s mother had once looked down on Qiao Xi. Even though Qiao Xi had founded Moling Corporation, she was never kind to Qiao Xi. As far as she was concerned, Qiao Xi was just a daughter who was abandoned by the Qiao family and was utterly not worthy of her son.","Now, she was even more vicious to Qiao Rou than she was to Qiao Xi back then.","Qiao Rou was disheartened.","Those people who used to smile at her now abandoned her and even wanted to beat her to death!","Qiao Rou’s head kept hitting the floor. The skin on her forehead was already numb and she could not feel any pain. Her pale lips trembled slightly. “I’m sorry...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Are you talking to me?”","Gu Moling’s mother did not like Qiao Xi in the past and thought that Qiao Rou was obedient and sensible. Moreover, the Qiao family’s business would be handed to Qiao Rou in the future, so she wanted to make things difficult for Qiao Xi time and again. However, she had a flattering expression on her face now.","“Xi Xi, she’s already kowtowed to you and apologized. Look...”","Gu Moling’s mother raised her hand and slapped Qiao Rou again.","Qiao Rou’s eyes were bloodshot as she suppressed her anger. “I was wrong. I shouldn’t... shouldn’t have harmed you. I-I’m sorry.” “Sister, is this your way of apologizing? If you’re unwilling, I won’t force you. Why don’t you let Old Madam Qiao teach you how to apologize?”","Qiao Xi’s icy-cold gaze landed on Old Madam Qiao. Old Madam Qiao’s expression changed. “Qiao Xi, I’m your grandmother!”","On the other hand, Qiao Rou opened her mouth and spat out a mouthful of blood. She felt a splitting headache and fainted.","However, no one was willing to help her up. Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei stood there coldly and did not dare to move. They were afraid that Gu Zheng would vent his anger on them, so they lowered their heads and tried their best to blend into the background.","Gu Moling finally heaved a sigh of relief. Fortunately, Qiao Rou had apologized to Qiao Xi before she fainted. Qiao Xi should be appeased now. Moreover, Qiao Xi still had him in her heart. She would not make things difficult for him.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Old Madam Qiao, don’t be nervous. I’m a junior, after all. I don’t intend for you to apologize to me, but I have something to say to you.”"]},{"number":481,"title":"Chapter 481 - Her Dowry","paragraphs":["Old Madam Qiao heaved a sigh of relief and pretended to be loving. “Xi Xi, look, Rou Rou has already paid the price. Her face and body are covered in injuries. Moreover, Rou Rou and Moling can’t get married anymore. You should calm down!”","Seeing that the matter had escalated to this point, the guests had long wanted to leave. However, because Gu Zheng was sitting there, no one dared to take that first move.","Under the burning gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi said casually, “When my mother married into the Qiao family, she had a dowry. I heard that Madam Xu Mei wants to use it as Qiao Rou’s dowry and bring it to Gu Moling’s family?”","Hearing this, Xu Mei’s heart skipped a beat as she turned pale with fright. “Xi Xi, I... I thought...”","Qiao Zhenguo looked at Gu Zheng’s gloomy eyes and hurriedly walked forward. He explained while trembling, “Xi Xi, don’t... misunderstand! We’re not trying to take the dowry for ourselves, but... Now that there’s a problem with the Qiao family’s company, we can’t fork out the money for now. Rou Rou is about to get married, and the person she wants to marry is the young master of the Gu family, so we wanted to borrow your mother’s dowry first. When the Qiao family recovers, we’ll return the dowry to you.”","“Heh.” Qiao Xi sneered. “But Qiao Rou and Gu Moling aren’t getting married anymore. Shouldn’t this dowry be returned to its rightful owner, then?”","Qiao Zhenguo frowned as cold sweat broke out on his back. Xu Mei’s face was filled with horror as well. The two of them felt a chill run down their spines.","Qiao Zhenguo lowered his head and did not say anything. The dowry left behind by Xia Yunqiu was not worth a small amount. It was comparable to the net worth of several Qiao families.","Now that the Qiao family’s company was gone, they could only rely on the assets and companies left behind by Xia Yunqiu to make a comeback. If they did not have those, they would be in trouble.","Moreover, this dowry had always been in his hands. It had already been so many years, so why should he give it to Qiao Xi just because she wanted it back?","Qiao Zhenguo looked troubled, but if he did not agree, President Gu would not let him off easily. He might even lose his life!","“Father seems to be... unwilling! My younger sister and I are both daughters of the Qiao family. When she was getting, you were afraid that she would be aggrieved and were willing to give my mother’s dowry to her. Now that you’ve found out I’m married, why can’t you give this dowry to me? Moreover, this dowry belongs to me. There’s nothing wrong with giving it to me!”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “I’ve already married into the Gu family, so how can I not have a dowry? In your eyes, Gu Zheng can’t compare to Gu Moling, huh? Is that why you think there’s no need to give me a dowry?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes and stared coldly at Qiao Zhenguo. Qiao Zhenguo’s face instantly turned pale as he said helplessly, “Xi Xi, that’s your mother’s dowry. Logically speaking, I should give it to you, but...”","Qiao Zhenguo looked troubled. It was as if there was a huge pressure behind him, and his body was trembling slightly.","“But you know how difficult it is for the Qiao family right now. We really need this money to make a comeback. Moreover, your mother has been dead for so many years. She left you behind, and the Qiao family has been taking care of you. You also know that raising a child requires a lot of money. Although she’s dead, she still has the responsibility to raise you. She should pay the child support fees.”","Qiao Zhenguo turned to look at Gu Zheng and smiled obsequiously. “President Gu, how would we dare to patronize you?! It’s just that Xi Xi didn’t tell us that she has gotten married. Otherwise, I would definitely have given her the dowry. I thought that Xi Xi wouldn’t be able to use the dowry for the time being, so I planned to give it to Rou Rou first. I didn’t expect Xi Xi to have already married you.","“Moreover, President Gu, you also know that the Qiao family has been in turmoil all these years. The assets and dowry Yun Qiu left behind have all been used to fill the gaps. Xi Xi now wants me to hand over all the dowry. I really... can’t do it!”","The guests nodded thoughtfully. Actually, Qiao Zhenguo was right. The dowry was Xia Yunqiu’s premarital assets, but the two of them had been married for so many years. Moreover, Xia Yunqiu had also passed away for so many years. This sum of money should be given to Qiao Zhenguo. Moreover, Qiao Zhenguo had also been taking care of Qiao Xi’s basic necessities. This was quite a large sum. It seemed to be slightly inappropriate for the Qiao family to give it all away.","Seeing that everyone nodded affirmatively, Qiao Zhenguo’s expression softened."]},{"number":482,"title":"Chapter 482 - Godparents’ Support","paragraphs":["“I spent a lot of money raising you. I couldn’t bear the burden alone, so... I spent a portion of your mother’s dowry on you. If you want all of it back, I really can’t do it!” Qiao Zhenguo tried his best to persuade her. “Xi Xi, actually, I’ve always had high hopes for you all these years. I know you hate Xu Mei and Rou Rou. That’s why I haven’t let Xu Mei formally join the Qiao family. It’s just that this is Rou Rou’s engagement banquet, so I let her come back. However, you fell out with the Qiao family over such a small matter. How can I hand the Qiao family to you?","“Xi Xi, I’m your father. Although we’ve had some misunderstandings, you’ll always be my daughter. You can’t... quarrel with your family like this. It won’t be good for your reputation either. Tell me...”","At this moment, footsteps came from outside. Gu Zheng slowly looked up. “Mr. Qin, Madam Qin, please come in.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before abruptly turning around.","At this moment, an elegant noblewoman and her husband were standing at the door. The two of them were dressed exquisitely with faint smiles on their lips. Under everyone’s gazes, they slowly walked in. Qin Xian swept his gaze around and looked gently at Qiao Xi. Then, he walked in front of Gu Zheng and nodded slightly. The two of them greeted each other.","Madam Qin, who was beside him, was dressed fashionably. She had supple skin and a proud figure. She wore a sparkling sapphire necklace on her neck and exuded the charm of a mature woman. If one did not say it, who would know that she was Qin An’s mother?","Madam Qin’s aura was fully released. Her red lips moved slightly. “President Qiao, the two of us are here today to tell you that Xi Xi’s family isn’t the Qiao family!”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised and hurriedly walked over to Gu Zheng’s side. She lowered her voice and asked, “You reached out to them?”","Madam Qin raised her head arrogantly and glanced at the Qiao family coldly. Then, she sneered. “President Qiao, I heard you outside the door just now. You said that you used Madam Xia’s assets to raise Xi Xi. That’s reasonable. After all, Qiao Xi isn’t your only daughter. Madam Xia should pay a portion of the child support fees, but are you sure you really spent your money on Qiao Xi?” Gu Zheng turned his head and said in Qiao Xi’s ear, “I was the one who asked them to support you. Are you surprised?”","DI","Qiao Xi hurriedly nodded. This was truly a pleasant surprise! “You said that the Qiao family’s business isn’t doing well, so how did Xu Mei have the spare money to buy jewelry? I heard that Madam Xu spent more than ten million yuan in a jewelry store once. Who exactly does this money belong to? I think everyone knows it very well.”","Qiao Zhenguo’s face instantly turned livid. “You... Who are you? What does my conversation with my daughter have to do with","you?”","Madam Qin ignored him and walked up to Xu Mei. She raised her hand and slapped her hard, then tore off a necklace from her neck.","“Everyone, take a good look. This necklace is HT’s new model. It’s a custom-made piece. The price is about ten million yuan. Madam Xu seems to have bought more than this. “President Qiao, you said that you spent a lot of money to raise Xi Xi, but from what I know, you didn’t raise Xi Xi at all. The Qiao family abandoned her in the countryside and let her fend for herself. They even let an illegitimate daughter occupy her identity and assets. Now, they even want to give Madam Xia’s dowry to an illegitimate daughter. Do you think we’re all stupid?”","Qiao Xi ran over to Madam Qin and shouted happily, “Godmother! Godfather!”","“My good daughter!” Madam Qin raised her eyebrows and looked at Qiao Zhenguo with disdain. “I’m sorry, President Qiao. Qiao Xi is my daughter. You’re not worthy of being her father! You took Xi Xi’s assets and raised your mistress and illegitimate daughter. How dare you bargain here? Hurry up and return the dowry to Xi Xi!”","As soon as she finished speaking, she walked in front of Qiao Zhenguo with anger radiating from all over her body and rolled her eyes. “President Qiao, you dote on your illegitimate daughter but mistreat the daughter of the legitimate wife. You even let Qiao Rou malign Xi Xi. Is this how you are as a father?”","“And Old Madam Qiao, you forced Xi Xi to break up with Gu Moling for the sake of an illegitimate daughter. You didn’t care at all that Xi Xi and Gu Moling were engaged a long time ago. Why should Xi Xi give in? As Xi Xi’s grandmother, you’re biased toward an illegitimate daughter. Are you worthy to be Xi Xi’s grandmother?”"]},{"number":483,"title":"Chapter 483 - Everyone Kicks A Man Who Is Down","paragraphs":["Madam Qin’s eyes were filled with anger as she said to Qiao Xi, “Xi Xi, don’t be afraid. Godmother will stand up for you. I’m here to see who dares to bully you!”","With that said, everyone discussed softly.","“They’re from the Qin family in the capital!”","Madam Qin’s words were sharp. “You still want Xi Xi’s assets? Does your Qiao family have any shame?! The person who gave birth to Xi Xi was Madam Xia Yunqiu, and the person who raised Xi Xi was our Qin family. What right do you have to ask for money?”","“You!” Old Madam Qiao’s face was red from embarrassment. The servants beside her helped her stand up.","“Now, Qiao Xi’s backer is our Qin family, and there’s also the supremely powerful President Gu. I’ll tell you clearly today! The Qiao family can forget about taking a single cent from Xi Xi!”","The guests started whispering when they heard this. “So, Qiao Xi was adopted by the Qin family. No wonder she managed to get married to President Gu. It looks like they’ve known each other since they were young.”","“In my opinion, the Qiao family is in the wrong here. Although I have business dealings with the Qiao family, I have to be fair about this. Moreover, the Qiao family’s relatives have all been implicated now. If we still stand on the Qiao family’s side, we’ll definitely be implicated as well.”","Qiao Zhenguo pursed his lips tightly, his face livid. Just as he was about to retort, his friend, who had always been close to him, spoke first.","“President Qiao, I think Madam Qin is right. Mrs. Gu was abandoned when she was young. It was Madam Qin who raised her. As a father, you didn’t fulfill your responsibility to raise her. You... You don’t have the right to take Madam Xia’s dowry. I advise you to return the dowry to Mrs. Gu!”","Qiao Zhenguo immediately swallowed his words.","Gu Zheng sat on the sofa and smiled meaningfully. Now, those who were close to the Qiao family in the past could not wait to cut ties with the Qiao family.","“President Qiao, I didn’t expect you to abandon your biological daughter and let an illegitimate daughter squander Sister Yunqiu’s inheritance. You even chased Qiao Xi to the countryside. You’re too heartless as a father!”","“That’s right! We were wrong to believe that President Qiao was a loyal person. You’re so heartless to your own daughter, let alone us. You might scam us of a sum of money one day, so I’ve decided not to have any more dealings with the Qiao family!”","“We have to cut off all ties with the Qiao family!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s body went limp, and he swayed so much that he was about to faint. Old Madam Qiao gritted her teeth, but in the face of supreme power, she was powerless to retort.","The guests all denounced the Qiao family and declared that they would cut ties with them.","Actually, they did not think that Qiao Zhenguo was that heartless. It was just that he had offended Gu Zheng’s wife. This group of people naturally wanted to take the opportunity to curry favor with Gu Zheng, so they all reprimanded Qiao Zhenguo.","uu","At this moment, Qiao Xi slowly stood up from the main seat and said coldly, “I presume everyone knows that this villa was left behind by my mother. I should have been the one to inherit it, but it’s been occupied by the Qiao family for so many years. They even stole the jewelry and company my mother left for me. It’s time for them to return everything to me!”","With that said, everyone forced Qiao Zhenguo to hand over his late wife’s inheritance.","Qiao Zhenguo’s face darkened as he glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “You... Qiao Xi! You...”","“What about me?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and smiled sarcastically. Then, she walked in front of Xu Mei and tore off a crystal bracelet from her hand.","“Madam Xu, you’ve been borrowing this bracelet for so many years. It’s time to return it to me!”","Everyone cursed in succession. “The Qiao family willingly accepting a mistress means that they’re not good people. This pair of mother and daughter are two-faced b*tches. They pretend to be gentle and weak on the surface, but they actually stole Qiao Xi’s things behind her back. They even made use of others to try and kill her!”","“President Qiao, I really don’t know what you’re thinking. How could you like such a b*tch?”","“Mrs. Gu is right. Zhenguo, you’ve been occupying her villa for so many years. She doesn’t have any other requests. She just wants you to return what rightfully belongs to her. You’d better leave with the Qiao family!”","“I was wondering how the Qiao family could afford such a big villa. It turns out that it was bought by Madam Xia! President Qiao, this villa is not yours to begin with. It’s not appropriate for you to let your mistress and your illegitimate daughter stay here, right?”"]},{"number":484,"title":"Chapter 484 - The Qiao Family Was Chased Away","paragraphs":["The guests were all the Qiao family’s relatives and friends. Now, they did not care about their relationship with the Qiao family anymore. They were afraid that Gu Zheng would take his anger out on them because of the Qiao family, so they quickly distanced themselves from the Qiao family.","Once one person started to criticize, everyone started cursing along.","President Gu had personally come today because he wanted the Qiao family to be abandoned and lose everything. If Mrs. Gu was satisfied, she naturally would not look for trouble with them.","Qiao Zhenguo was indeed a scumbag. Everything he had now belonged to Xia Yunqiu. Unexpectedly, after Xia Yunqiu died, he threw Qiao Xi to the countryside and even took Xia Yunqiu’s money to support his mistress and illegitimate daughter. Such a person should not have a good ending.","Qiao Zhenguo lowered his head, his body trembling violently. Why did Qiao Xi marry Gu Zheng? Why did she bring Gu Zheng back with her? Why was she forcing them to leave the villa?","Bang!","Someone threw a bottle over and smashed it heavily on Qiao Zhenguo’s head. A wound instantly appeared on his forehead, and blood slowly gushed out.","“Qiao Zhenguo, you’ve implicated us! Get lost!”","Someone made a move. Everyone instantly swarmed over and pushed the Qiao family out.","Old Madam Qiao’s legs were weak to begin with, and she was almost pushed down. She instantly roared. “Let go! This is our Qiao family’s villa! What right—”.","“Old hag! You still have the cheek to say that this is the Qiao family’s villa?! This is Madam Xia’s pre-marital assets. What right does the Qiao family have to stay here? Hurry up and get lost! You’re an eyesore standing here!”","Although the Qiao family was not considered a top family in Li City, ever since they inherited Xia Yunqiu’s company and assets, they were considered a reputable family. When had Old Madam Qiao ever heard such insults? Her expression instantly darkened as she roared with a ferocious expression. “Qiao Xi! I’m your grandmother, yet you’re actually chasing us out! You unfilial granddaughter! Unfilial...”","Her shouts gradually disappeared from the living room. She was pushed out by everyone. The walking cane in her hand fell to the floor, and she staggered.","The commotion was so big that the neighbors beside them also came out to watch the show. They discussed among themselves. “I heard that the Qiao family’s old madam is a crafty person who abuses her biological granddaughter. Now, she has received her retribution! How embarrassing!”","The anger in Madam Qin’s heart had yet to dissipate. “Qiao Xi belongs to the Qin family, but this old woman from the Qiao family even dares to bully her. Does she think the Qin family is easy to bully?”","Qin Xian was gentle like jade and had a mild temper. He was naturally not as shrewish as Madam Qin. He only said indifferently, “I’ll help Xi Xi...”","Before he could finish, Madam Qin said angrily, “What’s the name of that illegitimate daughter? Qiao Rou, right?! I heard she’s a small celebrity. No wonder Little Six doesn’t want to live with the Qiao family. What kind of demons are they?!”","After the Qiao family was chased out, the Qiao family’s living room instantly became much more spacious. Even the air became fresher.","Song Shijing came forward to clear the scene. The guests did not dare to delay and quickly left. Qiao Xi and the others were the only ones left in the Qiao family’s villa.","Madam Qin had her hands on her hips as she looked at Qin An and Qin Xian. She frowned, scaring the two of them. “I won’t count on you two anymore. I’ll tell my eldest son about this.”","Qin Xian: “...”","He smiled slightly. “Wifey, I’ll teach Qiao Zhenguo a lesson. How can I let him off since he dares to bully our daughter? In the future, wherever our Qin family is, the Qiao family must hide.”","Qin An also nodded. “I’ll also help Little Six. I’ll definitely not let anyone who dares to bully my sister off. However, if I kill them, it’ll be too easy for them. I’ll definitely let them taste the pain of being tortured!”","At this moment, the call connected. Mrs. Qin complained on the phone. The other party was silent for a few seconds, then she heard a clear laugh. “Haha, someone’s bullying Little Six. Alright, I’ll go back immediately.” After the call ended, Qin An said aggrievedly, “Brother is coming back? When you found out that Little Six was bullied, you rushed over. Brother is coming back too? If I was the one who got bullied, you definitely wouldn’t care this much about me!”","Madam Qin smacked him. “Shut up!”","An hour later, the Qin family left, but Gu Yao came.","Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa, talking on the phone with someone. His thin lips moved slightly. “Reassess.”","Qiao Xi looked at him curiously."]},{"number":485,"title":"Chapter 485 - No Blood Relationship","paragraphs":["After hanging up, Gu Zheng’s face was serious. “I previously sent someone to investigate Qiao Zhenguo, and we found out a secret. Before he married Mother-in-law, he was injured once. That part of his body was injured.”","Gu Zheng slowly stood up and leaned closer. “Actually, there’s a possibility that you’re not Qiao Zhenguo’s biological daughter.” Qiao Xi frowned. “Actually, I’ve long suspected this possibility, but I previously took Qiao Zhenguo’s hair and did a paternity test. The test report says that we’re related by blood. Actually, it doesn’t matter if he’s my biological father or not. In any case, he has nothing to do with me anymore.”","“But Qiao Rou...”","The apple of Qiao Zhenguo’s eye, Qiao Rou, was not his biological daughter either. Could it be that Xu Mei had cheated on him?","This news was too explosive!","Gu Zheng said awkwardly, “I think he has lost his ability to procreate, so she shouldn’t be related to him by blood.”","What? Qiao Zhenguo was infertile?","Qiao Xi had guessed that she was not Qiao Zhenguo’s biological daughter, but she did not expect that Qiao Zhenguo was unable to procreate at all. This had indeed caused her to be slightly shocked.","Gu Yao lowered his head.","It would be good if he was not related to the Gu family by blood. This way, he would not be the son of Huang Lilan and Gu Weiming. He could continue to be Gu Zheng’s younger brother and even be more carefree than now.","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Since Gu Zheng was so sure, it meant that he had already obtained an official DNA report. However, why did it show that they were father and daughter when she took Qiao Zhenguo’s hair to be tested back then?","Qiao Xi’s eyes sank. What exactly was the secret behind this?","Gu Yao hurriedly said excitedly, “Qiao Xi, you’re not Qiao Zhenguo’s daughter! I knew it! How could such a wretched family be related to you?!”","“Qiao Xi, are you going to ask why the DNA test said that you did state you and Qiao Zhenguo are father and daughter? I think there’s a possibility that your mother was chased after by someone, so she could only hide her identity and escape to Li City. She founded a company and left behind a huge amount of wealth. She was afraid that someone would discover your whereabouts, so she found Qiao Zhenguo and they pretended to get married. The mastermind was afraid that you would find your biological father, so they faked the DNA test report.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","With Gu Yao’s imagination, he should be writing novels!","Just then, Song Shiyu walked over. “President, the villa has been cleaned up.”","Gu Zheng nodded and looked at Qiao Xi gently. “Change the name.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at the plaque with the words ‘Qiao family’s villa’ that was usually hung on the wall of the villa’s outer courtyard. Gu Zheng had instructed someone to take it down.","meone","She thought for a moment. “My mom’s surname is Xia, so let’s change it to ‘Xia Residence’!”","Gu Zheng stroked her hair. “The DNA results will be out tomorrow. I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi nodded.","The next day.","The test this time was done by Gu Zheng’s people to avoid the results from being affected. As expected, Qiao Xi and Qiao Zhenguo were not related by blood.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly, and her voice was cold. “The test I did earlier was tampered with. Looks like someone was stopping me from finding out the truth. It can also be said that the other party was stopping me from finding my biological father!","“But what’s the mastermind’s goal? What’s my mother’s true identity? I have a feeling that their background is definitely not simple. THey’re probably from a large family.","“The person who stopped me from finding out the truth probably thinks that if I find out, it’ll harm their interests and even make them lose everything.”","Gu Zheng looked up. “You’re right. In order to cover up this truth, that person has been monitoring the Qiao family. It might be someone from the Qiao family.”","Seeing Qiao Xi’s frown, Gu Zheng smiled. “Don’t think about it. I’ll help you investigate. I’ve asked Song Shiyu to help you manage Mother-in-law’s businesses. Do you want to take a look?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly nodded. She had to go!","Gu Zheng comforted her softly, saying, “This matter has been hidden for so many years. We can’t rush it. We have to slowly investigate.”","He was a little hesitant, but he still asked a sharp question. “Do you... want to find your biological father?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were indifferent. “It doesn’t matter to me whether I find him or not. In any case, I have four brothers and you by my side. A father figure isn’t that important to me anymore.”"]},{"number":486,"title":"Chapter 486 - Luo City’s Xu Family","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng smiled gently and glanced at Song Shijing Song Shijing immediately understood what he meant. He walked out and made a call. “Mr. Qin, um... the president will bring Young Madam over later.","“Alright, Mr. Qin. Thank you so much. Young Madam will be very happy when she finds out the surprise you’ve prepared for her!”","The businesses under Xia Yunqiu’s name were originally under Qiao Corporation. Now that they were all taken back, Qiao Xi directly changed the headquarters’ name to ‘Yunqiu’. Only her mother’s name was worthy of these businesses.","In the future, she would be the boss of these businesses. How could she not go take a look at the situation?","Li Xing’er came over early to congratulate her and handed Qiao Xi a small gift box. “This is my gift. It’s just a small token from me.”","Qiao Xi smiled, took it, and held her hand as they entered the mall.","Unexpectedly, the mall that was originally packed with people was very quiet at this moment. Although there were staff members at the entrance of the mall, there were no customers at all. Qiao Xi observed the mall with some doubts. These shops had all changed their names, while announcements of new products and discounts were hanging in the shops. How could there be no customers? When she got closer, she saw that the two sides of a shop were surrounded by bodyguards. No one was allowed to approach.","Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold. Song Shijing said in a hurry, “President, I’ll go see what’s going on.”","Qiao Xi walked toward the shop as well. At this moment, it was being guarded by dozens of bodyguards. All of them were fierce-looking, and the customers could only leave helplessly.","After a while, Song Shijing came back with a gloomy face. “President, the young miss from the Xu branch family is here. Her bodyguards are blocking the door to prevent customers from entering.”","Xu family?","Qiao Xi found it slightly familiar, but she could not recall which family it was. It seemed that there was no rich family with the surname Xu in Li City.","A daughter from the branch family came to the mall to buy things but still wanted to clear the area? She was too arrogant.","Li Xing’er sneered. “Xu family? Luo City’s Xu family? I’ve heard of this family.”","Song Shijing nodded. “It’s the Xu family of Luo City. I don’t know what’s going on with the Xu family these days. Mr. Xu, Madam Xu, and Miss Xu are all here in Li City. I didn’t expect a daughter from the branch family to come with them.”","Li Xing’er rushed to the bodyguards and said indignantly, “Who gave you the guts to behave atrociously here?! Hurry up and move aside!”","The bodyguards lowered their heads and glanced at her with serious expressions. “Our miss is here at this mall and we won’t let anyone disturb her, so we’re in charge of clearing the area.”","Qiao Xi watched as a few bodyguards chased the customers away. Although the customers were unwilling, they did not dare resist and could only leave dejectedly.","Li Xing’er was instantly angry. “The noble families of Li City are not inferior to those from Luo City. What right do the people from Luo City have to behave atrociously in Li City’s territory? Moreover, I heard that the Xu family is here to look for someone. Why is a daughter from the branch family here?”","Qiao Xi and the others walked forward but were stopped by the bodyguards.","The bodyguards were all extremely arrogant. It was as if they were the noblest dogs in the world. However, they were still dogs!","“It’s your honor that our miss came to Li City. She’s very favored in the Xu family. How can a small fry like you compare to her?! Leave quickly! Otherwise, don’t blame us if we hurt you.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent.","Song Shijing’s face darkened. If he could not even deal with these bodyguards, how could he be qualified to work under the president? Hence, he immediately contacted the person in charge of the mall.","Li Xing’er knew that this shop belonged to Qiao Xi, so she said with a mocking expression, “Do you guys own this shop? You’re chasing people away just because you want to! Is your miss a fairy? Is that why she doesn’t dare to meet others? If you block the door like this, who’s going to be responsible for the losses?”","The bodyguard looked angry and raised his fist to hit Li Xing’er. Seeing this, Song Shiyu rushed up and kicked him away. He then turned around with a proud expression. “President, am I cool?”","Seeing that one of them had been beaten up, the bodyguards rushed over aggressively. Song Shiyu looked calm and smiled as he attacked. Soon, the people were all lying on the floor and crying.","Was this all the Xu family could do? How useless!"]},{"number":487,"title":"Chapter 487 - Mrs. Gu Is Vengeful","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She had never seen a noble family so unreasonable. Which young miss would actually request to clear the mall? A young miss from a branch family still dared to be so arrogant in a foreign city?","WO","At this moment, the manager walked to the door. When he saw Qiao Xi, his face was instantly filled with delight as he hurriedly rushed over. “Miss, you’re finally here!”","Qiao Xi looked at the bodyguards who were groaning on the floor, then glanced at the shop. “Why are you alone?”","There should have been many salespeople in the shop, but now, only the manager was left.","The manager looked at the second floor and said helplessly, “Miss Xu is too domineering. She chased the customers away and even got the employees to serve her. However, our business in Luo City needs the Xu family’s help. I don’t dare to offend Miss Xu.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. The Xu family was actually being arrogant in her territory? Even if the head of the Xu family came today, she would make Miss Xu pay a painful price!","Qiao Xi walked into the shop aggressively and instructed, “Go explain to those customers who were chased away and appease their emotions. Also, give them some gifts or discount cards. You must satisfy them.”","Then, she instructed another shop assistant, “Throw these bodyguards out with the others. Prepare to receive customers.”","The two of them nodded, and then they did as Qiao Xi instructed.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “I want to meet this extremely noble young miss of the Xu family!”","Li Xing’er was angry. “The Xu family is nothing! This is Li City! Doesn’t she know who your husband is? It’s President Gu—”","Before she could finish, an ear-piercing female voice came from the second floor. “Who do you think you are?! Our Xu family is a big family, yet you dare to publicly insult us?”.","Qiao Xi saw a woman walk down from the second floor. She was wearing branded clothes and walked over arrogantly.","She was followed by a few staff members of Yunqiu. Each of them was carrying a few exquisite bags.","This shop was a high-end shop for women. Most of the items here were custom-made pieces and were very expensive. Even if Li Xing’er was rich, she would not be willing to buy too many.","This Miss Xu actually wanted 18 luxury bags. Li Xing’er widened her eyes in shock. Was this person crazy?! Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi had a smile on her face. Li Xing’er did not understand why she was smiling. Then, she saw Qiao Xi smiling as she walked forward.","“Hello, Miss Xu. I’m Yunqiu’s shareholder and the person in charge.”","Song Shijing said in Gu Zheng’s ear in a low voice, “The bags in her hands are all about a million yuan each. Even a rich family like Miss Li has to hesitate to buy a few. How could a young miss from the Xu branch family possibly fork out so much money?”.","These bags added up to about 20 million yuan!","Song Shijing frowned. “It’ll be awkward if Miss Xu can’t afford it. President, what do you think we should do?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Since she has already decided to buy them, she has to pay for them. If she can’t afford it, send the bill to the Xu family.” He paused with a smile. “But I’m afraid 20 million isn’t enough.”","Song Shijing looked confused.","Gu Zheng said, “Mrs. Gu has always been vengeful. Miss Xu disturbed her shop’s business, so of course, she has to scam Miss Xu. How can 20 million appease her anger?”","Song Shijing: “?” The president seemed to be looking forward to Young Madam’s act of revenge!","Qiao Xi asked with a gentle expression, “Many new styles have arrived in the shop today. Which ones do you like, Miss Xu?”","Xu Zidie saw that Qiao Xi was polite and nodded in satisfaction. “I like them all. Wrap them up!”","The shop assistant immediately nodded and carefully packaged the bags. The bags were expensive, and the materials used to pack them were high-quality fabrics. She was afraid that she would accidentally scratch the material.","Xu Zidie saw that all her bags were packed and was about to leave when she was stopped by the manager. “Miss Xu, out of the 18 bags you just bought, ten of them are new products, while seven of them are custom-made pieces. The price is generally around one million per bag. The last bag is our shop’s treasure. There’s only one in the world and it was designed by Gu Shan. The price for that is 3.5 million yuan.”"]},{"number":488,"title":"Chapter 488 - Miss Xu Buys Things Without Paying","paragraphs":["Chapter 488 Miss Xu Buys Things Without Paying","“Miss Xu, your bill is a total of 21.5 million yuan. Since we’re having a promotion now, you can enjoy a discount if you spend more than five million yuan. I’ll give you a discount. It’ll be exactly 21 million yuan. Do you want to swipe your card or...”","The shop was silent.","Xu Zidie’s expression darkened as she exclaimed in a sharp voice, “20 million?”","Was there a mistake?! These bags were worth so much?","The manager still had a smile on his face. “It’s 21 million. Miss Xu, you’re from Luo City’s Xu family, so you definitely don’t lack this bit of money. If you happen to not have any money with you, you can send someone over. You can wait here in the meantime. We’ll prepare coffee and pastries for you.”","Xu Zidie’s expression turned livid.","She snorted arrogantly. “Pfft! You want 20 million from me for just these few bags? Do you think I’m a spendthrift?! This is a shady shop. Forget it, I won’t bicker with you! I’m going to leave!” With that, she turned to leave.","Qiao Xi stopped her with an indifferent expression and revealed a perfunctory smile. “Miss Xu, our shop mainly focuses on selling luxury goods. The materials we use are also the most expensive. Moreover, these bags were all marked with price tags. It’s probably because you didn’t look carefully. If... you think you can’t afford them, you can still refund them.”","Xu Zidie was just a young miss from the Xu branch family. It was a little difficult for her to fork out 20 million at once.","She shouted in exasperation, “You’re scamming me!”","“Miss Xu, you’ve misunderstood.” Qiao Xi blinked. “Look at these bags. We’ve already clearly marked the prices. If you think they’re expensive, you could’ve chosen not to buy them. We wouldn’t have forced you. But as the daughter of the Xu family, you want to take the bags and leave without paying. What’s the difference between that and robbery?","“Miss Xu, you’re wronging me by saying that I’m scamming you of your money. You got the bodyguards to clear the venue and asked our shop to focus on serving you. According to the usual sales volume, we lost at least three million yuan when you asked to clear the place.","“Moreover, because you chased away other customers, we need to appease them and compensate them. We need a sum of money to do that. This sum of money is more than a million yuan.","“I took on both the costs and didn’t ask Miss Xu to compensate, but you’re accusing me of scamming you? If you really think so, then won’t tolerate it anymore. I hope you can pay for your losses just now!”","Li Xing’er could not help but laugh.","The manager quickly calculated the losses and reported, “Miss, according to the rough estimates of the customers who had to be chased away, we need about 3.7 million yuan. The discount cards and gifts that we gave the customers are worth 1.3 million yuan, so it’s exactly five million yuan. Together with the previous 21 million, it’s 26 million yuan.”","“What? You want more money?! Believe it or not, I’ll sue you!”","When Xu Zidie heard this number, she was instantly infuriated. “I’m the young miss of the Xu family. How dare you stop me? It’s your honor that I’m here!”","“If others know that I like your bag, they’ll definitely buy from you. I’m advertising your shop. Don’t be ungrateful and ask me for money. I think you must be crazy poor!”","Xu Zidie pushed Qiao Xi and was about to walk out.","Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened. “Since you’re unwilling to pay, then let’s call the police. If news of this gets out, I’m afraid you’ll become famous. I heard that the Xu family’s company has made investments in the tourism industry recently. If everyone knows that Miss Xu is someone who doesn’t pay for the things she buys, I wonder if they’ll still be willing to spend money on the Xu family’s businesses?”","“You!” Xu Zidie roared. “You’re not showing our Xu family any respect! I... It’s your honor that I’ve taken a liking to the things in your shop. You... You actually dare to threaten me? Do you believe that I’ll destroy your shop?! “How dare you threaten me? I’ll make you pay a painful price!”","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression. “Alright, then I can only seek the help of the police. The bags you’re taking with you are worth more than 20 million. When the matter blows up, the Xu family won’t just have to pay 20 million. It might even be 200 million or more.”","Xu Zidie’s expression was ugly as she gritted her teeth.","Suddenly","“Miss Qiao, Zidie is naughty and mischievous. I apologize on her behalf.”"]},{"number":489,"title":"Chapter 489 - Best Actor Shen Yu Is Here","paragraphs":["A gentle female voice sounded, and everyone looked in the direction of the voice.","Xu Zidie was delighted and hurriedly went forward. “Sister Anran!”","The person was also dressed in gold and silver, but her aura was a few levels higher than Xu Zidie’s. It was obvious from her every move that she was a daughter of a noble family. Her bearing and expression were very well-mannered.","The moment this woman appeared, she seemed to be glowing. Her aura announced to everyone that she was a top socialite.","Qiao Xi sized her up and instantly understood that this woman was the eldest daughter of the Xu family, Xu Anran.","Xu Anran’s arrogant gaze landed on Qiao Xi, then she revealed a gentle smile. “Miss Qiao, my younger sister is spoiled by her family. She might be a little inappropriate in her actions, but our Xu family will absolutely not owe anyone anything. We’ll pay what we should. There’s no need for a discount. Use this card.”","Xu Anran took out a black card from her bag and handed it to Qiao Xi. “My dad gave me this card. There’s no limit to the amount. It’s only 20 million yuan. It’s enough.”","With that, she turned to look at Xu Zidie. “You can’t be so willful next time.”","“Sister Anran, I was wrong. Eldest Uncle is so good to you. He actually gave you a black card. You’re indeed the eldest daughter of the Xu family. That wandering woman definitely can’t compare to...” Suddenly, her expression changed. She knew that she had said something wrong and hurriedly smiled awkwardly. “Sister An Ran, don’t think too much. I mean, you’re the eldest daughter of the Xu family. No one can be nobler than you.”","Xu Anran’s expression did not change as she smiled indifferently. “Yes.”","She swiped her card and left first. She had a strong aura and looked like a noble young miss. Xu Zidie immediately followed her while the bodyguards followed behind the two sisters.","Suddenly, Xu Anran stopped in her tracks. A trace of viciousness flashed past her eyes, but when she turned around, she was smiling gently. “Miss Qiao, we’ll meet again!”","Then, the bodyguards stood beside Xu Anran and slowly disappeared in front of everyone.","Li Xing’er pursed her lips. “The eldest daughter of the Xu family in Luo City is really imposing! She even needs dozens of bodyguards to accompany her when she goes shopping. Those who don’t know might think that someone is trying to assassinate her! I’m really speechless!”","“However, Xu Anran is indeed not simple. She’s a popular female celebrity and the eldest daughter of the Xu family. No one in the entertainment industry dares to provoke her. Because of this, she has obtained many good resources.”","“Maybe it’s because she’s not only the eldest daughter of the Xu family but also a popular celebrity, so she needs so many bodyguards when she goes out!”","Song Shijing frowned. “I have a feeling that this young miss did it on purpose. Although there are many people in the mall, there’s no need to clear the area. It’s like she’s doing it for someone to see.”","For who, then?","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds.","This seemingly noble and dignified Miss Xu was not as gentle as she looked. She just knew how to hide her true colors well. Such a person was even more terrifying. If one was careless, one would fall into her trap.","Qiao Xi did not like to make assumptions about others behind their backs, but she could clearly sense that the eldest miss of the Xu family was inexplicably hostile toward her. Moreover, she did not seem to have told the Xu sisters that she was called Qiao Xi, but Xu Anran had clearly called her Miss Qiao.","How strange!","After the shop returned to its normal operations, Qiao Xi decided to go to another shop to take a closer look. Gu Zheng pulled her back and said in a low voice, “Don’t leave yet. I have a surprise for you.” Qiao Xi looked up with a puzzled expression, then she heard a woman’s scream.","“Ahhh! It’s Shen Yu!”","“It’s Best Actor Shen Yu? Didn’t they say that he left the entertainment industry and went overseas? Why is he here? Has he come back?”","ove","“Shen Yu and his manager are here. What... are they doing here?”","“Look at Shen Yu’s Weibo. He said he was coming to the mall for an event today. Let’s go see our idol!”","When Shen Yu walked to the door of Yunqiu’s shop, the worries in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly vanished. She rushed over excitedly and shouted sweetly, “Brother, you’re back!”","At this moment, Xu Anran also heard the commotion. “Shen Yu?”","She was silent for a while, then narrowed her eyes. “Help me take a photo and post it on Weibo. Let everyone know that Shen Yu and I are in the same mall.”","Xu Zidie was puzzled. “Sister Anran, although he’s a popular actor, you...”"]},{"number":490,"title":"Chapter 490 - Making Use Of His Popularity","paragraphs":["“Shen Yu is not just a popular actor. He’s the only son of the Shen family in the capital.” Xu Anran smiled meaningfully. “I need to make people realize my value. I want everyone to know that I’m the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Only I can bring endless glory and benefits to the Xu family.”","Not only was Xu Zidie Xu Anran’s younger cousin, but she was also Xu Anran’s assistant. She hurriedly took a few photos and edited them. She posted them using Xu Anran’s studio’s account and tagged Xu Anran’s account.","Xu Zidie was puzzled. “What is Shen Yu doing in the mall, though?”","Xu Anran had a look of disdain and snorted. “Maybe he can’t stay overseas anymore. Someone invited him to a mall for an event, so he came back.”","It must not be because of that person.","Xu Anran’s eyes were slightly cold. She knew that the matter could not be hidden anymore, so she had to be fully prepared before the matter was exposed. In that case, even if the truth was revealed, the Xu family would not be able to be without her.","Moreover, she had been with her parents for so long. Could it be that she could not compare to a stranger?","Qiao Xi had not seen her brother for a long time and was jumping around excitedly. Shen Yu waved at everyone, and the fans instantly quietened down.","Qiao Xi did not get too close and just stood at the side to look at him. Her eldest brother was the most steady among all her brothers, yet he entered the entertainment industry. It was truly unexpected.","After that, he gradually left the entertainment industry and took over the family business. He was managing the Shen family’s business very well.","He was the only heir of the Shen family in the capital. He was calm, experienced, and serious. Only when he was with someone close to him would he reveal a smile.","“Wow! This mall is too awesome! They actually managed to invite Shen Yu?” “Shen Yu usually never participates in offline activities. Sometimes, he doesn’t even attend press conferences for movies. I heard that he has a very powerful background and is the young master of a big family. He has never cared about salary when filming movies. He only chooses the movies he likes. Moreover, no one can force him to do things he doesn’t want to do.”","“I’m very curious now about the person who managed to invite Shen Yu over!”","Shen Yu stood on stage, and his cold voice came from the microphone. If one observed carefully, they would realize that his eyes were fixed on someone below the stage. His gaze was gradually turning gentle.","“I came back today for an important person. I hope to give her my blessings on this special","day.”","Then, Shen Yu sang a melodious song. This song was written for his sister by a famous musician in Country F. It was suitable for Qiao Xi now.","His voice was low and filled with love.","Actually, everyone knew that Shen Yu’s voice was outstanding, but he had never sung in public. Was he dedicating his first live performance to his sister?","As the last note fell, Shen Yu left the venue under the protection of his assistant and bodyguards. The fans were still extremely excited as they screamed and cheered.","Qiao Xi went backstage and brought Shen Yu to the lounge on the second floor. “Brother, how were you during your time overseas? Did you come back this time because of work?”","Shen Yu rubbed Qiao Xi’s smooth hair. “I was doing well. I came back this time because I heard that you’re married now?”","Qiao Xi nodded. Shen Yu’s gaze landed on Gu Zheng, and his entire body instantly stiffened.","Half an hour later.","There were two explosive news articles on Weibo. One was that Shen Yu had returned to the country, while the other was about Shen Yu and Xu Anran.","Shen Yu was chatting with Qiao Xi when he received a call from his manager. Only then did he know that Weibo had exploded.","Qiao Xi hurriedly took out her phone and opened Weibo. She could not help but frown. Xu Anran? The stylish eldest daughter of the Xu family who was in her shop just now?","She clicked on Xu Anran’s studio’s Weibo account and saw a photo that captured the name of the mall.","Xu Anran Studio: [Anran is here to see an important person.) Qiao Xi frowned unhappily. Was Xu Anran’s Weibo post trying to use her brother’s popularity?","Eldest Brother had just returned to the country. He came to the mall and said that he was performing for an important person. Then, Xu Anran posted on Weibo and said something similar. Wasn’t this just making others misunderstand?!","As expected, the fans immediately linked Xu Anran and Shen Yu’s return to China."]},{"number":491,"title":"Chapter 491 - Acting As The Weak Sister","paragraphs":["[The important person that An Ran is talking about is Best Actor Shen Yu? Shen Yu happened to be back in the country and sang a song in the luxury goods mall. He also said that his performance is dedicated to an important person. Could it be that they...]","[I heard that Sister Anran bought 18 bags from the luxury bag shop Yunqiu. Do you know how much the luxury bags from Yunqiu are worth? Each bag costs millions. She actually bought 18. How generous!)","[Damn! Sister Anran is rich and willful. She bought 20 million yuan worth of bags?]","(What’s so strange about that? Xu Anran is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. You know the Xu family of Luo City, right? She’s their most beloved daughter. She can have anything she wants. It’s just 20 million yuan. It’s nothing to her.]","[I’m jealous. The eldest daughter of the Xu family was born with a silver spoon in her mouth. Her parents dote on her, and she has a brother who dotes on her too. She even knows Shen Yu. Moreover, Shen Yu’s song was dedicated to his younger sister. Could it be that Xu Anran is Shen Yu’s younger sister?]","[Is Xu Anran favored by all? Huh, I’ve seen it all!)","Qiao Xi snorted. “The song you sang was clearly for me. With her Weibo post, everyone now thinks it was for her. Eldest Miss Xu is quite popular herself, so why is she using this method to gain attention?”","Shen Yu smiled gently and said, “Be good. I’ll clarify things on Weibo.”","Qiao Xi waved her hand. There was nothing to explain. If he clarified things now, who knew what the internet would say? It was better to remain silent.","Moreover, everyone had already made their assumptions. They were sure that the two of them had agreed to meet at the mall. If Shen Yu denied it, Xu Anran would bite back and mistake Shen Yu’s actions for being something else.","A strange feeling arose in Qiao Xi’s heart, and she muttered in a low voice, “I keep having the feeling that the eldest miss of the Xu family... seems to have an inexplicable hostility toward me.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. He suddenly looked up and met Shen Yu’s eyes. The two of them shook their heads tacitly as if they had reached an agreement.","Shen Yu smiled and said, “Our Little Six is so good-looking. Xu Anran must be jealous. Don’t worry. Why are you looking for trouble with an outsider?","“Little Six, I came back to the country this time because a director invited me to act in a movie. I think the plot is good, so I want you to act with me.”","In the Shen family’s residence in the capital.","Madam Shen frowned. “My heart aches for Little Six. I haven’t told my parents yet! If they find out, they’ll definitely worry again.”","Mr. Shen comforted her. “Don’t worry. Little Six is already an adult. She has the ability to face things alone. It’s also a good thing that she could find her biological parents.” “But...” Madam Shen’s face was full of worry. “Previously, I was the one who suggested... Little Six went missing and I wanted to find a girl about the same age as her to replace her. I was muddle-headed back then and thought of such things. Now that Little Six is back, things have become so miserable!”","Mr. Shen said helplessly, “Didn’t I ask Shen Yu to go to Li City? With him protecting Little Six, he definitely won’t let her be bullied. Moreover, Little Six has to go through all these. She needs to acknowledge her ancestors. We can’t interfere in this matter.”","“But if they don’t treat Little Six well, our Shen family won’t sit back and do nothing. At most, we just won’t acknowledge her!”","The next day.","Qiao Xi obtained the script for that movie.","Shen Yu was shooting an ancient movie. The male lead was a slave who slowly became a powerful official of the imperial court. It was a story of how officials could cause chaos in the imperial court and finally help the emperor establish a prosperous era.","The role Qiao Xi was going to play was the male lead’s younger sister. However, she passed away very early in the movie, so she did not have many scenes. However, many male characters were fond of her. She was also the younger sister who the male lead doted on. Only when he recalled her would his tender side be brought out.","Most of her scenes were flashbacks. She only had about ten minutes of screentime, so it was a very simple task for Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi jumped up excitedly after reading the script. “Gu Zheng, the role that Big Brother chose for me is really too good!”","Gu Zheng glanced at her and nodded. “Yes, very good. A weak and ill sister who can’t take care of herself is indeed very suitable for your character. You’ll be able to have fun.”","Qiao Xi was speechless: “...”"]},{"number":492,"title":"Chapter 492 - Character Was Snatched","paragraphs":["At this moment, Xu Anran was in the director’s lounge.","The director asked eagerly, “Miss Xu, are you Mr. Shen’s younger sister?” Xu Anran smiled. She did not admit it but did not deny it either. “The Xu and Shen families are close. I’ve known Shen Yu since we were young.” The director immediately understood. Even if Xu Anran was not Shen Yu’s sister, she was still the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She was someone he could offend.","It was just that Shen Yu had said that he wanted to decide who to cast for this role. If the director wanted to sign a contract with Xu Anran, he had to ask Shen Yu first. However, Miss Xu said she did not want a salary and even invested ten million yuan. She just asked to play the role of the male lead’s younger sister.","If the director did not agree, wouldn’t it be equivalent to rejecting ten million yuan?","Just then, the producer walked in and said in a low voice, “When Shen Yu signed the contract, he said that he had already found someone for the role. If we sign a contract with Xu Anran...”","The director advised, saying, “Qiao Xi has never acted before and has no popularity. Xu Anran is an A-list actress. Who can bring us more benefits? Think about it carefully!”","“But Qiao Xi’s acting skills are really good. She’s a university graduate, and she even acts better than Xu Anran. You’ve seen the audition footage too. Everyone thinks she matches—”.","The two of them were discussing in low voices when Xu Zidie suddenly shouted, “Qiao Xi? You’re talking about Qiao Xi?”","The director looked up. “Uh... She’s the original actress for this role.”","Xu Zidie sneered. “She’s a scammer! She scammed Sister Anran and me out of a lot of money. How can such a person who has no acting experience be worthy of snatching the role from Sister Anran? If she acts in this movie, it’ll be completely ruined! Our Sister Anran has a good track record in the box office. Will you choose a newcomer who will ruin the movie or our Sister Anran?!”","Xu Anran said gently, “Zidie.”","Then, she said generously, “I’ve never seen Qiao Xi’s acting, but I don’t think she’s a professional. Without systematic training, how could she act well in a movie... But it’s okay. If you’ve already decided on a role, then forget it. After all, first come, first serve.”","“Sister Anran, why should you give the role to that woman?! You’re the most suitable person for this role. What right does she have to compete with you?”","The director hesitated for a moment. “Miss Xu, I think you’re more suitable for this role.”","After that, Xu Anran’s fans started commenting on the Internet: (An An and Shen Yu are going to film a movie. She’ll be acting as Shen Yu’s younger sister. She’s his younger sister both in the movie and in real life. They’re a strong couple.]","When Gu Yao heard that Qiao Xi was going to act in a movie, he followed over curiously.","Second Young Master Gu once dreamt of becoming a celebrity when he was young. He even participated in auditions at that time, but because he only had a handsome face while his limbs were uncoordinated, he did not know how to sing or dance. His acting was even more awkward, so he eventually gave up.","However, he was still very curious about the filming industry, so he decided to visit the set.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already memorized all the lines. This was not difficult for her. After all, she was the scriptwriter and had participated in many movies. Although she had gone to the filming location to supervise the filming before, she never once showed her face. She also used a fake name then.","Shen Yu was very satisfied with her acting skills and thought that she was the most suitable candidate, so he signed the contract with her. She was supposed to shoot today.","Qiao Xi had already put on her makeup and clothes. She was waiting, but she did not hear anyone call out to her.","Suddenly, a sharp female voice sounded. “Who are you?! Who allowed you to break into Sister Anran’s dressing room?”","Qiao Xi and Gu Yao looked up and saw three makeup artists storming in aggressively. They pushed Gu Yao away rudely and even pushed Qiao Xi. After making room, they obsequiously invited Xu Anran in.","“Sister Anran, be careful.”","Qiao Xi heard the discussion outside the door.","“Xu Anran is here too! As expected of the eldest daughter of the Xu family, she’s really imposing!”","“The little princess of a rich family! My goddess!”","Xu Anran sat elegantly on the chair. The three makeup artists immediately came forward and helped her dress up. They were careful not to hurt the princess. Qiao Xi frowned. What did this mean?","Gu Yao was about to ask when one of the makeup artists pointed at Qiao Xi angrily."]},{"number":493,"title":"Chapter 493 - The Rules Of The Entertainment Industry","paragraphs":["“You! You’re wearing Sister Anran’s clothes, right? This role belongs to Sister Anran. What right do you have to wear her clothes?”","Gu Yao was indignant. “Who said that this role belongs to Xu Anran? The role of Shen Yu’s sister belongs to Qiao Xi!”","The makeup artist was not to be outdone either. She shouted at the top of her voice, “How unreasonable! A newcomer actually wants to snatch Sister Anran’s role!”","Xu Anran looked up slightly, her eyes filled with provocation. “Miss Qiao, what a coincidence.”","Qiao Xi frowned.","Xu Anran smiled. “What happened before was just a misunderstanding. Moreover, I’ve already made it clear. Miss Qiao, why are you affecting my filming because of that? You should quickly take off your clothes.”","The moment the makeup artist shouted, many people gathered at the door.","Xu Anran’s eyes were indifferent as she sighed helplessly. “Miss Qiao, the entertainment industry has its rules. As a newcomer, it’s really not right for you to snatch the role of a senior. Moreover, I’ve already signed the contract. What exactly do you want to do by wearing my clothes?”","The moment that was said, everyone immediately burned with anger.","A newbie actually wanted to snatch Xu Anran’s role? She was crazy to think she could become famous this way!","Xu Zidie immediately took out her phone and took a few photos. She exaggerated the matter and posted it on Weibo. Instantly, Xu Anran’s fans stood up for their goddess.","Xu Anran’s fans were in the tens of millions. Now that a newbie was openly provoking and snatching their idol’s role, the fans on the internet were instantly infuriated and started to curse Qiao Xi.","Gu Yao stood up for Qiao Xi. “Let’s not mention the fact that she’s a newbie. The ‘first come, first serve’ principle still applies here. Qiao Xi was the one who signed the contract first. You stole her role and are even yapping back?”","“Qiao Xi! Why are you standing here?” At this moment, the director rushed over angrily. He was afraid of offending the eldest daughter, Xu Anran, so he could only push all the responsibility to Qiao Xi.","“You’re just a newbie, yet you dare to snatch the role? Quickly apologize to Anran! If Anran doesn’t bicker with you, then quickly take off your clothes and leave! Don’t let me see you again!”","Gu Yao was dumbfounded. This was the entertainment industry? It was Xu Anran who stole Qiao Xi’s role, but everyone thought that Qiao Xi was in the wrong. Now, the director was even forcing her to apologize to Xu Anran. Was there any justice in this world?","After the director reprimanded Qiao Xi, those who were still slightly doubtful also believed that Qiao Xi wanted to snatch Xu Anran’s role.","Xu Anran was calm. “Forget it, there’s no need to apologize. You might not know the rules of the entertainment industry. I’ll forgive you this time. I hope you won’t commit the same mistake again. Go change out of your clothes and leave the production team as soon as possible. Don’t delay the filming. Everyone’s waiting.”","Qiao Xi felt a wave of rage surge from her heart.","Seeing that she was not moving, the director immediately pointed at her and shouted, “Qiao Xi! If you want to go further in the future, don’t do anything irrational. Anran is an A-list actress and the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She’s magnanimous and won’t bicker with you. I hope you won’t fail to appreciate her kindness. If you offend her, you won’t be able to bear the consequences!”","Qiao Xi secretly reached into her bag and pressed the recording button. “Director, I signed the contract two days ago. If you’re regretting your decision, compensate me for the breach of contract.”","The director said loudly and generously, “It’s just the penalty for breach of contract. We’ll compensate you. You’re just a newcomer, so you don’t need much money. Miss Xu doesn’t even care about this bit of money. I advise you to leave quickly. If you offend Anran, you’ll suffer!”","With that, the director turned around and looked at Xu Anran with a smile. “Let me formally introduce you to the cast and crew. Xu Anran will be playing the role of the male lead’s younger sister!","“Anran has already passed the audition. Her acting skills are outstanding. We all agree that Anran is more suitable for this role. It’s getting late now. Anran, quickly put on your makeup. We’ll start filming soon.","“Miss Qiao, I don’t want things to get too ugly. Leave yourself. Don’t force me to chase you out!”","At this moment, Shen Yu was still filming. There was only Gu Yao beside Qiao Xi. He felt that he had to shoulder the responsibility of protecting Qiao Xi, so he said unwillingly, “You’re bullying-“","“You’re the one who’s thinking of snatching a senior’s role, but you’re unconvinced with this outcome?”","“That’s right! It’s just that Sister Anran is magnanimous and doesn’t want to bicker with you. If it were someone else, you won’t be able to stay in the entertainment industry anymore!”"]},{"number":494,"title":"Chapter 494 - A Big Movie","paragraphs":["Xu Anran said indifferently, “Miss Qiao, actually, I admire you very much. If it were something else, I could give in to you, but this is a big movie. Please forgive me for not giving in.”","Gu Yao was so angry that his face was red. “Xu Anran, you’re the one who stole the role. You","_","11","“Gu Yao, don’t be angry at them. Let’s go.” Qiao Xi tugged at his sleeve and comforted him softly, then she looked up. “Miss Xu.”","“Miss Qiao, is there anything else?”","Qiao Xi blinked. “I just want to remind you that the Xu family can’t allow you to do everything you want. You’d better take care of yourself!”","A trace of viciousness flashed past Xu Anran’s eyes, but she immediately recovered her calm. She turned around and asked in a low voice, “Have you deleted the footage of Qiao Xi’s audition?”","Xu Zidie leaned over to her ear and replied, “The director accepted our ten million yuan and deleted it a long time ago. He also deleted the surveillance cameras. There won’t be any negative news. Sister Anran, you’re the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She’s not your match. Just perform your role well!”","Xu Anran smiled confidently.","That was right. She was the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She had the love of her parents and brother since she was young. She was the beloved daughter of the Xu family. With such a powerful background, no one in the entertainment industry dared to offend her.","Qiao Xi... She was an orphan now. Who could help her?","The two of them walked out of the dressing room, but Gu Yao was still indignant. “Qiao Xi! She’s bullying you, yet you’re letting it go just like that? You clearly signed the contract two days ago, and you even memorized the script. What right do you have to let her snatch your role?","“Also, that silly woman even said on Weibo that you stole her role. As a senior, she just gave you a small reminder, but you just gave up and left!”","Qiao Xi opened Weibo. Sure enough, after just a few minutes, the news of her snatching a senior’s role had spread online.","Xu Anran had many fans, and the number of reposts increased. Moreover, the Xu family was behind her.","Qiao Xi was not annoyed and smiled instead.","“How can we just let it go like this? Am I the kind of person who would swallow my anger?”","Gu Yao’s eyes lit up. “What are you going to","do?”","Qiao Xi smiled craftily. “Even though some things have been deleted... it doesn’t mean that they’ve vanished. As long as they once existed, I have the ability to recover them.”","Gu Yao did not understand what she meant.","Qiao Xi directly pulled him to another lounge and took out her laptop. She logged into Black Tide’s account and tapped her fingers on the keyboard before obtaining the surveillance footage. She then found the surveillance cameras in the lounge and confirmed a route that could avoid the cameras. She then put the laptop in her bag and pulled Gu Yao away.","“Huh? Where are we going?”","“Of course... we’re going to counter-attack!”","At this moment, after Shen Yu finished filming his first scene, his assistant hurriedly went forward to tell him what had happened in the dressing room. Shen Yu’s expression immediately darkened. He strode out of the filming location and quickly went to the director’s lounge.","Many crew members were puzzled. Everyone knew that although Shen Yu looked cold, he had never lost his temper. Who made him angry?","In the director’s lounge, Xu Anran had already put on her makeup and changed her clothes. The director was explaining the script to her. “This role is really quite good. I reckon that this movie can attract a large number of fans. Our movie requires actors to act with their original voices, but I’ve already found a voice actor who has a similar voice to yours. You don’t have to worry much.”","Xu Anran nodded. “Director Ding, thank you. As long as you work for me, our Xu family will definitely—”","Before she could finish, a loud bang interrupted her.","Shen Yu kicked open the door and slammed a bank card on the table. The director looked puzzled and asked nervously, “Mister... Mr. Shen, you...”","Shen Yu’s eyes were cold. He did not look at Xu Anran at all. His thin lips moved slightly. “The breach of contract.”","The director was stunned for a few seconds, then he chuckled and said, “It’s alright. We’ll handle Qiao Xi’s compensation. I won’t trouble you to spend the money-“","“I’m not acting anymore.”","Shen Yu exuded a cold aura, and his expression was cold. He did not give the director any chance to salvage the situation. “When I agreed to act in this role, I had a condition. It was that the role of my sister had to be decided by me. Now that you’ve breached the contract, I’ll withdraw from this movie!”"]},{"number":495,"title":"Chapter 495 - Hide Your Fox Tail","paragraphs":["The director’s and producer’s expressions changed.","After Shen Yu finished speaking, he turned around and left. The director hurriedly chased after him. “Mr. Shen, don’t be angry. The contract does say that this role has to be approved by you, but... Miss Xu isn’t an outsider! Don’t you know her? Moreover, she’s the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She’s willing to play this role and even brought in funds. She’ll definitely bring more box office sales to this movie. It’s a good thing for us.","“Moreover, you’re already halfway through filming. If you quit the movie now, it’ll be ruined. It’s too late for us to find actors now. Moreover, these losses...”","Shen Yu’s lawyer walked over and replied coldly, “Whatever loss has nothing to do with Mr. Shen. Director Ding, the contract clearly states that this role had to be decided by Mr. Shen. Since you broke the contract, Mr. Shen doesn’t have to abide by the agreement. Moreover, Mr. Shen will compensate you for the breach of contract. He has already done what he should.","“Director Ding, no matter where you go to seek judgment on this matter, it’s indeed your production team who broke the contract. If you think Miss Xu is more suitable for this role, you can take the money Miss Xu gave you to find another actor.”","“You... Shen Yu!” Director Ding was so angry that his face turned red.","Xu Anran walked out and said generously, “Mr. Shen, this movie is already halfway done. Everyone on the production team has worked hard for this movie. It’s not worth it for you to quit just because of a newbie. Moreover, I really like this role. I hope”","“Heh! What right do you have to speak?” Shen Yu sneered, his eyes filled with disdain. “Miss Xu, fake things can never become real. If you’re smart, hide your fox tail. Don’t do anything you shouldn’t. Otherwise, you’ll have to pay the price sooner or later!","“If you continue to be so arrogant, I’d like to see how long your mask as a princess of a noble family can last. Watch out!”","Xu Anran gasped, and her face instantly turned pale.","Shen Yu... He actually knew about that.","So what? She had lived with her parents and brother for so many years. They would not abandon her.","Even if the real princess came back, they would still dote on her like before. That person was just a stranger. There was nothing to be afraid of. Moreover, that person was definitely not as outstanding as her. However... she had to become more outstanding before that and let the Xu family know her value.","Shen Yu walked to the filming location and hesitated for a moment.","The lawyer asked, “Sir, what else can I do for","you?”","Shen Yu shook his head. “It’s nothing. I just think that this script is good.”","The lawyer thought that Mr. Shen still could not bear to let it go. He was about to comfort him when he heard","“It’s okay, this production team is about to be disbanded. When the time comes, I can buy the script and find a more professional production team to film it.”","The lawyer widened his eyes. Was Mr. Shen going to attack the production team? Shen Yu sneered. Since they dared to bully Little Six, they had to pay the price. If they did not let Little Six act in this role, they could forget about filming this movie!","At this moment, Qiao Xi brought Gu Yao to the director’s lounge while avoiding all the surveillance cameras.","The lounge was very spacious, and the audition area was just beside it. Previously, she had auditioned for the role of the male lead’s younger sister there. At that time, everyone was very satisfied and they directly signed the contract with her. Unexpectedly, Xu Anran interfered.","Qiao Xi stood at the door and took out her laptop. Her fingers fiddled with it nimbly, and the surveillance cameras in the lounge were instantly switched off.","She brought Gu Yao inside and turned on the computer on the director’s desk. She found the audition video.","As expected, everyone’s videos were in the folder except hers. Qiao Xi smiled. Xu Anran was really smart. She knew to quickly delete her audition video, but...","Then, Gu Yao widened his eyes and looked at everything in front of him in disbelief.","Qiao Xi’s slender and fair fingers moved nimbly across the keyboard. Half a minute later, the computer suddenly flashed, and the deleted videos were instantly restored.","She copied the video and deleted the unnecessary information. She turned off the computer and walked out of the lounge. Then, she restored all the surveillance cameras."]},{"number":496,"title":"Chapter 496 - My Sister-In-Law Is So Cool!","paragraphs":["The surveillance cameras in the lounge were only switched off for a minute. Even if it was discovered, no one would find it strange.","Gu Yao watched Qiao Xi’s actions, and his mouth fell open.","‘My sister-in-law is so cool!’","He shouted excitedly, “Qiao Xi, I officially announce that you’re my idol from now on! I want to learn from you!” Gu Zheng was already waiting outside the filming site. After Qiao Xi said goodbye to Shen Yu, she got into the car. Shen Yu’s assistant asked in a low voice, “Sixth Miss doesn’t seem to care.”","Shen Yu smiled. “She won’t bicker with an outsider. Moreover, this role doesn’t matter much to her!”","However, he would hold a grudge for this.","Little Six had always liked to pretend to be weak. The role she was supposed to be playing in this movie was a weak and sickly sister. It was the perfect role for her to show her acting skills. Unexpectedly, it was ruined by Xu Anran.","He did not care what relationship Little Six had with the Xu family. Since Xu Anran bullied Little Six, she had to pay a painful price!","Then, Xu Anran received a call from her brother, Xu Anyi.","“Anran, I saw the news online. What’s that woman’s name... Qiao Xi, right? She dares to snatch your role?” Xu Anran choked weakly. “Brother, I’m fine. She’s just a small celebrity who wants to be famous, so she deliberately tried to steal my role. Actually, she doesn’t even want to act. She just wants to become famous by using me.”","Xu Anyi panicked. “Why are you crying?!","“Anran, that woman actually dared to bully you! You’ve been wronged. I’ll help you take revenge. I’ll definitely make her pay the price! I’ll let her know the consequences of making you angry!”","Xu Anran sobbed aggrievedly, and her voice sounded delicate. “Brother, don’t... Don’t be rash. She’s just being silly. Anyway, she didn’t manage to snatch it away. However, the male lead abandoned his role for her. I got this role, but I can’t continue filming.”","“That’s too much! She couldn’t get the chance, so she’s not letting you act either!” Xu Anyi said angrily, “Anran, don’t worry. With me around, I won’t let you be bullied!”","Xu Anran smiled.","‘Qiao Xi, your biological brother wants to deal with you!’","By then, the Xu family would hate and ostracize her. Even if she returned to the Xu family, they would not be able to accept her.","Why didn’t she die?! Why did she come back?!","Song Shiyu was driving. He glanced at the rearview mirror and frowned. “President, I think someone’s following us.”","Gu Zheng looked calm and lowered his eyes. “Song Shiyu, your observation skills have deteriorated. You only just realized it. Do you want me to send you for training?”","Song Shiyu: “...”","‘I did something wrong even though I realized we’re being followed? The president is really troublesome.’","Song Shiyu said nervously, “President, what should we do now?”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers played with a dagger in his hands, then he hid it in his sleeve. He leaned back lazily and said, “Get rid of them.”","“No problem!” Song Shiyu stepped on the accelerator and sped away, pulling the distance from the car.","At the intersection, Gu Zheng said again, “Turn left.”","Song Shiyu immediately made a sharp turn. The car behind him could not react in time and rushed past the intersection.","Boom!","There was a dead-end in front of them. The car that was following them accidentally crashed, and smoke instantly rose.","Gu Zheng pushed open the car door. The people in the car knew that they had been discovered and also got out of the car with weapons.","“They’re here for me?” Qiao Xi was surprised.","She also got out of the car and kicked a man who was attacking her. She smiled coldly. “The Xu family is quite fast!”.","There were a total of four people in the car. After a while, they were all lying on the ground and wailing. Qiao Xi turned around and asked, “There should be surveillance cameras along this road, right?” “Yeah.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “I originally didn’t want to make a fuss about it with the Xu family. But since they insist on coming over to provoke me, then don’t blame me for being merciless.”","That night, the matter of the newbie snatching a senior’s role occupied the list of trending topics. Xu Anran’s fans started slandering Qiao Xi, and Qiao Xi’s account was dug out.","The netizens actually did not know that Yun Chu was Qiao Xi. After all, it was just a blurry photo that was exposed at that time. It was impossible to see her face clearly. Everyone only thought that Qiao Xi looked a little familiar, but they would absolutely not expect that Qiao Xi was Yun Chu."]},{"number":497,"title":"Chapter 497 - You Will Always Be The Eldest Miss Of The Xu Family","paragraphs":["Xu Anran’s fans did not think too much about it. They only knew that someone had bullied Anran. Anran was so kind-hearted. She was still the eldest daughter of the Xu family, after all. That b*tch actually dared to snatch her","role?","At the Xu family’s villa.","Xu Anyi sat on the sofa and waited for the hitmen he hired to bring him news, but there was no call at all. He even lost contact with them.","He suddenly had a bad feeling and decided to take a look at the situation himself. Could it be that they had been discovered?","Xu Anyi was about to leave when Madam Xu and Xu Anran walked in. Madam Xu frowned. “You’ve been in the entertainment industry for so many years, but someone actually stole your role? Who’s that woman?”","Xu Anran smiled helplessly. “Mom, I’m fine. It’s all in the past. She’s just a newbie. She just entered the industry... She wished to climb up to a high position and wanted to snatch the role from me. However, the director gave me the role and didn’t let her succeed.”","Madam Xu said disdainfully, “How could a newbie dare to snatch a role from you? It looks like she’s relying on someone powerful to be so arrogant! How nauseating!” Xu Anran rolled her eyes. “Yes, she only dares to snatch the role from me because of her man’s power.”","“How can she compare to you? You’re in the entertainment industry as a hobby. If you don’t want to act anymore, you can simply come home and inherit the family assets, my good daughter.” Madam Xu looked at her with affection.","Xu Anran’s face was filled with joy. Then, her eyes were filled with sorrow. “Mom, I know that you and Dad are good to me, but I’m... not your biological child. If my sister comes back, will you...”","She choked as tears trickled down her face. “No matter what the future holds, you’ll always be my mother...”","Seeing her cry, Madam Xu’s heart instantly ached. “Baby girl, stop crying. Whether my biological daughter returns or not, you’re still the eldest daughter of the Xu family. You’re still my daughter. Don’t worry.”","Thinking of her biological daughter, Madam Xu could not help but frown. When she first went missing, she had cried so badly. After Anran joined their family, she gradually stopped thinking about her biological daughter. Now, she actually thought that it was good even if her biological daughter did not come back. Anyway, she already treated Anran as her biological daughter.","Moreover, Anran was obedient and sensible She was good-looking, and every move she made exuded the aura of a noble young lady. She was worthy of being the eldest daughter of the Xu family. If that biological daughter of hers was found, wouldn’t she end up being an embarrassment to the Xu family?","d","At the thought of this, Madam Xu felt annoyed and frustrated. “We haven’t found her, right? So why are you crying? Remember, you’ll always be the eldest daughter of the Xu family. No one can replace you.” “That’s right, Anran. You’re my only sister. Our Xu family is rich and powerful. Not just anyone can enter!” Xu Anyi also said, “If she’s a good-for-nothing or someone who has missing limbs, how is she worthy of the Xu family? So it’s better if she doesn’t come back...”","When Xu Anran heard what the two of them said, she immediately heaved a sigh of relief and said gently, “Mom, Brother, thank you. I won’t cry anymore. Someone will be here to interview me later. If you’re not busy, can you show your faces? There’s no need to say anything. Just greet them.”","“Alright! Since An An has already said so, why would we refuse? You’re my obedient daughter. You’re the noblest eldest daughter of the Xu family. No one is more outstanding than you.”","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had just switched on her phone when she saw a notification. (Xu Anran has accepted an interview and is responding to the news of her role being snatched. The live broadcast will start at 3:00 p.m.!]","She looked at the time. It was three o’clock, so she clicked on the live broadcast.","At this moment, the host was standing in front of a luxurious house. He held a microphone and said, “Everyone, I’m currently standing in front of Xu Anran’s mansion. Today, Anran will officially respond to the news of her role being snatched. This is the first time Anran’s mother and brother will be appearing. Don’t miss this opportunity. I hope everyone can continue to pay attention to our interview today.”","en","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Now, she wondered if she had a grudge against Xu Anran in her previous life. The first time they met, the Xu family caused trouble in her shop. The second time they met, Xu Anran snatched her role and even bit back. The third time, they sent people to kill her?"]},{"number":498,"title":"Chapter 498 - A Top Socialite’s Live Broadcast","paragraphs":["At this moment, Xu Anran had already appeared in the live broadcast. She was wearing a light purple dress. The dress covered her legs, but it outlined her slender waist and slightly revealed her fair collarbone.","She was dressed casually, but she exuded a noble aura from her bones. She exuded an elegant and pure aura. One look and one could tell that she was a top socialite.","At this moment, the audience in the live broadcast exploded.","(Wow! Anran is indeed from a rich family! This villa is too luxurious!]","[An An originally lived in Luo City, but she has moved to Li City and is temporarily staying there. Their villa in Luo City is definitely bigger. I heard it’s like a castle.)","(She’s a top socialite! No ordinary person can compare to her! I’m so envious!)","Xu Anran stood up elegantly and smiled sweetly. “I’ll show everyone around our new villa. I just moved in recently, so it’s very new to me too.”","She lowered her eyes and smiled proudly. She thought that Qiao Xi must hate her to death now. Perhaps Qiao Xi was watching the live broadcast right now.","She wanted Qiao Xi to know that it did not matter if she was biologically related to the Xu family. She had already occupied the position of the eldest daughter of the Xu family, so it was impossible for her to easily give it up.","Xu Anran led everyone to the second floor.","“This is my room. It’s the best room in the house with the best lighting. There’s also an open balcony outside. I plan to plant flowers there. To the right, there’s a cloakroom.”","Xu Anran smiled in embarrassment. “Actually, this is Dad and Mom’s room, but they insisted that I stay here. They said that they want me to stay in it comfortably. My family dotes on me too much. I really have no choice.”","The host said obsequiously, “Anran is indeed the princess of a rich family!”","Qiao Xi could not help but nod. This room was really well renovated. Xu Anran had good taste. Not only was it luxurious, but it was also very tasteful.","Xu Anran talked about her daily life, making the viewers in the live broadcast all cry out in envy. Then, the wealthy and graceful Madam Xu and the tall and handsome Xu Anyi appeared to greet her. The people watching the broadcast instantly erupted.","Xu Anran smiled and introduced, “This is my mother, and this is my brother. Dad is still busy with work and hasn’t gotten off work yet.” The broadcast was filled with comments.","(Wow! No wonder An Ran is so good-looking. Her mom and brother are both good-looking as well!]","(I want such a life too! I’m envious of Princess Anran again!]","(Xu Anran is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. A small rookie dares to snatch her role? She’s too arrogant! Isn’t she afraid that the Xu family will deal with her?]","The number of comments instantly increased. The host looked a little awkward. Then, he got to the main topic.","“Anran, you know as well that I came here today to interview you about your role being stolen. Can you tell me more about the situation? The audience also wants to know.”","Xu Anran lowered her eyes and smiled helplessly. “Our Xu family won’t bicker with a newbie. Regarding her snatching the role from me... it’s all in the past. I don’t have anything to say. I just hope that the entertainment industry can be a little more righteous. Newbies should learn more and not think of taking shortcuts. It’ll only harm them.”","She paused and frowned. She said awkwardly, “I... I didn’t want to say this, but I have to warn everyone not to... go so far just... just for a few benefits. Anyway, I hope all girls will love themselves and not go astray.”","(Anran is such a pure princess. She must have never seen the dirty side of the entertainment industry. Some people are unscrupulous just to get a good role!) [So that Miss Qiao used such methods to try and snatch the role from Anran. How disgusting!)","(She must’ve sold her body to get a big role after being given a small supporting role. She must not have any ability at all. She can only rely on men to get to the top!)","The comments were filled with curses. Xu Anran’s fans were all standing up for her.","(B*tch! She slept around so she could snatch a role! She even dares to snatch the role from Anran. She’s not even worthy to be Anran’s substitute!]","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Xu Anran said gently, “Everyone, there’s no need to have such a big reaction. It’s not wrong for her to want to become famous, but she shouldn’t have used such a despicable method. Actually, I was also very surprised at that time.”"]},{"number":499,"title":"Chapter 499 - 9 Time For The Performance!","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Xi took out her laptop and quickly typed a few words on the keyboard. Xu Anran adjusted the angle and said to the camera, “I wish to tell Miss Qiao that it’s not enough to be an actress just by relying on your looks. You have to rely on your ability. Since you want to succeed, you have to learn more and improve your acting skills. Don’t always think of taking shortcuts.”","Qiao Xi pressed the enter button.","The entire live broadcast instantly darkened. The host and Xu Anran did not notice it and were still chatting.","Xu Anran showed her tolerance and generosity. “Although Miss Qiao wanted to snatch my role, I don’t blame her anymore. I hope this won’t happen again in the future. What the entertainment industry needs is ability, not connections!”","The fans watching were still cursing Qiao Xi.","Before they could finish typing, the livestream was instantly frozen. Then, everyone realized that a surveillance video had appeared on the screen. They could not forcefully turn it off.","In Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully.","It was time for the performance!","At this moment, the audience realized that their electronics seemed to have been infected with a virus. They could not turn off the window or send messages. They were forced to watch the surveillance footage. The video showed an audition room. The director and producer were sitting on chairs, waiting for the next candidate to enter.","Immediately after, a person appeared in the surveillance footage. Everyone instantly widened their eyes and realized that this person was Qiao Xi.","Why was she in the audition room? Was she going to cause trouble?","Just as everyone was guessing, Qiao Xi walked to the center of the room and started performing","She was auditioning for the role of Shen Yu’s weak and delicate sister. There were only a few lines, but Qiao Xi could fully express the feelings of the character. She was not inferior even in front of Best Actor Shen Yu. She had brought the character to life.","Best Actor Shen Yu was publicly recognized as an actor with good acting skills and good looks both locally and overseas. He was the top actor in the country, but he was not at all inferior to Qiao Xi when it came to acting. Everyone even thought that Qiao Xi was the real protagonist in this scene. Shen Yu was just a supporting role, so all their attention was on her.","At this moment, everyone realized that Qiao Xi’s acting skills were actually so outstanding.","After this scene ended, the director and producer stood up and applauded. They also took out the contract very enthusiastically. At that time, both parties happily decided on the role and even told Qiao Xi to come directly for the shoot in two days.","The surveillance footage ended, and the livestream returned to normal.","At this moment, Xu Anran was showing everyone around her backyard. She had not looked at the comments.","(Did everyone see that? What happened just now? Was it a video of Qiao Xi’s audition?]","[I think she acted very well... Why... Why did Xu Anran say that she doesn’t have the ability?]","(So what if she’s capable? It’s her fault that she stole Anran’s role. Anran got that role first!)","(Why did the livestream suddenly stop? Who showed us that video?] After a few comments, the livestream was cut off again. Then, another surveillance video appeared.","It was still the surveillance footage of the audition room. However, the person who walked in this time was Xu Anran. The fans were delighted. It was not easy to get the chance to see Anran’s audition tapes.","Although the timestamp shown on the surveillance footage stated that it took place a day later than Qiao Xi’s audition, An Ran might have already reserved this role!","Then","When Xu Anran’s audition began, everyone was stunned. She could not even memorize the lines and only said a few random words. Then, she skillfully dripped eye drops at the corners of her eyes and pretended to cry in sorrow. The crew members present were all embarrassed.","The people in front of the screen were also stunned.","(Isn’t Xu Anran very professional? But she has to use eye drops to cry? It turns out her fans have been making stories up this whole time. They always say that she has good acting skills and is a workaholic. They even praise her for her acting skills?]","(She just said that Qiao Xi doesn’t have any acting skills. But the person who doesn’t have any acting skills is her, right?!] The brainless fans still helped to clear their idol’s name: (An An is just too busy and didn’t have time to memorize the script. After she officially takes on this movie, she’ll definitely memorize her lines. Qiao Xi is just a newbie, so how can her acting skills be better than An An’s? Moreover, even if she has the ability, it can’t hide the fact that Qiao Xi sold her body to get the role!]"]},{"number":500,"title":"Chapter 500 - You’re The Most Sinister Person!","paragraphs":["The brainless fans had just posted their comments when the screen went black again.","Then, another surveillance video appeared. Xu Anran and Xu Zidie walked into the director’s lounge. The director and producer quickly went forward to welcome them.","Xu Anran said, “Director Ding, I can invest funds into the production. The Xu family will invest five million yuan into this movie. We only have one request, and that is I’ll play the role of Shen Yu’s younger sister.”","Director Ding was put in a difficult position. “Miss Xu, it’s not that I don’t want to give you face, but... the role has been decided. It’s a newcomer recommended by Mr. Shen. Her acting skills are very good, and she signed the contract yesterday. I’m really sorry—”. Xu Anran was calm. “Ten million.”","At this moment, Xu Zidie shouted aggressively, “Qiao Xi? Is that b*tch worthy of competing with our Sister Anran? “She’s a scammer! She scammed Sister Anran and me out of a lot of money. How can such a person who has no acting experience be worthy of snatching the role from Sister Anran? If she acts in this movie, it’ll be completely ruined! Our Sister Anran has a good track record in the box office. If you choose Qiao Xi to act in it, don’t blame the Xu family for being merciless!”","Then, Xu Anran said generously, “I’ve never seen Qiao Xi’s acting, but I don’t think she’s a professional. Without systematic training, how could she act well in a movie... But it’s okay. If you’ve already decided on a role, then forget it. After all, first come, first serve.”","Director Ding hesitated again and again. Ultimately, he said, “Alright, Miss Xu. You’ll get this role.”","Xu Anran said, “Don’t worry, Director Ding. I’ll pay the compensation for Qiao Xi’s breach of contract.”","With that, the video ended and went back to the livestream.","At this moment, Xu Anran was still introducing her backyard. She even said that she often composed or practiced acting here. She did not realize that the situation in the livestream had changed.","The audience was unable to recover from their shock for a long time. It turned out that it was not Qiao Xi who stole Xu Anran’s role, but Xu Anran who stole Qiao Xi’s role. Moreover, she even bit back?","Everyone was stunned for a few seconds before digesting this news. Then, they heard Xu Anran say, “This is my first time working with Shen Yu, but...”","The host asked, “What’s the matter?”","“But Mr. Shen seems to like Miss Qiao Xi more.”","Xu Anran sighed helplessly. “Mr. Shen has already announced on Weibo that he’s quitting this movie. Moreover, after Qiao Xi stole my role, I really don’t understand why a person like Mr. Shen would stand up for Qiao Xi. It might be because Qiao Xi was recommended by him. I don’t know what Qiao Xi said to Mr. Shen, but maybe...”","Xu Anran’s words would definitely make Shen Yu’s fans stand up and attack Qiao Xi. She wanted everyone to blame Qiao Xi for Shen Yu’s withdrawal from the production team.","Shen Yu had been in the entertainment industry for so many years and had never gotten into any scandals. This time, he quit the production team for a newcomer. The relationship between Shen Yu and Qiao Xi was definitely not simple. Xu Anran smiled meaningfully. “I think Mr. Shen will see it clearly one day. It’s just a matter of time.”","The host was about to ask something when he suddenly heard a roar through his earpiece. “Are you blind?! Look at the livestream’s comments!”","The host was stunned for a few seconds. He turned to look at the livestream and was instantly dumbfounded. The entire screen was covered by ‘gifts’, and the screen was stuck.","Normally, it was normal for people to send gifts in a livestream, but these people were sending ‘rotten eggs’, ‘smelly socks’, and ‘broken wine bottles’. This meant that the audience was very dissatisfied. What was going on?","Before the host could react, Xu Anran asked gently, “What happened? Let’s go to my study now. There are many of my books there...”","Before she could finish, someone in the livestream suddenly opened the audio channel. Immediately, a roar sounded.","“You’re still pretending! You’re clearly the one who stole Qiao Xi’s role, yet you’re wrongly accusing her! You’re even capable of maligning a newbie, huh? You pretend to be generous on the surface, but you’re actually the most sinister person here!”","The entire venue was silent. The servants in the villa all lowered their heads, afraid that Eldest Miss would take her anger out on them. They only saw Xu Anran’s face turn pale as her body stiffened up.","After being stunned for a few seconds, Xu Anran hurriedly explained, “I don’t understand what you mean. If you’re Miss Qiao’s fan, then I have nothing to say. I hope you’ll take the initiative to leave and not disturb our livestream.”"]}]);
